  "errors": [],
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43788628",
      "title": "Creating & Conditionally Rendering Another Component",
      "lectureOrder": 51,
      "videoOrder": 47,
      "sourceHash": "afa14b2496b9c9dc0944a16046835e244345b941a4cd7fea56377b86de418614",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.6,
          "end": 1.68,
          "en": "Now that we're able",
          "zh": "現在我們能夠"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.68,
          "end": 5.31,
          "en": "to mark tasks as completed,",
          "zh": "把任務標記為已完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.31,
          "end": 9.33,
          "en": "we, of course, also wanna make sure that we can add tasks.",
          "zh": "我們當然也想確保我們可以新增任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.33,
          "end": 12.99,
          "en": "And here, I got another exercise for you.",
          "zh": "而這裡，我有另一個練習給你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.99,
          "end": 16.77,
          "en": "I want you to create a first basic version",
          "zh": "我想讓你建立一個最初的基本版本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.77,
          "end": 20.04,
          "en": "of such a component which doesn't need any styling at all,",
          "zh": "這樣一個元件，它完全不需要任何樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.04,
          "end": 23.1,
          "en": "doesn't matter where it appears, doesn't need a form,",
          "zh": "出現在哪裡都沒關係，也不需要表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.1,
          "end": 26.4,
          "en": "just some shell which output some text.",
          "zh": "只要某個會輸出一些文字的外殼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.4,
          "end": 28.98,
          "en": "And I want you to build that component,",
          "zh": "而我想讓你建立那個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.98,
          "end": 30.6,
          "en": "add it to the application,",
          "zh": "把它加到應用程式裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.6,
          "end": 34.5,
          "en": "and make sure that it shows up anywhere on the screen,",
          "zh": "並確保它出現在畫面上的任何地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.5,
          "end": 38.493,
          "en": "doesn't matter where, when that Add Task button is clicked.",
          "zh": "哪裡都沒關係，當那個 Add Task 按鈕被點擊時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.54,
          "end": 42.69,
          "en": "So that you add the code that listens for a click,",
          "zh": "所以你要加上監聽點擊的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.69,
          "end": 45.48,
          "en": "and that then conditionally renders",
          "zh": "然後有條件地渲染"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.48,
          "end": 48.96,
          "en": "this newly added new-task.component.",
          "zh": "這個新加入的 new-task.component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.96,
          "end": 51.09,
          "en": "That's your task right now.",
          "zh": "那就是你現在的任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.09,
          "end": 54.24,
          "en": "After a short pause, which you can use to pause the video",
          "zh": "在一段短暫停頓之後，你可以用來暫停影片"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.24,
          "end": 57.843,
          "en": "and try this on your own, we'll implement this together.",
          "zh": "並自己試著做，我們會一起實作這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.87,
          "end": 64.38,
          "en": "So let's add this new component together now.",
          "zh": "所以現在讓我們一起加上這個新元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.38,
          "end": 67.26,
          "en": "For this, I'm back in the project, of course,",
          "zh": "為此，我當然回到專案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.26,
          "end": 71.19,
          "en": "and I'll again use the CLI to generate a new component,",
          "zh": "而我會再次使用 CLI 來產生一個新元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.19,
          "end": 74.52,
          "en": "and I wanna have that component in the tasks folder.",
          "zh": "而我想把那個元件放在 tasks 資料夾裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.52,
          "end": 76.14099999999999,
          "en": "And then they are,",
          "zh": "然後就是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.14099999999999,
          "end": 79.863,
          "en": "it's the new-task.component I want to add.",
          "zh": "我想加的是 new-task.component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.94,
          "end": 82.44,
          "en": "And if you have component names",
          "zh": "而如果你的元件名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.44,
          "end": 84.18,
          "en": "that consist of multiple names,",
          "zh": "由多個名稱組成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.18,
          "end": 86.733,
          "en": "you should separate them with a dash like this.",
          "zh": "你應該像這樣用連字號把它們分開。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.72,
          "end": 89.25,
          "en": "I don't need the tests,",
          "zh": "我不需要測試，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.25,
          "end": 93.09,
          "en": "so again, I will add --skip-tests.",
          "zh": "所以我再次會加上 --skip-tests。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.09,
          "end": 97.68299999999999,
          "en": "And with that, this new, new-task folder here is added.",
          "zh": "而這樣，這裡這個新的 new-task 資料夾就被加上了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.69,
          "end": 101.13,
          "en": "Now as mentioned at the moment,",
          "zh": "現在如剛才提到的，目前"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.13,
          "end": 103.8,
          "en": "I don't care how it looks and where it appears,",
          "zh": "我不在意它看起來如何、出現在哪裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.8,
          "end": 107.22,
          "en": "so I'll just keep that default starting content,",
          "zh": "所以我就保留那個預設的起始內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.22,
          "end": 111.72,
          "en": "this dummy text here in the new-task.component.html file.",
          "zh": "這裡 new-task.component.html 檔案裡的這段假文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.72,
          "end": 114.42,
          "en": "And I just wanna make sure that it shows up",
          "zh": "而我只想確保它會出現，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.42,
          "end": 119.13,
          "en": "if this button in the task component here is clicked,",
          "zh": "如果這裡 task 元件裡的這個按鈕被點擊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.13,
          "end": 122.193,
          "en": "if this Add-Task button is clicked.",
          "zh": "如果這個 Add Task 按鈕被點擊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.6,
          "end": 126.21,
          "en": "Therefore I'll start by adding a click listener",
          "zh": "因此我會先加上一個 click 監聽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.21,
          "end": 128.163,
          "en": "to this Add Task button,",
          "zh": "到這個 Add Task 按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.3,
          "end": 131.61,
          "en": "and I'll then add a new method",
          "zh": "然後我會加一個新方法"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.61,
          "end": 134.313,
          "en": "to this tasks.component.ts file.",
          "zh": "到這個 tasks.component.ts 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.27,
          "end": 140.27,
          "en": "And I'll name this method onStartAddTask,",
          "zh": "而我會把這個方法命名為 onStartAddTask，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.49,
          "end": 142.8,
          "en": "because this kind of describes",
          "zh": "因為這有點描述了"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.8,
          "end": 146.01,
          "en": "what's happening when the button is clicked.",
          "zh": "按鈕被點擊時發生的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.01,
          "end": 150.32999999999998,
          "en": "We start the process of adding a new task",
          "zh": "我們開始新增一項任務的流程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.32999999999998,
          "end": 153.09,
          "en": "by conditionally showing a component",
          "zh": "藉由有條件地顯示一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.09,
          "end": 156.78300000000002,
          "en": "that will allow us to enter the task details.",
          "zh": "那個元件會讓我們輸入任務細節。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.19,
          "end": 163.19,
          "en": "I also need an extra property which controls",
          "zh": "我還需要一個額外的屬性，它控制"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.23,
          "end": 168.03,
          "en": "whether this new-task.component is visible or not.",
          "zh": "這個 new-task.component 是否可見。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.03,
          "end": 172.56,
          "en": "Therefore, here at the top, maybe above the tasks,",
          "zh": "因此，在這裡頂端，也許在 tasks 上方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.56,
          "end": 175.14,
          "en": "the exact position doesn't matter.",
          "zh": "確切位置沒有關係。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.14,
          "end": 179.287,
          "en": "I'll add a new property called isAddingTask.",
          "zh": "我會加一個叫做 isAddingTask 的新屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 182.28,
          "end": 183.51,
          "en": "The name is up to you,",
          "zh": "名稱由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 183.51,
          "end": 186.09,
          "en": "but it should be a name that describes",
          "zh": "但它應該是一個能描述"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 186.09,
          "end": 189.153,
          "en": "the value that's stored in the property.",
          "zh": "存在這個屬性裡的值的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 190.11,
          "end": 192.573,
          "en": "And here, I'll set this to false initially.",
          "zh": "而這裡，我會一開始把它設成 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 193.71,
          "end": 196.8,
          "en": "And since I'm assigning that initial value,",
          "zh": "而因為我指派了那個初始值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 196.8,
          "end": 200.7,
          "en": "types script is able to infer the type of value",
          "zh": "TypeScript 能夠推斷"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 200.7,
          "end": 204.003,
          "en": "I plan on storing on this property in general.",
          "zh": "我打算一般存在這個屬性上的值的型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 204.93,
          "end": 208.82999999999998,
          "en": "It correctly infers that it'll be a Boolean,",
          "zh": "它正確地推斷那會是布林，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 208.82999999999998,
          "end": 211.023,
          "en": "which I'll store in this property.",
          "zh": "也就是我會存在這個屬性裡的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 212.34,
          "end": 213.21,
          "en": "As a side note,",
          "zh": "附帶一提，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 213.21,
          "end": 217.07999999999998,
          "en": "you could explicitly add this type annotation nonetheless,",
          "zh": "你仍然可以明確加上這個型別註記，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 217.07999999999998,
          "end": 220.62,
          "en": "but this is not required and also not recommended",
          "zh": "但這不是必須的，也不建議，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 220.62,
          "end": 223.113,
          "en": "if the inferred type is the correct type.",
          "zh": "如果推斷出的型別就是正確的型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 224.73,
          "end": 227.94,
          "en": "So isAddingTask is false initially,",
          "zh": "所以 isAddingTask 一開始是 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 227.94,
          "end": 231.18,
          "en": "but it should be changed to true",
          "zh": "但如果我們觸發 onStartAddTask，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 231.18,
          "end": 234.09300000000002,
          "en": "if we trigger onStartAddTask.",
          "zh": "它應該被改成 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 236.04,
          "end": 240.273,
          "en": "So in here, I want to set isAddingTask to true.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我想把 isAddingTask 設成 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 242.22,
          "end": 246.33,
          "en": "And now, in the tasks.component.html file,",
          "zh": "而現在，在 tasks.component.html 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 246.33,
          "end": 251.07,
          "en": "I want to use this newly added, isAddingTask property",
          "zh": "我想使用這個新加上的 isAddingTask 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 251.07,
          "end": 255.213,
          "en": "to conditionally show this new-task.component.",
          "zh": "來有條件地顯示這個 new-task.component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 256.26,
          "end": 260.55,
          "en": "So we can use @if here, and check if isAddingTask is true.",
          "zh": "所以我們可以在這裡使用 @if，並檢查 isAddingTask 是否為 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 263.34,
          "end": 268.053,
          "en": "And if it is, I wanna output app-new-task,",
          "zh": "如果是，我想輸出 app-new-task，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 268.92,
          "end": 273.21,
          "en": "that is the selector of this new-task.component",
          "zh": "那是這個 new-task.component 的 selector，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 273.21,
          "end": 274.983,
          "en": "that was added by the CLI.",
          "zh": "由 CLI 加上的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 276.93,
          "end": 280.08,
          "en": "Now as always, this must be added to the imports",
          "zh": "現在一如往常，這必須被加到 imports，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 280.08,
          "end": 283.98,
          "en": "in order to be available in the tasks component.",
          "zh": "才能在 tasks 元件裡使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 283.98,
          "end": 286.2,
          "en": "So that is something that must be done.",
          "zh": "所以那是必須做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 286.2,
          "end": 288.84000000000003,
          "en": "The NewTaskComponent must be imported",
          "zh": "NewTaskComponent 必須被匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 288.84000000000003,
          "end": 291.09000000000003,
          "en": "and added to the imports here,",
          "zh": "並加到這裡的 imports，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 291.09000000000003,
          "end": 293.763,
          "en": "but with that done, it can be rendered.",
          "zh": "但做完之後，它就可以被渲染。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 294.93,
          "end": 299.1,
          "en": "And then here, with this event binding on this button,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡，這個按鈕上的這個事件綁定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 299.1,
          "end": 300.93,
          "en": "we can and should execute",
          "zh": "我們可以、也應該執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 300.93,
          "end": 304.473,
          "en": "this newly added onStartAddTask method.",
          "zh": "這個新加上的 onStartAddTask 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 305.73,
          "end": 309.63,
          "en": "With that, if you save that and you click Add Task,",
          "zh": "這樣，如果你儲存那個並點擊 Add Task，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 309.63,
          "end": 312.96,
          "en": "you will see that this new-task.component appears",
          "zh": "你會看到這個 new-task.component 出現，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 312.96,
          "end": 315.66,
          "en": "and that's therefore working as it should.",
          "zh": "因此它如預期運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 315.66,
          "end": 318.42,
          "en": "Now we can start working on that component",
          "zh": "現在我們可以開始處理那個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 318.42,
          "end": 321.6,
          "en": "so that we do actually open it as a dialogue",
          "zh": "好讓我們確實把它當成對話框打開，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 321.6,
          "end": 323.013,
          "en": "and show some form.",
          "zh": "並顯示某個表單。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43788630",
      "title": "Managing The \"New Task\" Dialog",
      "lectureOrder": 52,
      "videoOrder": 48,
      "sourceHash": "0cbaab18128f5b49abf5484a68ef3417f0e85f70aaf2c983a6017d6d014b60fc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 3.21,
          "en": "So now I wanna work on the template",
          "zh": "所以現在我想處理範本"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.21,
          "end": 6.93,
          "en": "and the styling of this new-task.component.",
          "zh": "以及這個 new-task.component 的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.93,
          "end": 9.39,
          "en": "And for that, attached you actually find",
          "zh": "而為此，附件裡你其實會找到"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.39,
          "end": 13.68,
          "en": "a prepared new-task.component.html file,",
          "zh": "一個準備好的 new-task.component.html 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.68,
          "end": 16.08,
          "en": "which includes a dialog",
          "zh": "它包含一個 dialog，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.08,
          "end": 20.1,
          "en": "that's always open, which then in turn holds a form",
          "zh": "那個 dialog 總是打開的，裡面接著放著一個表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.1,
          "end": 22.053,
          "en": "with some input fields.",
          "zh": "帶著一些 input 欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.89,
          "end": 26.28,
          "en": "Now, there is no Angular-specific code in there,",
          "zh": "現在，那裡面沒有 Angular 專屬的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.28,
          "end": 28.53,
          "en": "which is why I prepared it for you",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我幫你準備好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.53,
          "end": 30.12,
          "en": "just so that we save some time,",
          "zh": "只是為了省下一些時間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.12,
          "end": 32.25,
          "en": "and we don't have to write it all together.",
          "zh": "而我們不必一起把它全部寫出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.25,
          "end": 34.35,
          "en": "But in the end, it's just some markup",
          "zh": "但最後，它只是一些標記，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.35,
          "end": 38.28,
          "en": "that we'll use the default browser built in dialog element",
          "zh": "我們會使用瀏覽器預設內建的 dialog 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.28,
          "end": 41.73,
          "en": "to show a form as an overlay above the rest",
          "zh": "把一個表單顯示成覆蓋在頁面其餘內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.73,
          "end": 44.43,
          "en": "of the page content and attached,",
          "zh": "上方的一層，而附件裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.43,
          "end": 48.72,
          "en": "you therefore also find a new-task.component.css file,",
          "zh": "你因此也會找到一個 new-task.component.css 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.72,
          "end": 51.423,
          "en": "which includes some required styles.",
          "zh": "它包含一些必要的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.25,
          "end": 57,
          "en": "With that, if you use these two attached files,",
          "zh": "這樣，如果你使用這兩個附件檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57,
          "end": 61.77,
          "en": "the HTML and the CSS file, if you save everything,",
          "zh": "HTML 和 CSS 檔案，如果你儲存一切，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.77,
          "end": 63.99,
          "en": "you should be able to add a task",
          "zh": "你應該能夠新增一項任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.99,
          "end": 68.46000000000001,
          "en": "and get this overlay dialog when trying to do that.",
          "zh": "並在試著這樣做時得到這個覆蓋的對話框。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.46000000000001,
          "end": 69.72,
          "en": "But, of course, at the moment,",
          "zh": "但當然，目前"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.72,
          "end": 71.61,
          "en": "this dialog doesn't do anything",
          "zh": "這個對話框不會做任何事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.61,
          "end": 74.25,
          "en": "and we also can't really close it",
          "zh": "而我們也沒辦法真正關掉它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.25,
          "end": 77.16,
          "en": "because that's now the logic we'll add together",
          "zh": "因為那就是我們現在要一起加上的邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.16,
          "end": 79.14,
          "en": "with help of Angular.",
          "zh": "藉助 Angular。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.14,
          "end": 83.1,
          "en": "And let's start with making sure that we can close it,",
          "zh": "而讓我們從確保我們可以關掉它開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.1,
          "end": 85.44,
          "en": "for example, by clicking on the backdrop",
          "zh": "例如點擊背景遮罩，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.44,
          "end": 88.74,
          "en": "or by clicking this cancel button here.",
          "zh": "或點擊這裡的這個取消按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.74,
          "end": 93.57,
          "en": "And the idea is to essentially emit an event",
          "zh": "而想法本質上是，當這個背景遮罩"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.57,
          "end": 97.83,
          "en": "from inside this new-task.component when this backdrop",
          "zh": "或這裡的這個 Cancel 按鈕被點擊時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.83,
          "end": 100.59,
          "en": "or this Cancel button here is clicked,",
          "zh": "從這個 new-task.component 裡面發出一個事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.59,
          "end": 104.31,
          "en": "a cancel event let's say, which can then be handled",
          "zh": "比方說一個 cancel 事件，然後它可以由"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.31,
          "end": 108.6,
          "en": "by the tasks.component, which is the component",
          "zh": "tasks.component 來處理，也就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.6,
          "end": 112.8,
          "en": "that is rendering this new-task.component.",
          "zh": "正在渲染這個 new-task.component 的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.8,
          "end": 116.22,
          "en": "So that we set, this isAddingTask property",
          "zh": "這樣我們就把那個 tasks.component 裡的"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.22,
          "end": 120,
          "en": "in that tasks.component back to false,",
          "zh": "這個 isAddingTask 屬性設回 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120,
          "end": 123.09,
          "en": "which it also is initially if we clicked on Cancel",
          "zh": "如果我們點了 Cancel 或背景遮罩，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.09,
          "end": 124.203,
          "en": "or the backdrop.",
          "zh": "它一開始也是 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.16,
          "end": 127.17,
          "en": "Now again, this is definitely something",
          "zh": "現在同樣，這絕對是"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.17,
          "end": 129.99,
          "en": "you can try implementing on your own first",
          "zh": "你可以先自己試著實作的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.99,
          "end": 132.09,
          "en": "because you will only need knowledge",
          "zh": "因為你只需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.09,
          "end": 134.04,
          "en": "you already gained thus far.",
          "zh": "到目前為止已經學到的知識。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.04,
          "end": 136.23,
          "en": "But after a short pause, which you can use",
          "zh": "但在一段短暫停頓之後，你可以用來"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.23,
          "end": 139.353,
          "en": "to pause the video, we'll implement it together.",
          "zh": "暫停影片，我們會一起實作它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.26,
          "end": 145.44,
          "en": "So to make this dialog closeable,",
          "zh": "所以為了讓這個對話框可以關閉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.44,
          "end": 149.82,
          "en": "I will start here in the tasks.component TypeScript file",
          "zh": "我會從這裡的 tasks.component TypeScript 檔案開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.82,
          "end": 152.43,
          "en": "by adding another new method.",
          "zh": "加上另一個新方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.43,
          "end": 155.31,
          "en": "Maybe here at the bottom, though the exact position",
          "zh": "也許在這裡底部，不過確切位置"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.31,
          "end": 159.317,
          "en": "doesn't matter, and I'll name it onCancelAddTask.",
          "zh": "沒有關係，而我會把它命名為 onCancelAddTask。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.664,
          "end": 162.51,
          "en": "That sounds like a fitting name",
          "zh": "那聽起來是個合適的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.51,
          "end": 166.96,
          "en": "because it should be invoked when we cancel this process",
          "zh": "因為當我們取消這個流程時它應該被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.85,
          "end": 171.543,
          "en": "and in there, we can set isAddingTask to false,",
          "zh": "而在那裡，我們可以把 isAddingTask 設成 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.65,
          "end": 176.13,
          "en": "which because of the code in its template,",
          "zh": "由於它範本裡的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.13,
          "end": 180.63,
          "en": "we'll then remove this new-task.component from the DOM",
          "zh": "接著就會把這個 new-task.component 從 DOM 移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.63,
          "end": 183.66,
          "en": "because this is only rendered conditionally",
          "zh": "因為這只在 isAddingTask 為 true 時"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.66,
          "end": 186.993,
          "en": "with help of @if if isAddingTask is true.",
          "zh": "藉助 @if 有條件地被渲染。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.01,
          "end": 190.08,
          "en": "If isAddingTask is set to false,",
          "zh": "如果 isAddingTask 被設成 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.08,
          "end": 193.26,
          "en": "it will therefore be removed by Angular automatically",
          "zh": "它因此會被 Angular 自動移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.26,
          "end": 195.39,
          "en": "because of how Angular works",
          "zh": "因為 Angular 的運作方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.39,
          "end": 198.663,
          "en": "and because of our declarative template code here.",
          "zh": "也因為我們這裡的宣告式範本程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 199.98,
          "end": 202.23,
          "en": "So therefore now, we, of course, must make sure",
          "zh": "所以因此現在，我們當然必須確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 202.23,
          "end": 205.17000000000002,
          "en": "that we do invoke onCancelAddTask",
          "zh": "如果對話框被關閉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 205.17000000000002,
          "end": 207.32999999999998,
          "en": "if the dialog is closed.",
          "zh": "我們確實呼叫 onCancelAddTask。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.32999999999998,
          "end": 208.86,
          "en": "And therefore, we should go",
          "zh": "因此，我們應該前往"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.86,
          "end": 211.86,
          "en": "to the new-task.component.html file,",
          "zh": "new-task.component.html 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.86,
          "end": 215.01,
          "en": "which is responsible for rendering that dialog.",
          "zh": "它負責渲染那個對話框。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 215.01,
          "end": 219.21,
          "en": "And we should add click listeners here on that backdrop div",
          "zh": "而我們應該在那個 backdrop div 上加上 click 監聽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 219.21,
          "end": 222.69,
          "en": "so that clicking the backdrop will close the dialog",
          "zh": "這樣點擊背景遮罩就會關閉對話框，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 222.69,
          "end": 225.54,
          "en": "and on this Cancel button here.",
          "zh": "以及這裡的這個 Cancel 按鈕上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 225.54,
          "end": 227.07,
          "en": "By the way, it's important",
          "zh": "順帶一提，重要的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 227.07,
          "end": 229.98,
          "en": "that this button here is of type=\"button,\"",
          "zh": "這裡的這個按鈕是 type=\"button\"，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 229.98,
          "end": 233.94,
          "en": "not because of Angular, but because of how the web works",
          "zh": "不是因為 Angular，而是因為網頁的運作方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 233.94,
          "end": 236.07,
          "en": "because of it would be of type Submit,",
          "zh": "因為如果它是 type Submit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 236.07,
          "end": 238.5,
          "en": "it would actually trigger a form submission,",
          "zh": "它其實會觸發表單送出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 238.5,
          "end": 241.74,
          "en": "which could have unwanted side effects.",
          "zh": "那可能會有不想要的副作用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 241.74,
          "end": 244.11,
          "en": "By setting this button to type=\"button\",",
          "zh": "把這個按鈕設成 type=\"button\"，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 244.11,
          "end": 245.88,
          "en": "this will not occur.",
          "zh": "這就不會發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 245.88,
          "end": 249.153,
          "en": "But that's just a side note, not specific to Angular.",
          "zh": "但那只是附帶說明，不是 Angular 專屬的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 250.74,
          "end": 253.05,
          "en": "Now, these click listeners on the Cancel button,",
          "zh": "現在，Cancel 按鈕和"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 253.05,
          "end": 256.26,
          "en": "the backdrop, should invoke a method inside",
          "zh": "背景遮罩上的這些 click 監聽器，應該呼叫"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 256.26,
          "end": 257.973,
          "en": "of the new-task.component.",
          "zh": "new-task.component 裡面的一個方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 258.87,
          "end": 261.18,
          "en": "So in here in the component class,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡的元件類別裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 261.18,
          "end": 264.57,
          "en": "we can add a new onCancel method.",
          "zh": "我們可以加一個新的 onCancel 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 264.57,
          "end": 269.22,
          "en": "And now I wanna emit a custom event whenever that happens.",
          "zh": "而現在我想在那發生時發出一個自訂事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 269.22,
          "end": 273.78,
          "en": "So as you learned it before, we should use @Output here,",
          "zh": "所以如你之前學到的，我們應該在這裡使用 @Output，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 273.78,
          "end": 277.74,
          "en": "which of course is imported from @angular/core as always.",
          "zh": "它當然一如往常從 @angular/core 匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 277.74,
          "end": 280.32,
          "en": "And then add our own event property,",
          "zh": "然後加上我們自己的事件屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 280.32,
          "end": 284.58,
          "en": "which could be named cancel since this accurately describes",
          "zh": "可以命名為 cancel，因為這準確描述了"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 284.58,
          "end": 286.533,
          "en": "the kind of event we're adding here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡加上的事件種類。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 287.73,
          "end": 290.7,
          "en": "Now, this should be a new EventEmitter as always,",
          "zh": "現在，這應該一如往常是一個新的 EventEmitter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 290.7,
          "end": 292.713,
          "en": "imported from @angular/core.",
          "zh": "從 @angular/core 匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 293.94,
          "end": 295.65,
          "en": "And this will be an EventEmitter",
          "zh": "而這會是一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 295.65,
          "end": 298.89300000000003,
          "en": "that will actually not transmit any kind of data.",
          "zh": "實際上不會傳送任何資料的 EventEmitter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 299.90999999999997,
          "end": 302.55,
          "en": "Therefore, as a generic type annotation,",
          "zh": "因此，作為泛型型別註記，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 302.55,
          "end": 305.61,
          "en": "you should add the special void type here.",
          "zh": "你應該在這裡加上特殊的 void 型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 305.61,
          "end": 308.34,
          "en": "Now, that is something you didn't know in advance,",
          "zh": "現在，那是你事先不知道的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 308.34,
          "end": 309.84,
          "en": "but you could also set it up",
          "zh": "但你也可以完全不帶"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 309.84,
          "end": 313.71,
          "en": "without any generic type information at all.",
          "zh": "任何泛型型別資訊來設定它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 313.71,
          "end": 316.71,
          "en": "Void is just a special type that essentially means",
          "zh": "void 只是一個特殊型別，本質上表示"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 316.71,
          "end": 320.31,
          "en": "that there will be no data being emitted.",
          "zh": "不會有任何資料被發出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 320.31,
          "end": 323.34,
          "en": "And with that, we can then go here to onCancel",
          "zh": "而這樣，我們接著可以前往這裡的 onCancel，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 323.34,
          "end": 325.38,
          "en": "and use our cancel property",
          "zh": "並使用我們的 cancel 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 325.38,
          "end": 328.83299999999997,
          "en": "to emit a new event which does not carry any data.",
          "zh": "來發出一個不帶任何資料的新事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 330.39,
          "end": 333.75,
          "en": "And now with that, we can use this onCancel method here",
          "zh": "而現在有了那個，我們可以在這裡使用這個 onCancel 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 333.75,
          "end": 336.84000000000003,
          "en": "in the new-task.component.html file,",
          "zh": "在 new-task.component.html 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 336.84000000000003,
          "end": 339.57,
          "en": "both for the backdrop click listener",
          "zh": "同時給背景遮罩的 click 監聽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 339.57,
          "end": 343.02,
          "en": "and this Cancel button click listener.",
          "zh": "和這個 Cancel 按鈕的 click 監聽器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 343.02,
          "end": 347.07,
          "en": "And we can then use our own cancel event here,",
          "zh": "然後我們可以在這裡使用我們自己的 cancel 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 347.07,
          "end": 351.87,
          "en": "so to say, in the tasks.component template",
          "zh": "可以說，在 tasks.component 範本裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 351.87,
          "end": 353.88,
          "en": "to listen for that cancel event",
          "zh": "監聽那個 cancel 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 353.88,
          "end": 356.7,
          "en": "on the new-task.component instance.",
          "zh": "在 new-task.component 實例上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 356.7,
          "end": 359.867,
          "en": "And then here we wanna invoke onCancelAddTask.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡我們想呼叫 onCancelAddTask。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 360.81,
          "end": 364.05,
          "en": "This method we added a couple of minutes ago.",
          "zh": "這個我們幾分鐘前加上的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 364.05,
          "end": 366.6,
          "en": "If you now save everything, you should be able",
          "zh": "如果你現在儲存一切，你應該能夠"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 366.6,
          "end": 370.47,
          "en": "to open this dialog, but to then also close it",
          "zh": "打開這個對話框，但接著也能關掉它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 370.47,
          "end": 373.23,
          "en": "by clicking on the backdrop like this",
          "zh": "像這樣點擊背景遮罩，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 373.23,
          "end": 375.723,
          "en": "or by clicking on the Cancel button.",
          "zh": "或點擊 Cancel 按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 377.07,
          "end": 380.79,
          "en": "And that's another important step into the right direction.",
          "zh": "而那是朝正確方向邁出的另一步。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 380.79,
          "end": 382.92,
          "en": "Next, we, of course, wanna make sure",
          "zh": "接下來，我們當然想確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 382.92,
          "end": 385.71,
          "en": "that we also extract the entered data",
          "zh": "我們也取出已輸入的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 385.71,
          "end": 388.83299999999997,
          "en": "and we actually do create a new task.",
          "zh": "並且我們確實建立一項新任務。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43788632",
      "title": "Using Directives & Two-Way-Binding",
      "lectureOrder": 53,
      "videoOrder": 49,
      "sourceHash": "d42786f5430d761e856400643e84e6aae93abd26e9a2478a0693ff8a9e2795f2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.39,
          "end": 2.94,
          "en": "So when using Angular,",
          "zh": "所以使用 Angular 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.94,
          "end": 7.08,
          "en": "how can we now get those entered values",
          "zh": "我們現在要如何取得那些已輸入的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.08,
          "end": 10.86,
          "en": "from the input text area and the other input here",
          "zh": "從 input 文字區域和這裡的另一個 input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.86,
          "end": 13.92,
          "en": "when that form is submitted?",
          "zh": "當那個表單被送出時？"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.92,
          "end": 15.48,
          "en": "Now as always in programming,",
          "zh": "現在一如往常，在程式設計裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.48,
          "end": 17.16,
          "en": "there will be different approaches,",
          "zh": "會有不同的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.16,
          "end": 19.83,
          "en": "but here is one of the most common ways",
          "zh": "但這裡是最常見的方式之一"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.83,
          "end": 23.16,
          "en": "of handling form inputs and form submissions.",
          "zh": "用來處理表單輸入與表單送出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.16,
          "end": 26.16,
          "en": "We'll use another way of binding templates",
          "zh": "我們會使用另一種把範本"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.16,
          "end": 30,
          "en": "to data called two-way binding,",
          "zh": "綁到資料的方式，叫做雙向綁定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30,
          "end": 33.45,
          "en": "which in the end is the combination of property",
          "zh": "它最後是屬性綁定"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.45,
          "end": 36.273,
          "en": "and event binding, as you will see.",
          "zh": "和事件綁定的組合，如你將會看到的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.17,
          "end": 39.09,
          "en": "Now to use two-way binding,",
          "zh": "現在要使用雙向綁定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.09,
          "end": 42.453,
          "en": "we have to go back to the new task component,",
          "zh": "我們必須回到 new task 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.29,
          "end": 46.53,
          "en": "so to the class of that template.",
          "zh": "也就是那個範本的類別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.53,
          "end": 48.75,
          "en": "And then in there, we can add a new property",
          "zh": "然後在那裡，我們可以加一個新屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.75,
          "end": 50.79,
          "en": "called enteredTitle.",
          "zh": "叫做 enteredTitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.79,
          "end": 52.5,
          "en": "The name is up to you of course,",
          "zh": "名稱當然由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.5,
          "end": 55.17,
          "en": "but the idea is to store the title",
          "zh": "但想法是儲存"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.17,
          "end": 57.93,
          "en": "that is entered in this input field.",
          "zh": "在這個 input 欄位裡輸入的標題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.93,
          "end": 61.68,
          "en": "Now I'll assign an initial value of an empty string,",
          "zh": "現在我會指派一個空字串作為初始值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.68,
          "end": 63.96,
          "en": "and therefore TypeScript correctly infers",
          "zh": "因此 TypeScript 正確地推斷"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.96,
          "end": 66.78,
          "en": "that this property will be of type string.",
          "zh": "這個屬性的型別會是字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.78,
          "end": 69.87,
          "en": "So no further information is needed here.",
          "zh": "所以這裡不需要更多資訊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.87,
          "end": 72.06,
          "en": "We also don't need input or output,",
          "zh": "我們也不需要 input 或 output，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.06,
          "end": 75.99,
          "en": "since we'll only use this property inside of this component",
          "zh": "因為我們只會在這個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.99,
          "end": 77.373,
          "en": "and its template.",
          "zh": "及其範本裡使用這個屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.72,
          "end": 82.02,
          "en": "But now I wanna make sure that with every keystroke",
          "zh": "但現在我想確保每按一次按鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.02,
          "end": 85.53,
          "en": "the user makes in that input field,",
          "zh": "使用者在那個 input 欄位裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.53,
          "end": 89.52,
          "en": "this property here and the value stored in that property",
          "zh": "這裡的這個屬性、以及存在那個屬性裡的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.52,
          "end": 93.333,
          "en": "will be updated with the value entered by the user.",
          "zh": "都會被更新成使用者輸入的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.32,
          "end": 99,
          "en": "And this is done by adding a special directive",
          "zh": "而這是藉由加上一個特殊指令來完成的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99,
          "end": 102.15,
          "en": "as it's called, to the input field",
          "zh": "如它被稱呼的那樣，加到那個 input 欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.15,
          "end": 104.72999999999999,
          "en": "on which you wanna listen for changes.",
          "zh": "也就是你想監聽變更的那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.72999999999999,
          "end": 108.3,
          "en": "And that's the ngModel directive.",
          "zh": "而那就是 ngModel 指令。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.3,
          "end": 111.18,
          "en": "And by the way, whenever something starts with ng,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，每當某個東西以 ng 開頭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.18,
          "end": 113.46000000000001,
          "en": "you know that it's coming from Angular,",
          "zh": "你就知道它來自 Angular，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.46000000000001,
          "end": 116.22,
          "en": "that it's built into Angular.",
          "zh": "它內建於 Angular。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.22,
          "end": 119.4,
          "en": "Now directives are an Angular feature,",
          "zh": "現在指令是 Angular 的一項功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.4,
          "end": 123.42,
          "en": "which we will explore in greater detail later in the course,",
          "zh": "我們會在課程稍後更深入探索，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.42,
          "end": 125.73,
          "en": "and then you will also learn",
          "zh": "然後你也會學到"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.73,
          "end": 128.43,
          "en": "how you can build your own directives.",
          "zh": "如何建立你自己的指令。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.43,
          "end": 132.45,
          "en": "But the main idea behind this directive feature",
          "zh": "但這項指令功能背後的主要想法"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.45,
          "end": 135.18,
          "en": "really just is that they allow you",
          "zh": "其實就是它們讓你"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.18,
          "end": 140.18,
          "en": "to add extra functionalities to elements.",
          "zh": "能把額外功能加到元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141,
          "end": 144.57,
          "en": "In the end, directives are almost like components,",
          "zh": "最後，指令幾乎像元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.57,
          "end": 146.49,
          "en": "because the idea behind components",
          "zh": "因為元件背後的想法"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.49,
          "end": 149.37,
          "en": "also is that you can build your own things",
          "zh": "也是你可以建立你自己的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.37,
          "end": 152.01,
          "en": "that bring their own functionality.",
          "zh": "它們帶來自己的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.01,
          "end": 157.01,
          "en": "But directives, unlike components, don't have templates.",
          "zh": "但指令和元件不同，沒有範本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.14,
          "end": 160.41,
          "en": "And indeed components in Angular are considered",
          "zh": "而確實，Angular 裡的元件被視為"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.41,
          "end": 163.47,
          "en": "to be directives with templates.",
          "zh": "帶有範本的指令。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.47,
          "end": 165.48,
          "en": "So if we're talking about a component,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們在談一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.48,
          "end": 167.79,
          "en": "we have a directive with a template.",
          "zh": "我們有一個帶範本的指令。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 167.79,
          "end": 170.19,
          "en": "If we talk about a directive, we have,",
          "zh": "如果我們談一個指令，我們有的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 170.19,
          "end": 174.21,
          "en": "well, just a directive, just an enhancement to an element",
          "zh": "嗯，只是一個指令，只是對元素的一種增強，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.21,
          "end": 177.123,
          "en": "that does not bring its own template.",
          "zh": "它不帶來自己的範本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.02,
          "end": 180.42,
          "en": "But that's not too important right now,",
          "zh": "但那現在不太重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.42,
          "end": 183.78,
          "en": "because for the most part, you will work with components,",
          "zh": "因為大多數時候，你會使用元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.78,
          "end": 187.29,
          "en": "but occasionally you need some directives here and there,",
          "zh": "但偶爾你這裡那裡需要一些指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.29,
          "end": 189.75,
          "en": "like the ngModel directive here,",
          "zh": "像這裡的 ngModel 指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.75,
          "end": 191.82,
          "en": "like maybe some directive you'll build",
          "zh": "像也許你稍後在課程裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.82,
          "end": 193.8,
          "en": "on your own later in the course,",
          "zh": "自己建立的某個指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.8,
          "end": 197.49,
          "en": "or like the ngFor directive I mentioned earlier,",
          "zh": "或像我稍早提到的 ngFor 指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.49,
          "end": 200.04,
          "en": "in case you are using an Angular version",
          "zh": "如果你使用的 Angular 版本"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 200.04,
          "end": 205.04,
          "en": "where this more modern @for syntax is not supported.",
          "zh": "不支援這個較新的 @for 語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.38,
          "end": 208.2,
          "en": "But that's the idea behind directives.",
          "zh": "但那就是指令背後的想法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 208.2,
          "end": 212.25,
          "en": "They simply are Angular-powered element enhancements,",
          "zh": "它們就是由 Angular 驅動的元素增強，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.25,
          "end": 213.57,
          "en": "you could say.",
          "zh": "你可以這樣說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 213.57,
          "end": 216.21,
          "en": "And this ngModel directive here",
          "zh": "而這裡這個 ngModel 指令"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 216.21,
          "end": 220.2,
          "en": "is a directive offered by Angular that's meant to be used",
          "zh": "是 Angular 提供的一個指令，用意是用在"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.2,
          "end": 225.2,
          "en": "with input or text area, or other form-related elements",
          "zh": "input 或 textarea，或其他與表單相關的元素上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 225.6,
          "end": 230.52,
          "en": "to help you get access to the value entered by the user",
          "zh": "幫助你取得使用者輸入到"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 230.52,
          "end": 231.99,
          "en": "into those elements.",
          "zh": "那些元素裡的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.99,
          "end": 236.01,
          "en": "And specifically this ngModel directive can be used",
          "zh": "而具體來說，這個 ngModel 指令可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.01,
          "end": 238.14,
          "en": "with that two-way binding feature.",
          "zh": "和那個雙向綁定功能一起使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.14,
          "end": 241.17,
          "en": "I'm about to show you to set up some",
          "zh": "我即將讓你看如何設定某種"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 241.17,
          "end": 245.67,
          "en": "life tracking connection to the value entered by the user,",
          "zh": "與使用者輸入值的即時追蹤連線，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 245.67,
          "end": 248.82,
          "en": "so that you can keep track of it with every keystroke",
          "zh": "這樣你就能在每次按鍵時追蹤它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 248.82,
          "end": 252.393,
          "en": "and so that you could also override it if needed.",
          "zh": "也可以在需要時覆寫它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 253.62,
          "end": 256.71,
          "en": "Which looks like this.",
          "zh": "看起來像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 256.71,
          "end": 260.49,
          "en": "You wrap it with parentheses,",
          "zh": "你用圓括號包住它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 260.49,
          "end": 263.703,
          "en": "and then you wrap that with square brackets.",
          "zh": "然後再用方括號包住那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 264.75,
          "end": 269.04,
          "en": "And this is a special syntax built into Angular",
          "zh": "而這是內建於 Angular 的特殊語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 269.04,
          "end": 272.15999999999997,
          "en": "that sets up two-way binding",
          "zh": "它在這個情況為這個 ngModel 指令"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 272.15999999999997,
          "end": 275.7,
          "en": "for this ngModel directive in this case.",
          "zh": "設定雙向綁定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 275.7,
          "end": 280.7,
          "en": "Now this two-way binding syntax can not be used",
          "zh": "現在這個雙向綁定語法不能用在"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 281.49,
          "end": 284.97,
          "en": "on any property of elements.",
          "zh": "元素的任何屬性上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 284.97,
          "end": 289.97,
          "en": "Instead by default, no element properties supported.",
          "zh": "預設反而沒有元素屬性支援它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 290.82,
          "end": 295.29,
          "en": "NgModel, however, is a directive offered by Angular,",
          "zh": "不過 ngModel 是 Angular 提供的一個指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 295.29,
          "end": 298.71,
          "en": "which does support two-way binding.",
          "zh": "它確實支援雙向綁定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 298.71,
          "end": 302.07,
          "en": "Later in the course, when we dive deeper into components",
          "zh": "稍後在課程裡，當我們更深入元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 302.07,
          "end": 305.88,
          "en": "and directives, and other things, you will also learn",
          "zh": "和指令以及其他東西時，你也會學到"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 305.88,
          "end": 309.63,
          "en": "how to support two-way binding on your own properties",
          "zh": "如何在你自己的屬性上支援雙向綁定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 309.63,
          "end": 311.94,
          "en": "in your own components for example.",
          "zh": "例如在你自己的元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 311.94,
          "end": 315.12,
          "en": "But for the moment, we'll use this ngModel directive,",
          "zh": "但目前，我們會使用這個 ngModel 指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 315.12,
          "end": 318.12,
          "en": "which was built by the Angular team",
          "zh": "它由 Angular 團隊建立，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 318.12,
          "end": 322.32,
          "en": "to help us with getting input from input elements.",
          "zh": "用來幫助我們從 input 元素取得輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 322.32,
          "end": 324.78,
          "en": "And that's exactly what we're trying to do here,",
          "zh": "而那正是我們在這裡試著做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 324.78,
          "end": 328.44,
          "en": "and we can do it with help of this two-way binding syntax,",
          "zh": "而我們可以藉助這個雙向綁定語法來做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 328.44,
          "end": 332.73,
          "en": "which is supported by this ngModel directive.",
          "zh": "這個 ngModel 指令支援它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 332.73,
          "end": 337.73,
          "en": "So you can think of this ngModel thing here",
          "zh": "所以你可以把這裡這個 ngModel 想成"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 337.74,
          "end": 342.42,
          "en": "basically as something that's placed on an input element",
          "zh": "基本上是放在一個 input 元素上的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 342.42,
          "end": 347.31,
          "en": "to add extra features and properties to that element",
          "zh": "給那個元素加上額外功能和屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 347.31,
          "end": 349.62,
          "en": "under the hood, behind the scenes.",
          "zh": "在底層、在幕後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 349.62,
          "end": 352.89,
          "en": "Like for example, this ngModel property,",
          "zh": "例如這個 ngModel 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 352.89,
          "end": 355.8,
          "en": "which supports two-way binding.",
          "zh": "它支援雙向綁定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 355.8,
          "end": 360.42,
          "en": "And in general, the idea behind this directives feature",
          "zh": "而一般來說，這項指令功能背後的想法"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 360.42,
          "end": 364.35,
          "en": "is that you can build things, directives,",
          "zh": "是你可以建立一些東西，也就是指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 364.35,
          "end": 368.13,
          "en": "which enhance the elements on which they are placed",
          "zh": "它們增強被放置其上的元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 368.13,
          "end": 371.94,
          "en": "by adding extra features, extra behaviors,",
          "zh": "藉由加上額外功能、額外行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 371.94,
          "end": 373.98,
          "en": "or properties to them,",
          "zh": "或屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 373.98,
          "end": 377.25,
          "en": "like the ngModel directive does it here.",
          "zh": "就像 ngModel 指令在這裡做的那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 377.25,
          "end": 379.17,
          "en": "And again, you will learn",
          "zh": "而同樣，你稍後會學到"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 379.17,
          "end": 381.54,
          "en": "how to build your own directives later,",
          "zh": "如何建立你自己的指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 381.54,
          "end": 384.48,
          "en": "and then also see how they work behind the scenes.",
          "zh": "然後也會看到它們在幕後如何運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 384.48,
          "end": 386.82,
          "en": "But for the moment, we can use ngModel",
          "zh": "但目前，我們可以使用 ngModel"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 386.82,
          "end": 391.5,
          "en": "with this two-way binding syntax here to give you access",
          "zh": "搭配這裡這個雙向綁定語法，讓你能取得"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 391.5,
          "end": 395.88,
          "en": "to the value entered into this input field by the user,",
          "zh": "使用者輸入到這個 input 欄位裡的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 395.88,
          "end": 398.64,
          "en": "whilst at the same time allowing you",
          "zh": "同時也允許你"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 398.64,
          "end": 401.85,
          "en": "to write data back into this input.",
          "zh": "把資料寫回這個 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 401.85,
          "end": 404.01,
          "en": "That's what two-way binding means.",
          "zh": "那就是雙向綁定的意思。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 404.01,
          "end": 405.48,
          "en": "You can listen to input,",
          "zh": "你可以監聽輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 405.48,
          "end": 409.92,
          "en": "but also output data both with one syntax,",
          "zh": "也可以輸出資料，兩者用同一種語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 409.92,
          "end": 411.963,
          "en": "with this syntax here.",
          "zh": "就是這裡這個語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 413.52,
          "end": 417.87,
          "en": "Now this two-way binding syntax then needs a property",
          "zh": "現在這個雙向綁定語法接著需要一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 417.87,
          "end": 419.64,
          "en": "to which you wanna bind.",
          "zh": "你想綁定的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 419.64,
          "end": 422.227,
          "en": "In my case here, the enteredTitle.",
          "zh": "在我這裡的情況，是 enteredTitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 423.63,
          "end": 425.94,
          "en": "But as you'll see, I will get an error",
          "zh": "但如你將會看到的，如果我試著像這樣設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 425.94,
          "end": 427.74,
          "en": "if I try to set it up like this.",
          "zh": "我會得到一個錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 427.74,
          "end": 431.55,
          "en": "And the error is that we can't bind to ngModel,",
          "zh": "而錯誤是我們不能綁定到 ngModel，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 431.55,
          "end": 434.91,
          "en": "since it isn't a known property of input.",
          "zh": "因為它不是 input 的已知屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 434.91,
          "end": 439.5,
          "en": "So in the end, ngModel is unknown to Angular.",
          "zh": "所以最後，ngModel 對 Angular 來說是未知的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 439.5,
          "end": 443.49,
          "en": "And the reason for that is that just like components,",
          "zh": "而原因是，就像你在範本裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 443.49,
          "end": 445.89,
          "en": "you are trying to use in your template,",
          "zh": "試著使用的元件一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 445.89,
          "end": 449.58,
          "en": "you have to register this directive",
          "zh": "你必須註冊這個指令"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 449.58,
          "end": 451.743,
          "en": "in order to be able to use it.",
          "zh": "才能使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 452.64,
          "end": 456.69,
          "en": "So we must go to the new-task.component.ts file.",
          "zh": "所以我們必須前往 new-task.component.ts 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 456.69,
          "end": 458.94,
          "en": "And then here in the imports array,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡的 imports 陣列裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 458.94,
          "end": 462.09000000000003,
          "en": "we have to register this directive.",
          "zh": "我們必須註冊這個指令。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 462.09000000000003,
          "end": 466.443,
          "en": "And that's typically done by registering the FormsModule,",
          "zh": "而那通常是藉由註冊 FormsModule 來完成的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 467.34000000000003,
          "end": 472.293,
          "en": "which is a thing imported from @angular/forms.",
          "zh": "它是從 @angular/forms 匯入的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 474.09000000000003,
          "end": 477.51,
          "en": "And you can think of that FormsModule",
          "zh": "而你可以把那個 FormsModule"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 477.51,
          "end": 482.34,
          "en": "as a collection of directives and features",
          "zh": "想成一組指令和功能的集合，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 482.34,
          "end": 487.34,
          "en": "that help you with dealing with forms and with user input.",
          "zh": "它們幫助你處理表單和使用者輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 487.92,
          "end": 490.95,
          "en": "And will use another feature of that FormsModule",
          "zh": "而我們會使用那個 FormsModule 的另一項功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 490.95,
          "end": 492.39300000000003,
          "en": "in a couple of minutes.",
          "zh": "在幾分鐘後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 493.29,
          "end": 495.99,
          "en": "This FormsModule when registered here",
          "zh": "這個 FormsModule 在這裡被註冊後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 495.99,
          "end": 499.44,
          "en": "then unlocks the ngModel directive.",
          "zh": "接著就解鎖 ngModel 指令。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 499.44,
          "end": 502.98,
          "en": "And that directive supports this two-way binding syntax,",
          "zh": "而那個指令支援這個雙向綁定語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 502.98,
          "end": 505.77,
          "en": "which allows us to set up two-way binding",
          "zh": "它讓我們能在這個 enteredTitle 屬性上"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 505.77,
          "end": 508.593,
          "en": "on this enteredTitle property.",
          "zh": "設定雙向綁定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 510,
          "end": 513.99,
          "en": "And you can see the two-way binding in action",
          "zh": "而你可以看到雙向綁定的作用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 513.99,
          "end": 518.01,
          "en": "by copying this paragraph with this input here",
          "zh": "藉由複製這裡這個帶有這個 input 的段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 518.01,
          "end": 519.75,
          "en": "and pasting it in here.",
          "zh": "並把它貼在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 519.75,
          "end": 524.433,
          "en": "And then I'll name it title2 also on the id and the name.",
          "zh": "然後我會把它也在 id 和 name 上命名為 title2。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 525.45,
          "end": 527.7,
          "en": "But I'll keep this two-way binding",
          "zh": "但我會讓這個雙向綁定"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 527.7,
          "end": 531.243,
          "en": "to the exact same property on both inputs.",
          "zh": "在兩個 input 上都指向完全相同的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 533.1,
          "end": 535.98,
          "en": "And if you know, save that and you that dialogue,",
          "zh": "而如果你現在儲存那個並打開那個對話框，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 535.98,
          "end": 538.23,
          "en": "you therefore see these two titles.",
          "zh": "你因此會看到這兩個標題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 538.23,
          "end": 541.77,
          "en": "But you'll notice that if you type into the first input,",
          "zh": "但你會注意到，如果你在第一個 input 裡打字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 541.77,
          "end": 544.743,
          "en": "the second one changes as well.",
          "zh": "第二個也會跟著改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 545.94,
          "end": 549.42,
          "en": "And that's happening, because it is two-way binding.",
          "zh": "而那會發生，是因為它是雙向綁定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 549.42,
          "end": 551.49,
          "en": "We get the value that's being entered,",
          "zh": "我們取得正在被輸入的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 551.49,
          "end": 554.793,
          "en": "but we also then write it back into the input field.",
          "zh": "但我們接著也把它寫回 input 欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 556.65,
          "end": 559.26,
          "en": "That's why this can be a very useful feature,",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼這可以是非常有用的功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 559.26,
          "end": 562.77,
          "en": "even though here, we of course don't need that second input.",
          "zh": "即使在這裡，我們當然不需要那個第二個 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 562.77,
          "end": 564.243,
          "en": "So I will delete it here.",
          "zh": "所以我會在這裡刪掉它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 565.56,
          "end": 568.83,
          "en": "But therefore now, the enteredTitle property",
          "zh": "但因此現在，enteredTitle 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 568.83,
          "end": 572.523,
          "en": "will be updated under the hood with every keystroke.",
          "zh": "會在每次按鍵時於幕後被更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 574.53,
          "end": 576.455,
          "en": "And therefore, we can of course also add",
          "zh": "因此我們當然也可以加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 576.455,
          "end": 581.455,
          "en": "enteredSummary property in the new task component clause.",
          "zh": "new task 元件類別裡的 enteredSummary 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 582.6,
          "end": 586.41,
          "en": "And an enteredDate property,",
          "zh": "以及一個 enteredDate 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 586.41,
          "end": 588.483,
          "en": "which also should hold a string.",
          "zh": "它也應該持有一個字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 590.49,
          "end": 594.6,
          "en": "And then back in the new-task.component template,",
          "zh": "然後回到 new-task.component 範本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 594.6,
          "end": 597.78,
          "en": "we can and should copy this ngModel code",
          "zh": "我們可以、也應該複製這段 ngModel 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 597.78,
          "end": 599.973,
          "en": "and also add it on the text area.",
          "zh": "並也把它加到 textarea 上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 601.02,
          "end": 604.953,
          "en": "But then here, I wanna bind the enteredSummary,",
          "zh": "但然後在這裡，我想綁定 enteredSummary，"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 606.15,
          "end": 609.24,
          "en": "and add it to this due-date input,",
          "zh": "並把它加到這個 due-date input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 609.24,
          "end": 610.803,
          "en": "and bind the enteredDate.",
          "zh": "並綁定 enteredDate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 612.63,
          "end": 617.63,
          "en": "And as a side note, inputs in HTML will always",
          "zh": "附帶一提，HTML 裡的 input 總是"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 618.48,
          "end": 622.29,
          "en": "yield string values, even if it's of type date,",
          "zh": "產生字串值，即使它的型別是 date，"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 622.29,
          "end": 624.6,
          "en": "it will not yield a date object,",
          "zh": "它也不會產生一個日期物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 624.6,
          "end": 627.81,
          "en": "instead, it will yield a string value.",
          "zh": "而是會產生一個字串值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 627.81,
          "end": 631.803,
          "en": "That's why I also made enteredDate a string here.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我也把這裡的 enteredDate 做成字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 633.57,
          "end": 637.89,
          "en": "And with that, we'll now be updating these three properties",
          "zh": "而這樣，我們現在會更新這三個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 637.89,
          "end": 641.34,
          "en": "as we're typing into their respective input fields.",
          "zh": "在我們對各自的 input 欄位打字時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 641.34,
          "end": 644.613,
          "en": "Now we just also have to handle the form submission.",
          "zh": "現在我們也必須處理表單送出。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43788634",
      "title": "Signals & Two-Way-Binding",
      "lectureOrder": 54,
      "videoOrder": 50,
      "sourceHash": "fe79d9ff9d685ab52137d2085baa15ef1e8c7f3f55400ebee0745f416ee07498",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.26,
          "en": "- Now, before we handle the form",
          "zh": "現在，在我們處理表單"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.26,
          "end": 4.88,
          "en": "- submission though, I briefly want to",
          "zh": "送出之前，我想簡短地"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.88,
          "end": 7.08,
          "en": "- show you how you could use two-way",
          "zh": "讓你看看你可以如何使用雙向"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.08,
          "end": 9.76,
          "en": "- binding and this syntax here with",
          "zh": "綁定，以及這裡這個語法搭配"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.76,
          "end": 12.86,
          "en": "- signals, because at the moment I'm not",
          "zh": "signal，因為目前我沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.86,
          "end": 13.92,
          "en": "- using signals here.",
          "zh": "在這裡使用 signal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.18,
          "end": 17.44,
          "en": "- These are regular properties and we rely",
          "zh": "這些是一般屬性，而我們依賴"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.44,
          "end": 19.38,
          "en": "- on the standard angular change",
          "zh": "標準的 Angular 變更"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.38,
          "end": 21.34,
          "en": "- detection mechanism for finding out",
          "zh": "偵測機制，來找出"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.34,
          "end": 22.96,
          "en": "- whether they changed and for updating",
          "zh": "它們是否改變，並更新"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 22.96,
          "end": 23.46,
          "en": "- the UI.",
          "zh": "使用者介面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.04,
          "end": 27.86,
          "en": "- Now we could be using signals here, by",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在這裡使用 signal，藉由"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 27.86,
          "end": 30.54,
          "en": "- calling the signal function, which must",
          "zh": "呼叫 signal 函式，它必須"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 30.54,
          "end": 34.62,
          "en": "- be imported from atAngularCore, and by",
          "zh": "從 @angular/core 匯入，並藉由"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.62,
          "end": 37,
          "en": "- then wrapping our initial values with it,",
          "zh": "接著用它包住我們的初始值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 37.5,
          "end": 40.32,
          "en": "- so that these values are assigned as",
          "zh": "這樣這些值就被指派為"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 40.32,
          "end": 43.38,
          "en": "- initial values for those signals, but they",
          "zh": "那些 signal 的初始值，但它們"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.38,
          "end": 45.54,
          "en": "- can of course now also be changed to",
          "zh": "當然現在也可以被改成"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 45.54,
          "end": 46.7,
          "en": "- get updated values.",
          "zh": "更新後的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 48.319,
          "end": 50.12,
          "en": "- Now how can we change them with",
          "zh": "現在我們要如何藉助"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 50.12,
          "end": 51.64,
          "en": "- help of two-way binding though?",
          "zh": "雙向綁定來改變它們呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 52.28,
          "end": 54.26,
          "en": "- Well, nothing easier than that.",
          "zh": "嗯，沒有比這更容易的了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 54.74,
          "end": 56.82,
          "en": "- All you have to do is set up two-way",
          "zh": "你要做的就是設定雙向"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 56.82,
          "end": 58.7,
          "en": "- binding as you did it before.",
          "zh": "綁定，就像你之前做的那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 59.52,
          "end": 62.08,
          "en": "- So this code here does not need to",
          "zh": "所以這裡這段程式碼不需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 62.08,
          "end": 64.099,
          "en": "- change, because Angular will",
          "zh": "改變，因為 Angular 會"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 64.099,
          "end": 67.4,
          "en": "- automatically detect that entered title,",
          "zh": "自動偵測 enteredTitle、"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 67.7,
          "end": 70.48,
          "en": "- entered summary and so on are now",
          "zh": "enteredSummary 等等現在是"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 70.48,
          "end": 73.82,
          "en": "- signals and ngModel will behave",
          "zh": "signal，而 ngModel 會相應地"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 73.82,
          "end": 77,
          "en": "- accordingly and will read those signals",
          "zh": "運作，並在內部讀取那些 signal"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 77,
          "end": 79.7,
          "en": "- internally to get the value that should be",
          "zh": "以取得應該被"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 79.7,
          "end": 82.74,
          "en": "- set on the input and will update those",
          "zh": "設到 input 上的值，並在值改變時更新那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 82.74,
          "end": 85.02,
          "en": "- signals whenever the value changes,",
          "zh": "signal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 85.32,
          "end": 87.68,
          "en": "- because the user types into these input",
          "zh": "因為使用者在這些 input"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 87.68,
          "end": 88.06,
          "en": "- fields.",
          "zh": "欄位裡打字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 88.98,
          "end": 91.03999999999999,
          "en": "- So you don't need to do anything in a",
          "zh": "所以你不需要在"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 91.03999999999999,
          "end": 93.68,
          "en": "- template in order to work with signals",
          "zh": "範本裡做任何事，就能使用 signal"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 93.68,
          "end": 96.16,
          "en": "- instead of those standard properties.",
          "zh": "而不是那些標準屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 97.62,
          "end": 99.8,
          "en": "- It's especially important that you don't",
          "zh": "特別重要的是你不要"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 99.8,
          "end": 102.38,
          "en": "- start reading the signals, though you",
          "zh": "開始讀取那些 signal，不過如果你試著這樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 102.38,
          "end": 104.22,
          "en": "- should get an error if you try to.",
          "zh": "你應該會得到一個錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 104.52000000000001,
          "end": 106.6,
          "en": "- You should get an error that this is an",
          "zh": "你應該會得到一個錯誤，說這是一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 106.6,
          "end": 108.32,
          "en": "- unsupported expression in a two-way",
          "zh": "雙向綁定裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 108.32,
          "end": 108.74000000000001,
          "en": "- binding.",
          "zh": "不支援的運算式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 109.88,
          "end": 112.84,
          "en": "- Because again, Angular will read those",
          "zh": "因為同樣，當我們像這裡這樣把 signal"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 112.84,
          "end": 116.53999999999999,
          "en": "- signal values for you when using signals",
          "zh": "和雙向綁定"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 116.53999999999999,
          "end": 119,
          "en": "- in conjunction with two-way binding",
          "zh": "以及 ngModel 一起使用時，Angular 會替你讀取那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 119,
          "end": 121.46,
          "en": "- and ngModel as we're doing it here.",
          "zh": "signal 值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 123.1,
          "end": 126.16,
          "en": "- With that, I'll get rid of signal here",
          "zh": "這樣，我會把這裡的 signal 拿掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 126.16,
          "end": 127.86,
          "en": "- though, because I don't want to use",
          "zh": "因為我不想在這裡使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 127.86,
          "end": 130.36,
          "en": "- signals here and I'll also get rid of the",
          "zh": "signal，我也會拿掉"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 130.36,
          "end": 132.4,
          "en": "- import which was added, but it's of",
          "zh": "被加上的那個 import，但"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 132.4,
          "end": 133.76,
          "en": "- course important to know how you",
          "zh": "當然重要的是知道你要如何"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 133.76,
          "end": 136.04,
          "en": "- could use signals with two-way binding",
          "zh": "把 signal 和雙向綁定一起使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 136.04,
          "end": 137.06,
          "en": "- and now you do.",
          "zh": "而現在你知道了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43788640",
      "title": "Handling Form Submission",
      "lectureOrder": 55,
      "videoOrder": 51,
      "sourceHash": "d37100c1814bf33ef5b5d163685a7e5df55cf0f94d83e1b8daaeb66f27803600",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 1.98,
          "en": "So how do we now handle",
          "zh": "那麼，我們現在要如何處理"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.98,
          "end": 3.72,
          "en": "the submission of this form",
          "zh": "這個表單的提交，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 3.72,
          "end": 6.42,
          "en": "so that we can then close the dialogue",
          "zh": "好讓我們能關閉對話框，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.42,
          "end": 10.233,
          "en": "and add this data to the tasks array?",
          "zh": "並把這些資料加入 tasks 陣列呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.34,
          "end": 13.92,
          "en": "Well, the way HTML works",
          "zh": "HTML 的運作方式是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.92,
          "end": 18.18,
          "en": "is such that if you have a Submit button in a form,",
          "zh": "如果表單裡有一個 Submit 按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.18,
          "end": 19.92,
          "en": "as it's the case here,",
          "zh": "就像這裡一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.92,
          "end": 24.12,
          "en": "that button when pressed will automatically submit the form",
          "zh": "按下這個按鈕時，表單就會自動提交，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.12,
          "end": 27.42,
          "en": "and the browser will then try to send a request",
          "zh": "接著瀏覽器會嘗試把表單資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.42,
          "end": 32.42,
          "en": "with that form data to the server that served the website.",
          "zh": "以請求的形式送到提供這個網站的伺服器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.85,
          "end": 34.89,
          "en": "Now, that's a problem here,",
          "zh": "但這在這裡會是個問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.89,
          "end": 37.59,
          "en": "because that would be our development server,",
          "zh": "因為那會是我們的開發伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.59,
          "end": 42.48,
          "en": "which is not configured to take incoming data requests",
          "zh": "而它並沒有設定成可以接收"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.48,
          "end": 44.52,
          "en": "that wanna submit data.",
          "zh": "想要提交資料的請求。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.52,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "We don't support that here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡並不支援這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 49.26,
          "en": "This server really only exists",
          "zh": "這個伺服器其實只是用來"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.26,
          "end": 51.483,
          "en": "to serve the index.html file.",
          "zh": "提供 index.html 檔案而已。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.83,
          "end": 56.22,
          "en": "Therefore we wanna prevent that browser default.",
          "zh": "因此，我們要阻止瀏覽器的這個預設行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.22,
          "end": 59.37,
          "en": "We wanna make sure that no such request is sent",
          "zh": "我們要確保不會送出這樣的請求，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.37,
          "end": 62.61,
          "en": "so that we can instead handle the submission",
          "zh": "好讓我們改用 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.61,
          "end": 65.343,
          "en": "in JavaScript on the client side.",
          "zh": "在用戶端處理這次提交。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.81,
          "end": 71.07,
          "en": "And preventing this browser default behavior",
          "zh": "而在使用 Angular 時，要阻止瀏覽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.07,
          "end": 74.13,
          "en": "of creating and sending that request",
          "zh": "建立並送出請求的這種預設行為"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.13,
          "end": 77.52,
          "en": "is pretty simple when using Angular,",
          "zh": "其實非常簡單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.52,
          "end": 80.22,
          "en": "because it will actually automatically",
          "zh": "因為它實際上會自動"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.22,
          "end": 82.14,
          "en": "be prevented for you",
          "zh": "幫你阻止這件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.14,
          "end": 85.89,
          "en": "if you're importing that FormsModule,",
          "zh": "只要你匯入了 FormsModule 就行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.89,
          "end": 90.89,
          "en": "which we did add to the imports to unlock ngModel,",
          "zh": "而我們為了使用 ngModel，已經把它加進 imports 了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.26,
          "end": 95.37,
          "en": "because this FormsModule inside of it",
          "zh": "這是因為 FormsModule 內部"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.37,
          "end": 99.6,
          "en": "includes a component built by the Angular team,",
          "zh": "包含了一個由 Angular 團隊打造的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.6,
          "end": 101.75999999999999,
          "en": "which uses the form element,",
          "zh": "這個元件使用 form 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.75999999999999,
          "end": 105.66,
          "en": "the standard form element tag, as a selector,",
          "zh": "也就是標準的 form 標籤作為選擇器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.66,
          "end": 108.96000000000001,
          "en": "and which therefore takes control of this form,",
          "zh": "因此它會在背後自動"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.96000000000001,
          "end": 111.06,
          "en": "under the hood automatically,",
          "zh": "接管這個表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.06,
          "end": 114.273,
          "en": "simply by importing this FormsModule.",
          "zh": "只要匯入 FormsModule 就會如此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.28999999999999,
          "end": 117.53999999999999,
          "en": "And this form component,",
          "zh": "而這個 form 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.53999999999999,
          "end": 120.09,
          "en": "which took control of this form here,",
          "zh": "接管了這裡的表單之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.09,
          "end": 124.2,
          "en": "will automatically listen to the submission of the form",
          "zh": "就會自動監聽表單的提交，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.2,
          "end": 127.8,
          "en": "and then prevent that browser default",
          "zh": "並在提交發生時"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.8,
          "end": 130.83,
          "en": "when that submission occurs.",
          "zh": "阻止瀏覽器的預設行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.83,
          "end": 134.4,
          "en": "So therefore, you technically don't need to do anything",
          "zh": "所以嚴格來說，你不需要做任何事"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.4,
          "end": 137.55,
          "en": "to prevent that default.",
          "zh": "來阻止這個預設行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.55,
          "end": 139.74,
          "en": "Now of course we want to be notified",
          "zh": "當然，我們還是希望在提交發生時"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.74,
          "end": 141.84,
          "en": "when such a submission occurs though,",
          "zh": "能收到通知，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.84,
          "end": 145.38,
          "en": "and we wanna run our own code when it happens.",
          "zh": "並在那時執行我們自己的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.38,
          "end": 147.96,
          "en": "And therefore this FormsModule,",
          "zh": "因此，這個接管了 form 元素的"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.96,
          "end": 151.07999999999998,
          "en": "which took control of this form element",
          "zh": "FormsModule"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.07999999999998,
          "end": 155.73,
          "en": "also gives you a special event that will be emitted.",
          "zh": "也提供了一個會被發出的特殊事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.73,
          "end": 158.25,
          "en": "The ngSubmit event",
          "zh": "也就是 ngSubmit 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.25,
          "end": 161.79,
          "en": "to which you can listen on this form element,",
          "zh": "你可以在這個 form 元素上監聽它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.79,
          "end": 165.6,
          "en": "which will occur when that form submission happened",
          "zh": "它會在表單提交發生、"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.6,
          "end": 169.59,
          "en": "and that browser default was prevented.",
          "zh": "而且瀏覽器預設行為被阻止之後觸發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.59,
          "end": 173.07,
          "en": "And you can then run your own code in response",
          "zh": "接著你就可以執行自己的程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.07,
          "end": 175.2,
          "en": "to this ngSubmit event.",
          "zh": "來回應這個 ngSubmit 事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.2,
          "end": 176.7,
          "en": "So therefore, by simply",
          "zh": "所以，只要"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.7,
          "end": 179.55,
          "en": "setting up event binding to ngSubmit",
          "zh": "對 ngSubmit 設定事件繫結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.55,
          "end": 182.04,
          "en": "and then running any code of your choice,",
          "zh": "然後執行任何你想要的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.04,
          "end": 185.64,
          "en": "you will be able to handle this form submission on your own",
          "zh": "就能在你的 Angular 程式碼中"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.64,
          "end": 188.13,
          "en": "in your Angular code.",
          "zh": "自行處理這次表單提交。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.13,
          "end": 189.18,
          "en": "And for that I'll add",
          "zh": "為此，我會在這裡新增"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.18,
          "end": 193.653,
          "en": "a new method here onSubmit, sounds like a fitting name,",
          "zh": "一個新的方法 onSubmit，這名稱聽起來很合適，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 194.58,
          "end": 198.663,
          "en": "and I'll bind this to the ngSubmit event like this.",
          "zh": "然後像這樣把它繫結到 ngSubmit 事件上。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43788644",
      "title": "Using the Submitted Data",
      "lectureOrder": 56,
      "videoOrder": 52,
      "sourceHash": "6dc05aeb76ccf9301b4541bbe10c53a65aa36062d7b09e09031f75979c70e4c1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 2.67,
          "en": "Now since we have that two-way binding,",
          "zh": "既然我們有了雙向繫結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.67,
          "end": 5.808,
          "en": "which populates, enteredTitle, enteredSummary,",
          "zh": "它會填入 enteredTitle、enteredSummary"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.808,
          "end": 10.41,
          "en": "and enteredDate, we can use these properties in onSubmit",
          "zh": "和 enteredDate，我們就能在 onSubmit 中使用這些屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.41,
          "end": 14.793,
          "en": "to construct a new task or do whatever we wanna do.",
          "zh": "來建立新任務，或做任何我們想做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.2,
          "end": 21.2,
          "en": "And what I wanna do here is let the TasksComponent,",
          "zh": "而我在這裡想做的，是讓管理所有任務的"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.27,
          "end": 23.28,
          "en": "which manages all my tasks,",
          "zh": "TasksComponent"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.28,
          "end": 27.84,
          "en": "know about that new task data that has been submitted,",
          "zh": "知道剛剛提交的新任務資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.84,
          "end": 32.01,
          "en": "so that we can add a new task there to this tasks array,",
          "zh": "這樣我們就能在那裡把新任務加入 tasks 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.01,
          "end": 34.62,
          "en": "and so that we can close the dialogue",
          "zh": "也能透過把 this.isAddingTask 設為 false"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.62,
          "end": 38.4,
          "en": "by setting this.isAddingTask to false.",
          "zh": "來關閉對話框。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.4,
          "end": 40.44,
          "en": "So in the NewTaskComponent,",
          "zh": "所以在 NewTaskComponent 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.44,
          "end": 43.83,
          "en": "we wanna emit another new event here,",
          "zh": "我們要在這裡發出另一個新事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.83,
          "end": 47.55,
          "en": "the add event, for example.",
          "zh": "例如 add 事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.55,
          "end": 49.44,
          "en": "As always, this name is up to you,",
          "zh": "一如往常，名稱由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.44,
          "end": 53.19,
          "en": "but it should describe the event that's occurring.",
          "zh": "但它應該要能描述所發生的事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.19,
          "end": 55.86,
          "en": "And we create a new EventEmitter object for that,",
          "zh": "我們為此建立一個新的 EventEmitter 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.86,
          "end": 60.09,
          "en": "but this time we will be submitting some data.",
          "zh": "不過這次我們會送出一些資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.09,
          "end": 64.35,
          "en": "And the data I wanna submit here is an object,",
          "zh": "我想送出的資料是一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.35,
          "end": 67.68,
          "en": "since I wanna submit the title, summary, and date.",
          "zh": "因為我要送出標題、摘要和日期。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.68,
          "end": 69.27,
          "en": "So it should be an object",
          "zh": "所以它應該是一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.27,
          "end": 73.203,
          "en": "that has a title key which will hold a value of type string,",
          "zh": "有一個 title 鍵，其值為字串型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 74.1,
          "end": 78.09,
          "en": "a summary key which will hold a value of type string,",
          "zh": "一個 summary 鍵，其值為字串型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.09,
          "end": 82.293,
          "en": "and a date key which will hold a value of type string.",
          "zh": "還有一個 date 鍵，其值也是字串型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 84.75,
          "end": 88.56,
          "en": "And then here in onSubmit, we use this add property",
          "zh": "然後在 onSubmit 中，我們使用這個 add 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 88.56,
          "end": 93.56,
          "en": "to emit a new event, and we pass our object to emit.",
          "zh": "來發出新事件，並把物件傳給 emit。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 94.38,
          "end": 98.523,
          "en": "And that object now must have a title property,",
          "zh": "而這個物件現在必須有 title 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 99.66,
          "end": 101.94,
          "en": "because of this generic type we added here,",
          "zh": "因為我們在這裡加了泛型型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 101.94,
          "end": 104.19,
          "en": "and that is why we are adding it,",
          "zh": "這也正是我們加上它的原因，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 104.19,
          "end": 107.913,
          "en": "so that we do add the proper type down here when we emit.",
          "zh": "這樣在下方 emit 時才能確保型別正確。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 109.11,
          "end": 111.607,
          "en": "And the title is of course this.enteredTitle,",
          "zh": "title 當然就是 this.enteredTitle，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 113.16,
          "end": 116.013,
          "en": "the summary is this.enteredSummary,",
          "zh": "summary 是 this.enteredSummary，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 116.88,
          "end": 119.553,
          "en": "and the date is this.enteredDate,",
          "zh": "date 則是 this.enteredDate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 122.22,
          "end": 124.95,
          "en": "like this, that's the finished code here",
          "zh": "像這樣，這就是 NewTaskComponent 類別中"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 124.95,
          "end": 127.32300000000001,
          "en": "in the NewTaskComponent class.",
          "zh": "完成的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 128.49,
          "end": 132.15,
          "en": "Now we can go to the tasks.component template,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以前往 tasks.component 範本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 132.15,
          "end": 135.75,
          "en": "and there on this NewTaskComponent instance,",
          "zh": "在這個 NewTaskComponent 實例上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 135.75,
          "end": 137.673,
          "en": "we can listen to this add event.",
          "zh": "監聽這個 add 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 138.84,
          "end": 143.84,
          "en": "And then trigger a new method in the TasksComponent class,",
          "zh": "然後觸發 TasksComponent 類別中的一個新方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 146.7,
          "end": 150.813,
          "en": "which we can call onAddTask, for example.",
          "zh": "例如可以叫做 onAddTask。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 152.07,
          "end": 155.82,
          "en": "And here of course I expect to get my taskData,",
          "zh": "當然，我預期在這裡會收到 taskData，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 155.82,
          "end": 157.92000000000002,
          "en": "which again should be an object",
          "zh": "它同樣應該是一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 157.92000000000002,
          "end": 160.2,
          "en": "that has that shape I described",
          "zh": "具有我在 new-task.component.ts 檔案中"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 160.2,
          "end": 164.013,
          "en": "in my new-task.component.ts file.",
          "zh": "描述的那種結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 164.91,
          "end": 167.52,
          "en": "And now since I need the same type definition",
          "zh": "既然我需要在多個檔案中"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 167.52,
          "end": 171.723,
          "en": "in multiple files, I actually wanna outsource it again.",
          "zh": "使用相同的型別定義，我其實想再次把它抽出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 172.95,
          "end": 177.95,
          "en": "And we could outsource it here in a new-task.model.ts file",
          "zh": "我們可以把它抽到新的 new-task.model.ts 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 178.38,
          "end": 183.24,
          "en": "or we could merge it into the existing task.model.ts file,",
          "zh": "也可以合併到現有的 task.model.ts 檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 183.24,
          "end": 184.29,
          "en": "that is up to you.",
          "zh": "這由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 184.29,
          "end": 187.413,
          "en": "And I'll go for this approach where I merge it.",
          "zh": "我會採用合併的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 188.37,
          "end": 191.25,
          "en": "So here I export another interface,",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡匯出另一個 interface，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 191.25,
          "end": 196.05,
          "en": "I'll name it NewTaskData, that sounds like a fitting name.",
          "zh": "命名為 NewTaskData，聽起來很合適。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 196.05,
          "end": 200.463,
          "en": "And then I have my object definition here.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡放上我的物件定義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 201.78,
          "end": 205.47,
          "en": "Now in the new-task.component TypeScript file, instead",
          "zh": "接著在 new-task.component 的 TypeScript 檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 205.47,
          "end": 208.8,
          "en": "of defining this object type inline like this,",
          "zh": "我不再像這樣以行內方式定義物件型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 208.8,
          "end": 213.633,
          "en": "I'll use this NewTaskData type,",
          "zh": "而是改用這個 NewTaskData 型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 214.82999999999998,
          "end": 218.64,
          "en": "which must be imported from this task.model file.",
          "zh": "它必須從 task.model 檔案匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 218.64,
          "end": 221.463,
          "en": "And again, we can add this type annotation here.",
          "zh": "同樣地，我們可以在這裡加上型別註記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 224.55,
          "end": 229.55,
          "en": "And we can now do the same in the tasks.component file.",
          "zh": "接著也可以在 tasks.component 檔案中做同樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 229.68,
          "end": 234.14,
          "en": "There, the taskData we receive in this method should be",
          "zh": "在那裡，這個方法收到的 taskData"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 234.14,
          "end": 238.71,
          "en": "of that shape, so it should be that NewTaskData type.",
          "zh": "應該就是那種結構，也就是 NewTaskData 型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 238.71,
          "end": 242.46,
          "en": "And therefore of course, we also must import this type here",
          "zh": "因此，我們當然也必須在這個元件檔案中"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 242.46,
          "end": 245.85,
          "en": "in this component file.",
          "zh": "匯入這個型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 245.85,
          "end": 248.223,
          "en": "We can also add the type annotation here.",
          "zh": "我們也可以在這裡加上型別註記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 251.04,
          "end": 253.92,
          "en": "With that we know that we'll get such a task here,",
          "zh": "這樣我們就知道會在這裡拿到這樣的任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 253.92,
          "end": 258.12,
          "en": "and therefore we can then edit our tasks array",
          "zh": "接著就能修改 tasks 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 258.12,
          "end": 260.673,
          "en": "and push a new task onto it.",
          "zh": "把新任務 push 進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 262.14,
          "end": 267.14,
          "en": "Now this tasks array holds tasks that have this shape,",
          "zh": "這個 tasks 陣列中的任務都具有這樣的結構："
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 267.54,
          "end": 270.33299999999997,
          "en": "an id, and then title, summary, dueDate, and a userId.",
          "zh": "一個 id，以及 title、summary、dueDate 和 userId。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 273.45,
          "end": 274.283,
          "en": "So therefore,",
          "zh": "所以，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 274.283,
          "end": 277.56,
          "en": "the new task we wanna add here should have that same shape.",
          "zh": "我們要加入的新任務也應該具有相同的結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 277.56,
          "end": 281.07,
          "en": "And actually TypeScript thankfully forces us",
          "zh": "幸好 TypeScript 其實會強制我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 281.07,
          "end": 282.453,
          "en": "to have that shape here.",
          "zh": "在這裡遵守這個結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 283.83,
          "end": 287.64,
          "en": "So I'll add an id property here,",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡加上 id 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 287.64,
          "end": 290.52,
          "en": "and I wanna generate a new id here.",
          "zh": "並且想在這裡產生一個新的 id。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 290.52,
          "end": 295.23,
          "en": "So for simplicity reasons, I'll simply use the current date,",
          "zh": "為了簡單起見，我直接使用目前的日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 295.23,
          "end": 297.96,
          "en": "get the time in milliseconds,",
          "zh": "取得以毫秒為單位的時間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 297.96,
          "end": 300.75,
          "en": "and then convert this to a string.",
          "zh": "再把它轉成字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 300.75,
          "end": 303.36,
          "en": "It's not a perfectly unique id.",
          "zh": "這並不是絕對唯一的 id，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 303.36,
          "end": 307.2,
          "en": "We could generate two tasks at exactly the same point",
          "zh": "我們有可能在完全相同的時間點"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 307.2,
          "end": 310.563,
          "en": "of time, but it's definitely good enough for this demo.",
          "zh": "建立兩個任務，但對這個示範來說絕對夠用了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 312.09,
          "end": 315.18,
          "en": "And I'll also set the other fields.",
          "zh": "我也會設定其他欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 315.18,
          "end": 319.14,
          "en": "The title can be set to taskData.title.",
          "zh": "title 可以設為 taskData.title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 319.14,
          "end": 322.95,
          "en": "The summary should be set to taskData.summary,",
          "zh": "summary 應設為 taskData.summary，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 322.95,
          "end": 326.703,
          "en": "and the dueDate should be set to taskData.date.",
          "zh": "dueDate 則應設為 taskData.date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 327.66,
          "end": 331.233,
          "en": "But of course then we also need that userId here.",
          "zh": "當然，我們在這裡還需要 userId。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 332.34000000000003,
          "end": 337.34000000000003,
          "en": "And that userId is thankfully something which we have here,",
          "zh": "幸好這個 userId 我們在這裡已經有了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 337.71,
          "end": 339.243,
          "en": "because of this input.",
          "zh": "因為有這個 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 340.38,
          "end": 342.51,
          "en": "So we have that userId property",
          "zh": "我們有 userId 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 342.51,
          "end": 345.39300000000003,
          "en": "which holds the ID of the currently selected user.",
          "zh": "它存放著目前所選使用者的 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 346.98,
          "end": 351.557,
          "en": "So therefore userId is simply equal to this.userId,",
          "zh": "所以 userId 就直接等於 this.userId，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 353.7,
          "end": 357.42,
          "en": "and that should therefore then add a new task.",
          "zh": "這樣應該就能新增一個任務了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 357.42,
          "end": 359.85,
          "en": "By the way, if you would want to add it at the beginning",
          "zh": "順帶一提，如果你想把它加到陣列的"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 359.85,
          "end": 362.79,
          "en": "of the array, you could add the unshift method,",
          "zh": "開頭，可以改用 JavaScript 內建的"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 362.79,
          "end": 365.583,
          "en": "which is built into JavaScript, instead of push.",
          "zh": "unshift 方法，而不是 push。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 366.96,
          "end": 371.34,
          "en": "Now with that, we're almost there, but not quite.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就快完成了，但還差一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 371.34,
          "end": 376.34,
          "en": "We also want to set isAddingTask to false,",
          "zh": "我們也要把 isAddingTask 設為 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 377.07,
          "end": 378.963,
          "en": "so that we close the dialogue.",
          "zh": "這樣才能關閉對話框。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 380.01,
          "end": 383.943,
          "en": "And in the tasks.component template file,",
          "zh": "而在 tasks.component 範本檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 384.87,
          "end": 388.98,
          "en": "we of course have to set this add event,",
          "zh": "我們當然必須把 NewTaskComponent 發出的"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 388.98,
          "end": 391.68,
          "en": "which is emitted by the NewTaskComponent,",
          "zh": "這個 add 事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 391.68,
          "end": 394.86,
          "en": "to this newly added onAddTask method",
          "zh": "連接到新加的 onAddTask 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 394.86,
          "end": 397.503,
          "en": "and forward that emitted event data.",
          "zh": "並轉傳所發出的事件資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 400.2,
          "end": 403.74,
          "en": "And with that all done, if we now save everything,",
          "zh": "都完成之後，如果現在儲存所有檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 403.74,
          "end": 405.84000000000003,
          "en": "we can give this a try,",
          "zh": "就可以來試試看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 405.84000000000003,
          "end": 409.293,
          "en": "and enter some new data,",
          "zh": "輸入一些新資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 410.52,
          "end": 413.90999999999997,
          "en": "like this, pick a date,",
          "zh": "像這樣，選個日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 413.90999999999997,
          "end": 417.09000000000003,
          "en": "and if I click Create, the dialog closes,",
          "zh": "按下 Create 後，對話框就關閉了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 417.09000000000003,
          "end": 419.67,
          "en": "and my task shows up here,",
          "zh": "而我的任務出現在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 419.67,
          "end": 423.66,
          "en": "and only for that user, not for any other user.",
          "zh": "而且只會出現在這位使用者底下，不會出現在其他使用者那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 423.66,
          "end": 425.52,
          "en": "So that's working as it should.",
          "zh": "所以它運作得正如預期。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 425.52,
          "end": 427.44,
          "en": "We can also complete this task,",
          "zh": "我們也可以完成這個任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 427.44,
          "end": 429.75,
          "en": "and that's all looking good therefore.",
          "zh": "一切看起來都很好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 429.75,
          "end": 433.2,
          "en": "And hence we're almost done with this application,",
          "zh": "因此，這個應用程式已經快完成了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 433.2,
          "end": 434.88,
          "en": "but there still are a couple",
          "zh": "不過還有幾項"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 434.88,
          "end": 438.303,
          "en": "of improvements I wanna implement together with you.",
          "zh": "我想和你一起實作的改進。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43788646",
      "title": "Content Projection with ng-content",
      "lectureOrder": 57,
      "videoOrder": 53,
      "sourceHash": "67b7f27844382f6d5fd575225fc3c0da4df769cb362a1519ed9a16bae66d0665",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 3,
          "en": "So at this point,",
          "zh": "所以到目前為止，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3,
          "end": 5.88,
          "en": "the application here is almost done,",
          "zh": "這個應用程式幾乎完成了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.88,
          "end": 9.66,
          "en": "but there are some improvements I wanna make to the code",
          "zh": "但我還想對程式碼做一些改進，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.66,
          "end": 12.3,
          "en": "to follow all the common best practices",
          "zh": "以遵循所有常見的最佳實踐，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.3,
          "end": 16.71,
          "en": "and to also explore some other crucial Angular features",
          "zh": "同時也探索其他一些"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.71,
          "end": 18.18,
          "en": "you should know about.",
          "zh": "你應該知道的關鍵 Angular 功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.18,
          "end": 21.93,
          "en": "And I'll actually start with such a feature.",
          "zh": "事實上，我就要從這樣一個功能開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.93,
          "end": 24.87,
          "en": "If we take a look at a user, we can see",
          "zh": "如果我們查看某位使用者，會發現"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.87,
          "end": 27.18,
          "en": "that the task I'm outputting here",
          "zh": "我在這裡輸出的任務"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.18,
          "end": 29.82,
          "en": "actually has no rounded corners",
          "zh": "其實沒有圓角，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.82,
          "end": 32.73,
          "en": "and also no drop shadow behind it,",
          "zh": "背後也沒有陰影，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.73,
          "end": 35.55,
          "en": "which is not necessarily a huge problem,",
          "zh": "這未必是什麼大問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.55,
          "end": 38.49,
          "en": "but which is a look I'd like to have.",
          "zh": "但我希望它有那種外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.49,
          "end": 40.86,
          "en": "Now, of course, we could simply add it",
          "zh": "當然，我們可以直接把它加到"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.86,
          "end": 45.123,
          "en": "to the CSS styling here of that task,",
          "zh": "這個任務的 CSS 樣式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.99,
          "end": 48.09,
          "en": "but actually here in this application,",
          "zh": "但其實在這個應用程式裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.09,
          "end": 51.51,
          "en": "I already got that exact style that I'd like",
          "zh": "另一個元件中已經有我想在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.51,
          "end": 54.36,
          "en": "to replicate here in another component,",
          "zh": "重現的完全相同樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.36,
          "end": 56.52,
          "en": "in the user.component.",
          "zh": "也就是在 user.component 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.52,
          "end": 61.11,
          "en": "There it's on this div, which wraps this button",
          "zh": "它在包住這個按鈕的 div 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.11,
          "end": 64.95,
          "en": "where I have this border radius, this drop shadow,",
          "zh": "那裡有這個圓角、這個陰影，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.95,
          "end": 67.62,
          "en": "and I make sure that the content inside of it",
          "zh": "而且我確保了裡面的內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.62,
          "end": 69.543,
          "en": "doesn't break out of this box.",
          "zh": "不會超出這個方框。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.86,
          "end": 73.28999999999999,
          "en": "Now, of course, we could simply set this up",
          "zh": "當然，我們可以直接把它設定成"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.28999999999999,
          "end": 77.25,
          "en": "as a general globally available CSS class",
          "zh": "一個全域可用的通用 CSS 類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.25,
          "end": 78.66,
          "en": "and start assigning that",
          "zh": "然後開始把它指派給"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.66,
          "end": 82.53,
          "en": "to our elements in the different component templates.",
          "zh": "不同元件範本中的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.53,
          "end": 86.07,
          "en": "But there also is an alternative using an Angular feature,",
          "zh": "但也有另一種使用 Angular 功能的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.07,
          "end": 88.68,
          "en": "which you will need from time to time.",
          "zh": "這是你不時會需要用到的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.68,
          "end": 93.63,
          "en": "And therefore here, instead of just solving this with CSS,",
          "zh": "因此在這裡，我不只用 CSS 解決，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.63,
          "end": 98.49000000000001,
          "en": "I'll create a new component, again with the Angular CLI,",
          "zh": "而是再次透過 Angular CLI 建立一個新元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.49000000000001,
          "end": 101.97,
          "en": "and I'll store this component in a shared folder,",
          "zh": "並把這個元件存放在 shared 資料夾中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.97,
          "end": 105.06,
          "en": "which doesn't exist yet in my app folder.",
          "zh": "而 app 資料夾裡目前還沒有這個資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.06,
          "end": 107.55,
          "en": "And I'll name the component card.",
          "zh": "我會把這個元件命名為 card。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.55,
          "end": 109.35,
          "en": "Now, I chose shared here",
          "zh": "我之所以選擇 shared，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.35,
          "end": 112.77000000000001,
          "en": "because this is now not a component that belongs",
          "zh": "是因為這個元件並不屬於"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.77000000000001,
          "end": 117.12,
          "en": "to a specific feature area of this application.",
          "zh": "應用程式中某個特定的功能區塊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.12,
          "end": 120.24,
          "en": "It doesn't belong to the users or the tasks.",
          "zh": "它不屬於 users，也不屬於 tasks。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.24,
          "end": 122.61,
          "en": "Instead, it's a UI component",
          "zh": "它是一個 UI 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.61,
          "end": 126.21,
          "en": "that could be used anywhere in the application.",
          "zh": "可以在應用程式中的任何地方使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.21,
          "end": 128.88,
          "en": "So we could also name the folder ui,",
          "zh": "所以我們也可以把資料夾命名為 ui，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.88,
          "end": 130.473,
          "en": "but I will go for shared.",
          "zh": "但我會用 shared。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.43,
          "end": 135.96,
          "en": "I don't need tests, so I will add --skip-tests.",
          "zh": "我不需要測試，所以會加上 --skip-tests。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.96,
          "end": 140.19,
          "en": "And with that, a new component file and folder is created,",
          "zh": "這樣就建立了新的元件檔案和資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.19,
          "end": 142.023,
          "en": "that card component here.",
          "zh": "也就是這裡的 card 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.16,
          "end": 148.16,
          "en": "Now, in this card component template, I wanna have a div,",
          "zh": "在這個 card 元件範本中，我想放一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.29,
          "end": 151.773,
          "en": "and then we'll soon add something inside of that div.",
          "zh": "之後我們很快會在這個 div 裡放些內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.82,
          "end": 154.71,
          "en": "And I wanna style that div",
          "zh": "我想用我在 user.component 中給你看過的那些樣式"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.71,
          "end": 158.22,
          "en": "with those styles I showed you on the user.component.",
          "zh": "來設定這個 div 的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.22,
          "end": 159.81,
          "en": "So these styles here,",
          "zh": "所以這些樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.81,
          "end": 163.59300000000002,
          "en": "I'll cut them from the user.component.css file,",
          "zh": "我會把它們從 user.component.css 檔案剪下來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.67000000000002,
          "end": 168.873,
          "en": "and instead add them here in the card.component.css file.",
          "zh": "改放到 card.component.css 檔案中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.76,
          "end": 174.933,
          "en": "Now with that, this div here will receive these styles.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，這裡的 div 就會套用這些樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 176.28,
          "end": 180.33,
          "en": "And now my idea is to use this card component,",
          "zh": "而我的想法是使用這個 card 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.33,
          "end": 184.65,
          "en": "this custom card component here as a wrapper",
          "zh": "把這個自訂的 card 元件當作包裝器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 184.65,
          "end": 189.24,
          "en": "around my user button here, so instead of that div.",
          "zh": "包住這裡的使用者按鈕，取代那個 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.24,
          "end": 192.06,
          "en": "And I could then also use it as a wrapper",
          "zh": "接著我也可以在 task.component 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 192.06,
          "end": 195.96,
          "en": "in the task.component around that article",
          "zh": "把它當作包裝器包住那個 article，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 195.96,
          "end": 198.21,
          "en": "so that I get the same structure",
          "zh": "這樣在所有把這個元件當作包裝器使用的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 198.21,
          "end": 200.67000000000002,
          "en": "and styling in all the places",
          "zh": "都能得到相同的結構"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.67000000000002,
          "end": 203.613,
          "en": "where I use this component as a wrapper.",
          "zh": "和樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 204.87,
          "end": 206.46,
          "en": "So let's give this a try.",
          "zh": "我們來試試看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 206.46,
          "end": 208.17000000000002,
          "en": "Let's go to the user component",
          "zh": "前往 user 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 208.17000000000002,
          "end": 212.11,
          "en": "and replace this div with app-card",
          "zh": "把這個 div 換成 app-card，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 213.06,
          "end": 216.15,
          "en": "and the closing tag goes down there.",
          "zh": "結束標籤則放到下面那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 216.15,
          "end": 218.82,
          "en": "So now we don't have a self-closing component,",
          "zh": "所以現在這不是自我閉合的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 218.82,
          "end": 222.513,
          "en": "but instead a component with content between its tags.",
          "zh": "而是標籤之間有內容的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 224.13,
          "end": 226.95,
          "en": "Now as always, we must add it to the imports",
          "zh": "一如往常，我們必須把它加到 imports 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 226.95,
          "end": 228.84,
          "en": "in order to be available.",
          "zh": "它才能使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 228.84,
          "end": 230.43,
          "en": "So I'll quickly do that",
          "zh": "所以我很快做一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 230.43,
          "end": 233.94299999999998,
          "en": "so that the user.component knows about that CardComponent.",
          "zh": "讓 user.component 知道 CardComponent。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 235.53,
          "end": 239.7,
          "en": "And now if we save everything, huh,",
          "zh": "現在如果儲存所有檔案，咦，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 239.7,
          "end": 241.38,
          "en": "the users are gone",
          "zh": "使用者不見了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 241.38,
          "end": 244.26,
          "en": "and I instead see those dots,",
          "zh": "取而代之的是這些點點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 244.26,
          "end": 247.05,
          "en": "which I set up as a placeholder",
          "zh": "那是我在新加的 card.component 範本中"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 247.05,
          "end": 250.77,
          "en": "in that newly added card.component template,",
          "zh": "設定的預留內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 250.77,
          "end": 252.183,
          "en": "these dots here.",
          "zh": "就是這裡這些點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 253.639,
          "end": 257.31,
          "en": "And this is a super important behavior to understand",
          "zh": "這是一個非常重要、"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 257.31,
          "end": 259.2,
          "en": "and be aware of.",
          "zh": "必須理解並留意的行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 259.2,
          "end": 263.04,
          "en": "When you use an Angular component somewhere",
          "zh": "當你在應用程式某處使用 Angular 元件時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 263.04,
          "end": 266.13,
          "en": "in your application, like here as a wrapper",
          "zh": "例如像這裡用它包住"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 266.13,
          "end": 270.78,
          "en": "around some other markup, it will by default not keep",
          "zh": "其他標記，預設情況下它不會保留"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 270.78,
          "end": 273.54,
          "en": "that markup around which you wrap it.",
          "zh": "你所包住的那些標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 273.54,
          "end": 277.11,
          "en": "Instead, it will replace this wrapped markup",
          "zh": "相反地，它會用自己的範本標記"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 277.11,
          "end": 280.05,
          "en": "with its own template markup.",
          "zh": "取代被包住的標記，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 280.05,
          "end": 281.58,
          "en": "So with the markup defined",
          "zh": "也就是這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 281.58,
          "end": 284.13,
          "en": "in the card.component template here.",
          "zh": "card.component 範本中定義的標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 284.13,
          "end": 287.31,
          "en": "Now, it's not uncommon though that you might want",
          "zh": "不過，你經常會想把"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 287.31,
          "end": 291.54,
          "en": "to combine the markup of this card component in this case",
          "zh": "這個例子中 card 元件的標記"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 291.54,
          "end": 294.09000000000003,
          "en": "and the markup of the wrapped component.",
          "zh": "和被包住內容的標記結合起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 294.09000000000003,
          "end": 295.17,
          "en": "And this is done",
          "zh": "做法是"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 295.17,
          "end": 298.95,
          "en": "by adding another special element in the template",
          "zh": "在包裝元件的範本中"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 298.95,
          "end": 301.08,
          "en": "of the wrapping component.",
          "zh": "加入另一個特殊元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 301.08,
          "end": 303.48,
          "en": "So of the card component here,",
          "zh": "也就是這裡的 card 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 303.48,
          "end": 306.993,
          "en": "and that would be the ng-content element.",
          "zh": "而那個元素就是 ng-content。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 308.07,
          "end": 311.52,
          "en": "This is an element that's not built into the browser,",
          "zh": "這不是瀏覽器內建的元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 311.52,
          "end": 315.09,
          "en": "but instead, as you can also tell by this prefix,",
          "zh": "正如你從這個前綴"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 315.09,
          "end": 318.06,
          "en": "ng, is coming from Angular",
          "zh": "ng 看得出來，它來自 Angular，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 318.06,
          "end": 321,
          "en": "and it essentially acts as a placeholder",
          "zh": "本質上它就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 321,
          "end": 322.98,
          "en": "for the wrapped markup.",
          "zh": "被包住之標記的預留位置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 322.98,
          "end": 325.95,
          "en": "So for the markup that's wrapped by this component",
          "zh": "也就是被這個擁有此範本的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 325.95,
          "end": 328.05,
          "en": "that has this template.",
          "zh": "所包住的標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 328.05,
          "end": 332.25,
          "en": "So ng-content will be replaced with the markup",
          "zh": "所以 ng-content 會被替換成"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 332.25,
          "end": 334.35,
          "en": "that's being wrapped by the card component,",
          "zh": "card 元件所包住的標記，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 334.35,
          "end": 336.24,
          "en": "so by this markup.",
          "zh": "也就是這裡的這段標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 336.24,
          "end": 338.25,
          "en": "And that's how you can then merge",
          "zh": "這樣你就能把"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 338.25,
          "end": 340.56,
          "en": "these different markups together",
          "zh": "這些不同的標記合併在一起，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 340.56,
          "end": 343.40999999999997,
          "en": "because, of course, you can use ng-content",
          "zh": "因為你當然可以把 ng-content"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 343.40999999999997,
          "end": 345.9,
          "en": "wherever you wanna use it here.",
          "zh": "放在這裡任何你想放的位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 345.9,
          "end": 348.69,
          "en": "And you could have a way more complex structure here",
          "zh": "你也可以在這裡建立更複雜的結構，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 348.69,
          "end": 351.27,
          "en": "with more HTML elements.",
          "zh": "包含更多 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 351.27,
          "end": 352.95,
          "en": "It just happens to be the case here",
          "zh": "只是在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 352.95,
          "end": 354.633,
          "en": "that we have a pretty simple one.",
          "zh": "我們剛好用的是相當簡單的結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 355.92,
          "end": 358.86,
          "en": "But with that added, if you now save this,",
          "zh": "加上它之後，如果現在儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 358.86,
          "end": 362.97,
          "en": "the users are back and they got the same style as before,",
          "zh": "使用者就回來了，而且樣式和之前一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 362.97,
          "end": 364.2,
          "en": "which is now coming",
          "zh": "只不過現在樣式是來自"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 364.2,
          "end": 367.86,
          "en": "from that wrapping card.component though.",
          "zh": "外層的 card.component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 367.86,
          "end": 369.6,
          "en": "And ng-content, therefore,",
          "zh": "因此，ng-content"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 369.6,
          "end": 372.75,
          "en": "is another crucial Angular feature,",
          "zh": "是另一個關鍵的 Angular 功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 372.75,
          "end": 375.06,
          "en": "which can help you build more powerful",
          "zh": "可以幫助你打造更強大、"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 375.06,
          "end": 377.19,
          "en": "and flexible components.",
          "zh": "更有彈性的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 377.19,
          "end": 380.49,
          "en": "And we can therefore now also use this card.component here",
          "zh": "所以我們現在也可以在 task.component 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 380.49,
          "end": 383.46,
          "en": "as a wrapper in the task.component",
          "zh": "把這個 card.component 當作包裝器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 383.46,
          "end": 388.413,
          "en": "and wrap this article with app-card like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣用 app-card 包住這個 article。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 389.31,
          "end": 392.28,
          "en": "And of course, then import this card.component",
          "zh": "當然，接著要把這個 card.component"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 392.28,
          "end": 393.93,
          "en": "into the task.component",
          "zh": "匯入到 task.component 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 393.93,
          "end": 396.243,
          "en": "so that it is available there as well.",
          "zh": "讓它在那裡也能使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 397.62,
          "end": 401.88,
          "en": "And with that, you'll see that now these tasks also have",
          "zh": "這樣一來，你會看到這些任務現在也有了"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 401.88,
          "end": 403.89,
          "en": "that look with the rounded corners",
          "zh": "圓角的外觀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 403.89,
          "end": 406.08299999999997,
          "en": "and this slight drop shadow.",
          "zh": "以及這個淡淡的陰影。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43788650",
      "title": "Transforming Template Data with Pipes",
      "lectureOrder": 58,
      "videoOrder": 54,
      "sourceHash": "ace582a6c5f96b0ad67dd4ada0300f9aec6db71c0ef4190adf8a5c66aafd3a3d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 2.91,
          "en": "Another pretty important feature",
          "zh": "Angular 提供的另一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.91,
          "end": 6.69,
          "en": "offered by Angular is the feature of pipes,",
          "zh": "相當重要的功能是 pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.69,
          "end": 11.19,
          "en": "which in the end are output transformers you could say,",
          "zh": "說到底，你可以把它們看成輸出轉換器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.19,
          "end": 15.45,
          "en": "things that transform output in templates.",
          "zh": "也就是在範本中轉換輸出內容的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.45,
          "end": 17.82,
          "en": "And a good example for such a pipe",
          "zh": "這種 pipe 的一個好例子"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.82,
          "end": 21.48,
          "en": "can be seen in the task.component.html file.",
          "zh": "可以在 task.component.html 檔案中看到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.48,
          "end": 24.6,
          "en": "Because here, we of course have this date,",
          "zh": "因為在這裡，我們當然有這個日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.6,
          "end": 27.39,
          "en": "this due date, which we're outputting.",
          "zh": "也就是我們正在輸出的到期日。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.39,
          "end": 31.38,
          "en": "At the moment, it looks like this, which is not horrible,",
          "zh": "目前它看起來像這樣，雖然不算太糟，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.38,
          "end": 35.073,
          "en": "but maybe also not the most human readable way.",
          "zh": "但可能也不是最容易閱讀的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36,
          "end": 38.34,
          "en": "To output this in a nicer way,",
          "zh": "為了以更好的方式輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.34,
          "end": 43.34,
          "en": "we can funnel this value through a pipe",
          "zh": "我們可以把這個值導入一個 pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.47,
          "end": 45.81,
          "en": "by using this pipe symbol,",
          "zh": "方法是使用這個 pipe 符號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.81,
          "end": 50.43,
          "en": "this vertical bar here after task.dueDate.",
          "zh": "也就是在 task.dueDate 後面的這條直線。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.43,
          "end": 53.16,
          "en": "And then after this pipe symbol,",
          "zh": "然後在這個 pipe 符號之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.16,
          "end": 57.27,
          "en": "we add one of the pipes defined by Angular,",
          "zh": "加上 Angular 所定義的其中一個 pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.27,
          "end": 60.93,
          "en": "so one of the pipes built into Angular.",
          "zh": "也就是 Angular 內建的 pipe 之一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.93,
          "end": 62.94,
          "en": "And you can also build your own pipes,",
          "zh": "你也可以打造自己的 pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.94,
          "end": 64.68,
          "en": "and we'll do that later in the course,",
          "zh": "我們會在課程稍後這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.68,
          "end": 67.02,
          "en": "but for now, we'll use a built-in one.",
          "zh": "但現在我們先使用內建的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.02,
          "end": 70.71000000000001,
          "en": "And the built-in pipe I wanna use is the date pipe,",
          "zh": "我想用的內建 pipe 是 date pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.71000000000001,
          "end": 74.34,
          "en": "which as the name suggests is a transformer",
          "zh": "顧名思義，它是 Angular 提供的"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.34,
          "end": 76.68,
          "en": "that's provided by Angular",
          "zh": "一個轉換器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.68,
          "end": 81.68,
          "en": "that aims to format dates in a more human readable way.",
          "zh": "目的是以更易讀的方式來格式化日期。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.11,
          "end": 84.93,
          "en": "Now, this date pipe currently is unknown,",
          "zh": "目前這個 date pipe 還無法辨識，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.93,
          "end": 88.41,
          "en": "and at least at the point of time where I'm recording this,",
          "zh": "而至少在我錄製這段影片的時候，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.41,
          "end": 91.89,
          "en": "I also don't get such a import suggestion.",
          "zh": "我也沒有得到匯入建議。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.89,
          "end": 93.57,
          "en": "But that's, of course, no problem.",
          "zh": "但這當然不是問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.57,
          "end": 98.03999999999999,
          "en": "We can import it manually in the task component",
          "zh": "我們可以在 task 元件中手動匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.03999999999999,
          "end": 103.03999999999999,
          "en": "by importing the DatePipe written like this",
          "zh": "從 @angular/common 匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.572,
          "end": 107.49000000000001,
          "en": "from @angular/common.",
          "zh": "像這樣寫的 DatePipe。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.49000000000001,
          "end": 110.31,
          "en": "So not from core, but from common.",
          "zh": "所以不是從 core，而是從 common。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.31,
          "end": 114.15,
          "en": "And then we add the DatePipe next to the CardComponent",
          "zh": "接著在 imports 陣列中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 114.15,
          "end": 116.82,
          "en": "here in the imports array.",
          "zh": "把 DatePipe 加在 CardComponent 旁邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.82,
          "end": 118.32,
          "en": "With that, it's unlocked",
          "zh": "這樣它就可以使用了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.32,
          "end": 121.14,
          "en": "and it will now transform this date.",
          "zh": "現在它會轉換這個日期。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.14,
          "end": 122.943,
          "en": "As you can see, if you saved this,",
          "zh": "如你所見，儲存之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.86,
          "end": 128.7,
          "en": "now this is formatted in a more human readable way.",
          "zh": "現在它就以更容易閱讀的方式格式化了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 128.7,
          "end": 132.39,
          "en": "Now, this DatePipe also can be configured",
          "zh": "此外，這個 DatePipe 也可以設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 132.39,
          "end": 136.5,
          "en": "so that you can control how the date should be formatted,",
          "zh": "讓你控制日期要如何格式化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.5,
          "end": 140.43,
          "en": "and you find more information in the official documentation.",
          "zh": "更多資訊可以在官方文件中找到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 140.43,
          "end": 143.46,
          "en": "There, you also find a more detailed description",
          "zh": "在那裡，你也會找到更詳細的說明"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.46,
          "end": 146.34,
          "en": "and also detailed usage notes.",
          "zh": "以及詳細的使用注意事項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.34,
          "end": 150,
          "en": "Because in the end, those Angular pipes can be configured",
          "zh": "因為說到底，這些 Angular pipe 都可以設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 150,
          "end": 152.5,
          "en": "by adding a colon after the pipe name",
          "zh": "方法是在 pipe 名稱後加上冒號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 153.42000000000002,
          "end": 155.76,
          "en": "and then thereafter any parameters,",
          "zh": "再接著加上任何參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.76,
          "end": 159.153,
          "en": "any configuration that should be passed to the pipe.",
          "zh": "也就是要傳給 pipe 的任何設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.2,
          "end": 163.68,
          "en": "For example, here, we could pass the string short",
          "zh": "例如在這裡，我們可以把字串 short"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.68,
          "end": 168.68,
          "en": "to the DatePipe so that we get this formatting style here.",
          "zh": "傳給 DatePipe，得到這種格式樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.93,
          "end": 170.57999999999998,
          "en": "So if we save this,",
          "zh": "所以如果儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.57999999999998,
          "end": 173.883,
          "en": "we now would have this short formatting look here.",
          "zh": "現在就會是這種簡短的格式外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174.84,
          "end": 177.24,
          "en": "Now, in my case, that's actually not what I want.",
          "zh": "不過在我的情況下，這其實不是我想要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 177.24,
          "end": 180.87,
          "en": "Instead, I want this full date formatting,",
          "zh": "我想要的是完整的日期格式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 180.87,
          "end": 185.87,
          "en": "and therefore, I'll use fullDate as an option here.",
          "zh": "因此我會在這裡使用 fullDate 作為選項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 186.12,
          "end": 189.03,
          "en": "And with that, I get this output,",
          "zh": "這樣我就得到這個輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 189.03,
          "end": 191.64,
          "en": "which in my opinion looks better.",
          "zh": "我個人覺得看起來更好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 191.64,
          "end": 194.133,
          "en": "And that's the concept of working with pipes.",
          "zh": "這就是使用 pipe 的概念。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43788652",
      "title": "Getting Started with Services",
      "lectureOrder": 59,
      "videoOrder": 55,
      "sourceHash": "7df37195202cf5a7c34cf849dfb6a6598aaf0fcc806730e8df17f749f7294285",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.81,
          "end": 2.79,
          "en": "So, at this point,",
          "zh": "所以到這個時候，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.79,
          "end": 5.1,
          "en": "the app is basically finished.",
          "zh": "這個應用程式基本上已經完成了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.1,
          "end": 6.45,
          "en": "It works the way it should,",
          "zh": "它能正常運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.45,
          "end": 10.653,
          "en": "we can complete our tasks, and we can add new tasks.",
          "zh": "我們可以完成任務，也可以新增任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.55,
          "end": 14.88,
          "en": "But the code base can actually be improved",
          "zh": "但程式碼其實還可以改進，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.88,
          "end": 17.13,
          "en": "and should be improved.",
          "zh": "而且也應該改進。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.13,
          "end": 18.3,
          "en": "Because at the moment,",
          "zh": "因為目前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.3,
          "end": 22.29,
          "en": "we're managing all our tasks and all the logic",
          "zh": "我們在 TasksComponent 中管理所有任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.29,
          "end": 27.29,
          "en": "for manipulating those tasks in the TasksComponent,",
          "zh": "以及操作這些任務的所有邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.69,
          "end": 30.18,
          "en": "which on first sight makes sense, right?",
          "zh": "乍看之下很合理，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.18,
          "end": 31.95,
          "en": "It's the TasksComponent",
          "zh": "它就是 TasksComponent，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.95,
          "end": 34.713,
          "en": "so it makes sense to manage tasks in there.",
          "zh": "所以在那裡管理任務很合理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.61,
          "end": 38.61,
          "en": "But actually when working with Angular,",
          "zh": "但實際上在使用 Angular 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.61,
          "end": 41.04,
          "en": "it's considered a good practice",
          "zh": "一般認為好的做法是"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.04,
          "end": 45.36,
          "en": "to keep your Components and their classes",
          "zh": "讓你的元件及其類別"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.36,
          "end": 47.73,
          "en": "as lean as possible.",
          "zh": "盡可能保持精簡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.73,
          "end": 51.12,
          "en": "And managing some data like these tasks here,",
          "zh": "而管理像這些任務這樣的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.12,
          "end": 55.32,
          "en": "which are actually used by multiple Components,",
          "zh": "它們其實會被多個元件使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.32,
          "end": 60.32,
          "en": "after all the NewTaskComponent, for example, adds a task",
          "zh": "畢竟例如 NewTaskComponent 會新增任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.6,
          "end": 64.41,
          "en": "and the Task Component deletes tasks.",
          "zh": "而 Task 元件會刪除任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.41,
          "end": 67.02,
          "en": "If you have situations like this,",
          "zh": "遇到這種情況時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.02,
          "end": 68.85,
          "en": "it's typically recommended",
          "zh": "通常建議"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.85,
          "end": 72.753,
          "en": "that you use a service for managing that data.",
          "zh": "使用 service 來管理這些資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.77,
          "end": 78.51,
          "en": "And services are another crucial feature in Angular",
          "zh": "service 是 Angular 中另一個關鍵功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.51,
          "end": 81.51,
          "en": "every Angular developer must know about.",
          "zh": "每位 Angular 開發者都必須了解。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.51,
          "end": 85.5,
          "en": "That's why we will now build such a service.",
          "zh": "所以我們現在就要打造這樣一個 service。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.5,
          "end": 89.52,
          "en": "So, how do we build a service in Angular?",
          "zh": "那麼，要如何在 Angular 中打造 service 呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.52,
          "end": 92.91,
          "en": "Well, it typically starts by creating a new file",
          "zh": "通常會從建立一個新檔案開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.91,
          "end": 97.28999999999999,
          "en": "because just like Components or models,",
          "zh": "因為就像元件或模型一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.28999999999999,
          "end": 101.00999999999999,
          "en": "services should live in their own files.",
          "zh": "service 也應該放在自己的檔案中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.00999999999999,
          "end": 103.41,
          "en": "Now here I plan to create a service",
          "zh": "在這裡，我打算建立一個 service"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.41,
          "end": 104.94,
          "en": "that will manage my tasks,",
          "zh": "來管理我的任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.94,
          "end": 109.94,
          "en": "hence I will create that service in the tasks folder",
          "zh": "因此我會把這個 service 建立在 tasks 資料夾中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.95,
          "end": 112.253,
          "en": "next to the TasksComponent.",
          "zh": "放在 TasksComponent 旁邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.25,
          "end": 116.00999999999999,
          "en": "So, it's there where I create an extra file",
          "zh": "所以我在那裡建立一個額外的檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.00999999999999,
          "end": 121.01,
          "en": "and I'll name that file tasks.service.ts.",
          "zh": "並把它命名為 tasks.service.ts。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.31,
          "end": 125.19,
          "en": "I choose tasks because we'll be managing some tasks",
          "zh": "我選擇 tasks，是因為我們要管理一些任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.19,
          "end": 128.16,
          "en": "and then the type of the file,",
          "zh": "而檔案的類型，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 128.16,
          "end": 130.29,
          "en": "so to say, is service",
          "zh": "可以這麼說，是 service，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.29,
          "end": 132.543,
          "en": "because we'll store a service in there.",
          "zh": "因為我們會在裡面存放一個 service。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.86,
          "end": 136.62,
          "en": "Now, what is a service in Angular?",
          "zh": "那麼，Angular 中的 service 是什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.62,
          "end": 139.35,
          "en": "Well, it's just another class",
          "zh": "其實它就只是另一個類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.35,
          "end": 141.427,
          "en": "and I'll name it TasksService.",
          "zh": "我會把它命名為 TasksService。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.477,
          "end": 144.81,
          "en": "And at this point,",
          "zh": "到這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.81,
          "end": 146.91,
          "en": "it hopefully also makes sense",
          "zh": "希望你也能理解"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.91,
          "end": 150.96,
          "en": "why you should name your Component classes like this,",
          "zh": "為什麼元件類別應該這樣命名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.96,
          "end": 155.64,
          "en": "why you should include the word Component in their names",
          "zh": "為什麼名稱中要包含 Component 這個字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.64,
          "end": 158.37,
          "en": "because these are not the only kinds of classes",
          "zh": "因為它們並不是你唯一"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.37,
          "end": 159.84,
          "en": "you'll be working with.",
          "zh": "會用到的類別種類。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.84,
          "end": 162.63,
          "en": "Instead, a service is also a class,",
          "zh": "service 同樣也是一個類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 162.63,
          "end": 165.9,
          "en": "and hence it's named TasksService here.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡命名為 TasksService。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.9,
          "end": 168.6,
          "en": "Now, the idea behind such a service",
          "zh": "這種 service 背後的概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 168.6,
          "end": 173.13,
          "en": "then typically is that it performs some operation",
          "zh": "通常是執行某些操作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.13,
          "end": 175.86,
          "en": "and/or manages some data",
          "zh": "以及／或管理某些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.86,
          "end": 180.3,
          "en": "that might be needed by one or more other Components.",
          "zh": "而這些可能是一個或多個其他元件需要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.3,
          "end": 183.93,
          "en": "So, in this case, I want this service to manage my tasks,",
          "zh": "在這個例子中，我想讓這個 service 管理我的任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.93,
          "end": 187.41,
          "en": "hence I'll start by cutting this tasks array",
          "zh": "所以我會先把這個 tasks 陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.41,
          "end": 189.99,
          "en": "from the TasksComponent",
          "zh": "從 TasksComponent 剪下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 189.99,
          "end": 193.14,
          "en": "and by instead adding it as a property still",
          "zh": "改成像這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.14,
          "end": 195.813,
          "en": "to the TasksService like this.",
          "zh": "作為屬性加到 TasksService 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 198.36,
          "end": 202.05,
          "en": "Now, however, I'll make it a private property",
          "zh": "不過，我會把它設為私有屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.05,
          "end": 206.13,
          "en": "by adding this private modifier in front of it,",
          "zh": "在前面加上這個 private 修飾詞，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 206.13,
          "end": 209.1,
          "en": "which is something you can do in TypeScript",
          "zh": "這是 TypeScript 可以做到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 209.1,
          "end": 213.82,
          "en": "so that it can actually only be used inside of this service",
          "zh": "讓它實際上只能在這個 service 內部使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 214.8,
          "end": 216.66,
          "en": "because as a next step,",
          "zh": "因為下一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 216.66,
          "end": 220.14,
          "en": "I now want to add a couple of methods",
          "zh": "我想加入幾個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 220.14,
          "end": 223.71,
          "en": "which can then be used from outside the service",
          "zh": "讓 service 外部可以使用這些方法"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 223.71,
          "end": 226.74,
          "en": "to get hold of tasks",
          "zh": "來取得任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 226.74,
          "end": 229.5,
          "en": "or add or delete tasks.",
          "zh": "或是新增、刪除任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 229.5,
          "end": 232.17000000000002,
          "en": "Specifically, here I wanna add a method",
          "zh": "具體來說，我想在這裡新增一個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 232.17000000000002,
          "end": 234.573,
          "en": "called getUserTasks,",
          "zh": "叫做 getUserTasks，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 236.04,
          "end": 241.04,
          "en": "which expects to get a userId of type string as an input,",
          "zh": "它預期接收一個字串型別的 userId 作為輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 241.23,
          "end": 244.56,
          "en": "and which should then return all the tasks",
          "zh": "然後應該回傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 244.56,
          "end": 247.263,
          "en": "that belong to the user with that ID.",
          "zh": "屬於該 ID 使用者的所有任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 248.61,
          "end": 251.25,
          "en": "And of course, that is some logic we already have",
          "zh": "當然，這段邏輯我們在 TasksComponent 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 251.25,
          "end": 252.31,
          "en": "in the TasksComponent",
          "zh": "已經有了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 253.2,
          "end": 257.97,
          "en": "in this selectedUserTasks computed value here.",
          "zh": "就在這裡的 selectedUserTasks computed 值中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 257.97,
          "end": 261.12,
          "en": "So, we can simply cut this code here",
          "zh": "所以我們可以直接把這段程式碼剪下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 261.12,
          "end": 263.673,
          "en": "and bring that over into our service.",
          "zh": "搬到我們的 service 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 265.11,
          "end": 268.08,
          "en": "Now, this is not this.userId now though,",
          "zh": "不過現在這裡不是 this.userId，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 268.08,
          "end": 272.46,
          "en": "but just userId, this parameter we're receiving here.",
          "zh": "而只是 userId，也就是我們在這裡接收的參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 272.46,
          "end": 276.84000000000003,
          "en": "Now, in addition, I also want a method for adding a task.",
          "zh": "此外，我還需要一個新增任務的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 276.84000000000003,
          "end": 280.47,
          "en": "So, here I add a method called addTask,",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡加入一個叫做 addTask 的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 280.47,
          "end": 285.47,
          "en": "which should get the taskData as an input,",
          "zh": "它應該接收 taskData 作為輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 285.96,
          "end": 287.89,
          "en": "and that will be of type NewTaskData",
          "zh": "型別是 NewTaskData，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 289.65,
          "end": 294.65,
          "en": "using that type that we did store in that task.model file,",
          "zh": "也就是我們存放在 task.model 檔案中的那個型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 295.44,
          "end": 298.38,
          "en": "hence this import here must be added.",
          "zh": "因此必須加上這裡的匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 298.38,
          "end": 303,
          "en": "And then, inside of addTask, we can add this logic,",
          "zh": "接著在 addTask 中，我們可以加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 303,
          "end": 305.25,
          "en": "which we have in the TasksComponent",
          "zh": "TasksComponent 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 305.25,
          "end": 309,
          "en": "for adding a new task to this array of tasks",
          "zh": "把新任務加入任務陣列的這段邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 309,
          "end": 312.39300000000003,
          "en": "and add this here in addTask in my service.",
          "zh": "並把它放到我 service 的 addTask 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 313.44,
          "end": 315.93,
          "en": "Now, I also need the userId here",
          "zh": "此外，為了新增任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 315.93,
          "end": 317.46,
          "en": "in order to add a task,",
          "zh": "我在這裡也需要 userId，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 317.46,
          "end": 321.09,
          "en": "so I expect to get this, which is of type string,",
          "zh": "所以我預期會收到它，型別是字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 321.09,
          "end": 323.163,
          "en": "as a second parameter here.",
          "zh": "作為這裡的第二個參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 324.06,
          "end": 326.31,
          "en": "Then, I assign that userId",
          "zh": "然後我把這個 userId"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 326.31,
          "end": 330.813,
          "en": "as a value for the userId property in this object.",
          "zh": "指定為這個物件中 userId 屬性的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 333,
          "end": 336.72,
          "en": "Of course, we also need a method for deleting a task,",
          "zh": "當然，我們也需要一個刪除任務的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 336.72,
          "end": 339.75,
          "en": "so removeTask could be a fitting name,",
          "zh": "removeTask 可能是個合適的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 339.75,
          "end": 343.40999999999997,
          "en": "and here I expect to get the ID",
          "zh": "在這裡我預期會收到"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 343.40999999999997,
          "end": 345.45,
          "en": "of the task that should be removed,",
          "zh": "要刪除之任務的 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 345.45,
          "end": 347.97,
          "en": "which will be of type string.",
          "zh": "型別是字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 347.97,
          "end": 351.69,
          "en": "Again, we have the logic in a TasksComponent already,",
          "zh": "同樣地，這段邏輯在 TasksComponent 中已經有了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 351.69,
          "end": 356.283,
          "en": "there it's this line of code that can be copied.",
          "zh": "就是那裡這行可以複製的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 358.59000000000003,
          "end": 361.77,
          "en": "So, here I will overwrite my tasks",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我會用移除了一個任務後的"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 361.77,
          "end": 365.43,
          "en": "with the new tasks where I removed one task.",
          "zh": "新任務陣列覆寫原本的任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 365.43,
          "end": 366.45,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 366.45,
          "end": 371.45,
          "en": "we outsourced all this task's data management related logic",
          "zh": "我們就把所有和任務資料管理相關的邏輯"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 371.7,
          "end": 373.89300000000003,
          "en": "into this extra class.",
          "zh": "抽到了這個額外的類別中。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43788656",
      "title": "Getting Started with Dependency Injection",
      "lectureOrder": 60,
      "videoOrder": 56,
      "sourceHash": "ed70634ccac58fc380ccae69c90935785a995fcff27fc06840199f902ed14cf4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 2.76,
          "en": "Now, of course we now need access",
          "zh": "當然，我們現在需要存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.76,
          "end": 4.17,
          "en": "to this class",
          "zh": "這個類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.17,
          "end": 7.53,
          "en": "or to an object that's based on this class",
          "zh": "或者說存取以這個類別為基礎的物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.53,
          "end": 10.77,
          "en": "so that we can get hold of our tasks again.",
          "zh": "才能再次取得我們的任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.77,
          "end": 15.06,
          "en": "And therefore, as a first step, we should export this class",
          "zh": "因此第一步，我們應該匯出這個類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 18.633,
          "en": "so that we can use it somewhere else in our application.",
          "zh": "才能在應用程式的其他地方使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.86,
          "end": 23.76,
          "en": "Now we can go to the tasks.component.ts file,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以前往 tasks.component.ts 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.76,
          "end": 28.263,
          "en": "and we can import this newly added service here.",
          "zh": "在這裡匯入這個新加的 service。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.1,
          "end": 34.08,
          "en": "So this tasks service, we can import it from",
          "zh": "也就是這個 tasks service，我們可以從"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.08,
          "end": 36.333,
          "en": "the tasks.service file.",
          "zh": "tasks.service 檔案匯入它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.07,
          "end": 40.23,
          "en": "Now this is a class",
          "zh": "這是一個類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.23,
          "end": 43.29,
          "en": "and therefore a blueprint for an object.",
          "zh": "因此是物件的藍圖。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.29,
          "end": 47.13,
          "en": "So in order to interact with it and use these methods",
          "zh": "所以為了和它互動、使用這些方法"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.13,
          "end": 49.2,
          "en": "and so on, we actually have",
          "zh": "等等，我們其實必須"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.2,
          "end": 52.143,
          "en": "to instantiate this service first.",
          "zh": "先實例化這個 service。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.1,
          "end": 56.52,
          "en": "And we could do that by adding a new property,",
          "zh": "我們可以透過新增一個屬性來做到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.52,
          "end": 58.56,
          "en": "potentially a private property,",
          "zh": "可能是一個私有屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.56,
          "end": 62.82,
          "en": "which is only meant to be used in this component class here",
          "zh": "只打算在這個元件類別中使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.82,
          "end": 65.04,
          "en": "that could be named tasksService,",
          "zh": "可以命名為 tasksService，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 67.56,
          "en": "and where we do then instantiate",
          "zh": "然後在那裡像這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.56,
          "end": 69.603,
          "en": "this tasksService like this.",
          "zh": "實例化這個 tasksService。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.68,
          "end": 72.72,
          "en": "And then for example here, when we want",
          "zh": "接著例如在這裡，當我們想"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.72,
          "end": 76.83,
          "en": "to get our selectedUserTasks, we could do that",
          "zh": "取得 selectedUserTasks 時，就可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.83,
          "end": 78.64,
          "en": "by reaching out to this tasksService",
          "zh": "透過這個 tasksService，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.62,
          "end": 80.97,
          "en": "and by calling getUserTasks",
          "zh": "呼叫 getUserTasks，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.2,
          "end": 86.673,
          "en": "and by then passing this.userId to this method.",
          "zh": "並把 this.userId 傳給這個方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.28999999999999,
          "end": 91.773,
          "en": "But this approach has a huge problem.",
          "zh": "但這種做法有一個很大的問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.88,
          "end": 97.47,
          "en": "If we instantiate this class here like this,",
          "zh": "如果我們像這樣在這裡實例化這個類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.47,
          "end": 99.8,
          "en": "then we'll have one instance",
          "zh": "那麼在這個元件中就會有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.8,
          "end": 102.87,
          "en": "of this service in this component.",
          "zh": "這個 service 的實例。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.87,
          "end": 105.24000000000001,
          "en": "But if we then want to use the service",
          "zh": "但如果我們接著也想在"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.24000000000001,
          "end": 107.61,
          "en": "in another component as well,",
          "zh": "另一個元件中使用這個 service，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.61,
          "end": 110.91,
          "en": "we would create a separate independent instance",
          "zh": "就會在那裡建立一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.91,
          "end": 112.25999999999999,
          "en": "of that service there.",
          "zh": "獨立的 service 實例。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.25999999999999,
          "end": 116.493,
          "en": "We would not be sharing that one object that we create here.",
          "zh": "我們並不會共用在這裡建立的那個物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.6,
          "end": 119.7,
          "en": "And the implication of that is",
          "zh": "這意味著，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.7,
          "end": 122.19,
          "en": "that if we then change the data",
          "zh": "如果我們接著在另一個元件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.19,
          "end": 126.27,
          "en": "that's managed by that service in another component,",
          "zh": "修改由這個 service 管理的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.27,
          "end": 128.94,
          "en": "those changes wouldn't be reflected here",
          "zh": "這些變更不會反映在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.94,
          "end": 133.35,
          "en": "because we would be operating on different instances",
          "zh": "因為我們操作的是不同的"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.35,
          "end": 134.763,
          "en": "of that tasksService.",
          "zh": "tasksService 實例。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.22,
          "end": 141.21,
          "en": "That's why Angular gives you another powerful tool",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼 Angular 提供了另一個強大工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.21,
          "end": 145.2,
          "en": "which is used in conjunction with services,",
          "zh": "它會和 service 搭配使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 145.2,
          "end": 148.65,
          "en": "and that's a tool called dependency injection,",
          "zh": "那就是依賴注入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.65,
          "end": 151.35,
          "en": "which is a quite common mechanism,",
          "zh": "這是一種相當常見的機制，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.35,
          "end": 155.64,
          "en": "especially when working with object oriented programming.",
          "zh": "尤其是在物件導向程式設計中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.64,
          "end": 158.88,
          "en": "And the idea behind dependency injection is",
          "zh": "依賴注入背後的概念是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.88,
          "end": 162.9,
          "en": "that you don't create this instance on your own,",
          "zh": "你不自己建立這個實例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 162.9,
          "end": 165.42000000000002,
          "en": "but that you instead tell Angular",
          "zh": "而是告訴 Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 165.42000000000002,
          "end": 167.34,
          "en": "that you need such an instance",
          "zh": "你需要這樣一個實例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 167.34,
          "end": 170.57999999999998,
          "en": "and you let Angular create it.",
          "zh": "然後讓 Angular 來建立它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.57999999999998,
          "end": 174.72,
          "en": "And therefore Angular can create this instance once,",
          "zh": "因此 Angular 可以只建立一次這個實例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 174.72,
          "end": 177.54,
          "en": "and you can then use this one instance",
          "zh": "而你就能在不同元件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.54,
          "end": 179.04,
          "en": "in different components,",
          "zh": "使用這同一個實例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 179.04,
          "end": 183.48,
          "en": "and therefore you would then be operating on the same data.",
          "zh": "這樣就會操作同一份資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.48,
          "end": 185.46,
          "en": "So how do we then tell Angular",
          "zh": "那麼，我們要如何告訴 Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 185.46,
          "end": 187.29,
          "en": "that we want such an instance?",
          "zh": "我們需要這樣一個實例呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.29,
          "end": 190.8,
          "en": "Well, for example, by adding the constructor function",
          "zh": "例如，可以在這個類別中加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.8,
          "end": 194.22,
          "en": "to this class, which is a special method",
          "zh": "constructor 函式，這是一個特殊方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 194.22,
          "end": 197.34,
          "en": "which you can add to any class in JavaScript,",
          "zh": "你可以把它加到任何 JavaScript 類別中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 197.34,
          "end": 199.98,
          "en": "which will automatically be executed",
          "zh": "它會在這個類別被實例化時"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 199.98,
          "end": 203.43,
          "en": "when this class here is instantiated,",
          "zh": "自動執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 203.43,
          "end": 206.7,
          "en": "which will happen automatically by Angular",
          "zh": "而每當這個元件被用在某個範本中時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 206.7,
          "end": 209.463,
          "en": "whenever this component is used in some template.",
          "zh": "Angular 就會自動實例化它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 210.32999999999998,
          "end": 213.66,
          "en": "So this constructor will be executed automatically",
          "zh": "所以這個 constructor 會自動執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 213.66,
          "end": 216.99,
          "en": "and it will be Angular that executes it in the end",
          "zh": "而最終執行它的是 Angular，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 216.99,
          "end": 221.1,
          "en": "because it will be Angular that instantiates this component.",
          "zh": "因為實例化這個元件的正是 Angular。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 221.1,
          "end": 225.32999999999998,
          "en": "Therefore, you tell Angular about the dependency you need",
          "zh": "因此，你只要把需要的依賴"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 225.32999999999998,
          "end": 230.32999999999998,
          "en": "by simply adding it here as a parameter to this constructor.",
          "zh": "作為參數加到這個 constructor 中，就能告訴 Angular。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 230.52,
          "end": 233.91,
          "en": "So here we could add this tasksService parameter,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以在這裡加入 tasksService 參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 233.91,
          "end": 238.05,
          "en": "and by then giving it a type of TasksService,",
          "zh": "並把它的型別指定為 TasksService，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 238.05,
          "end": 239.97,
          "en": "we let Angular know",
          "zh": "藉此讓 Angular 知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 239.97,
          "end": 244.97,
          "en": "that we need this service instance here in this component.",
          "zh": "我們在這個元件中需要這個 service 實例。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 245.4,
          "end": 249.75,
          "en": "That's how Angular's dependency injection mechanism works.",
          "zh": "這就是 Angular 依賴注入機制的運作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 249.75,
          "end": 253.56,
          "en": "You specify your dependencies in your constructor function,",
          "zh": "你在 constructor 函式中指定依賴，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 253.56,
          "end": 257.55,
          "en": "and by clearly defining the type of the parameter you want,",
          "zh": "並明確定義所需參數的型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 257.55,
          "end": 261.54,
          "en": "Angular is able to look up the class of that type",
          "zh": "Angular 就能找到該型別的類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 261.54,
          "end": 264.66,
          "en": "and create it for you, so to say.",
          "zh": "可以說是幫你建立它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 264.66,
          "end": 267.54,
          "en": "Now, of course, to make this tasksService",
          "zh": "當然，為了讓這個 tasksService"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 267.54,
          "end": 269.25,
          "en": "available in the rest of the class,",
          "zh": "能在類別的其他地方使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 269.25,
          "end": 271.74,
          "en": "we then have to store it in a property,",
          "zh": "我們接著必須把它存到一個屬性中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 271.74,
          "end": 274.65,
          "en": "and therefore we can either bring back our private",
          "zh": "所以我們可以把私有的"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 274.65,
          "end": 276.57,
          "en": "tasksService property,",
          "zh": "tasksService 屬性加回來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 276.57,
          "end": 280.05,
          "en": "which is of type TasksService like this,",
          "zh": "像這樣型別為 TasksService，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 280.05,
          "end": 282.90999999999997,
          "en": "and then set it in the constructor body",
          "zh": "然後在 constructor 本體中"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 284.94,
          "end": 286.23,
          "en": "like this",
          "zh": "像這樣設定它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 286.23,
          "end": 289.65,
          "en": "so that we store the received argument",
          "zh": "把收到的引數存到"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 289.65,
          "end": 292.023,
          "en": "in this tasksService property.",
          "zh": "這個 tasksService 屬性中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 293.28,
          "end": 297.36,
          "en": "Or we take a shortcut that's offered by TypeScript",
          "zh": "或者，我們可以使用 TypeScript 提供的捷徑，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 297.36,
          "end": 300.84,
          "en": "and we get rid of the property and the constructor body,",
          "zh": "移除這個屬性和 constructor 本體，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 300.84,
          "end": 303.3,
          "en": "and we instead add private",
          "zh": "改為加上 private，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 303.3,
          "end": 306.18,
          "en": "or public if it should be publicly available,",
          "zh": "或者如果要公開就用 public，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 306.18,
          "end": 308.07,
          "en": "but here private is enough,",
          "zh": "但這裡用 private 就夠了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 308.07,
          "end": 310.8,
          "en": "in front of this parameter,",
          "zh": "加在這個參數前面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 310.8,
          "end": 313.74,
          "en": "and that will then automatically create a property",
          "zh": "這樣就會自動建立一個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 313.74,
          "end": 315.81,
          "en": "of the same name.",
          "zh": "名稱和參數相同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 315.81,
          "end": 317.31,
          "en": "It's simply a shortcut",
          "zh": "這只是一個捷徑，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 317.31,
          "end": 319.35,
          "en": "that's provided by TypeScript",
          "zh": "由 TypeScript 提供，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 319.35,
          "end": 321.18,
          "en": "so that this common pattern",
          "zh": "讓這種常見的模式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 321.18,
          "end": 324.06,
          "en": "of storing a parameter in a property",
          "zh": "也就是把參數存到屬性中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 324.06,
          "end": 325.623,
          "en": "gets a bit more convenient.",
          "zh": "變得更方便一些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 326.49,
          "end": 330.603,
          "en": "And with that, we can then finally get our user tasks.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們終於可以取得使用者的任務了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 331.89,
          "end": 334.83,
          "en": "However, we're not entirely there yet",
          "zh": "不過我們還沒完全完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 334.83,
          "end": 338.67,
          "en": "because by adding this code, we let Angular know",
          "zh": "因為加上這段程式碼後，我們告訴 Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 338.67,
          "end": 341.823,
          "en": "that we need an object of type TasksService,",
          "zh": "我們需要一個 TasksService 型別的物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 342.78,
          "end": 346.65,
          "en": "and Angular then will look for such a class,",
          "zh": "Angular 接著會去找這樣的類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 346.65,
          "end": 349.08,
          "en": "but it will not magically scan",
          "zh": "但它不會神奇地再次掃描"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 349.08,
          "end": 351.153,
          "en": "all your files and folders again.",
          "zh": "你所有的檔案和資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 352.08,
          "end": 354.51,
          "en": "Instead, you need to register",
          "zh": "相反地，你需要把"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 354.51,
          "end": 358.17,
          "en": "this TasksService, this class here,",
          "zh": "這個 TasksService，也就是這個類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 358.17,
          "end": 362.31,
          "en": "as something injectable with Angular",
          "zh": "註冊為 Angular 可注入的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 362.31,
          "end": 365.34,
          "en": "so that Angular knows that it can be injected",
          "zh": "讓 Angular 知道它可以被注入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 365.34,
          "end": 366.51,
          "en": "and that it should look",
          "zh": "並且在遇到像這裡這樣的依賴時"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 366.51,
          "end": 370.05,
          "en": "for this thing when encountering a dependency",
          "zh": "應該去尋找"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 370.05,
          "end": 371.193,
          "en": "like we have it here.",
          "zh": "這個東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 372.3,
          "end": 374.22,
          "en": "And we do register this class",
          "zh": "而我們要把這個類別"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 374.22,
          "end": 376.59,
          "en": "as injectable with Angular",
          "zh": "註冊為 Angular 可注入的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 376.59,
          "end": 379.41,
          "en": "by adding another decorator to it,",
          "zh": "方法是為它加上另一個裝飾器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 379.41,
          "end": 382.41,
          "en": "the Injectable decorator,",
          "zh": "也就是 Injectable 裝飾器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 382.41,
          "end": 385.683,
          "en": "which is imported from @angular/core.",
          "zh": "它從 @angular/core 匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 387.78,
          "end": 390.33,
          "en": "You add this by executing it like a function",
          "zh": "你像呼叫函式一樣執行它來加上它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 390.33,
          "end": 393.633,
          "en": "and by then passing a configuration object to it.",
          "zh": "然後傳入一個設定物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 394.65,
          "end": 396.75,
          "en": "And in this configuration object,",
          "zh": "在這個設定物件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 396.75,
          "end": 401.13,
          "en": "it's this providedIn option that should be set",
          "zh": "應該設定的是 providedIn 這個選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 401.13,
          "end": 404.01,
          "en": "and you should set it to root.",
          "zh": "而且應該把它設為 root。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 404.01,
          "end": 407.22,
          "en": "Now, just as with all these other essential concepts,",
          "zh": "就像其他這些重要概念一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 407.22,
          "end": 409.53,
          "en": "we'll dive deeper into services",
          "zh": "我們會在課程稍後更深入探討 service"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 409.53,
          "end": 413.64,
          "en": "and dependency injection a little bit later in the course.",
          "zh": "和依賴注入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 413.64,
          "end": 417,
          "en": "But for most cases, it's this syntax here,",
          "zh": "但在大多數情況下，你需要的"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 417,
          "end": 417.96,
          "en": "which you need,",
          "zh": "就是這裡這種語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 417.96,
          "end": 422.013,
          "en": "in order to make a class, a service, injectable.",
          "zh": "用來讓一個類別、一個 service 可被注入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 423.3,
          "end": 425.64,
          "en": "By adding this decorator like this,",
          "zh": "像這樣加上這個裝飾器之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 425.64,
          "end": 428.46,
          "en": "Angular now is aware of this service",
          "zh": "Angular 現在就知道這個 service，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 428.46,
          "end": 431.58,
          "en": "and can create such an instance when you need it.",
          "zh": "並能在你需要時建立這樣的實例。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 431.58,
          "end": 434.25,
          "en": "And most importantly, it will only create",
          "zh": "最重要的是，它只會建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 434.25,
          "end": 436.41,
          "en": "and reuse one instance",
          "zh": "並重複使用一個實例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 436.41,
          "end": 438.39,
          "en": "so that different components",
          "zh": "讓不同元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 438.39,
          "end": 441.27,
          "en": "operate on the same object in memory",
          "zh": "操作記憶體中的同一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 441.27,
          "end": 443.58299999999997,
          "en": "and therefore on the same data.",
          "zh": "也因此操作同一份資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 444.6,
          "end": 447.66,
          "en": "Therefore, here, if you now save this,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，如果你現在儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 447.66,
          "end": 449.85,
          "en": "the app will not fully work yet,",
          "zh": "應用程式還不會完全正常運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 449.85,
          "end": 451.53,
          "en": "but if you select a user,",
          "zh": "但如果你選擇一位使用者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 451.53,
          "end": 453.72,
          "en": "you at least see those dummy tasks.",
          "zh": "至少能看到那些假任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 453.72,
          "end": 457.74,
          "en": "And as you can see, they are fetched on a per user basis,",
          "zh": "如你所見，它們是依使用者分別取得的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 457.74,
          "end": 461.49,
          "en": "and we only see the tasks of a given user.",
          "zh": "我們只會看到特定使用者的任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 461.49,
          "end": 465.81,
          "en": "So that is working and we are using that service.",
          "zh": "所以這部分是可行的，我們也正在使用這個 service。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 465.81,
          "end": 467.88,
          "en": "But now of course, we want to use",
          "zh": "但現在我們當然想在"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 467.88,
          "end": 470.22,
          "en": "that service in multiple components",
          "zh": "多個元件中使用這個 service，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 470.22,
          "end": 472.17,
          "en": "because that's one of the main reasons",
          "zh": "因為這正是"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 472.17,
          "end": 473.90999999999997,
          "en": "for adding such a service",
          "zh": "加入這樣一個 service 的主要原因之一，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 473.90999999999997,
          "end": 476.55,
          "en": "that we can make our component classes lean",
          "zh": "讓我們的元件類別保持精簡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 476.55,
          "end": 480.633,
          "en": "and reuse that logic in different places of our application.",
          "zh": "並在應用程式的不同地方重複使用這些邏輯。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43788658",
      "title": "More Service Usage & Alternative Dependency Injection Mechanism",
      "lectureOrder": 61,
      "videoOrder": 57,
      "sourceHash": "9046d3d2a7a22e3af038559eb5b6a251b41fc3dfa6b2afcca5a5a1fe57af4feb",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 3.42,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmüller] So now in order to reuse",
          "zh": "所以為了重複使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.42,
          "end": 5.49,
          "en": "our tasks service,",
          "zh": "我們的 tasks service，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.49,
          "end": 7.44,
          "en": "I'll actually start by going",
          "zh": "我會先從"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.44,
          "end": 9.843,
          "en": "to this new task component here.",
          "zh": "這個新的 new task 元件這裡開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.1,
          "end": 15.21,
          "en": "And there, it's in this on submit method",
          "zh": "而那邊呢，是在這個 on submit 方法裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.21,
          "end": 19.35,
          "en": "where I actually no longer want to emit",
          "zh": "我在那裡其實已經不想再 emit"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.35,
          "end": 21.333,
          "en": "the entered task data.",
          "zh": "輸入的任務資料了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.35,
          "end": 26.073,
          "en": "Instead here we also want to use that Service Now.",
          "zh": "相反地，我們在這裡也想用那個 service 了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.94,
          "end": 30,
          "en": "And we can again inject it by using this constructor",
          "zh": "而我們同樣可以用這個 constructor 來注入它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30,
          "end": 32.19,
          "en": "or with help of another feature",
          "zh": "或者用另一個功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.19,
          "end": 34.17,
          "en": "that's also offered by Angular.",
          "zh": "這個功能也是 Angular 提供的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.17,
          "end": 36.96,
          "en": "And it's up to you which one you prefer",
          "zh": "至於你偏好哪一種，由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.96,
          "end": 39.48,
          "en": "because you can also simply add",
          "zh": "因為你也可以單純加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.48,
          "end": 42.75,
          "en": "a private or public property again,",
          "zh": "一個 private 或 public 的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.75,
          "end": 46.08,
          "en": "and again, I will name it tasks service.",
          "zh": "同樣地，我會把它命名為 tasks service。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.08,
          "end": 48.24,
          "en": "But now instead of receiving it",
          "zh": "但現在不是接收它"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.24,
          "end": 50.07,
          "en": "in the constructor and so on,",
          "zh": "在 constructor 裡等等，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.07,
          "end": 53.76,
          "en": "you can initialize it to a value that is created",
          "zh": "而是可以把它初始化成一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.76,
          "end": 57.45,
          "en": "with help of the inject function,",
          "zh": "由 inject 函式產生的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.45,
          "end": 61.77,
          "en": "which must be imported from @Angular core.",
          "zh": "這個 inject 函式必須從 @Angular/core 匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.77,
          "end": 65.31,
          "en": "So this function must be imported from Angular.",
          "zh": "所以這個函式必須從 Angular 匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.31,
          "end": 68.78999999999999,
          "en": "And this inject function does what the name implies,",
          "zh": "而這個 inject 函式做的事就如同它的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.78999999999999,
          "end": 71.46000000000001,
          "en": "it injects a dependency",
          "zh": "它會注入一個相依性"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.46000000000001,
          "end": 75.033,
          "en": "and provides it as a value for this property.",
          "zh": "並提供給這個屬性作為值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.17,
          "end": 80.613,
          "en": "And here it's then this tasks service which we wanna inject.",
          "zh": "而這裡就是我們想注入的 tasks service。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.56,
          "end": 84.36,
          "en": "So therefore you have to import",
          "zh": "所以你必須匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.36,
          "end": 87.18,
          "en": "this tasks service class again.",
          "zh": "這個 tasks service 類別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.18,
          "end": 89.64,
          "en": "And then you don't instantiate it here,",
          "zh": "接著你在這裡並不會實例化它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.64,
          "end": 93.525,
          "en": "but instead you use just the task service class name",
          "zh": "而是只使用 task service 這個類別名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.525,
          "end": 98.525,
          "en": "as a so-called injection token that's passed to inject.",
          "zh": "當作所謂的 injection token 傳給 inject。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.47999999999999,
          "end": 102.6,
          "en": "And again, Angular will then do the heavy lifting",
          "zh": "同樣地，Angular 就會在幕後"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.6,
          "end": 103.443,
          "en": "under the hood.",
          "zh": "做所有繁重的工作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.97,
          "end": 106.08,
          "en": "And with this done,",
          "zh": "而做完這些之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.08,
          "end": 110.31,
          "en": "you can then get rid of this code here in onSubmit",
          "zh": "你就可以把這裡 onSubmit 中的這段程式碼拿掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.31,
          "end": 115.31,
          "en": "and instead use this taskService to call addTask.",
          "zh": "改用這個 taskService 來呼叫 addTask。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.82,
          "end": 121.41,
          "en": "And then again, we have to create such a tasks data object",
          "zh": "接著同樣地，我們必須建立一個這樣的 tasks data 物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.41,
          "end": 125.37,
          "en": "where we have the title, so I'll enter the title",
          "zh": "裡面要有 title，所以我會填入 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.37,
          "end": 129.51,
          "en": "and summary, so the entered summary",
          "zh": "還有 summary，也就是輸入的 summary，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.51,
          "end": 133.083,
          "en": "and also the date, the entered date.",
          "zh": "以及 date，也就是輸入的 date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 134.37,
          "end": 138.93,
          "en": "And in addition, we also need to provide the user ID.",
          "zh": "此外，我們還需要提供 user ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 138.93,
          "end": 140.81,
          "en": "And at the moment we don't have that here",
          "zh": "而目前我們在這裡還沒有這個值"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 140.81,
          "end": 143.31,
          "en": "in this new task component.",
          "zh": "在這個新的 new task 元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.31,
          "end": 146.7,
          "en": "So therefore we should actually add an input here",
          "zh": "所以我們實際上應該在這裡加上一個 input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.7,
          "end": 149.67000000000002,
          "en": "imported from @Angular core,",
          "zh": "從 @Angular/core 匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 149.67000000000002,
          "end": 154.59300000000002,
          "en": "the user ID input, which is actually required,",
          "zh": "也就是 user ID 這個 input，它是必要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 155.55,
          "end": 158.28300000000002,
          "en": "and of type string like this.",
          "zh": "然後像這樣型別是 string。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 160.2,
          "end": 162.897,
          "en": "And with that, we have the user ID available",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就能取得 user ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 162.897,
          "end": 167.34,
          "en": "and we can pass it here as a second argument to add task,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡把它當成 add task 的第二個參數傳進去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 167.34,
          "end": 168.55700000000002,
          "en": "this.userID.",
          "zh": "也就是 this.userID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 170.22,
          "end": 174.813,
          "en": "So with that, we then use that service to add a new task.",
          "zh": "所以這樣我們就是用那個 service 來新增一個新任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 176.37,
          "end": 177.93,
          "en": "And we provide that service",
          "zh": "而我們提供那個 service"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 177.93,
          "end": 179.79,
          "en": "with help of this inject function,",
          "zh": "是藉由這個 inject 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 179.79,
          "end": 182.16,
          "en": "which is simply an alternative",
          "zh": "它只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 182.16,
          "end": 184.5,
          "en": "to this constructor based approach.",
          "zh": "constructor 做注入這種做法的另一種選擇。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.5,
          "end": 187.713,
          "en": "And it's up to you which approach you prefer.",
          "zh": "至於你偏好哪一種做法，由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 189.3,
          "end": 192.51,
          "en": "Now with that change made, we of course have to make sure",
          "zh": "現在做完這個改動，我們當然必須確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 192.51,
          "end": 196.68,
          "en": "that this user ID is provided to the new task component.",
          "zh": "這個 user ID 有被傳給 new task 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 196.68,
          "end": 200.46,
          "en": "So therefore in the task component template file,",
          "zh": "所以在 task component 的模板檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 200.46,
          "end": 203.37,
          "en": "we should set that user ID here",
          "zh": "我們應該在這裡設定那個 user ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 203.37,
          "end": 206.31,
          "en": "equal to the user ID property,",
          "zh": "讓它等於 user ID 這個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 206.31,
          "end": 210.063,
          "en": "which is indeed available here in the tasks component.",
          "zh": "這個屬性確實在 tasks component 裡就有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 211.26,
          "end": 214.68,
          "en": "Now of course, if we use this approach,",
          "zh": "當然，如果我們用這種做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.68,
          "end": 218.43,
          "en": "we actually no longer emit the add event",
          "zh": "我們其實就不再 emit add 事件了"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 218.43,
          "end": 220.95,
          "en": "and therefore we can get rid of that here",
          "zh": "所以我們可以把這裡的"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 220.95,
          "end": 222.753,
          "en": "in the new task component.",
          "zh": "new task 元件裡那個拿掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 223.8,
          "end": 225.57,
          "en": "But since I still want to make sure",
          "zh": "但因為我還是想確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 225.57,
          "end": 230.57,
          "en": "that the dialogue gets closed whenever we submit the form,",
          "zh": "每次送出表單時對話視窗都會關閉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.88,
          "end": 235.47,
          "en": "I'll rename the cancel event here to close",
          "zh": "我會把這裡的 cancel 事件改名為 close"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 235.47,
          "end": 238.644,
          "en": "so that we have a more universal name here.",
          "zh": "這樣這裡的名字就比較通用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 238.644,
          "end": 241.65,
          "en": "And I'll emit close here.",
          "zh": "然後我在這裡 emit close。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 241.65,
          "end": 245.331,
          "en": "And I'll also emit this close event here in onSubmit",
          "zh": "我也要在 onSubmit 裡的這個位置 emit 這個 close 事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 245.331,
          "end": 247.863,
          "en": "after submitting the data to the service.",
          "zh": "在把資料送給 service 之後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 249.72,
          "end": 254.72,
          "en": "And with this change made back in the tasks component,",
          "zh": "而回到 tasks component 做這個改動之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 254.85,
          "end": 257.94,
          "en": "we should no longer listen for a cancel event,",
          "zh": "我們就不該再監聽 cancel 事件了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 257.94,
          "end": 259.89300000000003,
          "en": "but instead for a close event,",
          "zh": "而是要監聽 close 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 260.91,
          "end": 263.37,
          "en": "and maybe also rename this method here",
          "zh": "也許還可以把這裡的方法"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 263.37,
          "end": 268.203,
          "en": "to onCloseAddTask or something like this.",
          "zh": "改名為 onCloseAddTask 之類的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 269.4,
          "end": 271.83,
          "en": "We should also get rid of this add event",
          "zh": "我們也該把這個 add 事件拿掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 271.83,
          "end": 273.663,
          "en": "since it no longer exists.",
          "zh": "因為它已經不存在了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 275.13,
          "end": 280.13,
          "en": "And now as a last step in the tasks component class,",
          "zh": "接著作為 tasks component 類別裡的最後一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 280.65,
          "end": 283.47,
          "en": "the onCancelAddTask method",
          "zh": "onCancelAddTask 這個方法"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 283.47,
          "end": 286.58299999999997,
          "en": "should be renamed to onCloseAddTask.",
          "zh": "應該改名為 onCloseAddTask。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 287.76,
          "end": 291.54,
          "en": "And the on add task method should be removed",
          "zh": "而 on add task 這個方法應該被移除"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 291.54,
          "end": 293.673,
          "en": "because we're no longer triggering it.",
          "zh": "因為我們不再觸發它了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 294.57,
          "end": 296.55,
          "en": "But with all those changes made,",
          "zh": "不過做完這些改動之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 296.55,
          "end": 298.77,
          "en": "if we now go back and reload,",
          "zh": "如果我們回到前面重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 298.77,
          "end": 300.64,
          "en": "we can still add a new task",
          "zh": "我們還是可以新增一個新任務"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 306.27,
          "end": 308.28,
          "en": "and we still close the dialogue",
          "zh": "而且對話視窗還是會關閉"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 308.28,
          "end": 310.83,
          "en": "and see the task being added here.",
          "zh": "並看到任務在這裡被新增。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 310.83,
          "end": 313.26,
          "en": "So that all still works as before,",
          "zh": "所以一切還是一樣運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 313.26,
          "end": 315.543,
          "en": "but now with the help of our service.",
          "zh": "但現在有我們這個 service 的協助。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43788662",
      "title": "Time to Practice: Services",
      "lectureOrder": 62,
      "videoOrder": 58,
      "sourceHash": "2c4115e49baec1903dab3b3467fec8f9c762c77b2059648093960ea0de02b8b3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 4.05,
          "en": "And now I got another exercise for you.",
          "zh": "現在我又有一個練習要給你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.05,
          "end": 8.16,
          "en": "I want you to edit the code of this application",
          "zh": "我要你修改這個應用程式的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.16,
          "end": 10.32,
          "en": "such that clicking this complete button",
          "zh": "讓點擊這個完成按鈕時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.32,
          "end": 13.17,
          "en": "will again remove a task",
          "zh": "又可以把任務移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.17,
          "end": 16.02,
          "en": "because at the moment that's not happening.",
          "zh": "因為目前並沒有這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.02,
          "end": 18.96,
          "en": "And of course, you should implement that logic",
          "zh": "當然，你要用我們建立的"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.96,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "with help of the service that we built",
          "zh": "服務來實作那個邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 27.023,
          "en": "and without using the service here in the TasksComponent.",
          "zh": "而且不要在這裡的 TasksComponent 使用服務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.87,
          "end": 30.66,
          "en": "I mean, you should continue using it for getting the tasks,",
          "zh": "我的意思是說，取得任務時你還是可以繼續使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.66,
          "end": 34.53,
          "en": "but not for marking the task as completed.",
          "zh": "但不要用它來把任務標記為完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.53,
          "end": 37.11,
          "en": "You should do that somewhere else.",
          "zh": "這件事你要在別的地方做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.11,
          "end": 41.07,
          "en": "Again, here's a short pause for you to pause the video.",
          "zh": "同樣的，這裡給你一個短暫的暫停，讓你暫停影片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.07,
          "end": 43.623,
          "en": "Thereafter, we'll implement this together.",
          "zh": "接下來我們會一起實作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.59,
          "end": 50.22,
          "en": "So let's make sure tasks can be completed again.",
          "zh": "那我們來讓任務可以再次被完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.22,
          "end": 52.41,
          "en": "And for that, I'll actually start",
          "zh": "為了做到這件事，我會先"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.41,
          "end": 55.83,
          "en": "by removing this onCompleteTask method here",
          "zh": "把這裡的 onCompleteTask 函式移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.83,
          "end": 57.513,
          "en": "in the TasksComponent.",
          "zh": "在 TasksComponent 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.41,
          "end": 59.7,
          "en": "Because as I explained,",
          "zh": "因為正如我所解釋的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.7,
          "end": 62.58,
          "en": "I don't wanna use the service from in here,",
          "zh": "我不想在這裡面使用那個服務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.58,
          "end": 64.68,
          "en": "mainly for practice purposes,",
          "zh": "主要是為了練習，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.68,
          "end": 67.563,
          "en": "not because it would be super wrong to do that.",
          "zh": "而不是因為那樣做會非常錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.67,
          "end": 72.66,
          "en": "But instead, I now wanna practice working with that service",
          "zh": "相反地，我現在想練習使用那個服務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.66,
          "end": 77.26,
          "en": "by going to the task component which manages a single task",
          "zh": "在管理單一任務的那個 task 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.27,
          "end": 81.6,
          "en": "and it's now there where I wanna use that service",
          "zh": "而我現在想在那裡使用那個服務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.6,
          "end": 82.89,
          "en": "to get rid of it.",
          "zh": "來把它移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.89,
          "end": 85.62,
          "en": "So it's in here where I also wanna inject",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我也要注入"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.62,
          "end": 88.2,
          "en": "the tasksService again,",
          "zh": "tasksService，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.2,
          "end": 90.3,
          "en": "either with this inject function",
          "zh": "可以用這個 inject 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.3,
          "end": 93.99000000000001,
          "en": "or by using the constructor, whatever you prefer.",
          "zh": "也可以用建構子，你偏好哪種都行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.99000000000001,
          "end": 96.003,
          "en": "I'll go for the inject function,",
          "zh": "我會選擇 inject 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.2,
          "end": 101.973,
          "en": "which must be imported from @angular/core like this.",
          "zh": "它必須像這樣從 @angular/core 匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.03999999999999,
          "end": 105.09,
          "en": "And then as you learned,",
          "zh": "然後如你所學到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.09,
          "end": 109.05,
          "en": "it's the name of the class which should be injected,",
          "zh": "你要注入的是類別的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.05,
          "end": 112.44,
          "en": "or for which you want to have an instance",
          "zh": "或者說你想取得實例的那個類別名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.44,
          "end": 116.10300000000001,
          "en": "that should be injected, that's added to inject.",
          "zh": "把它加到 inject 裡面就對了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.83,
          "end": 121.26,
          "en": "With that in onCompleteTask,",
          "zh": "接著在 onCompleteTask 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.26,
          "end": 124.32,
          "en": "I no longer wanna emit some event,",
          "zh": "我不再想發出某個事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.32,
          "end": 129.12,
          "en": "but instead it's now the tasksService that I wanna use",
          "zh": "而是我現在想用 tasksService，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.12,
          "end": 131.373,
          "en": "where I wanna call removeTask.",
          "zh": "然後在裡面呼叫 removeTask。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 132.3,
          "end": 135.48,
          "en": "And that now expects to get the idea of the task",
          "zh": "而它現在預期要取得該任務的 id，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 135.48,
          "end": 137.7,
          "en": "as an input, and conveniently,",
          "zh": "作為輸入，剛好的是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.7,
          "end": 140.61,
          "en": "we have the entire task object available here,",
          "zh": "我們在這裡就有整個任務物件可用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.61,
          "end": 144.27,
          "en": "so we can simply pass this.task.id",
          "zh": "所以我們可以直接傳入 this.task.id，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.27,
          "end": 146.133,
          "en": "as a value to the tasksService.",
          "zh": "當作 tasksService 的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.07999999999998,
          "end": 151.53,
          "en": "And we can now get rid of this complete event",
          "zh": "現在我們可以去掉這個 complete 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.53,
          "end": 154.2,
          "en": "and therefore actually of the entire imports",
          "zh": "進而其實是去掉全部的匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.2,
          "end": 156.57,
          "en": "of EventEmitter and Output",
          "zh": "也就是 EventEmitter 和 Output，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 156.57,
          "end": 161.57,
          "en": "since this component now no longer needs to emit any events.",
          "zh": "因為這個元件現在不再需要發出任何事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 162.3,
          "end": 166.89,
          "en": "And it's now in the TasksComponent template file,",
          "zh": "而現在是在 TasksComponent 的模板檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.89,
          "end": 170.88,
          "en": "where we should stop listening for the complete event",
          "zh": "我們應該停止監聽 complete 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.88,
          "end": 173.04,
          "en": "because it won't be emitted anymore",
          "zh": "因為它不會再被發出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 173.04,
          "end": 177.32999999999998,
          "en": "because this task will now do its job on its own",
          "zh": "因為這個任務現在會靠這個服務"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 177.32999999999998,
          "end": 179.463,
          "en": "with help of this service.",
          "zh": "自己完成它的工作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 181.02,
          "end": 182.61,
          "en": "Well, and that should be it.",
          "zh": "好，應該就是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 182.61,
          "end": 187.2,
          "en": "If you save that, you should be able to select users",
          "zh": "如果你儲存了，應該就能選取使用者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 187.2,
          "end": 191.1,
          "en": "and also mark tasks as completed.",
          "zh": "也能把任務標記為完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 191.1,
          "end": 194.733,
          "en": "And as you see, those are then removed again.",
          "zh": "而如你所見，這些任務又會被移除。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43788664",
      "title": "Using localStorage for Data Storage",
      "lectureOrder": 63,
      "videoOrder": 59,
      "sourceHash": "e0734f869a739da9be75ce2ffcbce25614c7661314664a13f9fb75bf0000f50d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.75,
          "end": 3.54,
          "en": "So now that you also got an introduction",
          "zh": "那麼現在你也已經有了"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.54,
          "end": 7.02,
          "en": "to services and dependency injection,",
          "zh": "服務與相依性注入的簡介，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.02,
          "end": 10.05,
          "en": "you really have a solid foundation",
          "zh": "你真的有了一個扎實的基礎"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.05,
          "end": 13.05,
          "en": "about all the core Angular essentials",
          "zh": "在所有 Angular 核心必備知識上"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.05,
          "end": 15.66,
          "en": "every Angular developer needs to know.",
          "zh": "這些都是每位 Angular 開發者必須知道的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.66,
          "end": 18.03,
          "en": "Before we conclude this module, though,",
          "zh": "不過，在我們結束這個模組之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.03,
          "end": 20.46,
          "en": "there's one last little enhancement",
          "zh": "還有最後一個小改進"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.46,
          "end": 22.59,
          "en": "that we could make to this application",
          "zh": "我們可以對這個應用程式做"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.59,
          "end": 23.85,
          "en": "because at the moment,",
          "zh": "因為目前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.85,
          "end": 26.64,
          "en": "it works such that all the changes we make,",
          "zh": "它的運作方式是：我們所做的所有變更，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.64,
          "end": 30.3,
          "en": "all the tasks we add or we mark as completed,",
          "zh": "我們新增或標記完成的任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.3,
          "end": 32.98,
          "en": "are lost whenever we reload",
          "zh": "只要重新載入就會消失"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.05,
          "end": 37.56,
          "en": "because we're only working with some dummy data",
          "zh": "因為我們目前只在使用一些假資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.56,
          "end": 39.21,
          "en": "that's stored in memory",
          "zh": "這些資料只存放在記憶體中"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.21,
          "end": 43.323,
          "en": "and that's always recreated when the app restarts therefore.",
          "zh": "因此應用程式重新啟動時，總是會重新建立。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.31,
          "end": 46.62,
          "en": "And we could improve this app",
          "zh": "我們可以改善這個應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.62,
          "end": 51.62,
          "en": "by storing at least the tasks in a more persistent storage.",
          "zh": "把至少任務存到更持久的儲存空間中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.32,
          "end": 54.99,
          "en": "Now, later in the course, you will learn",
          "zh": "之後在課程中，你會學到"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.99,
          "end": 59.16,
          "en": "how to connect your Angular application to a backend,",
          "zh": "如何把你的 Angular 應用程式連接到後端，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.16,
          "end": 60.72,
          "en": "so to a server,",
          "zh": "也就是伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.72,
          "end": 64.2,
          "en": "where data could be stored in a real database.",
          "zh": "資料可以存放在真正的資料庫裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.2,
          "end": 65.73,
          "en": "But for the moment here,",
          "zh": "但就目前而言，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.73,
          "end": 68.85,
          "en": "I'll just store that data in the browser storage,",
          "zh": "我只會把那些資料存到瀏覽器的儲存空間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.85,
          "end": 71.07300000000001,
          "en": "which is better than nothing, I guess.",
          "zh": "我想這總比沒有好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.24,
          "end": 75.87,
          "en": "So the idea is to fetch the tasks",
          "zh": "所以概念是取得任務"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.87,
          "end": 80.22,
          "en": "from the browser storage when the app loads,",
          "zh": "應用程式載入時，從瀏覽器的儲存空間讀取，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.22,
          "end": 84.69,
          "en": "and to update the tasks stored in the browser storage",
          "zh": "並更新存在瀏覽器儲存空間中的任務"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.69,
          "end": 87.123,
          "en": "whenever we add or remove a task,",
          "zh": "每當我們新增或移除任務時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.08,
          "end": 90.9,
          "en": "and I'll start with the initialization.",
          "zh": "而我會從初始化開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.9,
          "end": 95.263,
          "en": "For that, we can add a constructor here to this TasksService",
          "zh": "為此，我們可以在這個 TasksService 加上建構函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.42,
          "end": 98.43,
          "en": "because as you learned, that's a function",
          "zh": "因為如你所學到的，那是一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.43,
          "end": 101.493,
          "en": "that's automatically executed when the app starts.",
          "zh": "應用程式啟動時會自動執行的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.50999999999999,
          "end": 106.2,
          "en": "And in there, we could set this.tasks array",
          "zh": "在裡面，我們可以把這個 this.tasks 陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.2,
          "end": 111.2,
          "en": "equal to data that we fetch from local storage.",
          "zh": "設成我們從 local storage 取得的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.69,
          "end": 115.22999999999999,
          "en": "Now, I'll actually do that with help of a helper constant,",
          "zh": "現在，我會用一個輔助常數來做這件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.22999999999999,
          "end": 118.02000000000001,
          "en": "where I reach out to localStorage",
          "zh": "我在其中存取 localStorage"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.02000000000001,
          "end": 120.66,
          "en": "and where I then call getItem",
          "zh": "然後呼叫 getItem"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.66,
          "end": 123.39,
          "en": "to get some data from local storage,",
          "zh": "以從 local storage 取得資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.39,
          "end": 127.32,
          "en": "which should be stored under a key of tasks.",
          "zh": "這個資料應該存放在 key 為 tasks 的項目下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.32,
          "end": 130.38,
          "en": "So the assumption is that in the browser's local storage,",
          "zh": "所以這裡的假設是，在瀏覽器的 local storage 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.38,
          "end": 134.13,
          "en": "we're storing some tasks with a key of tasks.",
          "zh": "我們用 key 為 tasks 存放了某些任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.13,
          "end": 137.7,
          "en": "Next, I wanna check if some tasks were found,",
          "zh": "接著，我要檢查是否有找到任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.7,
          "end": 140.07,
          "en": "and if I did find some tasks,",
          "zh": "如果我確實找到了一些任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.07,
          "end": 142.56,
          "en": "so if some data was stored there,",
          "zh": "也就是那裡存有資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.56,
          "end": 146.16,
          "en": "which will not be the case when we run this code",
          "zh": "那在我們第一次執行這段程式碼時不會是這種情況，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.16,
          "end": 149.67000000000002,
          "en": "for the first time, but if we do have some tasks,",
          "zh": "但如果我們確實有任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.67000000000002,
          "end": 152.64,
          "en": "then I wanna overwrite my tasks here",
          "zh": "那我要把這裡的任務覆寫掉"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.64,
          "end": 154.953,
          "en": "with the tasks from local storage.",
          "zh": "換成 local storage 中的任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.09,
          "end": 159.32999999999998,
          "en": "However, the tasks we retrieve from local storage,",
          "zh": "不過，我們從 local storage 取回的任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.32999999999998,
          "end": 162.78,
          "en": "this constant here, will always be a string",
          "zh": "也就是這個常數，永遠都會是一個字串"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 162.78,
          "end": 166.14,
          "en": "because we can't store complex values like arrays",
          "zh": "因為我們不能用這種方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.14,
          "end": 168.9,
          "en": "or objects in local storage like this.",
          "zh": "把陣列或物件這種複雜的值存進 local storage。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 168.9,
          "end": 172.14,
          "en": "Instead, we have to convert them to JSON first,",
          "zh": "相反地，我們必須先把它們轉成 JSON，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.14,
          "end": 175.47,
          "en": "which in the end is a string that has a certain format.",
          "zh": "而它最終就是一個具有特定格式的字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.47,
          "end": 178.98,
          "en": "So the assumption is that the tasks, if they exist,",
          "zh": "所以假設是，任務如果存在的話，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 178.98,
          "end": 181.53,
          "en": "will be stored in that JSON format,",
          "zh": "會以那個 JSON 格式存放，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 181.53,
          "end": 185.04,
          "en": "which is a standard format in programming.",
          "zh": "這是程式設計中的標準格式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.04,
          "end": 189.69,
          "en": "And therefore, here, I'll actually parse the tasks as JSON",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我會把任務解析成 JSON"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 189.69,
          "end": 191.73,
          "en": "to convert them back to an array.",
          "zh": "把它們轉回陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 191.73,
          "end": 193.203,
          "en": "That's the idea here.",
          "zh": "這就是這裡的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.37,
          "end": 197.85,
          "en": "So I keep my dummy tasks if no tasks are found,",
          "zh": "所以如果找不到任務，我就保留我的假任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.85,
          "end": 201.32999999999998,
          "en": "but if tasks are found, I'll use those instead.",
          "zh": "但如果找到任務，我就改用那些任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.32999999999998,
          "end": 202.653,
          "en": "That's the idea here.",
          "zh": "這就是這裡的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.91,
          "end": 206.46,
          "en": "Well, and now we need to update the tasks",
          "zh": "好，接下來我們需要在儲存或移除任務時"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.46,
          "end": 209.013,
          "en": "whenever we save or remove a task.",
          "zh": "隨時更新任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 209.94,
          "end": 212.73,
          "en": "And therefore, I'll add another helper method here,",
          "zh": "所以我會在這裡再加一個輔助方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.73,
          "end": 215.64,
          "en": "a private method, which is only meant to be used",
          "zh": "一個 private 方法，只能用在"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 215.64,
          "end": 220.317,
          "en": "from inside this service class, which I'll name saveTasks.",
          "zh": "這個服務類別內部，我會把它命名為 saveTasks。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 222.127,
          "end": 226.15699999999998,
          "en": "And here, I will simply call localStorage.setItem",
          "zh": "在這裡，我只要呼叫 localStorage.setItem"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 227.961,
          "end": 231.06,
          "en": "and set an item with a key of tasks,",
          "zh": "並設定一個 key 為 tasks 的項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 231.06,
          "end": 234.51,
          "en": "because that's also the key we're looking for",
          "zh": "因為那也是我們在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 234.51,
          "end": 236.643,
          "en": "when retrieving the tasks here.",
          "zh": "取得任務時要找的 key。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 239.22,
          "end": 242.43,
          "en": "And I wanna store my tasks array here.",
          "zh": "而我想把任務陣列存在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 242.43,
          "end": 247.43,
          "en": "So I will now use JSON.stringify to convert this.tasks,",
          "zh": "所以我現在會用 JSON.stringify 把 this.tasks，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 248.97,
          "end": 252.69,
          "en": "the tasks array that's currently managed by this service,",
          "zh": "也就是目前由這個服務管理的任務陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 252.69,
          "end": 255.81,
          "en": "to such a string in the JSON format.",
          "zh": "轉成 JSON 格式的字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 255.81,
          "end": 259.56,
          "en": "And that will then be stored in local storage.",
          "zh": "然後它就會被存進 local storage。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 259.56,
          "end": 263.01,
          "en": "And now we just have to call this.saveTasks",
          "zh": "而現在我們只要呼叫 this.saveTasks"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 263.01,
          "end": 264.66,
          "en": "after removing a task",
          "zh": "在移除任務之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 264.66,
          "end": 267.933,
          "en": "and after adding a task in both places.",
          "zh": "以及在新增任務之後，兩處都要呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 270.69,
          "end": 274.47,
          "en": "Well, and with that, if you now save that and reload,",
          "zh": "好，這樣一來，如果你現在儲存並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 274.47,
          "end": 277.77,
          "en": "you'll see the tasks are still there.",
          "zh": "你會看到任務還在。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 277.77,
          "end": 279.84000000000003,
          "en": "But if I now complete a task",
          "zh": "但如果我現在完成一個任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 279.84000000000003,
          "end": 282.6,
          "en": "and I therefore change my tasks,",
          "zh": "因此改變了我的任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 282.6,
          "end": 286.11,
          "en": "you can see if you use the browser developer tools",
          "zh": "你會看到，如果你開啟瀏覽器的開發者工具"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 286.11,
          "end": 290.58,
          "en": "and you go to the application tab that under local storage,",
          "zh": "並前往 application 分頁，在 local storage 底下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 290.58,
          "end": 293.28,
          "en": "there is a tasks key here,",
          "zh": "這裡有一個 tasks 這個 key，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 293.28,
          "end": 295.75,
          "en": "and the value under that key",
          "zh": "而那個 key 底下的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 296.67,
          "end": 301.67,
          "en": "is now actually this string with the tasks in this format.",
          "zh": "現在其實就是這個含有任務的字串，格式像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 302.67,
          "end": 304.02,
          "en": "It might not look like a string,",
          "zh": "它看起來可能不像字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 304.02,
          "end": 306.543,
          "en": "but it is stored in a string in the end.",
          "zh": "但它最終還是以字串儲存。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 308.88,
          "end": 311.4,
          "en": "So the data is stored and therefore indeed,",
          "zh": "所以資料有被儲存，因此確實，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 311.4,
          "end": 314.55,
          "en": "if I reload, we can see that for Marcus here,",
          "zh": "如果我重新載入，我們會看到 Marcus 這邊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 314.55,
          "end": 316.41,
          "en": "we only have one task now",
          "zh": "現在只剩一個任務"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 316.41,
          "end": 318.27,
          "en": "because we're now using the tasks",
          "zh": "因為我們現在使用的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 318.27,
          "end": 320.313,
          "en": "that are loaded from local storage.",
          "zh": "從 local storage 載入的任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 321.42,
          "end": 325.11,
          "en": "And this isn't an Angular-specific feature",
          "zh": "而這不是 Angular 專屬的功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 325.11,
          "end": 326.49,
          "en": "or anything like that,",
          "zh": "或類似的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 326.49,
          "end": 328.35,
          "en": "but I think it's a nice enhancement",
          "zh": "但我認為這對這個第一個示範應用程式來說"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 328.35,
          "end": 330.9,
          "en": "for this first demo app here,",
          "zh": "是個不錯的改進，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 330.9,
          "end": 332.85,
          "en": "which now allowed us to explore",
          "zh": "它讓我們得以探索"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 332.85,
          "end": 335.73,
          "en": "all those crucial Angular essentials",
          "zh": "所有那些關鍵的 Angular 必備知識"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 335.73,
          "end": 338.373,
          "en": "every Angular developer must know.",
          "zh": "每位 Angular 開發者都必須知道的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43788666",
      "title": "Module Summary",
      "lectureOrder": 64,
      "videoOrder": 60,
      "sourceHash": "400376b169a3e570536fbbafeb89bd8e013d31e118e2ad8f9521cf141ed1d00f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 4.14,
          "en": "So in this section, you now learned a lot about Angular.",
          "zh": "所以在這個單元中，你現在學了很多關於 Angular 的知識。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.14,
          "end": 8.07,
          "en": "You actually learned all about the crucial essentials",
          "zh": "你其實已經學會了所有必要的核心重點"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.07,
          "end": 10.86,
          "en": "every Angular developer must know.",
          "zh": "也就是每位 Angular 開發者都必須知道的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.86,
          "end": 13.68,
          "en": "You learned about Components, why they matter,",
          "zh": "你學會了元件，以及它們為什麼重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.68,
          "end": 16.26,
          "en": "and that the idea is that you build",
          "zh": "還有它的概念就是，你可以用元件來建構"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.26,
          "end": 19.83,
          "en": "potentially complex user interfaces with Components.",
          "zh": "可能非常複雜的使用者介面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.83,
          "end": 22.08,
          "en": "And you learned how to create Components.",
          "zh": "你也學會了如何建立元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.08,
          "end": 24.78,
          "en": "That there are classes that are decorated",
          "zh": "也就是有一些類別會加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.78,
          "end": 26.67,
          "en": "with that Component decorator,",
          "zh": "元件裝飾器（Component decorator），"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.67,
          "end": 28.83,
          "en": "which then holds the configuration",
          "zh": "它裡面會帶著設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.83,
          "end": 32.4,
          "en": "for a Component, like its identifier, you could say,",
          "zh": "也就是元件的識別名稱，可以說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.4,
          "end": 35.58,
          "en": "its selector, but also where to find the template",
          "zh": "也就是它的 selector，還有模板放在哪裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.58,
          "end": 37.26,
          "en": "or styles of a Component.",
          "zh": "或元件的樣式在哪裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.26,
          "end": 39.18,
          "en": "Because a Component, in the end,",
          "zh": "因為一個元件歸根究柢"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.18,
          "end": 43.05,
          "en": "is a custom HTML element, you could say.",
          "zh": "可以說就是一個自訂的 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.05,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "And the idea then is that you can use that element",
          "zh": "所以概念就是，你可以把這個元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 49.17,
          "en": "in the templates of other Components",
          "zh": "用在其他元件的模板裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.17,
          "end": 52.56,
          "en": "so that you're building a Component tree in the end.",
          "zh": "這樣最後就會形成一個元件樹。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.56,
          "end": 55.5,
          "en": "Now these Components can then also talk to each other",
          "zh": "這些元件之間也可以互相溝通"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.5,
          "end": 58.17,
          "en": "with help of Inputs and Outputs.",
          "zh": "靠的就是輸入與輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.17,
          "end": 61.44,
          "en": "Inputs are, in the end, properties of a Component",
          "zh": "輸入歸根究柢就是元件上的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.44,
          "end": 64.47,
          "en": "that can be set from outside that Component.",
          "zh": "而且可以從元件外部設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.47,
          "end": 66.66,
          "en": "So from inside the parent Component,",
          "zh": "例如在父元件裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.66,
          "end": 69.45,
          "en": "which uses the other Component in its template.",
          "zh": "它在自己的模板中使用另一個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.45,
          "end": 70.8,
          "en": "And Outputs are, in the end,",
          "zh": "而輸出歸根究柢"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.8,
          "end": 72.777,
          "en": "custom events that can be emitted",
          "zh": "就是可以被發出的自訂事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.777,
          "end": 74.7,
          "en": "and that can also contain data",
          "zh": "而且也可以夾帶資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.7,
          "end": 77.78999999999999,
          "en": "so that a child Component can talk back",
          "zh": "讓子元件可以把訊息傳回"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 77.78999999999999,
          "end": 79.17,
          "en": "to its parent Component",
          "zh": "傳給它的父元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.17,
          "end": 82.28999999999999,
          "en": "and let it know about something that happened inside of it,",
          "zh": "讓父元件知道內部發生了什麼事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.28999999999999,
          "end": 84.33,
          "en": "which is a crucial feature.",
          "zh": "這是一項非常重要的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.33,
          "end": 88.32,
          "en": "Now since things are happening in an Angular app,",
          "zh": "由於 Angular 應用程式中會發生很多事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.32,
          "end": 90.84,
          "en": "users might be clicking buttons and so on,",
          "zh": "例如使用者會點擊按鈕之類的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 90.84,
          "end": 93.24000000000001,
          "en": "it's also quite common that data changes",
          "zh": "所以資料改變的情況"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.24000000000001,
          "end": 94.47,
          "en": "in your Angular app,",
          "zh": "在你的 Angular 應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.47,
          "end": 96.57,
          "en": "and therefore you might wanna output",
          "zh": "非常常見，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 96.57,
          "end": 99.69,
          "en": "that dynamic data in the templates of your Components,",
          "zh": "因此你可能會想要把這些動態資料輸出到元件的模板裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 99.69,
          "end": 103.5,
          "en": "which you can do with various template binding syntaxes",
          "zh": "而這可以透過各種模板繫結語法來做到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.5,
          "end": 106.65,
          "en": "like with string interpolation, which can be used to,",
          "zh": "例如字串插值，可以用來"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.65,
          "end": 109.44,
          "en": "for example, output the value stored in a property",
          "zh": "輸出存放在某個屬性中的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.44,
          "end": 110.91,
          "en": "of your class.",
          "zh": "也就是你類別裡的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 110.91,
          "end": 114.84,
          "en": "Or if you want to set a property of some DOM element,",
          "zh": "或者如果你想設定某個 DOM 元素的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 114.84,
          "end": 116.34,
          "en": "like the source of an image,",
          "zh": "例如圖片的來源，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 116.34,
          "end": 118.71000000000001,
          "en": "you can do that with property binding.",
          "zh": "就可以用屬性繫結來做到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 118.71000000000001,
          "end": 120.51,
          "en": "If you wanna listen to events,",
          "zh": "如果你想監聽事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 120.51,
          "end": 123.51,
          "en": "no matter if they're custom events or built-in events,",
          "zh": "不管是自訂事件還是內建事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 123.51,
          "end": 125.31,
          "en": "you do that with event binding",
          "zh": "都要用事件繫結"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 125.31,
          "end": 128.13,
          "en": "where you use these parentheses around the event name,",
          "zh": "也就是在事件名稱外面加上括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 128.13,
          "end": 129.6,
          "en": "and you then define the code",
          "zh": "然後你再定義"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 129.6,
          "end": 132.45,
          "en": "that should be executed when the event occurs.",
          "zh": "事件發生時要執行的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 132.45,
          "end": 135.87,
          "en": "By the way, a special kind of binding is two-way binding,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，繫結還有一種特殊形式叫雙向繫結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 135.87,
          "end": 139.17000000000002,
          "en": "which is typically used in conjunction with form inputs,",
          "zh": "它通常搭配表單輸入一起使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 139.17000000000002,
          "end": 140.22,
          "en": "which is unlocked",
          "zh": "而這個功能要靠"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 140.22,
          "end": 143.37,
          "en": "by using this special two-way binding syntax",
          "zh": "這個特殊的雙向繫結語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 143.37,
          "end": 145.5,
          "en": "on properties that support it.",
          "zh": "在支援它的屬性上才能解鎖。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 145.5,
          "end": 146.79,
          "en": "Most properties don't,",
          "zh": "大部分屬性並不支援，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 146.79,
          "end": 150.54,
          "en": "but one property that does is the ngModel property,",
          "zh": "但有一個屬性支援，也就是 ngModel，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 150.54,
          "end": 153.36,
          "en": "which is offered by the ngModel directive,",
          "zh": "這是 ngModel 指令所提供的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 153.36,
          "end": 155.55,
          "en": "which is available once you import it",
          "zh": "而 ngModel 要在你匯入它"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 155.55,
          "end": 157.62,
          "en": "and unlock the FormsModule.",
          "zh": "並解鎖 FormsModule 之後才有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 157.62,
          "end": 159.87,
          "en": "You can then use the ngModel directive",
          "zh": "接著你就可以用 ngModel 指令"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 159.87,
          "end": 162.15,
          "en": "with its two-way binding syntax",
          "zh": "搭配它的雙向繫結語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 162.15,
          "end": 165.75,
          "en": "to set up this two-way communication on an Input element,",
          "zh": "在 Input 元素上建立這種雙向溝通，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 165.75,
          "end": 168.69,
          "en": "for example, which allows you to listen to changes",
          "zh": "例如這樣一來你就能監聽變化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 168.69,
          "end": 172.38,
          "en": "whilst also being able to send back data into the Input",
          "zh": "同時也能把資料送回 Input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 172.38,
          "end": 174.48,
          "en": "to update it, for example.",
          "zh": "來更新它，例如這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 174.48,
          "end": 177.32999999999998,
          "en": "Now coming back to data that changes,",
          "zh": "回到資料改變這件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 177.32999999999998,
          "end": 179.91,
          "en": "it's worth noting that by default,",
          "zh": "值得注意的是，預設情況下"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 179.91,
          "end": 182.7,
          "en": "Angular watches for possible events",
          "zh": "Angular 會監看可能發生的事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 182.7,
          "end": 184.74,
          "en": "that could lead to data changes",
          "zh": "看哪些事件可能導致資料改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 184.74,
          "end": 187.59,
          "en": "and therefore UI changes automatically",
          "zh": "並因此自動更新 UI，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 187.59,
          "end": 191.19,
          "en": "with help of an internal package called zone.js.",
          "zh": "靠的是一個叫 zone.js 的內部套件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 191.19,
          "end": 192.57,
          "en": "And therefore, by default,",
          "zh": "所以預設情況下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 192.57,
          "end": 195.63,
          "en": "all you have to do if you wanna update the UI",
          "zh": "如果你想更新 UI，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 195.63,
          "end": 197.37,
          "en": "is change some data,",
          "zh": "你只要改變某些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 197.37,
          "end": 199.65,
          "en": "for example, after a button click,",
          "zh": "例如點擊按鈕之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 199.65,
          "end": 202.38,
          "en": "and output that data in the template",
          "zh": "並在模板中輸出那份資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 202.38,
          "end": 205.65,
          "en": "with help of one of the template binding features,",
          "zh": "用上其中一種模板繫結功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 205.65,
          "end": 207.96,
          "en": "and Angular will figure out the rest,",
          "zh": "剩下的 Angular 就會自己處理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 207.96,
          "end": 209.67000000000002,
          "en": "which is pretty convenient.",
          "zh": "這其實相當方便。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 209.67000000000002,
          "end": 213.3,
          "en": "You can, however, also use Signals instead",
          "zh": "不過你也可以改用 Signal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 213.3,
          "end": 216.42000000000002,
          "en": "where Angular is not automatically watching",
          "zh": "這時 Angular 並不會自動監看"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 216.42000000000002,
          "end": 219.78,
          "en": "for all kinds of events that could lead to changes,",
          "zh": "各種可能導致變化的事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 219.78,
          "end": 223.95,
          "en": "but where you instead explicitly notify Angular",
          "zh": "而是你要明確地通知 Angular，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 223.95,
          "end": 226.02,
          "en": "about changes by, for example,",
          "zh": "例如透過"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 226.02,
          "end": 229.41,
          "en": "calling the set method on a Signal value.",
          "zh": "呼叫 Signal 值上的 set 方法來告知變化。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 229.41,
          "end": 232.95,
          "en": "And where Angular sets up a subscription",
          "zh": "而當你讀取一個 Signal 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 232.95,
          "end": 235.02,
          "en": "whenever you read a Signal",
          "zh": "Angular 就會建立一個訂閱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 235.02,
          "end": 237.9,
          "en": "so that it knows which places of your app",
          "zh": "這樣它就知道你應用程式中的哪些地方"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 237.9,
          "end": 240.6,
          "en": "are interested in those data changes",
          "zh": "對這些資料變化感興趣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 240.6,
          "end": 242.94,
          "en": "and should potentially be updated.",
          "zh": "以及可能需要被更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 242.94,
          "end": 246.3,
          "en": "And this, whilst being a bit more work for you,",
          "zh": "而這個做法雖然對你來說"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 246.3,
          "end": 249.27,
          "en": "the developer, can therefore be a more efficient",
          "zh": "多了一些工作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 249.27,
          "end": 251.31,
          "en": "State management mechanism",
          "zh": "但因此可以是一種更有效率的"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 251.31,
          "end": 254.55,
          "en": "and can potentially lead to better performance.",
          "zh": "狀態管理機制，也可能有更好的效能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 254.55,
          "end": 256.41,
          "en": "Though this Signals approach",
          "zh": "雖然這種 Signal 的做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 256.41,
          "end": 259.8,
          "en": "is only available since Angular version 16,",
          "zh": "只有從 Angular 16 版開始才有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 259.8,
          "end": 262.14,
          "en": "and therefore in older Angular projects,",
          "zh": "所以在較舊的 Angular 專案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 262.14,
          "end": 264.21,
          "en": "you, for example, can't use it.",
          "zh": "你就不能使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 264.21,
          "end": 267.15,
          "en": "Now it's also quite common that, for example,",
          "zh": "現在還有一種情況也很常見，例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 267.15,
          "end": 268.53,
          "en": "when some data changes,",
          "zh": "當某些資料改變時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 268.53,
          "end": 271.35,
          "en": "you wanna render some content conditionally",
          "zh": "你想有條件地渲染某些內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 271.35,
          "end": 273.18,
          "en": "only if a certain condition is met.",
          "zh": "只有在某個條件被滿足時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 273.18,
          "end": 275.1,
          "en": "And you can do that in Angular",
          "zh": "而在 Angular 中你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 275.1,
          "end": 278.01,
          "en": "by using the @if template syntax,",
          "zh": "用 @if 模板語法來做到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 278.01,
          "end": 280.47,
          "en": "which also, however, is only available",
          "zh": "不過這個語法同樣只有"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 280.47,
          "end": 282.63,
          "en": "since Angular version 17.",
          "zh": "從 Angular 17 版開始才有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 282.63,
          "end": 286.23,
          "en": "Before that, you had to use the special ngIf directive,",
          "zh": "在那之前，你必須使用特殊的 ngIf 指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 286.23,
          "end": 288.9,
          "en": "which was a bit more clunky to use however,",
          "zh": "但它用起來有點彆扭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 288.9,
          "end": 291.24,
          "en": "especially if you don't just have a if case,",
          "zh": "尤其當你不只是有 if 的情況，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 291.24,
          "end": 292.86,
          "en": "but also potentially some else",
          "zh": "而可能還有 else"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 292.86,
          "end": 295.71,
          "en": "or else if cases you want to handle.",
          "zh": "或 else if 的情況要處理的時候。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 295.71,
          "end": 298.89,
          "en": "Also common is that you wanna output some list data,",
          "zh": "同樣常見的是，你想輸出一些清單資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 298.89,
          "end": 301.17,
          "en": "and you wanna repeat some part of the DOM",
          "zh": "並且想針對 DOM 的某個部分做重複，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 301.17,
          "end": 304.17,
          "en": "for every element in an array, for example.",
          "zh": "例如針對陣列中的每個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 304.17,
          "end": 307.59,
          "en": "This can be done with the @for template syntax,",
          "zh": "這可以用 @for 模板語法來做到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 307.59,
          "end": 310.2,
          "en": "which makes it easy to loop through all the items",
          "zh": "它讓你很容易走過所有項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 310.2,
          "end": 312.66,
          "en": "in an array and output some markup",
          "zh": "也就是陣列中的所有項目，並輸出一些標記"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 312.66,
          "end": 314.76,
          "en": "for every element in that array.",
          "zh": "給陣列中的每個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 314.76,
          "end": 317.22,
          "en": "This feature is also only available",
          "zh": "這項功能同樣只有"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 317.22,
          "end": 319.08,
          "en": "since Angular version 17,",
          "zh": "從 Angular 17 版開始才有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 319.08,
          "end": 321.57,
          "en": "and therefore in older Angular versions,",
          "zh": "所以在較舊的 Angular 版本中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 321.57,
          "end": 324.66,
          "en": "you would use the ngFor directive instead.",
          "zh": "你會改用 ngFor 指令。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 324.66,
          "end": 327.93,
          "en": "Other features we had a look at in this section were,",
          "zh": "我們在這個單元看過的其他功能還有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 327.93,
          "end": 331.05,
          "en": "for example, how to dynamically add or not add",
          "zh": "例如如何動態地加上或不加"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 331.05,
          "end": 332.82,
          "en": "a CSS class to an element",
          "zh": "某個 CSS 類別到元素上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 332.82,
          "end": 335.85,
          "en": "with help of that special class binding syntax.",
          "zh": "靠的就是那個特殊的類別繫結語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 335.85,
          "end": 339.36,
          "en": "We also had a look at the special ng-content element,",
          "zh": "我們也看過特殊的 ng-content 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 339.36,
          "end": 341.7,
          "en": "which is offered by Angular, which in the end,",
          "zh": "這是 Angular 提供的，而它最終"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 341.7,
          "end": 345.48,
          "en": "allows you to define a slot in the markup of a template",
          "zh": "讓你可以在模板的標記中定義一個插槽，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 345.48,
          "end": 347.67,
          "en": "that will be used to render the content",
          "zh": "用這個插槽來渲染"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 347.67,
          "end": 350.13,
          "en": "that's passed between the tags of that Component,",
          "zh": "傳入該元件標籤之間的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 350.13,
          "end": 351.81,
          "en": "which can be really useful.",
          "zh": "這功能真的非常實用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 351.81,
          "end": 354.57,
          "en": "And we also, for example, had a look at pipes,",
          "zh": "我們也看過 pipes（管道），"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 354.57,
          "end": 358.11,
          "en": "which make it easy to format and transform values",
          "zh": "它讓你很容易格式化並轉換"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 358.11,
          "end": 359.73,
          "en": "you are outputting in the template,",
          "zh": "在模板中輸出的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 359.73,
          "end": 361.68,
          "en": "like for example, the date pipe,",
          "zh": "例如 date pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 361.68,
          "end": 364.05,
          "en": "which can help with date formatting,",
          "zh": "它可以協助日期格式化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 364.05,
          "end": 366.87,
          "en": "another feature that's built into Angular.",
          "zh": "這是 Angular 內建的另一項功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 366.87,
          "end": 370.05,
          "en": "Another problem you commonly have to deal with",
          "zh": "另一個你常要處理的問題"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 370.05,
          "end": 373.08,
          "en": "is the submission of forms and how to handle that.",
          "zh": "就是表單的提交，以及要如何處理它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 373.08,
          "end": 376.41,
          "en": "And that's, again, a place where Angular helps you",
          "zh": "而在這方面，Angular 又能幫上忙，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 376.41,
          "end": 379.56,
          "en": "by giving you the special ngSubmit event",
          "zh": "它提供了特殊的 ngSubmit 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 379.56,
          "end": 381,
          "en": "to which you can listen,",
          "zh": "你可以監聽它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 381,
          "end": 384.18,
          "en": "when using the forms module, I should say,",
          "zh": "我該說明一下，是在使用 FormsModule 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 384.18,
          "end": 387.48,
          "en": "which automatically prevents the browser's default,",
          "zh": "它會自動阻止瀏覽器的預設行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 387.48,
          "end": 390.33,
          "en": "which would be to send an HTTP request",
          "zh": "也就是發送 HTTP 請求"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 390.33,
          "end": 392.64,
          "en": "to the server that served the website,",
          "zh": "給提供這個網站的伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 392.64,
          "end": 395.76,
          "en": "which you typically don't want when building an Angular app,",
          "zh": "而你在開發 Angular 應用程式時通常不希望這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 395.76,
          "end": 399.21,
          "en": "so that instead, you can then handle the form submission",
          "zh": "所以你就可以改為自己處理表單提交，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 399.21,
          "end": 402.33,
          "en": "in the client side code, so in your Angular code,",
          "zh": "在用戶端的程式碼裡，也就是你的 Angular 程式碼中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 402.33,
          "end": 404.64,
          "en": "so that you have full control",
          "zh": "這樣你就完全能控制"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 404.64,
          "end": 407.46,
          "en": "over how the form submission is handled.",
          "zh": "表單提交要如何被處理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 407.46,
          "end": 410.34000000000003,
          "en": "Well, and last but definitely not least,",
          "zh": "最後，當然也是最重要的一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 410.34000000000003,
          "end": 411.87,
          "en": "we had a look at Services,",
          "zh": "我們看過服務（Services），"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 411.87,
          "end": 415.26,
          "en": "which is another crucial concept in Angular.",
          "zh": "這是 Angular 中另一個核心概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 415.26,
          "end": 418.26,
          "en": "To be precise, it's the combination of Services",
          "zh": "更精確地說，是服務"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 418.26,
          "end": 421.53,
          "en": "and Angular's dependency injection mechanism",
          "zh": "搭配 Angular 的相依注入機制，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 421.53,
          "end": 425.73,
          "en": "where the idea simply is that you can outsource data",
          "zh": "它的概念很簡單，就是你可以把資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 425.73,
          "end": 428.91,
          "en": "and logic from a Component into a Service",
          "zh": "和邏輯從元件中移出到一個服務裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 428.91,
          "end": 432.57,
          "en": "and then inject that Service into all the Components",
          "zh": "然後把那個服務注入到所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 432.57,
          "end": 434.64,
          "en": "that might be interested in the data",
          "zh": "對這些資料感興趣的元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 434.64,
          "end": 437.91,
          "en": "or some of the methods exposed by the Service.",
          "zh": "或對服務所提供的一些方法感興趣的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 437.91,
          "end": 441.99,
          "en": "You can inject that Service by decorating the Service class",
          "zh": "你可以用 @Injectable 裝飾器裝飾服務類別"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 441.99,
          "end": 445.14,
          "en": "with the @Injectable decorator, which in the end,",
          "zh": "來注入這個服務，而它最終"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 445.14,
          "end": 448.41,
          "en": "tells Angular that it should be aware of this Service,",
          "zh": "會告訴 Angular 應該知道有這個服務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 448.41,
          "end": 452.13,
          "en": "and that this is something you wanna inject somewhere.",
          "zh": "而且這是你想在某處注入的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 452.13,
          "end": 454.32,
          "en": "And you then do inject it either",
          "zh": "接著你要注入它，可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 454.32,
          "end": 455.88,
          "en": "with help of the constructor",
          "zh": "透過建構子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 455.88,
          "end": 458.52,
          "en": "by listing the Service as a dependency there,",
          "zh": "在那裡把這個服務列為相依項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 458.52,
          "end": 461.46,
          "en": "and it's the type annotation that's important here,",
          "zh": "而這裡重要的是型別標註，"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 461.46,
          "end": 464.4,
          "en": "or with help of the special inject function.",
          "zh": "或者用特殊的 inject 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 464.4,
          "end": 467.46,
          "en": "And then the places where you injected the Service",
          "zh": "而你注入服務的那些地方"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 467.46,
          "end": 470.67,
          "en": "can use the entire API of that Service,",
          "zh": "就可以使用該服務的整個 API，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 470.67,
          "end": 474.63,
          "en": "which therefore makes sharing logic and data a breeze.",
          "zh": "因此讓共享邏輯和資料變得非常輕鬆。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 474.63,
          "end": 478.83,
          "en": "So of course this section contained loads of content.",
          "zh": "所以這個單元當然包含非常多的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 478.83,
          "end": 480.63,
          "en": "It was a huge section,",
          "zh": "這是一個很龐大的單元，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 480.63,
          "end": 483.3,
          "en": "because there are many essential features",
          "zh": "因為有許多必備的功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 483.3,
          "end": 484.8,
          "en": "you must be aware of.",
          "zh": "是你必須知道的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 484.8,
          "end": 487.29,
          "en": "Now you can, of course, repeat that section",
          "zh": "當然，你可以隨時"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 487.29,
          "end": 489.63,
          "en": "as often as you want and as you need it",
          "zh": "想看幾遍就看幾遍"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 489.63,
          "end": 491.76,
          "en": "so that you make sure that you really have",
          "zh": "以確保你真的建立了"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 491.76,
          "end": 493.17,
          "en": "that solid foundation.",
          "zh": "那個扎實的基礎。"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 493.17,
          "end": 494.4,
          "en": "But you will, of course,",
          "zh": "但你當然也會"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 494.4,
          "end": 498.96,
          "en": "also see all those fundamental concepts in Action again,",
          "zh": "在整門課中反覆看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 498.96,
          "end": 502.32,
          "en": "over and over again throughout this entire course,",
          "zh": "這些核心概念的實際運用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 502.32,
          "end": 503.94,
          "en": "in all the other sections,",
          "zh": "在所有其他單元裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 503.94,
          "end": 506.97,
          "en": "and in all the other demo projects we'll build.",
          "zh": "以及我們會做的所有其他練習專案中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 506.97,
          "end": 509.4,
          "en": "So there will be plenty of opportunities",
          "zh": "所以你會有很多機會"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 509.4,
          "end": 511.68,
          "en": "to work with these essentials.",
          "zh": "實際操作這些核心觀念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 511.68,
          "end": 514.62,
          "en": "And therefore, we're now ready to take the next steps",
          "zh": "所以現在我們準備好邁向下一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 514.62,
          "end": 518.61,
          "en": "and dive deeper into those different core features",
          "zh": "更深入研究 Angular 提供的"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 518.61,
          "end": 522.99,
          "en": "Angular offers and also explore some more advanced concepts",
          "zh": "這些不同的核心功能，也探索一些更進階的概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 522.99,
          "end": 524.74,
          "en": "throughout the rest of this course.",
          "zh": "在整門課剩下的部分。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797772",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "lectureOrder": 65,
      "videoOrder": 61,
      "sourceHash": "5439c607281e7adc82de4c049de7f4cbc4bd3758120e50924aef2ca671d47d03",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 4.35,
          "en": "So at this point you did learn a lot",
          "zh": "所以到目前為止，你已經學了很多"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.35,
          "end": 8.16,
          "en": "about crucial Angular essentials,",
          "zh": "關於 Angular 重要的核心觀念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.16,
          "end": 12,
          "en": "and you did learn how to build Angular applications,",
          "zh": "你也學會了如何建立 Angular 應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12,
          "end": 14.73,
          "en": "at least basic applications.",
          "zh": "至少是基本的應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.73,
          "end": 18.63,
          "en": "And, of course, we're going to dive deeper into Angular",
          "zh": "當然，在這門課中我們會更深入探討 Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.63,
          "end": 22.89,
          "en": "and into more advanced features throughout this course.",
          "zh": "以及更多進階的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.89,
          "end": 26.37,
          "en": "However, when we explored",
          "zh": "不過，當我們探討"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.37,
          "end": 31.02,
          "en": "those essentials in the previous sections,",
          "zh": "前面這些核心觀念時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.02,
          "end": 35.37,
          "en": "we worked with, so-called standalone components,",
          "zh": "我們使用的是所謂的獨立元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 35.37,
          "end": 37.71,
          "en": "which is just one kind",
          "zh": "而它只是你在 Angular 應用程式中"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.71,
          "end": 40.44,
          "en": "of components you can build in Angular apps.",
          "zh": "能建立的元件種類之一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.44,
          "end": 44.61,
          "en": "And even though it's the nowadays recommended",
          "zh": "即使它現在是建議"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.61,
          "end": 46.95,
          "en": "way of building Angular Components,",
          "zh": "用來建立 Angular 元件的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.95,
          "end": 49.26,
          "en": "and it's the most modern way",
          "zh": "也是最現代的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.26,
          "end": 51.42,
          "en": "of building Angular components,",
          "zh": "可以建立 Angular 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.42,
          "end": 53.97,
          "en": "and of combining components,",
          "zh": "以及組合元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.97,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "there also exists an alternative,",
          "zh": "但也存在另一種做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 62.03,
          "en": "because you can also use so-called Angular modules",
          "zh": "因為你也可以使用所謂的 Angular 模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.13,
          "end": 65.28,
          "en": "for grouping components together",
          "zh": "把元件群組在一起，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.28,
          "end": 68.223,
          "en": "and for structuring your application.",
          "zh": "以及組織你的應用程式的結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.45,
          "end": 74.45,
          "en": "And this feature exists mostly for historic reasons,",
          "zh": "而這項功能主要是出於歷史因素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 74.91,
          "end": 76.28999999999999,
          "en": "because in the past",
          "zh": "因為在過去"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.28999999999999,
          "end": 81.28999999999999,
          "en": "and also when Angular Two was released in 2016,",
          "zh": "還有 Angular 2 在 2016 年發布時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.6,
          "end": 84.63,
          "en": "Angular modules were the only way",
          "zh": "Angular 模組是唯一的"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.63,
          "end": 87.09,
          "en": "of building Angular apps",
          "zh": "建立 Angular 應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87.09,
          "end": 90.06,
          "en": "or of combining Angular Components,",
          "zh": "或組合 Angular 元件的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.06,
          "end": 93.24000000000001,
          "en": "and therefore a lot of projects still used this approach.",
          "zh": "所以很多專案仍然使用這種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.24000000000001,
          "end": 95.85,
          "en": "And therefore, in this section,",
          "zh": "因此，在這個章節中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.85,
          "end": 100.22999999999999,
          "en": "you will learn what exactly Angular modules are",
          "zh": "你會學到 Angular 模組究竟是什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 100.22999999999999,
          "end": 102.6,
          "en": "and how you can create and use them,",
          "zh": "以及如何建立與使用它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.6,
          "end": 106.05,
          "en": "and how you can use them to combine components",
          "zh": "以及如何用它們來組合元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.05,
          "end": 109.8,
          "en": "instead of using standalone components.",
          "zh": "而不是使用獨立元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.8,
          "end": 112.25999999999999,
          "en": "You will learn how to declare",
          "zh": "你會學到如何在模組中宣告"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.25999999999999,
          "end": 115.68,
          "en": "and export components in modules",
          "zh": "並匯出元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.68,
          "end": 118.17,
          "en": "and why you would want to do that,",
          "zh": "以及你為什麼會想這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.17,
          "end": 122.25,
          "en": "and you will learn how to combine multiple modules",
          "zh": "你也會學到如何組合多個模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 125.13,
          "en": "and how to share module functionalities.",
          "zh": "以及如何共用模組的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.13,
          "end": 128.4,
          "en": "Though this will all, of course, make more sense",
          "zh": "當然，這一切都會變得更有意義，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 128.4,
          "end": 132.48,
          "en": "once you understand what exactly Angular modules are.",
          "zh": "當你了解 Angular 模組究竟是什麼之後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 132.48,
          "end": 134.043,
          "en": "So let's dive into that.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們深入探討吧。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797774",
      "title": "A First Introduction To Angular Modules (NgModule)",
      "lectureOrder": 66,
      "videoOrder": 62,
      "sourceHash": "e694fd1e25769304e20efa3dae8aa955be2418f6a5f47b2d4bd0af419e661919",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 1.86,
          "en": "Now to explore",
          "zh": "現在來探索"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.86,
          "end": 4.5,
          "en": "the concept of Angular modules,",
          "zh": "Angular 模組這個概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 7.74,
          "en": "I am back in that essentials application",
          "zh": "我回到了那個 essentials 應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.74,
          "end": 12.03,
          "en": "we worked on in the last course section.",
          "zh": "也就是我們上一個課程章節所做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.03,
          "end": 14.67,
          "en": "So it's the same application.",
          "zh": "所以還是同一個應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.67,
          "end": 17.19,
          "en": "You find a snapshot attached,",
          "zh": "你會看到附上的程式碼快照，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.19,
          "end": 20.52,
          "en": "and I can of course start this application",
          "zh": "當然，我可以在安裝相依套件"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.52,
          "end": 24.12,
          "en": "after installing the dependencies with NPM install.",
          "zh": "（用 NPM install）之後啟動這個應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.12,
          "end": 27.21,
          "en": "And I then get this app we worked on",
          "zh": "接著我就會看到我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.21,
          "end": 29.103,
          "en": "in the previous section.",
          "zh": "在上一個章節做過的那個應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.24,
          "end": 33.78,
          "en": "And now I wanna migrate this application",
          "zh": "而現在我想把這個應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.78,
          "end": 38.78,
          "en": "to use Angular modules, instead of Standalone Components.",
          "zh": "遷移成使用 Angular 模組，而不是 Standalone 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.12,
          "end": 43.11,
          "en": "So what's the idea behind Angular modules?",
          "zh": "那麼，Angular 模組背後的概念是什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.11,
          "end": 44.04,
          "en": "Well, as I mentioned,",
          "zh": "嗯，就像我提到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.04,
          "end": 48.27,
          "en": "it's a feature that mostly exists for historic reasons,",
          "zh": "這是一個主要基於歷史原因而存在的功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.27,
          "end": 51.6,
          "en": "though you can absolutely still use it today,",
          "zh": "但你今天當然還是可以使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.6,
          "end": 55.32,
          "en": "if you, for example, prefer it over Standalone Components,",
          "zh": "例如，如果你比起 Standalone 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.32,
          "end": 57.93,
          "en": "or if you are working on some project",
          "zh": "更喜歡它的話，或者你正在處理某個"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.93,
          "end": 60.12,
          "en": "that simply uses modules",
          "zh": "單純使用模組的專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.12,
          "end": 63.03,
          "en": "because it may be always used modules,",
          "zh": "因為它可能一直都是使用模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.03,
          "end": 66.87,
          "en": "or because it's using an older version of Angular.",
          "zh": "或者是因為它用的是較舊版本的 Angular。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.87,
          "end": 70.71000000000001,
          "en": "And the idea behind Angular modules",
          "zh": "而 Angular 模組背後的概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.71000000000001,
          "end": 74.01,
          "en": "in the end is that you don't specify",
          "zh": "最終是，你不必去指定"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.01,
          "end": 76.32,
          "en": "on a per component level",
          "zh": "在每個元件的層級"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.32,
          "end": 79.26,
          "en": "as you do it with Standalone Components,",
          "zh": "（像你在 Standalone 元件中所做的那樣），"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.26,
          "end": 83.19,
          "en": "which Components that component uses in its template.",
          "zh": "某個元件在它的模板中會用到哪些元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.19,
          "end": 86.52,
          "en": "So for example, with Standalone Components,",
          "zh": "所以例如在 Standalone 元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.52,
          "end": 89.64,
          "en": "if my app component in its template",
          "zh": "如果我的 app component 在它的模板中"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.64,
          "end": 93.81,
          "en": "uses my custom header component and the user component",
          "zh": "用到了我的自訂 header 元件、user 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.81,
          "end": 96,
          "en": "and the tasks component,",
          "zh": "還有 tasks 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96,
          "end": 101,
          "en": "I have to specify these Components in this imports array",
          "zh": "我就必須在 app 元件的"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.25,
          "end": 102.81,
          "en": "of the app component,",
          "zh": "這個 imports 陣列中指定這些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.81,
          "end": 106.08,
          "en": "if I'm dealing with Standalone Components.",
          "zh": "如果我是在處理 Standalone 元件的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.08,
          "end": 109.74000000000001,
          "en": "And instead of doing that on a per component level",
          "zh": "而與其在每個元件的層級這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.74000000000001,
          "end": 113.64,
          "en": "with modules, you instead create a module",
          "zh": "在使用模組時，你反而是建立一個模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.64,
          "end": 117.18,
          "en": "that simply combines all the Components",
          "zh": "把所有需要互相搭配運作的"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.18,
          "end": 119.58,
          "en": "that need to work with each other.",
          "zh": "元件單純組合在一起。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.58,
          "end": 121.05,
          "en": "You could say,",
          "zh": "你可以說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.05,
          "end": 124.08,
          "en": "so that your component decorators",
          "zh": "這樣你的元件裝飾器"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.08,
          "end": 127.23,
          "en": "and the configuration you pass to your Components",
          "zh": "以及傳給元件的設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.23,
          "end": 129.48,
          "en": "gets leaner because you don't need",
          "zh": "會變得更精簡，因為你不需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.48,
          "end": 131.79,
          "en": "this imports array, for example,",
          "zh": "例如這個 imports 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.79,
          "end": 134.25,
          "en": "when working with Angular modules,",
          "zh": "在使用 Angular 模組時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.25,
          "end": 137.88,
          "en": "but you instead have those extra modules.",
          "zh": "而是改用那些額外的模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.88,
          "end": 139.95,
          "en": "The downside of this approach",
          "zh": "這種做法的缺點是"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.95,
          "end": 144.69,
          "en": "is that whilst the component decorators get a bit leaner,",
          "zh": "雖然元件裝飾器變得比較精簡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.69,
          "end": 147.18,
          "en": "it's not immediately obvious",
          "zh": "但並不容易一眼看出"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.18,
          "end": 150.39,
          "en": "which component uses which other components.",
          "zh": "某個元件用了哪些其他元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.39,
          "end": 154.05,
          "en": "And you have to create those extra modules,",
          "zh": "而且你還得建立那些額外的模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.05,
          "end": 157.32,
          "en": "which is not necessarily an advantage.",
          "zh": "這未必算是一個優點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.32,
          "end": 160.17000000000002,
          "en": "But let's not waste too much time here,",
          "zh": "不過我們別在這裡花太多時間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.17000000000002,
          "end": 164.25,
          "en": "instead, let's simply migrate this essentials project here",
          "zh": "我們就直接把這個 essentials 專案"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.25,
          "end": 166.2,
          "en": "to use Angular modules.",
          "zh": "遷移成使用 Angular 模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.2,
          "end": 169.02,
          "en": "And along the way, you'll therefore learn how to work",
          "zh": "而在這個過程中，你就會學會如何操作"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.02,
          "end": 171.42000000000002,
          "en": "with those modules, how to create them,",
          "zh": "這些模組、如何建立它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.42000000000002,
          "end": 174.99,
          "en": "and how they differ from Standalone Components.",
          "zh": "以及它們和 Standalone 元件有什麼不同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.99,
          "end": 176.64,
          "en": "Though I also wanna mention",
          "zh": "不過我也要提一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.64,
          "end": 179.82,
          "en": "that you can mix and match Standalone Components",
          "zh": "你可以自由混合使用 Standalone 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.82,
          "end": 181.68,
          "en": "and modules if you wanted to,",
          "zh": "和模組，如果你想的話，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.68,
          "end": 183.933,
          "en": "but you'll also see that in action soon.",
          "zh": "但你很快就會看到實際的示範。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797780",
      "title": "Creating a First Empty Module",
      "lectureOrder": 68,
      "videoOrder": 63,
      "sourceHash": "b9e694a6b96a4932e181ef5ad4c7b9e7bd13cb0efe841e33c6e97250f48c062f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 2.01,
          "en": "So back in this project,",
          "zh": "所以回到這個專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.01,
          "end": 4.29,
          "en": "let's now create such a module.",
          "zh": "我們現在來建立一個這樣的模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.29,
          "end": 8.25,
          "en": "And what you typically do in every Angular app",
          "zh": "而在每個使用 Angular 模組的 Angular 應用程式裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.25,
          "end": 11.04,
          "en": "that uses Angular modules",
          "zh": "你通常會做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.04,
          "end": 14.52,
          "en": "is that you create a root AppModule,",
          "zh": "就是建立一個根層的 AppModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.52,
          "end": 18.45,
          "en": "typically next to the root AppComponent.",
          "zh": "通常會放在根層的 AppComponent 旁邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.45,
          "end": 21.33,
          "en": "So here next to the app.component.ts file,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，app.component.ts 檔案旁邊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.33,
          "end": 25.173,
          "en": "I create a app.module.ts file.",
          "zh": "我建立一個 app.module.ts 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.22,
          "end": 28.62,
          "en": "Again, following that naming convention",
          "zh": "同樣地，依照那個命名慣例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.62,
          "end": 31.53,
          "en": "you've seen over and over again throughout the course",
          "zh": "你在整門課裡已經一再看到過的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.53,
          "end": 34.14,
          "en": "where the file name contains a description",
          "zh": "就是檔名中含有"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.14,
          "end": 36.96,
          "en": "of what's inside that file.",
          "zh": "檔案內容說明的那個慣例。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.96,
          "end": 38.673,
          "en": "In this case, a module.",
          "zh": "在這個情況就是模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.08,
          "end": 44.01,
          "en": "Well then, a module as so often in Angular",
          "zh": "那麼，在 Angular 裡模組就像往常一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.01,
          "end": 47.37,
          "en": "is just a class that gets exported.",
          "zh": "其實只是一個被匯出的類別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.37,
          "end": 51.78,
          "en": "And as components or services, the name of the class",
          "zh": "而和元件或服務一樣，這個類別的名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.78,
          "end": 54.69,
          "en": "should have an identifier like app,",
          "zh": "應該包含一個像 app 這樣的識別字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.69,
          "end": 58.17,
          "en": "if it's the main app root module,",
          "zh": "如果它是主要的應用程式根模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.17,
          "end": 61.386,
          "en": "and then a description of what exactly this class is about.",
          "zh": "然後再加上這個類別確切用途的說明。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.386,
          "end": 64.17,
          "en": "And in this case, it will be a module.",
          "zh": "而在這個情況，它會是一個模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.17,
          "end": 66.17699999999999,
          "en": "So, the name would be AppModule.",
          "zh": "所以名稱會是 AppModule。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.11,
          "end": 69.09,
          "en": "Again, not for technical reasons,",
          "zh": "同樣地，這不是技術上的原因，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.09,
          "end": 70.92,
          "en": "you could name it whatever you want,",
          "zh": "你可以隨便命名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.92,
          "end": 74.463,
          "en": "but that's the convention you typically see in Angular.",
          "zh": "但這就是你在 Angular 裡通常會看到的慣例。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.57,
          "end": 80.13,
          "en": "Well, and then also, as you often see it in Angular,",
          "zh": "然後，就像你在 Angular 裡常見的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.13,
          "end": 84.93,
          "en": "you decorate this class with a special decorator,",
          "zh": "你會用一個特殊的裝飾器來裝飾這個類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.93,
          "end": 89.93,
          "en": "and that special decorator is imported from @angular/core,",
          "zh": "而那個特殊裝飾器是從 @angular/core 匯入的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.14,
          "end": 95.07300000000001,
          "en": "and it's the NgModule decorator that must be imported here.",
          "zh": "而這裡必須匯入的是 NgModule 這個裝飾器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 96.36,
          "end": 100.593,
          "en": "And that's then added with that @ symbol to this class.",
          "zh": "然後用 @ 這個符號把它加到這個類別上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 101.85,
          "end": 103.83,
          "en": "Now, like most decorators,",
          "zh": "現在，和大多數裝飾器一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.83,
          "end": 107.03999999999999,
          "en": "this decorator takes a configuration object",
          "zh": "這個裝飾器會接收一個設定物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.03999999999999,
          "end": 109.47,
          "en": "where you now configure this module.",
          "zh": "你就在裡面設定這個模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.47,
          "end": 112.41,
          "en": "Because I mentioned that modules would be the things",
          "zh": "因為我提過，模組會是那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.41,
          "end": 116.22,
          "en": "you set up to group Components together.",
          "zh": "用來把元件組合在一起的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.22,
          "end": 120.049,
          "en": "So, one essential configuration that must be done",
          "zh": "所以，有一項必要的設定必須"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 120.049,
          "end": 123.63,
          "en": "with help of that module is that you add",
          "zh": "透過那個模組來完成，就是你要加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.63,
          "end": 128.63,
          "en": "a declarations array to its configuration,",
          "zh": "一個 declarations 陣列到它的設定中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.85,
          "end": 133.38,
          "en": "because it's that array where you will declare",
          "zh": "因為你會在那個陣列裡宣告"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 133.38,
          "end": 137.4,
          "en": "and register all the components, for example,",
          "zh": "並註冊所有的元件，例如，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 137.4,
          "end": 140.25,
          "en": "that need to work together.",
          "zh": "那些需要一起運作的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 140.25,
          "end": 141.474,
          "en": "I'm saying for example,",
          "zh": "我只是說例如，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.474,
          "end": 144.45,
          "en": "because you could also add directives here,",
          "zh": "因為你也可以在這裡加入指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 144.45,
          "end": 147.81,
          "en": "but we will learn more about directives later in the course.",
          "zh": "不過我們會在課程後面學到更多關於指令的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.81,
          "end": 150.303,
          "en": "So, for now it's Components we wanna focus on.",
          "zh": "所以現在我們先專注在元件上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.74,
          "end": 153.63,
          "en": "Well, and which Components",
          "zh": "那麼，哪些元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 153.63,
          "end": 157.29,
          "en": "do wanna work together in our app?",
          "zh": "在我們的應用程式裡需要一起運作呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.29,
          "end": 160.77,
          "en": "Well, essentially all Components.",
          "zh": "基本上就是所有的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.77,
          "end": 162.987,
          "en": "Now, for more complex applications,",
          "zh": "現在，對於更複雜的應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 162.987,
          "end": 166.56,
          "en": "you could create multiple modules that work together,",
          "zh": "你可以建立多個互相協作的模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.56,
          "end": 170.13,
          "en": "and we'll do that a little bit later in this section.",
          "zh": "我們在這個小節稍後一點會做到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.13,
          "end": 174.153,
          "en": "But for a start, let's start with all Components here.",
          "zh": "不過一開始，我們先從這裡的元件開始。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797784",
      "title": "Bootstrapping Apps with Angular Modules",
      "lectureOrder": 69,
      "videoOrder": 64,
      "sourceHash": "d59dac605f8702d6a30d3e51c4a20a7e173db7ee41fbacaf9da310267675b03e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 2.61,
          "en": "And here for a start,",
          "zh": "首先在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.61,
          "end": 5.04,
          "en": "I will declare the app component",
          "zh": "我要宣告 app 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.04,
          "end": 7.86,
          "en": "because that is definitely one of the Components",
          "zh": "因為那確實是我們應用程式中"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.86,
          "end": 9.6,
          "en": "we have in our application",
          "zh": "其中一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.6,
          "end": 11.643,
          "en": "that should be considered by Angular.",
          "zh": "而它應該被 Angular 納入考量。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.63,
          "end": 14.07,
          "en": "Therefore, I will import",
          "zh": "所以我會匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.07,
          "end": 18.06,
          "en": "the {AppComponent} from './app.component';",
          "zh": "{AppComponent}，寫法是從 './app.component' 匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.06,
          "end": 20.31,
          "en": "so from the app.component.ts file,",
          "zh": "也就是從 app.component.ts 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.31,
          "end": 22.743,
          "en": "and add it here to declarations.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡的 declarations 加上它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.58,
          "end": 26.31,
          "en": "Now as I do that, I'm then getting an error",
          "zh": "現在當我這樣做，就出現了一個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.31,
          "end": 29.43,
          "en": "that the component app component is standalone",
          "zh": "說這個 app 元件是獨立元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.43,
          "end": 33.36,
          "en": "and cannot be declared in a Ng module,",
          "zh": "而且不能被宣告在一個 Ng 模組裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.36,
          "end": 34.89,
          "en": "because indeed modules",
          "zh": "因為事實上模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.89,
          "end": 38.28,
          "en": "and Standalone Components are rivaling concepts.",
          "zh": "和獨立元件是互相牴觸的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.28,
          "end": 41.31,
          "en": "So if we add a component to the declarations array,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們把一個元件加進 declarations 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.31,
          "end": 44.25,
          "en": "it can't be a Standalone Component.",
          "zh": "它就不能是獨立元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.25,
          "end": 46.02,
          "en": "Therefore, what we have to do",
          "zh": "所以我們必須做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.02,
          "end": 49.05,
          "en": "is go to the app.component.ts file",
          "zh": "是前往 app.component.ts 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.05,
          "end": 53.46,
          "en": "and remove this standalone true property here,",
          "zh": "把這裡的 standalone: true 屬性移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.46,
          "end": 58.46,
          "en": "or set it to standalone: false, which is the default though.",
          "zh": "或是設成 standalone: false，不過那本來就是預設值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.5,
          "end": 60.813,
          "en": "Therefore removing it also works.",
          "zh": "所以直接移除也可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.67,
          "end": 64.71,
          "en": "With that, you then see that I'm also getting",
          "zh": "這樣一來，你就會看到我又出現了另一個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.71,
          "end": 67.11,
          "en": "an error here in that component now,",
          "zh": "在這個元件這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.11,
          "end": 70.17,
          "en": "that the imports array is only valid",
          "zh": "說 imports 陣列只有在"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.17,
          "end": 71.76,
          "en": "if a component is standalone,",
          "zh": "元件是獨立元件時才有效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.76,
          "end": 74.34,
          "en": "which this component isn't anymore.",
          "zh": "而這個元件現在已經不是了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.34,
          "end": 77.703,
          "en": "So we should remove that from the app component as well.",
          "zh": "所以我們也應該把這個從 app 元件移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.62,
          "end": 82.17,
          "en": "And then of course, we can also remove those imports here",
          "zh": "當然，我們也可以把這裡的這些匯入移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.17,
          "end": 85.68,
          "en": "because we're not using these component class identifiers",
          "zh": "因為我們在這個檔案裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.68,
          "end": 87.273,
          "en": "in this file anymore.",
          "zh": "已經不再使用這些元件類別的識別名稱了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.98,
          "end": 92.97,
          "en": "So with that, this app component decorator got leaner.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，這個 app 元件的裝飾器就精簡多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.97,
          "end": 96.36,
          "en": "However, now our application also would crash,",
          "zh": "不過，現在我們的應用程式還是會當機，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.36,
          "end": 98.91,
          "en": "and it would actually crash for multiple reasons.",
          "zh": "而且其實還不只一個原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.91,
          "end": 100.62,
          "en": "So let's fix this.",
          "zh": "所以我們來把它修好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.62,
          "end": 103.02000000000001,
          "en": "So why is the application crashing now",
          "zh": "那為什麼應用程式現在會當機，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.02000000000001,
          "end": 106.41,
          "en": "that I added the app component to a module?",
          "zh": "明明我只是把 app 元件加到一個模組裡？"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.41,
          "end": 109.53,
          "en": "Well, because that's not all we have to do here.",
          "zh": "嗯，因為我們在這裡要做的不只這些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.53,
          "end": 111.96000000000001,
          "en": "Keep in mind that earlier in this course",
          "zh": "記得我在這門課一開始提過，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.96000000000001,
          "end": 114.6,
          "en": "I mentioned that it would be the main.ts file",
          "zh": "最先執行的是 main.ts 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.6,
          "end": 116.64,
          "en": "that gets executed first.",
          "zh": "它會最先被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.64,
          "end": 119.43,
          "en": "And in that file we're telling Angular",
          "zh": "而在那個檔案裡，我們告訴 Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.43,
          "end": 123.51,
          "en": "with which component we wanna start our Angular app.",
          "zh": "要用哪一個元件來啟動我們的 Angular 應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.51,
          "end": 125.793,
          "en": "So what our root component should be.",
          "zh": "也就是我們的根元件該是哪一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.05,
          "end": 129.15,
          "en": "Well, this approach only works",
          "zh": "嗯，但這種做法只有在"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.15,
          "end": 132.48,
          "en": "if that root component is a Standalone Component.",
          "zh": "那個根元件是獨立元件時才有效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.48,
          "end": 135.09,
          "en": "So if we're not using modules here,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們在這裡沒有用到模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.09,
          "end": 138.36,
          "en": "and of course that's not the case anymore,",
          "zh": "當然現在的情況已經不是這樣了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.36,
          "end": 141.843,
          "en": "app component isn't a Standalone Component anymore.",
          "zh": "app 元件已經不再是獨立元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 142.74,
          "end": 144.09,
          "en": "And therefore, indeed,",
          "zh": "所以事實上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.09,
          "end": 147.36,
          "en": "if you are working with a root Angular module",
          "zh": "如果你用的是根 Angular 模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.36,
          "end": 149.94,
          "en": "instead of Standalone Components,",
          "zh": "而不是獨立元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.94,
          "end": 153.96,
          "en": "you don't start your Angular application like this.",
          "zh": "你就不能用這種方式啟動 Angular 應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153.96,
          "end": 156.57,
          "en": "Instead, we can get rid of all these imports,",
          "zh": "相反地，我們可以去掉所有這些匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.57,
          "end": 158.86,
          "en": "and completely empty this file",
          "zh": "把這個檔案完全清空，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 159.81,
          "end": 162.337,
          "en": "and instead import something from",
          "zh": "然後改為從那裡匯入東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 162.337,
          "end": 165.387,
          "en": "@angular/platform-browser-dynamic';",
          "zh": "也就是從 @angular/platform-browser-dynamic 匯入；"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 166.59,
          "end": 168.6,
          "en": "And from there we have to import",
          "zh": "接著從那裡匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 168.6,
          "end": 172.173,
          "en": "the platform browser dynamic function,",
          "zh": "platformBrowserDynamic 這個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.57999999999998,
          "end": 176.13,
          "en": "and then this function must be executed.",
          "zh": "然後必須執行這個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 176.13,
          "end": 179.07,
          "en": "And on the result of calling that function,",
          "zh": "而呼叫這個函式所得到的結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 179.07,
          "end": 181.397,
          "en": "you can then call bootstrapModule.",
          "zh": "你就可以在它上面呼叫 bootstrapModule。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.19,
          "end": 187.26,
          "en": "And you now need to pass a reference of that class here.",
          "zh": "而現在你必須把那個類別的參考傳進來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 187.26,
          "end": 189.15,
          "en": "So the class name in the end",
          "zh": "也就是最後把類別名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 189.15,
          "end": 192.21,
          "en": "to this bootstrap module function now.",
          "zh": "傳給這個 bootstrapModule 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 192.21,
          "end": 197.1,
          "en": "So we should import the { AppModule } from ',",
          "zh": "所以我們應該寫成從那裡匯入 { AppModule }，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 197.1,
          "end": 200.64,
          "en": "and then from the app folder and the app module file",
          "zh": "然後是 app 資料夾裡的 app module 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 200.64,
          "end": 204.153,
          "en": "and pass that to the bootstrap module function.",
          "zh": "再把它傳給 bootstrapModule 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 205.98,
          "end": 209.43,
          "en": "And that's how you then start an Angular application",
          "zh": "這就是啟動一個使用模組的"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.43,
          "end": 211.68,
          "en": "that uses modules.",
          "zh": "Angular 應用程式的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.68,
          "end": 213.9,
          "en": "However, we're not entirely there yet,",
          "zh": "不過，我們還沒有完全到位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 218.13,
          "en": "because we also must edit the root module now.",
          "zh": "因為現在我們還必須編輯根模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.13,
          "end": 220.86,
          "en": "Because at the moment Angular just knows",
          "zh": "因為目前 Angular 只知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 220.86,
          "end": 222.48,
          "en": "that it's this app module",
          "zh": "要用這個 app 模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.48,
          "end": 226.02,
          "en": "with which the Angular application should be started,",
          "zh": "來啟動 Angular 應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 226.02,
          "end": 228.48,
          "en": "but it does not know which of the Components",
          "zh": "但它不知道在這裡宣告的這些元件之中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.48,
          "end": 231.78,
          "en": "that are declared here, should be the root component.",
          "zh": "哪一個才該是根元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.78,
          "end": 235.71,
          "en": "Of course, at the moment, we only have one component here,",
          "zh": "當然，目前我們這裡只有一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 235.71,
          "end": 237.45,
          "en": "but that will soon change",
          "zh": "但這很快就會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.45,
          "end": 240.42,
          "en": "because we will soon add more Components here",
          "zh": "因為我們很快就會在這裡加入更多元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 240.42,
          "end": 244.05,
          "en": "to tell Angular which other Components might be used",
          "zh": "好讓 Angular 知道 app 元件可能會用到"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.05,
          "end": 246.36,
          "en": "by the app component.",
          "zh": "哪些其他的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.36,
          "end": 248.01,
          "en": "And therefore, theoretically",
          "zh": "所以理論上來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 248.01,
          "end": 249.99,
          "en": "we would have multiple Components here",
          "zh": "我們這裡會有多個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 249.99,
          "end": 251.79,
          "en": "and Angular wouldn't know",
          "zh": "而 Angular 不會知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 251.79,
          "end": 254.91,
          "en": "with which component to start the app.",
          "zh": "該用哪一個元件來啟動應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 254.91,
          "end": 258.54,
          "en": "That's why to the root Angular module,",
          "zh": "所以你必須在根 Angular 模組裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 258.54,
          "end": 263.163,
          "en": "you also must add a special bootstrap configuration item.",
          "zh": "再加上一個特別的 bootstrap 設定項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 264.06,
          "end": 266.19,
          "en": "And this now also takes an array",
          "zh": "而這裡同樣要放一個陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 266.19,
          "end": 269.58,
          "en": "and it takes an array of all the root Components",
          "zh": "它放的是你想為應用程式設定的"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 269.58,
          "end": 271.86,
          "en": "you wanna set up for your application.",
          "zh": "所有根元件所組成的陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 271.86,
          "end": 274.5,
          "en": "And whilst this could be multiple Components,",
          "zh": "雖然這可以是多個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 274.5,
          "end": 276.03,
          "en": "it's typically just one,",
          "zh": "但通常只有一個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 276.03,
          "end": 279.57,
          "en": "because you typically just build Angular applications",
          "zh": "因為你通常只會建置由單一元件樹"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 279.57,
          "end": 283.8,
          "en": "that consist of a single tree of Components.",
          "zh": "所組成的 Angular 應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 283.8,
          "end": 286.92,
          "en": "So in my case, I specify the app component here",
          "zh": "所以在我的情況，我在這裡指定 app 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 286.92,
          "end": 290.22,
          "en": "so that Angular knows that this is the root component",
          "zh": "讓 Angular 知道這就是根元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 290.22,
          "end": 292.353,
          "en": "with which I wanna start the application.",
          "zh": "也是我想用來啟動應用程式的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 293.90999999999997,
          "end": 298.90999999999997,
          "en": "Well, with that, if we try to load our application again,",
          "zh": "嗯，做到這裡，如果我們再載入一次應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 298.95,
          "end": 301.17,
          "en": "or if we take a look at the terminal",
          "zh": "或者看一下終端機，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 301.17,
          "end": 304.86,
          "en": "where we have that Ng serve process up and running,",
          "zh": "那裡正跑著 ng serve 這個程序，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 304.86,
          "end": 308.16,
          "en": "we see that we still get some errors here.",
          "zh": "就會看到這裡還是有一些錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 308.16,
          "end": 311.4,
          "en": "For example, that Angular doesn't know",
          "zh": "例如，Angular 不認識"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 311.4,
          "end": 314.16,
          "en": "the app tasks component now,",
          "zh": "現在這個 app tasks 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 314.16,
          "end": 317.16,
          "en": "which we're using in the template of the app component.",
          "zh": "而我們正在 app 元件的模板中使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 317.16,
          "end": 320.013,
          "en": "So that's something else we'll have to fix.",
          "zh": "所以這是我們還得再處理的另一件事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797788",
      "title": "Declaring & Using Components",
      "lectureOrder": 70,
      "videoOrder": 65,
      "sourceHash": "a4389c7441c698f6f98a7e7a6836d613b0683baab192c8e368f49592e6a52981",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 1.74,
          "en": "Now it should make sense",
          "zh": "現在應該就說得通了"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.74,
          "end": 5.28,
          "en": "that Angular doesn't know the app-tasks component,",
          "zh": "Angular 已經不再知道 app-tasks 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.28,
          "end": 7.77,
          "en": "as well as some other components anymore.",
          "zh": "以及其他一些元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.77,
          "end": 9.84,
          "en": "And now that we're trying to start",
          "zh": "而現在我們要試著用這個模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.84,
          "end": 13.05,
          "en": "the Angular application with this module.",
          "zh": "啟動這個 Angular 應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.05,
          "end": 17.4,
          "en": "Because we faced a similar error way earlier in this course",
          "zh": "因為我們在這門課程很前面就遇過類似的錯誤"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.4,
          "end": 20.04,
          "en": "when we got started with Components.",
          "zh": "那是在我們開始學元件的時候。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.04,
          "end": 22.27,
          "en": "I mentioned earlier in the course",
          "zh": "我在課程前面提過，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.27,
          "end": 24.6,
          "en": "that Angular would not go ahead",
          "zh": "Angular 不會自動"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.6,
          "end": 28.183,
          "en": "and scan your entire project and register everything",
          "zh": "掃描你整個專案並註冊所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.183,
          "end": 31.8,
          "en": "that looks like a component as a Component.",
          "zh": "看起來像元件的東西，把它當成元件註冊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.8,
          "end": 35.1,
          "en": "Instead, you explicitly need to tell Angular",
          "zh": "相反地，你必須明確地告訴 Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.1,
          "end": 37.95,
          "en": "which components make up your application",
          "zh": "有哪些元件組成了你的應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.95,
          "end": 41.28,
          "en": "and how they should be aware of each other.",
          "zh": "以及它們要如何互相認識。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.28,
          "end": 43.74,
          "en": "And with Standalone Components,",
          "zh": "而在 Standalone 元件的情況下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 47.7,
          "en": "we of course do that with help of this imports array,",
          "zh": "當然是靠這個 imports 陣列來做到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.7,
          "end": 51.69,
          "en": "but we no longer have that on Module-based Components.",
          "zh": "但在以模組為基礎的元件上就沒有這個了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.69,
          "end": 54.03,
          "en": "Instead there it's in that module",
          "zh": "相反地，它在那個模組裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.03,
          "end": 56.49,
          "en": "where we have to declare all the Components",
          "zh": "我們必須在那裡宣告所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.49,
          "end": 58.563,
          "en": "that should know about each other.",
          "zh": "彼此需要互相認識的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.52,
          "end": 61.86,
          "en": "And therefore here in our application,",
          "zh": "所以在我們的應用程式裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.86,
          "end": 66.18,
          "en": "we should not just add the AppComponent to our app module,",
          "zh": "我們不該只把 AppComponent 加到 app module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.18,
          "end": 67.83,
          "en": "but also all the components",
          "zh": "而要把所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.83,
          "end": 69.963,
          "en": "that are being used by that Component.",
          "zh": "被那個元件使用的元件也加進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.89,
          "end": 72.27,
          "en": "Which means we, for example,",
          "zh": "這表示，舉例來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.27,
          "end": 76.68,
          "en": "also should add the HeaderComponent here",
          "zh": "我們也應該把 HeaderComponent 加到這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.68,
          "end": 81.68,
          "en": "because the AppComponent in its template uses this header.",
          "zh": "因為 AppComponent 在它的模板裡用了這個 header。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.37,
          "end": 87.45,
          "en": "But we should also add the user and tasks Components.",
          "zh": "但我們也該把 user 元件和 tasks 元件加進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.45,
          "end": 89.34,
          "en": "So therefore, back in the app module,",
          "zh": "所以回到 app module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.34,
          "end": 92.62,
          "en": "we should also add this UserComponent",
          "zh": "我們也應該把這個 UserComponent"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.38,
          "end": 96.863,
          "en": "and the TasksComponent.",
          "zh": "還有 TasksComponent 加進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.967,
          "end": 99.8,
          "en": "Now of course,",
          "zh": "當然，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.8,
          "end": 101.417,
          "en": "I'm getting a bunch of errors here now though,",
          "zh": "現在我這邊出現了一堆錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.417,
          "end": 104.88,
          "en": "because these are all Standalone Components",
          "zh": "因為這些全都是 Standalone 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.88,
          "end": 109.233,
          "en": "and I mentioned that you can't add those to declarations.",
          "zh": "而我提過，你不能把它們加到 declarations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.16,
          "end": 113.667,
          "en": "Now what you can do if you wanna keep those components",
          "zh": "那如果你想保留這些元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.667,
          "end": 117.96000000000001,
          "en": "as Standalone Components because you are, for example,",
          "zh": "為 Standalone 元件，比方說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.96000000000001,
          "end": 121.59,
          "en": "slowly but steadily migrating your project over,",
          "zh": "你正在一步一步地遷移你的專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.59,
          "end": 123.78,
          "en": "what you can do in such a scenario",
          "zh": "在這種情況下，你可以做的"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.78,
          "end": 127.32,
          "en": "is you can add a imports array to your module",
          "zh": "就是替你的模組加上一個 imports 陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.32,
          "end": 129.78,
          "en": "just as we had those imports arrays",
          "zh": "就像我們在 Standalone 元件上"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.78,
          "end": 132.03,
          "en": "on our Standalone Components.",
          "zh": "有那些 imports 陣列一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.03,
          "end": 134.82,
          "en": "And add any Standalone Components,",
          "zh": "然後把你想為應用程式註冊的"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.82,
          "end": 137.52,
          "en": "you wanna register for your application",
          "zh": "任何 Standalone 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.52,
          "end": 140.793,
          "en": "to that imports array instead of the declarations array.",
          "zh": "加到那個 imports 陣列，而不是 declarations 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.41,
          "end": 146.67000000000002,
          "en": "So, the declarations array is for non-Standalone Components.",
          "zh": "所以 declarations 陣列是給非 Standalone 元件用的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.67000000000002,
          "end": 150.753,
          "en": "The imports array can be used for Standalone Components.",
          "zh": "imports 陣列則可以用於 Standalone 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.77,
          "end": 155.163,
          "en": "And with that, we got no errors here anymore.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們這裡就沒有錯誤了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.32999999999998,
          "end": 157.92000000000002,
          "en": "However, you will see",
          "zh": "不過，你會看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.92000000000002,
          "end": 160.005,
          "en": "that as you try to view your application,",
          "zh": "當你嘗試檢視應用程式時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.005,
          "end": 162.81,
          "en": "you won't see anything on the screen.",
          "zh": "畫面上什麼都看不到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.81,
          "end": 164.79,
          "en": "And if you open the Browser Developer Tools,",
          "zh": "如果你開啟瀏覽器開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.79,
          "end": 168.78,
          "en": "you'll see an error here that a required Injectable",
          "zh": "你會在這裡看到一個錯誤，說某個必要的 Injectable"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.78,
          "end": 172.26,
          "en": "was not found in the dependency injection tree.",
          "zh": "在相依性注入的樹中找不到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 172.26,
          "end": 174.57,
          "en": "And we actually get an additional hint,",
          "zh": "而且我們其實還得到一個額外提示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.57,
          "end": 177.18,
          "en": "actually a solution for the problem",
          "zh": "其實就是這個問題的解法："
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.18,
          "end": 180.66,
          "en": "that if we are bootstrapping an NgModule, which we are,",
          "zh": "如果我們正在 bootstrap 一個 NgModule——我們確實如此——"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.66,
          "end": 182.565,
          "en": "we're trying to bootstrap the application",
          "zh": "我們正試著啟動這個應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.565,
          "end": 184.56,
          "en": "with the AppModule,",
          "zh": "而用的是 AppModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.56,
          "end": 187.983,
          "en": "we should make sure that the BrowserModule is imported.",
          "zh": "我們必須確保 BrowserModule 有被匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.97,
          "end": 193.02,
          "en": "Because modules can actually also import other modules",
          "zh": "因為模組其實也可以匯入其他模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.02,
          "end": 197.1,
          "en": "and will build another custom other module later.",
          "zh": "我們之後也會再打造另一個自訂的模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 197.1,
          "end": 199.44,
          "en": "But one module that has been built for us",
          "zh": "但有個已經為我們打造好的模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.44,
          "end": 202.5,
          "en": "by the Angular team, which we should import here,",
          "zh": "由 Angular 團隊打造、我們應該在這裡匯入的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.5,
          "end": 206.4,
          "en": "is the BrowserModule,",
          "zh": "就是 BrowserModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.4,
          "end": 210.153,
          "en": "which is imported from @angular/platform-browser.",
          "zh": "它是從 @angular/platform-browser 匯入的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.35,
          "end": 214.62,
          "en": "This is a module provided by the Angular team",
          "zh": "這是 Angular 團隊提供的模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 214.62,
          "end": 218.76,
          "en": "that in the end provides a collection of things",
          "zh": "它最終提供了一整套"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 218.76,
          "end": 221.25,
          "en": "that are needed by every Angular app",
          "zh": "每個 Angular 應用程式都需要的"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.25,
          "end": 223.14,
          "en": "in order to run correctly.",
          "zh": "東西，才能正確運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 223.14,
          "end": 227.35,
          "en": "This includes some generally helpful directives",
          "zh": "其中包含一些一般來說很有用的指令"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 227.35,
          "end": 229.47,
          "en": "that might be used in your application,",
          "zh": "可能會用在你的應用程式裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 229.47,
          "end": 231.66,
          "en": "but also some other crucial features",
          "zh": "但也包含其他一些關鍵功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 231.66,
          "end": 233.883,
          "en": "every application needs access to.",
          "zh": "每個應用程式都需要存取它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.72,
          "end": 236.915,
          "en": "That's why you must import this here.",
          "zh": "所以你必須在這裡匯入它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.915,
          "end": 240.45,
          "en": "And then, also add it to the imports array",
          "zh": "然後把它也加到"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 240.45,
          "end": 245.45,
          "en": "of your RootModule, so of your Appmodule typically.",
          "zh": "你的 RootModule 的 imports 陣列，通常就是你的 AppModule。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 245.79,
          "end": 250.352,
          "en": "Every Angular application when using Angular modules",
          "zh": "每個使用 Angular 模組的 Angular 應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 250.352,
          "end": 252.693,
          "en": "needs that BrowserModule.",
          "zh": "都需要那個 BrowserModule。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 254.25,
          "end": 257.37,
          "en": "Well, and with that, if you saved it and you reload,",
          "zh": "好，這樣一來，如果你儲存並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 257.37,
          "end": 259.65,
          "en": "you see we got no more errors here.",
          "zh": "你會看到我們這裡沒有錯誤了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.65,
          "end": 263.433,
          "en": "And the application indeed, again, works as before.",
          "zh": "而應用程式確實又像之前一樣運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 264.39,
          "end": 266.43,
          "en": "And that's therefore also an example",
          "zh": "所以這也是一個例子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 266.43,
          "end": 268.74,
          "en": "that shows us how we can combine",
          "zh": "顯示我們可以如何結合"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 268.74,
          "end": 272.46,
          "en": "Standalone and Module-based Components",
          "zh": "Standalone 元件和以模組為基礎的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 272.46,
          "end": 276.42,
          "en": "by adding any Standalone Components to imports",
          "zh": "把任何 Standalone 元件加到 imports，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 276.42,
          "end": 280.59000000000003,
          "en": "and any non-Standalone Components to declarations.",
          "zh": "把任何非 Standalone 元件加到 declarations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 280.59000000000003,
          "end": 282.114,
          "en": "But we're of course still not done",
          "zh": "不過當然，我們還沒完成"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 282.114,
          "end": 284.103,
          "en": "with this application here.",
          "zh": "這個應用程式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797790",
      "title": "A First Summary",
      "lectureOrder": 71,
      "videoOrder": 66,
      "sourceHash": "c71adb8dcc77932db2613a65ffc3446a2c13b94713b506971a89e5a04dc555ec",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.57,
          "end": 1.92,
          "en": "So at this point,",
          "zh": "所以到這個階段，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.92,
          "end": 5.28,
          "en": "you learned how to create an Angular module,",
          "zh": "你學會了如何建立 Angular 模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.28,
          "end": 8.25,
          "en": "how to bootstrap your Angular application",
          "zh": "如何用這樣的模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.25,
          "end": 10.26,
          "en": "with such a module,",
          "zh": "來啟動你的 Angular 應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.26,
          "end": 13.62,
          "en": "how to register non-Standalone Components,",
          "zh": "如何註冊非 Standalone 的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.62,
          "end": 15.87,
          "en": "how to register other modules",
          "zh": "如何註冊其他模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.87,
          "end": 19.2,
          "en": "and merge them into this module, so to say,",
          "zh": "可以說把它們合併進這個模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.2,
          "end": 22.53,
          "en": "and how to register Standalone Components",
          "zh": "以及如何註冊 Standalone 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.53,
          "end": 24.33,
          "en": "so that you can build applications",
          "zh": "讓你能建置"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.33,
          "end": 26.823,
          "en": "that use both kinds of Components.",
          "zh": "同時使用這兩種元件的應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.69,
          "end": 30.27,
          "en": "It's also worth mentioning here",
          "zh": "這裡也值得提一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.27,
          "end": 33.75,
          "en": "that those Standalone Components, on the other hand,",
          "zh": "另一方面，Standalone 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.75,
          "end": 36,
          "en": "also can use modules.",
          "zh": "也可以使用模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36,
          "end": 39.75,
          "en": "So you can not just add Standalone Components to modules,",
          "zh": "所以你不只能把 Standalone 元件加入模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.75,
          "end": 43.41,
          "en": "but also modules to Standalone Components.",
          "zh": "也可以把模組加到 Standalone 元件中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.41,
          "end": 46.2,
          "en": "And we're actually already doing that here",
          "zh": "而我們在這裡其實已經這麼做了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.2,
          "end": 49.593,
          "en": "in our application in the new task component.",
          "zh": "在我們應用程式的 new-task 元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.46,
          "end": 52.8,
          "en": "There, we have a Standalone Component,",
          "zh": "那裡我們有一個 Standalone 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.8,
          "end": 54.84,
          "en": "and in its imports array,",
          "zh": "而在它的 imports 陣列中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.84,
          "end": 58.38,
          "en": "we're not importing some other kind of component,",
          "zh": "我們並沒有匯入其他種類的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.38,
          "end": 61.74,
          "en": "but instead, a module, the FormsModule",
          "zh": "而是匯入一個模組，也就是 FormsModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.74,
          "end": 64.053,
          "en": "that is provided by Angular.",
          "zh": "它是由 Angular 提供的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.95,
          "end": 68.7,
          "en": "And that FormsModule is such a NgModule",
          "zh": "而這個 FormsModule 就是一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.7,
          "end": 71.46000000000001,
          "en": "that has been built by the Angular team,",
          "zh": "由 Angular 團隊所打造的 NgModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.46000000000001,
          "end": 75.24,
          "en": "and that provides a collection of Directives",
          "zh": "它提供了一組指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.24,
          "end": 78.63,
          "en": "and generally features we might wanna use",
          "zh": "以及我們可能想用的一般功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.63,
          "end": 80.55,
          "en": "in our application.",
          "zh": "在我們的應用程式中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.55,
          "end": 84.03,
          "en": "And we can easily use that in a Standalone Component",
          "zh": "而我們可以很容易地在 Standalone 元件中使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.03,
          "end": 87.63,
          "en": "by adding it to this imports array like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣把它加到 imports 陣列中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.63,
          "end": 89.1,
          "en": "That's nothing new.",
          "zh": "這沒什麼新奇的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.1,
          "end": 92.25,
          "en": "We did that in the previous section already,",
          "zh": "我們在前一個單元已經做過了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.25,
          "end": 94.62,
          "en": "but it's important to keep that in mind",
          "zh": "但還是要記住這點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.62,
          "end": 99.06,
          "en": "and understand that you can mix and match",
          "zh": "並理解你可以自由搭配混用"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.06,
          "end": 101.16,
          "en": "non-Standalone Components,",
          "zh": "非 Standalone 的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.16,
          "end": 105.06,
          "en": "and Standalone Components just as needed,",
          "zh": "和 Standalone 元件，依照需求即可。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.06,
          "end": 107.78999999999999,
          "en": "which is important because this, for example,",
          "zh": "這點很重要，因為例如這樣做"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.78999999999999,
          "end": 112.78999999999999,
          "en": "also simplifies the process of migrating an Angular app",
          "zh": "也能簡化遷移 Angular 應用程式的過程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.07,
          "end": 115.05,
          "en": "from Standalone Components",
          "zh": "例如從 Standalone 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.05,
          "end": 118.53,
          "en": "to modules or vice versa.",
          "zh": "遷移到模組，或反過來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.53,
          "end": 120.48,
          "en": "And speaking of migration,",
          "zh": "說到遷移，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.48,
          "end": 123.42,
          "en": "we're also going to continue with one here,",
          "zh": "我們在這裡也會繼續進行遷移，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.42,
          "end": 126.66,
          "en": "and we're going to continue to migrate",
          "zh": "我們要繼續把"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.66,
          "end": 129.84,
          "en": "this entire first demo app we built here",
          "zh": "我們在這裡打造的第一個練習應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 129.84,
          "end": 132.963,
          "en": "from Standalone Components to modules.",
          "zh": "從 Standalone 元件遷移到模組。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797800",
      "title": "Migrating All Components To Use Modules",
      "lectureOrder": 72,
      "videoOrder": 67,
      "sourceHash": "dc25d89ba81bbeb58c267867f72ebc883e5f4294477fc7b4d2871e871bbbfb66",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 3.48,
          "en": "So the goal now is to actually convert",
          "zh": "所以現在的目標是實際把"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.48,
          "end": 6.45,
          "en": "the HeaderComponent, UserComponent, TasksComponent,",
          "zh": "HeaderComponent、UserComponent、TasksComponent，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.45,
          "end": 11.37,
          "en": "and so on from Standalone to non-Standalone Components.",
          "zh": "等等，從獨立元件轉換成非獨立元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.37,
          "end": 14.64,
          "en": "And as a challenge and exercise,",
          "zh": "當成一個挑戰與練習，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.64,
          "end": 17.91,
          "en": "you can definitely try doing this on your own.",
          "zh": "你當然可以自己試著做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.91,
          "end": 20.13,
          "en": "Start with the HeaderComponent,",
          "zh": "先從 HeaderComponent 開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.13,
          "end": 22.29,
          "en": "and if you're then feeling fancy,",
          "zh": "如果你覺得還想再挑戰一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.29,
          "end": 26.637,
          "en": "also try continuing with the User and TasksComponent.",
          "zh": "也可以接著處理 UserComponent 和 TasksComponent。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.637,
          "end": 31.53,
          "en": "Those will be a bit more tricky because those Components,",
          "zh": "這兩個會比較棘手一點，因為那些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.53,
          "end": 33.45,
          "en": "especially the TasksComponent,",
          "zh": "尤其是 TasksComponent，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.45,
          "end": 36,
          "en": "use other Components internally,",
          "zh": "在內部還使用了其他元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36,
          "end": 38.31,
          "en": "which then also need to be migrated.",
          "zh": "那些元件也一樣需要一起轉換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.31,
          "end": 41.94,
          "en": "But you can definitely try doing this on your own as well",
          "zh": "但你當然也可以自己試著做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.94,
          "end": 43.83,
          "en": "after a couple of seconds,",
          "zh": "我給你幾秒鐘時間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.83,
          "end": 45.78,
          "en": "which I give you to pause the video",
          "zh": "讓你暫停影片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.78,
          "end": 48,
          "en": "so that you can try it on your own.",
          "zh": "自己試試看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48,
          "end": 50.13,
          "en": "We'll migrate these Components",
          "zh": "我們會把這些元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.13,
          "end": 52.41,
          "en": "and any other Components that may need",
          "zh": "以及任何其他可能需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.41,
          "end": 54.333,
          "en": "to be migrated together.",
          "zh": "一起轉換的元件都一併處理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.47,
          "end": 61.29,
          "en": "So let's convert these Components together now,",
          "zh": "所以現在就一起來轉換這些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.29,
          "end": 64.77,
          "en": "and I will start with the HeaderComponent.",
          "zh": "我會先從 HeaderComponent 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.77,
          "end": 66.69,
          "en": "Here, it's pretty straightforward",
          "zh": "這裡相當簡單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.69,
          "end": 70.26,
          "en": "because this component doesn't use any other Components.",
          "zh": "因為這個元件沒有使用任何其他元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.26,
          "end": 74.16,
          "en": "So all we have to do here is set standalone to false",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡只要把 standalone 設為 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.16,
          "end": 75.483,
          "en": "or remove it.",
          "zh": "或者直接移除它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.89,
          "end": 78.63,
          "en": "And then back in the app.module,",
          "zh": "然後回到 app.module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.63,
          "end": 81.67,
          "en": "move that HeaderComponent from the imports array",
          "zh": "把那個 HeaderComponent 從 imports 陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.56,
          "end": 84.363,
          "en": "to the declarations array.",
          "zh": "移到 declarations 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.71000000000001,
          "end": 86.91,
          "en": "And that's all.",
          "zh": "就這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.91,
          "end": 88.14,
          "en": "If we now save that,",
          "zh": "如果我們現在儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.14,
          "end": 91.23,
          "en": "the application reloads and still works as before,",
          "zh": "應用程式會重新載入，而且運作跟之前一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.23,
          "end": 93.513,
          "en": "and the header also still is there.",
          "zh": "header 也還在。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.4,
          "end": 97.41,
          "en": "Of course, we can there for now continue",
          "zh": "當然，我們現在可以繼續"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.41,
          "end": 98.56,
          "en": "with the UserComponent.",
          "zh": "處理 UserComponent。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.84,
          "end": 104.72999999999999,
          "en": "Here, we also remove standalone or set it to false.",
          "zh": "在這裡，我們也把 standalone 移除或設為 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.72999999999999,
          "end": 108.21000000000001,
          "en": "And here, we now are using some other component,",
          "zh": "而這裡我們還用到了另一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.21000000000001,
          "end": 109.11,
          "en": "the CardComponent.",
          "zh": "也就是 CardComponent。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.7,
          "end": 113.43,
          "en": "So we should remove that imports array here now",
          "zh": "所以我們現在應該把這裡的 imports 陣列移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.43,
          "end": 116.78999999999999,
          "en": "since we can't use that in Standalone Components,",
          "zh": "因為在獨立元件中不能用那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.78999999999999,
          "end": 118.56,
          "en": "and we can then therefore also get rid",
          "zh": "因此我們也可以順便移除"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.56,
          "end": 120.423,
          "en": "of this unused import.",
          "zh": "這個沒用到的 import。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.95,
          "end": 124.47,
          "en": "And instead back in the app.module,",
          "zh": "然後改回到 app.module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.47,
          "end": 127.44,
          "en": "we now should move the UserComponent",
          "zh": "我們現在應該把 UserComponent"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.44,
          "end": 129.9,
          "en": "from imports to declarations,",
          "zh": "從 imports 移到 declarations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.9,
          "end": 133.83,
          "en": "but we now also need to add the CardComponent here",
          "zh": "但現在還需要把 CardComponent 也加到這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.83,
          "end": 136.623,
          "en": "since we're using that in the UserComponent.",
          "zh": "因為我們在 UserComponent 中有使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 137.7,
          "end": 139.68,
          "en": "Now the CardComponent, of course,",
          "zh": "當然，CardComponent"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.68,
          "end": 141.84,
          "en": "is also a standalone component,",
          "zh": "本身也是一個獨立元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.84,
          "end": 146.57999999999998,
          "en": "so we should also convert that to a module-based component.",
          "zh": "所以我們也應該把它轉換成以模組為基礎的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.57999999999998,
          "end": 148.443,
          "en": "And also remove the imports array.",
          "zh": "並且也把 imports 陣列移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.27,
          "end": 154.32,
          "en": "With that, it's just the TasksComponent that remains,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，就只剩下 TasksComponent，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.32,
          "end": 156.99,
          "en": "but this component uses two other Components,",
          "zh": "但這個元件用了另外兩個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.99,
          "end": 159.32999999999998,
          "en": "which we'll also need to convert.",
          "zh": "我們也需要把它們轉換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 159.32999999999998,
          "end": 162.78,
          "en": "Now I'll start with the TasksComponent by setting it",
          "zh": "現在我會先從 TasksComponent 開始，把它"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.78,
          "end": 166.68,
          "en": "to standalone: false and by getting rid of imports,",
          "zh": "設為 standalone: false，並移除 imports，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 166.68,
          "end": 169.86,
          "en": "and by then getting rid of these unused imports",
          "zh": "接著把這些沒用到的 import"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 169.86,
          "end": 171.78300000000002,
          "en": "of the Task and NewTaskComponent.",
          "zh": "也就是 Task 與 NewTaskComponent 的 import 移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.45,
          "end": 175.65,
          "en": "And back in app.module,",
          "zh": "然後回到 app.module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 175.65,
          "end": 180.45,
          "en": "we add the TasksComponent here to declarations",
          "zh": "把 TasksComponent 加到這裡的 declarations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.45,
          "end": 183.393,
          "en": "and autoformat this to make it a bit more readable,",
          "zh": "並自動排版一下，讓它看起來清楚一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.38,
          "end": 189.38,
          "en": "and then also add the TaskComponent here for a single task",
          "zh": "然後也把 TaskComponent 加到這裡，代表單一任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.9,
          "end": 192.7,
          "en": "and also the NewTaskComponent.",
          "zh": "還有 NewTaskComponent。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.46,
          "end": 196.07999999999998,
          "en": "And you always must make sure",
          "zh": "而且你一定要確認"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 196.07999999999998,
          "end": 199.23,
          "en": "that all those imports up here are added as well.",
          "zh": "上面那些 import 也都有加進來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.23,
          "end": 200.94,
          "en": "Otherwise, Angular won't be able",
          "zh": "否則 Angular 就沒辦法"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 200.94,
          "end": 203.463,
          "en": "to find those Components in their files.",
          "zh": "在它們的檔案中找到那些元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.69,
          "end": 207.42000000000002,
          "en": "Now TaskComponent and NewTaskComponent",
          "zh": "現在 TaskComponent 和 NewTaskComponent"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.42000000000002,
          "end": 209.22,
          "en": "are Standalone Components.",
          "zh": "都是獨立元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.22,
          "end": 212.94,
          "en": "So we should convert the TaskComponent,",
          "zh": "所以我們應該轉換 TaskComponent，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 212.94,
          "end": 216.963,
          "en": "which is using the CardComponent though and the DatePipe.",
          "zh": "它有使用 CardComponent 還有 DatePipe。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.49,
          "end": 220.95,
          "en": "Now we have to remove that,",
          "zh": "現在我們必須把那個移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.95,
          "end": 224.28300000000002,
          "en": "and then also remove those unused imports.",
          "zh": "然後也把那些沒用到的 import 移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.07999999999998,
          "end": 229.29,
          "en": "And we are already declaring the CardComponent,",
          "zh": "而我們已經有宣告 CardComponent 了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.29,
          "end": 231.63,
          "en": "so we don't need to do anything here.",
          "zh": "所以這裡不需要做任何事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.63,
          "end": 233.28300000000002,
          "en": "But what about the DatePipe?",
          "zh": "那 DatePipe 呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 234.51,
          "end": 237.3,
          "en": "Well, you could think that you need to add it here",
          "zh": "嗯，你可能會以為需要像這樣把它加到這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 237.3,
          "end": 239.583,
          "en": "to imports like this.",
          "zh": "的 imports 裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 240.6,
          "end": 242.73,
          "en": "And indeed you could do that,",
          "zh": "你確實可以這樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 242.73,
          "end": 244.71,
          "en": "but you actually don't have to.",
          "zh": "但其實你不必這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.71,
          "end": 247.62,
          "en": "You don't have to add the DatePipe here",
          "zh": "你不需要把 DatePipe 加到這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 247.62,
          "end": 250.62,
          "en": "in this imports array because this is actually one",
          "zh": "的 imports 陣列，因為這其實是"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 250.62,
          "end": 253.2,
          "en": "of the things that's automatically included",
          "zh": "其中一項會被自動包含的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 253.2,
          "end": 254.823,
          "en": "by that browser module.",
          "zh": "那個 BrowserModule 會自動提供它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 255.75,
          "end": 259.11,
          "en": "So all those pipes are automatically unlocked",
          "zh": "所以那些 pipe 都會自動被解鎖，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 259.11,
          "end": 261.42,
          "en": "by that browser module, and therefore,",
          "zh": "由那個 BrowserModule 提供，因此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 261.42,
          "end": 263.913,
          "en": "you don't need to add the DatePipe here.",
          "zh": "你不需要把 DatePipe 加在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 265.95,
          "end": 269.22,
          "en": "And that leaves us with only the NewTaskComponent",
          "zh": "這樣就只剩下 NewTaskComponent"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 269.22,
          "end": 273.09000000000003,
          "en": "that must be migrated by removing standalone",
          "zh": "需要轉換，也就是移除 standalone"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.09000000000003,
          "end": 274.65,
          "en": "and this imports array.",
          "zh": "以及這個 imports 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 274.65,
          "end": 278.37,
          "en": "And here we are, of course, using the FormsModule,",
          "zh": "而這裡當然有使用 FormsModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 278.37,
          "end": 279.72,
          "en": "but you did already learn",
          "zh": "但你之前已經學過，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 279.72,
          "end": 283.53,
          "en": "that you can also merge modules into each other.",
          "zh": "模組之間也可以互相合併。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 283.53,
          "end": 285.51,
          "en": "So here, we have to get rid of imports",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我們要去掉 imports，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 285.51,
          "end": 287.103,
          "en": "and get rid of this import.",
          "zh": "並去掉這個 import。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 288.42,
          "end": 291.93,
          "en": "And then back in the app.module.ts file,",
          "zh": "然後回到 app.module.ts 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 291.93,
          "end": 296.52,
          "en": "we have to add this FormsModule to this imports array",
          "zh": "我們必須把這個 FormsModule 加到 imports 陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 296.52,
          "end": 300.66,
          "en": "of the app.module so that all the functionalities",
          "zh": "也就是 app.module 的 imports 陣列，這樣所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 300.66,
          "end": 304.77,
          "en": "and features provided by the FormsModule are made available",
          "zh": "FormsModule 提供的功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 304.77,
          "end": 307.683,
          "en": "to all these Components that are declared here.",
          "zh": "就能提供給這裡宣告的所有元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 311.07,
          "end": 312.48,
          "en": "And I'll just move",
          "zh": "然後我順手把"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 312.48,
          "end": 315.75,
          "en": "that automatically added import up to the top",
          "zh": "那個自動加上的 import 移到最上方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 315.75,
          "end": 319.56,
          "en": "so that we got all those Angular imports grouped together,",
          "zh": "讓所有 Angular 的 import 集中在一起，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 319.56,
          "end": 321.84,
          "en": "which is not required technically,",
          "zh": "技術上其實不需要這樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 321.84,
          "end": 324.33299999999997,
          "en": "but makes this all a bit more readable.",
          "zh": "但會讓整體好讀一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 326.07,
          "end": 327.6,
          "en": "Well, and with that,",
          "zh": "嗯，做了這些之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 327.6,
          "end": 330.51,
          "en": "finally, everything has been migrated,",
          "zh": "最後一切都轉換完成了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 330.51,
          "end": 333.27,
          "en": "and we therefore are able to, again,",
          "zh": "所以我們現在又可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 333.27,
          "end": 337.2,
          "en": "work on this application and add new tasks and complete them",
          "zh": "在這個應用程式上新增任務並完成它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 337.2,
          "end": 341.31,
          "en": "and do all that without getting any errors.",
          "zh": "而且不會出現任何錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 341.31,
          "end": 344.85,
          "en": "And that's therefore how we can migrate application",
          "zh": "所以這就是我們把應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 344.85,
          "end": 346.14,
          "en": "to use modules.",
          "zh": "轉換成使用模組的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 346.14,
          "end": 350.15999999999997,
          "en": "And most importantly, that's how modules work",
          "zh": "而最重要的是，模組是如何運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 350.15999999999997,
          "end": 352.95,
          "en": "and what the idea behind them is",
          "zh": "以及它們背後的想法是什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 352.95,
          "end": 356.22,
          "en": "because now we got that one single module file",
          "zh": "因為現在我們有那一個單一的模組檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 356.22,
          "end": 360.3,
          "en": "that declares all the Components that need to work together,",
          "zh": "它宣告了所有需要一起運作的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 360.3,
          "end": 363.66,
          "en": "and therefore, every component on its own is a bit leaner",
          "zh": "所以每個元件本身都更精簡了一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 363.66,
          "end": 366.963,
          "en": "and all that information is stored in its central place.",
          "zh": "而所有這些資訊都集中在那個地方儲存。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 368.01,
          "end": 370.68,
          "en": "That, however, isn't necessarily an advantage",
          "zh": "不過，這未必是一個優點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 370.68,
          "end": 374.01,
          "en": "because it is now an extra file we have to manage,",
          "zh": "因為它現在多了一個我們必須管理的檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 374.01,
          "end": 377.34,
          "en": "and adding the Components that are used by a component",
          "zh": "而且把某個元件所使用的其他元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 377.34,
          "end": 380.64,
          "en": "to its imports array wasn't too difficult",
          "zh": "加到它的 imports 陣列裡其實並不難，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 380.64,
          "end": 381.96,
          "en": "if we're being honest,",
          "zh": "如果老實說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 381.96,
          "end": 384.96,
          "en": "especially since those imports could be added",
          "zh": "何況那些 import 還可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 384.96,
          "end": 388.68,
          "en": "pretty much automatically as you saw before.",
          "zh": "幾乎像你之前看到的那樣自動加入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 388.68,
          "end": 392.31,
          "en": "That's why typically nowadays it's not recommended",
          "zh": "所以現在通常已經不推薦"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 392.31,
          "end": 394.77,
          "en": "to use this module-based approach anymore,",
          "zh": "再使用這種以模組為基礎的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 394.77,
          "end": 396.12,
          "en": "but you, of course,",
          "zh": "但你當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 396.12,
          "end": 400.11,
          "en": "still can and you still will see it in many projects.",
          "zh": "還是可以用，而且你在很多專案中還是會看到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 400.11,
          "end": 402.24,
          "en": "And that's why I also wanted",
          "zh": "所以我也想"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 402.24,
          "end": 404.49,
          "en": "to get you started with it here.",
          "zh": "在這裡讓你先熟悉它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 404.49,
          "end": 408.183,
          "en": "And we're not even done with this topic yet.",
          "zh": "而且這個主題我們還沒談完。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797802",
      "title": "Creating & Using Shared Modules",
      "lectureOrder": 73,
      "videoOrder": 68,
      "sourceHash": "15b6f25e7e4decb96ecb337d979bdf4c3707d15dae4f4ee945cfed3b673a181d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.75,
          "end": 3.39,
          "en": "So we built our first module",
          "zh": "所以我們建立了第一個模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.39,
          "end": 5.25,
          "en": "where we declare all the components",
          "zh": "在那裡宣告所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.25,
          "end": 7.35,
          "en": "that need to work together.",
          "zh": "需要一起運作的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.35,
          "end": 12.21,
          "en": "Now, as you are building more complex Angular applications",
          "zh": "現在，當你打造更複雜的 Angular 應用程式時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.21,
          "end": 17.21,
          "en": "it is pretty common that if you are using Angular modules",
          "zh": "如果你在使用 Angular 模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.06,
          "end": 21.15,
          "en": "that you wanna break up your application",
          "zh": "通常會想把應用程式拆開，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.15,
          "end": 26.1,
          "en": "into multiple modules, which are then merged together again.",
          "zh": "拆成多個模組，然後再把它們合併起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.1,
          "end": 30.09,
          "en": "For example, we could put all those task related components",
          "zh": "例如，我們可以把所有和任務相關的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.09,
          "end": 32.88,
          "en": "into a separate module,",
          "zh": "放進一個獨立的模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.88,
          "end": 36.33,
          "en": "but I'll actually start with the card component",
          "zh": "但我實際上會先從 card 元件開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.33,
          "end": 40.8,
          "en": "because that card component is in the end, shared across",
          "zh": "因為這個 card 元件最後是會在"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.8,
          "end": 44.88,
          "en": "different features of our application, you could say.",
          "zh": "我們應用程式的各種功能之間共用的，可以這麼說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.88,
          "end": 48.513,
          "en": "It's being used by the tasks and by the user list,",
          "zh": "它被 tasks 和 user list 使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 49.35,
          "end": 51.36,
          "en": "and it would be quite common",
          "zh": "而如果你在使用模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.36,
          "end": 53.88,
          "en": "if you are working with modules",
          "zh": "把這種共用元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.88,
          "end": 58.88,
          "en": "to put such shared components into its own module.",
          "zh": "放進它自己的模組，是很常見的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 59.79,
          "end": 61.65,
          "en": "And therefore, what you could do here",
          "zh": "所以在這裡你可以做的事是"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.65,
          "end": 66.65,
          "en": "is create a shared module in that shared folder,",
          "zh": "在那個 shared 資料夾中建立一個 shared 模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 66.81,
          "end": 70.383,
          "en": "so next to the card folder I have that shared module.",
          "zh": "所以在 card 資料夾旁邊，我就有那個 shared 模組了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 71.49,
          "end": 73.95,
          "en": "And here we would then export another class",
          "zh": "而在這裡我們會再匯出另一個類別"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 73.95,
          "end": 76.35300000000001,
          "en": "called shared module,",
          "zh": "叫做 SharedModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.55,
          "end": 81.03,
          "en": "which is decorated with the Ng module decorator,",
          "zh": "它是用 NgModule 裝飾器裝飾的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 81.03,
          "end": 84.03,
          "en": "just as the root app module was",
          "zh": "就像根層的 AppModule 一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 84.03,
          "end": 87.42,
          "en": "because this is also just another module.",
          "zh": "因為這也只是另一個模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 87.42,
          "end": 89.46000000000001,
          "en": "The only difference here now is",
          "zh": "現在唯一的差別是"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 89.46000000000001,
          "end": 92.78999999999999,
          "en": "that we won't have a bootstrap configuration here",
          "zh": "我們在這裡不會有 bootstrap 設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 92.78999999999999,
          "end": 94.28999999999999,
          "en": "because we only have that",
          "zh": "因為我們只有"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 94.28999999999999,
          "end": 97.59,
          "en": "in the root module of the application.",
          "zh": "在應用程式的根層模組中有這個設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.59,
          "end": 98.67,
          "en": "So in the module",
          "zh": "所以在被傳入"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.67,
          "end": 101.283,
          "en": "that's being passed here to bootstrap module.",
          "zh": "bootstrapModule 的那個模組裡，才有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.66,
          "end": 107.07,
          "en": "All other modules don't have such a bootstrap array,",
          "zh": "所有其他模組都沒有這樣的 bootstrap 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.07,
          "end": 109.473,
          "en": "but they will have a declarations array.",
          "zh": "但它們會有 declarations 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.49000000000001,
          "end": 112.62,
          "en": "And therefore, here in this shared module,",
          "zh": "所以在這個 SharedModule 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.62,
          "end": 115.28999999999999,
          "en": "we would add a declarations array.",
          "zh": "我們會加上一個 declarations 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.28999999999999,
          "end": 118.77000000000001,
          "en": "And then here to this list add the card component,",
          "zh": "然後在這個清單中加上 card 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.77000000000001,
          "end": 121.833,
          "en": "and only that component, in our case,",
          "zh": "在我們的情況中只加那個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.03,
          "end": 125.49,
          "en": "because that component then doesn't use",
          "zh": "因為那個元件並沒有在"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.49,
          "end": 128.46,
          "en": "any other components inside of its template.",
          "zh": "它的模板中使用任何其他元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 128.46,
          "end": 131.85,
          "en": "So we don't have to do anything else here.",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡不必做其他事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.85,
          "end": 136.41,
          "en": "And the idea now would be to add all shared components",
          "zh": "而現在的概念是，把所有共用元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.41,
          "end": 140.1,
          "en": "that we eventually might have in our application,",
          "zh": "（也就是我們應用程式未來可能擁有的所有共用元件）"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 140.1,
          "end": 143.1,
          "en": "if we would add more we would all add them here,",
          "zh": "如果我們新增更多，就全部加在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.1,
          "end": 147.09,
          "en": "to this module, so that if we had more shared components",
          "zh": "加到這個模組中，這樣如果我們有更多共用元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.09,
          "end": 150.543,
          "en": "than just a card component we would all add them here.",
          "zh": "而不只是一個 card 元件，就都會加在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.71,
          "end": 155.19,
          "en": "And then we would add another key here",
          "zh": "接著我們會在這裡再加一個 key"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 155.19,
          "end": 157.26,
          "en": "to this configuration.",
          "zh": "到這個設定中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.26,
          "end": 161.55,
          "en": "The exports key, where we define all the modules",
          "zh": "也就是 exports 這個 key，我們在那裡定義所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.55,
          "end": 163.71,
          "en": "that are not just needed internally",
          "zh": "不只是內部才需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.71,
          "end": 166.41,
          "en": "for those modules that are declared here,",
          "zh": "（除了在這裡宣告的那些模組內部需要之外），"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.41,
          "end": 169.44,
          "en": "but that should then also be made available",
          "zh": "而是也應該要"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.44,
          "end": 171.18,
          "en": "to any other module",
          "zh": "提供給任何其他"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 171.18,
          "end": 174.303,
          "en": "that potentially imports the shared module.",
          "zh": "可能匯入這個 shared 模組的模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175.35,
          "end": 179.61,
          "en": "Because my plan now indeed is to go to the app module",
          "zh": "因為我現在的計畫確實是要回到 AppModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.61,
          "end": 183.51,
          "en": "and remove the declaration of the card component here,",
          "zh": "把這裡的 card 元件宣告移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 183.51,
          "end": 185.613,
          "en": "and also remove this import here.",
          "zh": "並且把這裡的這個匯入也移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 187.56,
          "end": 192.56,
          "en": "And instead, I want to add my shared module here",
          "zh": "取而代之，我想把 shared 模組加到這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 192.57,
          "end": 194.133,
          "en": "to the imports array.",
          "zh": "的 imports 陣列中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 196.2,
          "end": 199.56,
          "en": "So we also must import the shared module from its file,",
          "zh": "所以我們也必須從它的檔案匯入 shared 模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 199.56,
          "end": 202.86,
          "en": "and then add it here to the imports array.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡把它加到 imports 陣列中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 202.86,
          "end": 205.05,
          "en": "And that would now merge the components",
          "zh": "而那樣就會把該模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 205.05,
          "end": 209.01,
          "en": "made available by that module into this declarations array",
          "zh": "所提供的元件合併進這個 declarations 陣列中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 209.01,
          "end": 211.743,
          "en": "behind the scenes, you could say, kind of.",
          "zh": "可以說是在幕後進行的，某種程度上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 212.94,
          "end": 215.88,
          "en": "However, it will only merge any components",
          "zh": "不過，它只會合併"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 215.88,
          "end": 218.97,
          "en": "that are specified in the exports array here.",
          "zh": "在這裡的 exports 陣列中指定的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 218.97,
          "end": 221.61,
          "en": "And therefore, if they want to make the card component",
          "zh": "所以，如果要讓 card 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 221.61,
          "end": 224.37,
          "en": "available to all components that are declared",
          "zh": "對 AppModule 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 224.37,
          "end": 228.06,
          "en": "in the app module, where I'm importing the shared module.",
          "zh": "（也就是我匯入 shared 模組的那個模組）所宣告的所有元件可用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 228.06,
          "end": 230.7,
          "en": "Then I have to add this card component",
          "zh": "那我就必須把這個 card 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 230.7,
          "end": 233.46,
          "en": "also to this exports array.",
          "zh": "也加到這個 exports 陣列中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 233.46,
          "end": 236.94,
          "en": "So that I'm declaring it and I'm then telling Angular",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我既宣告了它，也同時告訴 Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 236.94,
          "end": 239.64,
          "en": "that it should be available to any other modules",
          "zh": "它應該要對任何其他"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 239.64,
          "end": 241.323,
          "en": "that use the shared module.",
          "zh": "使用這個 shared 模組的模組可用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 243.21,
          "end": 244.92,
          "en": "And with that, the application again,",
          "zh": "完成這些之後，應用程式再次"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 244.92,
          "end": 247.89,
          "en": "would work as before without errors,",
          "zh": "就能像之前一樣正常運作，不會有錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 247.89,
          "end": 250.983,
          "en": "but now we added another custom module.",
          "zh": "但現在我們多了一個自訂模組。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797806",
      "title": "Creating More Complex Module-based App Structures",
      "lectureOrder": 74,
      "videoOrder": 69,
      "sourceHash": "68b5cbeeb65aec479202ce9b43953ae885468bad9a1d332ab28fea859a6c7040",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.75,
          "end": 2.64,
          "en": "And we don't have to stop there.",
          "zh": "而且我們不必停在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.64,
          "end": 6.96,
          "en": "We cannot also go to the tasks folder here",
          "zh": "我們也可以到這裡的 tasks 資料夾"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.96,
          "end": 11.96,
          "en": "for practice purposes and add a tasks module.",
          "zh": "練習一下並加上一個 tasks 模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.27,
          "end": 16.56,
          "en": "So a tasks module file and then in that tasks module file,",
          "zh": "也就是一個 tasks module 檔案，然後在那個 tasks module 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.56,
          "end": 21.243,
          "en": "we export tasks module class,",
          "zh": "我們匯出 tasks module 類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.08,
          "end": 24.963,
          "en": "which is decorated with NG module.",
          "zh": "並用 NgModule 裝飾它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 27.06,
          "end": 30.24,
          "en": "And here we now declare all the components",
          "zh": "然後在這裡宣告所有的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 30.24,
          "end": 33.18,
          "en": "that make up our tasks feature.",
          "zh": "它們組成了我們的 tasks 功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.18,
          "end": 35.37,
          "en": "So all the task related Components",
          "zh": "也就是所有和任務相關的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 35.37,
          "end": 37.023,
          "en": "that need to work together.",
          "zh": "那些需要一起運作的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.52,
          "end": 40.56,
          "en": "Now for that, I'll go to the app module,",
          "zh": "接著為了這個，我會到 app module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.56,
          "end": 43.38,
          "en": "and here it's essentially the tasks component,",
          "zh": "而這裡基本上就是 tasks component、"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.38,
          "end": 47.25,
          "en": "the task component, and the new task component",
          "zh": "task component 還有 new task component"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.25,
          "end": 51.51,
          "en": "and the card component, which is used by the task component.",
          "zh": "以及被 task component 使用的 card component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.51,
          "end": 55.11,
          "en": "Here I'm using the card, so we'll also need to make sure",
          "zh": "我在這裡有使用 card，所以我們也必須確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.11,
          "end": 57.903,
          "en": "that that's then available to those Components.",
          "zh": "它對那些元件來說是可用的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 59.19,
          "end": 61.17,
          "en": "But I'll start by migrating the Components,",
          "zh": "不過我會先搬移這些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.17,
          "end": 64.05,
          "en": "hence I'll cut them from here",
          "zh": "所以我要把它們從這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.05,
          "end": 67.59,
          "en": "from the declarations array in the app module.",
          "zh": "從 app module 的 declarations 陣列中剪下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.59,
          "end": 70.57,
          "en": "And we can now remove these unused imports",
          "zh": "現在我們可以移除這些沒用到的匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 71.7,
          "end": 75.813,
          "en": "and instead add them to the tasks module declarations array.",
          "zh": "改成把它們加到 tasks module 的 declarations 陣列裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 76.92,
          "end": 79.98,
          "en": "However, we now also need to add their imports,",
          "zh": "不過，現在我們還需要加上它們的 imports，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 79.98,
          "end": 84.18299999999999,
          "en": "and I'll let my IDE do that real quick here like this.",
          "zh": "我就直接讓我的 IDE 在這裡快速處理，像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 85.83,
          "end": 88.68299999999999,
          "en": "And with that, they would be able to work together again.",
          "zh": "這樣它們就能再次一起運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 89.88,
          "end": 93.84,
          "en": "However, they would neither be available to the app module,",
          "zh": "不過，它們對 app module 而言並不會變成可用的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 93.84,
          "end": 96.843,
          "en": "nor would they know about the card component.",
          "zh": "它們也不會知道 card component 的存在。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 98.16,
          "end": 101.13,
          "en": "Now, I'll start by making them available to the app module",
          "zh": "現在，我先讓它們對 app module 變成可用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 101.13,
          "end": 103.56,
          "en": "by adding them to my exports.",
          "zh": "方法是把它們加到我的 exports 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 103.56,
          "end": 106.35,
          "en": "And here we actually don't have to add all of them.",
          "zh": "而我們其實不必把全部都加進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 106.35,
          "end": 109.38,
          "en": "Instead, we only have to add all the Components",
          "zh": "相反地，我們只需要把所有被"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 109.38,
          "end": 112.5,
          "en": "that are being used by other Components defined",
          "zh": "定義在匯入該模組的其他元件所使用的"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 112.5,
          "end": 114.9,
          "en": "in the importing module.",
          "zh": "元件加進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 114.9,
          "end": 117.18299999999999,
          "en": "So in the app module in this case.",
          "zh": "在這個情況就是 app module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 118.2,
          "end": 120.87,
          "en": "And if we take a closer look at this module,",
          "zh": "如果我們更仔細看這個模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 120.87,
          "end": 124.41,
          "en": "we see that the user component does not use",
          "zh": "會發現 user component 並沒有使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 124.41,
          "end": 129.41,
          "en": "any tasks components neither does the header component",
          "zh": "任何 task 元件，header component 也沒有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 131.94,
          "end": 136.38,
          "en": "and the app component only in its template",
          "zh": "而 app component 只有在它的模板中"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 136.38,
          "end": 138.753,
          "en": "uses the tasks component.",
          "zh": "使用了 tasks component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 139.98,
          "end": 142.71,
          "en": "So that's therefore also the only component",
          "zh": "所以因此也只有這個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 142.71,
          "end": 146.97,
          "en": "that must be made available by the tasks module.",
          "zh": "必須由 tasks module 提供出去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 146.97,
          "end": 150.483,
          "en": "So it's only the tasks component that must be exported.",
          "zh": "所以只有 tasks component 需要被匯出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 152.07,
          "end": 154.77,
          "en": "We still need to declare all components here",
          "zh": "但這裡還是要宣告所有的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 154.77,
          "end": 157.47,
          "en": "because they are working with each other.",
          "zh": "因為它們彼此一起運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 157.47,
          "end": 160.14,
          "en": "The tasks component is after all,",
          "zh": "畢竟 tasks component"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 160.14,
          "end": 164.853,
          "en": "using the new task component and the task component.",
          "zh": "會使用 new task component 和 task component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 165.75,
          "end": 168.36,
          "en": "So they must all be declared,",
          "zh": "所以它們都必須被宣告，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 168.36,
          "end": 171.723,
          "en": "but we only need to export the tasks component.",
          "zh": "但我們只需要匯出 tasks component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 173.04,
          "end": 177.06,
          "en": "And with that, we can go to the app module again",
          "zh": "做完這些，我們就可以再回到 app module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 177.06,
          "end": 180.51,
          "en": "and now not just register the shared module here,",
          "zh": "現在不只註冊 shared module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 180.51,
          "end": 184.143,
          "en": "but also the tasks module.",
          "zh": "也要註冊 tasks module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 185.7,
          "end": 189.93,
          "en": "And that then makes the exported tasks component available",
          "zh": "這樣匯出的 tasks component 就會"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 189.93,
          "end": 191.583,
          "en": "to the app component again.",
          "zh": "再次對 app component 可用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 192.87,
          "end": 196.95,
          "en": "Nonetheless now, we would actually face a problem here.",
          "zh": "不過現在我們其實會在這裡遇到一個問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 196.95,
          "end": 199.38,
          "en": "You see, for example, the tasks are not showing up,",
          "zh": "你看，例如任務沒有顯示出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 199.38,
          "end": 202.95,
          "en": "and I'm getting an error here in my developer tools",
          "zh": "而且我在這裡的開發者工具中收到一個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 202.95,
          "end": 205.023,
          "en": "that the date pipe could not be found.",
          "zh": "說找不到 date pipe。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 206.76,
          "end": 208.53,
          "en": "And we're getting this problem",
          "zh": "而我們會遇到這個問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 208.53,
          "end": 211.86,
          "en": "because that date pipe is being used",
          "zh": "因為那個 date pipe 被"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 211.86,
          "end": 216.03300000000002,
          "en": "by one of my task related components by the task component.",
          "zh": "我其中一個任務相關的元件也就是 task component 使用了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 216.99,
          "end": 218.4,
          "en": "And it's not just a date pipe,",
          "zh": "而且不只 date pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 218.4,
          "end": 220.143,
          "en": "it's also that card component.",
          "zh": "還有那個 card component 也是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 221.01,
          "end": 224.88,
          "en": "Now you could say both things are made available",
          "zh": "現在你可能會說這兩樣東西都是由"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 224.88,
          "end": 226.65,
          "en": "by the app module.",
          "zh": "app module 提供的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 226.65,
          "end": 229.82999999999998,
          "en": "The browser module makes the date pipe available",
          "zh": "BrowserModule 提供了 date pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 229.82999999999998,
          "end": 232.923,
          "en": "and the shared module makes the card component available.",
          "zh": "而 shared module 提供了 card component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 233.76,
          "end": 235.59,
          "en": "And that would be true,",
          "zh": "而且這聽起來確實沒錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 235.59,
          "end": 239.73,
          "en": "but those things are only made available to the module",
          "zh": "但那些東西只會提供給"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 239.73,
          "end": 241.593,
          "en": "into which you're importing them.",
          "zh": "你把它們匯入的那個模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 242.52,
          "end": 244.74,
          "en": "So the card module is made available",
          "zh": "所以 card module 會提供給"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 244.74,
          "end": 248.79,
          "en": "to all these components, and so is the date pipe,",
          "zh": "這裡的這些元件，date pipe 也是一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 248.79,
          "end": 251.76,
          "en": "but not to any components that might be defined",
          "zh": "但它們不會提供給那些可能定義在"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 251.76,
          "end": 254.58,
          "en": "by any other imported module.",
          "zh": "其他被匯入的模組裡的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 254.58,
          "end": 257.34,
          "en": "So the tasks module does not know anything",
          "zh": "所以 tasks module 完全不知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 257.34,
          "end": 260.343,
          "en": "about the date pipe or the card component.",
          "zh": "date pipe 或 card component 的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 261.54,
          "end": 264.81,
          "en": "Now, to fix this, we have to add the imports array",
          "zh": "現在，為了解決這個問題，我們必須把 imports 陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 264.81,
          "end": 268.83,
          "en": "to that task module because as a simple rule,",
          "zh": "加到那個 task module，因為有個簡單的規則，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 268.83,
          "end": 271.83,
          "en": "every module must work on its own.",
          "zh": "每個模組都必須能夠獨立運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 271.83,
          "end": 274.08,
          "en": "So if a module needs something,",
          "zh": "所以如果一個模組需要某樣東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 274.08,
          "end": 277.47,
          "en": "it must declare or import it itself.",
          "zh": "它就必須自己宣告或匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 277.47,
          "end": 280.95,
          "en": "It can't get it from any parent module",
          "zh": "它不能從任何使用這個模組的"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 280.95,
          "end": 283.383,
          "en": "that might be using this module.",
          "zh": "父層模組那邊取得。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 285.06,
          "end": 288.57,
          "en": "So if we want to get access to the card component,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們想取得 card component 的存取，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 288.57,
          "end": 291.84000000000003,
          "en": "we have to import the shared module here",
          "zh": "就必須在這裡匯入 shared module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 291.84000000000003,
          "end": 294.09000000000003,
          "en": "in the tasks module as well,",
          "zh": "在 tasks module 裡也要匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 294.09000000000003,
          "end": 296.373,
          "en": "just as we do it in the app module.",
          "zh": "就像我們在 app module 裡做的那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 297.81,
          "end": 299.90999999999997,
          "en": "If we want to get access to the date pipe,",
          "zh": "如果我們想存取 date pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 299.90999999999997,
          "end": 301.893,
          "en": "we also need to import that.",
          "zh": "也必須把那個匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 302.76,
          "end": 307.17,
          "en": "We could now import it standalone like this.",
          "zh": "我們現在也可以像這樣單獨匯入它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 307.17,
          "end": 309.99,
          "en": "Instead, what you would do here is",
          "zh": "相反地，你在這裡該做的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 309.99,
          "end": 314.25,
          "en": "you would import another module provided by Angular.",
          "zh": "匯入另一個由 Angular 提供的模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 314.25,
          "end": 316.83,
          "en": "Now, you could think that it's the browser module",
          "zh": "現在，你可能會以為是 BrowserModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 316.83,
          "end": 319.29,
          "en": "because that is what we imported before,",
          "zh": "因為我們之前匯入的就是它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 319.29,
          "end": 320.43,
          "en": "but that would be wrong",
          "zh": "但那樣是錯的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 320.43,
          "end": 323.52,
          "en": "because the browser module is a special module",
          "zh": "因為 BrowserModule 是一個特殊的模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 323.52,
          "end": 327.45,
          "en": "that's only meant to be imported into the root module",
          "zh": "它只應該被匯入根層的模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 327.45,
          "end": 331.05,
          "en": "with which you bootstrap the application.",
          "zh": "也就是你用來 bootstrap 應用程式的模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 331.05,
          "end": 333.96,
          "en": "For all other modules that need access",
          "zh": "對於其他所有需要存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 333.96,
          "end": 337.23,
          "en": "to such common features like the date pipe,",
          "zh": "像 date pipe 這種共用功能的模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 337.23,
          "end": 340.35,
          "en": "there is another module provided by Angular,",
          "zh": "Angular 還提供了另一個模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 340.35,
          "end": 343.59000000000003,
          "en": "the common module, which is imported",
          "zh": "就是 CommonModule，它的匯入方式是"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 343.59000000000003,
          "end": 347.463,
          "en": "from @Angular common like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣從 @angular/common 匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 349.32,
          "end": 354.32,
          "en": "In addition, we also need to import the forms module here",
          "zh": "此外，我們還需要在這裡匯入 FormsModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 354.93,
          "end": 358.44,
          "en": "because the new task component is using features",
          "zh": "因為 new task component 正在使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 358.44,
          "end": 359.88,
          "en": "from that module.",
          "zh": "那個模組裡的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 359.88,
          "end": 362.73,
          "en": "It is using this NG submit event, for example,",
          "zh": "例如它用了這個 ngSubmit 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 362.73,
          "end": 364.533,
          "en": "and the NG model directive,",
          "zh": "以及 ngModel 這個指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 365.4,
          "end": 369.27,
          "en": "which are both provided by this forms module.",
          "zh": "而這兩個都是由 FormsModule 提供的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 369.27,
          "end": 371.82,
          "en": "So that must be added here to the imports array",
          "zh": "所以也必須把 FormsModule 加到這裡的 imports 陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 371.82,
          "end": 374.043,
          "en": "of this task module as well.",
          "zh": "也就是這個 task module 的 imports 陣列裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 376.17,
          "end": 378.75,
          "en": "And with that, we can then actually also go",
          "zh": "做完這些，我們就可以實際上再"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 378.75,
          "end": 383.22,
          "en": "to the app module and remove the forms module there,",
          "zh": "到 app module 那邊把 FormsModule 移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 383.22,
          "end": 384.51,
          "en": "not the browser module",
          "zh": "但不是 BrowserModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 384.51,
          "end": 386.97,
          "en": "that's still required for this general setup,",
          "zh": "它對這個基本架構來說仍然必要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 386.97,
          "end": 389.31,
          "en": "but the forms module can be removed",
          "zh": "而 FormsModule 可以被移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 389.31,
          "end": 392.4,
          "en": "because now no component of those components",
          "zh": "因為現在那些元件中沒有任何一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 392.4,
          "end": 394.83,
          "en": "is using anything from that module.",
          "zh": "在用到那個模組裡的任何東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 394.83,
          "end": 398.973,
          "en": "So that can be removed and so can be the unused import.",
          "zh": "所以它可以被移除，沒用到的匯入也可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 400.35,
          "end": 404.7,
          "en": "And with that, we're back to the working app we had before,",
          "zh": "做完這些，我們就回到了先前能運作的應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 404.7,
          "end": 409.02,
          "en": "but now we're also using multiple nested modules",
          "zh": "但現在我們還用了多個巢狀的模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 409.02,
          "end": 411.24,
          "en": "if you want to call them like this.",
          "zh": "如果你想這樣稱呼它們的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 411.24,
          "end": 416.13,
          "en": "And whilst splitting this app up into modules like this is",
          "zh": "而像這樣把這個應用程式拆成模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 416.13,
          "end": 420.75,
          "en": "definitely overkill because it was only a basic app,",
          "zh": "對一個基礎應用程式來說絕對是過度設計，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 420.75,
          "end": 424.44,
          "en": "it does show you how to work with modules,",
          "zh": "但它確實展示了你如何運用模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 424.44,
          "end": 426.45,
          "en": "which is important to know",
          "zh": "而這點是很重要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 426.45,
          "end": 430.32,
          "en": "because you might encounter module based applications",
          "zh": "因為你身為 Angular 開發者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 430.32,
          "end": 433.17,
          "en": "as you are working as an Angular developer",
          "zh": "可能會遇到以模組為基礎的應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 433.17,
          "end": 436.32,
          "en": "or you might simply prefer modules",
          "zh": "或者你單純就是比較偏好使用模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 436.32,
          "end": 440.313,
          "en": "over standalone components, which of course also is fine.",
          "zh": "而不是 standalone 元件，當然這樣也完全沒問題。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797820",
      "title": "Module Introduction & Starting Project",
      "lectureOrder": 75,
      "videoOrder": 70,
      "sourceHash": "4f9ca4df8e7fcce6cad9ff45e9df0e8941e25145a79fc078e298d3a2ed95d02e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 2.85,
          "en": "Only practice makes perfect.",
          "zh": "熟能生巧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.85,
          "end": 6.69,
          "en": "And that's of course also the case for Angular.",
          "zh": "當然，Angular 也是一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.69,
          "end": 8.85,
          "en": "That's why in this section here",
          "zh": "所以在這個章節裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.85,
          "end": 12.6,
          "en": "we'll build another brand new demo project.",
          "zh": "我們要再打造一個全新的示範專案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.6,
          "end": 15.63,
          "en": "An Investment Calculator where users",
          "zh": "一個投資計算器，讓使用者"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.63,
          "end": 19.17,
          "en": "can enter their initial investment amount,",
          "zh": "可以輸入他們的初始投資金額、"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.17,
          "end": 22.11,
          "en": "then their expected annual investment rate,",
          "zh": "然後是預期的年投資報酬率、"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.11,
          "end": 25.38,
          "en": "their expected return and the duration.",
          "zh": "預期報酬以及投資期間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.38,
          "end": 27.03,
          "en": "And then as a result,",
          "zh": "然後就能看到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.03,
          "end": 30.48,
          "en": "see how their investment is expected to develop.",
          "zh": "他們的投資預期會如何發展。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.48,
          "end": 34.83,
          "en": "But of course, this section is not primarily about this app,",
          "zh": "但當然，這個章節的重點並不是這個應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.83,
          "end": 36.63,
          "en": "even though it's a nice demo app.",
          "zh": "雖然它是個不錯的示範應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.63,
          "end": 39.27,
          "en": "But instead it's about a applying the knowledge",
          "zh": "而是關於套用你到目前為止"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.27,
          "end": 42.69,
          "en": "you gained thus far and about practicing what you learned.",
          "zh": "所學到的知識，並練習你學過的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.69,
          "end": 46.71,
          "en": "It's about practicing all those Angular Essentials.",
          "zh": "重點在於練習所有那些 Angular 基本功。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.71,
          "end": 49.835,
          "en": "And therefore this section now is a nice exercise",
          "zh": "所以這個章節是一個很好的練習，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.835,
          "end": 53.79,
          "en": "where we will build this Investment Calculator",
          "zh": "我們會在這個章節打造這個投資計算器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.79,
          "end": 55.44,
          "en": "by adding a \"Header\" component",
          "zh": "方式是加入一個「Header」元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.44,
          "end": 57.48,
          "en": "with a title and an image,",
          "zh": "帶有一個標題和一個圖片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.48,
          "end": 59.4,
          "en": "by adding a \"User Input\" component",
          "zh": "再加入一個「User Input」元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.4,
          "end": 62.82,
          "en": "that collects user input with two-way-binding.",
          "zh": "用雙向繫結來收集使用者輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.82,
          "end": 66,
          "en": "And by adding an \"InvestmentResults\" component",
          "zh": "再加入一個「InvestmentResults」元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66,
          "end": 68.97,
          "en": "that will output the results in a table.",
          "zh": "它會用表格輸出結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.97,
          "end": 71.964,
          "en": "And you can definitely try building this application",
          "zh": "你當然可以試著自己打造這個應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.964,
          "end": 75.908,
          "en": "on your own first, before then following along with me",
          "zh": "然後再跟著我一起做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.908,
          "end": 79.53,
          "en": "over the next lectures where we will build this together.",
          "zh": "在接下來幾堂課裡我們會一起完成它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.53,
          "end": 81.122,
          "en": "You can try this on your own first,",
          "zh": "你可以先自己試一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.122,
          "end": 83.46000000000001,
          "en": "and you can use signals or not.",
          "zh": "你也可以用或不用 signal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.46000000000001,
          "end": 85.2,
          "en": "You can use Standalone Components",
          "zh": "你可以用獨立元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.2,
          "end": 87.12,
          "en": "or Module-based Components.",
          "zh": "也可以用模組式的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.12,
          "end": 91.53,
          "en": "I will show you all different approaches in this section.",
          "zh": "我會在這個章節裡展示所有不同的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.53,
          "end": 93.47999999999999,
          "en": "You can use a service or not.",
          "zh": "你可以用服務，也可以不用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.47999999999999,
          "end": 97.29599999999999,
          "en": "You can solve this exercise in any way you want,",
          "zh": "你可以用任何你想用的方式完成這個練習，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.29599999999999,
          "end": 99.99000000000001,
          "en": "but of course, it will be challenging.",
          "zh": "但當然，這會有點挑戰。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.99000000000001,
          "end": 101.82,
          "en": "So if you're not able to solve it,",
          "zh": "所以如果你沒辦法完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.82,
          "end": 103.74000000000001,
          "en": "that's also absolutely fine.",
          "zh": "那也完全沒關係。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.74000000000001,
          "end": 105.53999999999999,
          "en": "We're just getting started here,",
          "zh": "我們才剛開始而已，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.53999999999999,
          "end": 108.21000000000001,
          "en": "and you can simply take this section",
          "zh": "而你可以把這個章節"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.21000000000001,
          "end": 112.14,
          "en": "as an extra opportunity to follow along with my solution",
          "zh": "當作額外的機會，跟著我的解法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.14,
          "end": 114.12,
          "en": "and follow my explanations.",
          "zh": "並聽我的說明。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.12,
          "end": 116.431,
          "en": "And you can also always pause my explanations",
          "zh": "你也可以隨時暫停我的說明，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.431,
          "end": 120.63,
          "en": "and only try out the next steps on your own.",
          "zh": "只自己試做接下來的步驟。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.63,
          "end": 122.91,
          "en": "If you wanna tackle the entire exercise,",
          "zh": "如果你想挑戰整個練習，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.91,
          "end": 124.29,
          "en": "that's of course great,",
          "zh": "那當然很好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.29,
          "end": 127.05,
          "en": "but you should then also absolutely have a look",
          "zh": "但你也絕對要先去"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 127.05,
          "end": 130.16,
          "en": "at the next lecture first since that lecture",
          "zh": "看一下下一堂課，因為那堂課"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.16,
          "end": 132.69,
          "en": "will include some helpful hints",
          "zh": "會提供一些有用的提示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.69,
          "end": 134.94,
          "en": "that you should absolutely keep in mind.",
          "zh": "你一定要放在心上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 134.94,
          "end": 136.686,
          "en": "Now, attached to this lecture,",
          "zh": "現在，這堂課的附件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 136.686,
          "end": 139.561,
          "en": "you find a brand new starting project,",
          "zh": "你可以找到一個全新的起始專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.561,
          "end": 143.196,
          "en": "which you should use since in there I, for example,",
          "zh": "你應該使用它，因為我在裡面"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.196,
          "end": 147.84,
          "en": "prepared this investment-results typeScript file,",
          "zh": "準備了這個 investment-results 的 TypeScript 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147.84,
          "end": 150.149,
          "en": "which you most likely won't use like that,",
          "zh": "你多半不會照那樣使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.149,
          "end": 152.405,
          "en": "but which contains some code",
          "zh": "但它裡面含有一些程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.405,
          "end": 155.73,
          "en": "that you might need to tweak a bit.",
          "zh": "你可能需要稍微調整一下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 155.73,
          "end": 157.92000000000002,
          "en": "As you see right now, it got some errors,",
          "zh": "如你現在所看到的，它有一些錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 157.92000000000002,
          "end": 160.98,
          "en": "but which you could use as a starting point",
          "zh": "但你可以把它當作一個起點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 160.98,
          "end": 165.98,
          "en": "to use that user input and derive those annual results.",
          "zh": "用那個使用者輸入並推導出那些年度結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.53,
          "end": 169.35,
          "en": "The data that should be output in a table",
          "zh": "也就是應該用表格輸出的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.35,
          "end": 171.03,
          "en": "You don't have to use that file,",
          "zh": "你不必使用那個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 171.03,
          "end": 172.98,
          "en": "but I will use it in my solution,",
          "zh": "但在我的解法裡我會使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 172.98,
          "end": 177.98,
          "en": "and it is simply there to help you focus on the Angular part",
          "zh": "它只是放在那裡，幫助你專注在 Angular 的部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.41,
          "end": 181.89,
          "en": "so that don't need to figure out how you can calculate",
          "zh": "讓你不必去想該怎麼計算"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 181.89,
          "end": 184.764,
          "en": "the accumulated interest and so on,",
          "zh": "累計利息之類的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 184.764,
          "end": 188.01,
          "en": "because that's not what this exercise is about.",
          "zh": "因為那不是這個練習的重點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.01,
          "end": 191.61,
          "en": "It is of course about the Angular part.",
          "zh": "這個練習的重點當然是 Angular 的部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 191.61,
          "end": 193.14,
          "en": "So that's the starting project,",
          "zh": "所以那就是起始專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 193.14,
          "end": 195.45,
          "en": "and I got two important notes",
          "zh": "而我還有兩個關於"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 195.45,
          "end": 197.43,
          "en": "regarding that starting project.",
          "zh": "這個起始專案的重要注意事項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 197.43,
          "end": 201.18,
          "en": "For one, you'll notice that it has a public folder",
          "zh": "第一，你會注意到它有一個 public 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 201.18,
          "end": 204.54,
          "en": "and no SRC assets folder.",
          "zh": "而且沒有 src/assets 資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 204.54,
          "end": 206.91,
          "en": "It's that public folder that contains the image",
          "zh": "正是那個 public 資料夾含有那張圖片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 206.91,
          "end": 210.3,
          "en": "that must be used in the header, for example.",
          "zh": "例如說要用在 header 裡的那一張。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 210.3,
          "end": 211.82999999999998,
          "en": "And if you wanna use that image,",
          "zh": "而如果你想用那張圖片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 211.82999999999998,
          "end": 213.289,
          "en": "there's one important difference",
          "zh": "有一個重要的差別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 213.289,
          "end": 217.74,
          "en": "compared to how you loaded it from the assets folder.",
          "zh": "跟你從 assets 資料夾載入它的方式相比。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 217.74,
          "end": 220.14,
          "en": "If you wanna use an image from the public folder,",
          "zh": "如果你想用 public 資料夾裡的圖片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 220.14,
          "end": 222.90800000000002,
          "en": "you don't put \"public\" into your image path.",
          "zh": "就不要在圖片路徑裡寫上「public」。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 222.90800000000002,
          "end": 226.71,
          "en": "Instead, you immediately put your image file name here,",
          "zh": "而是直接把圖片檔名放在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 226.71,
          "end": 228.483,
          "en": "whatever that file name may be.",
          "zh": "不管是什麼檔名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 229.56,
          "end": 231.06,
          "en": "And that will then load it.",
          "zh": "這樣就會載入它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 231.06,
          "end": 233.347,
          "en": "So, files stored in that public folder",
          "zh": "所以，放在那個 public 資料夾裡的檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 233.347,
          "end": 237.54,
          "en": "are referenced like this without adding public/",
          "zh": "引用時是像這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 237.54,
          "end": 238.373,
          "en": "in front of them.",
          "zh": "前面不會加上 public/。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 238.373,
          "end": 240.09,
          "en": "That's one important hint.",
          "zh": "這是第一個重要提示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 240.09,
          "end": 242.34,
          "en": "One important thing to be aware of.",
          "zh": "一件你一定要留意的重要事情。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 242.34,
          "end": 243.173,
          "en": "Other than that,",
          "zh": "除此之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 243.173,
          "end": 246.42,
          "en": "you can load and include the image as you learned it.",
          "zh": "你可以照你學過的方式載入並引入那張圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 246.42,
          "end": 247.581,
          "en": "The other important thing",
          "zh": "另一件重要的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 247.581,
          "end": 251.49,
          "en": "if you are trying to solve this exercise on your own",
          "zh": "如果你想自己完成這個練習，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 251.49,
          "end": 254.91,
          "en": "is that you'll need to build a couple of Components.",
          "zh": "就是你得建立幾個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 254.91,
          "end": 257.484,
          "en": "And in order to save you the hassle",
          "zh": "為了讓你不用麻煩，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 257.484,
          "end": 262.32,
          "en": "of writing your own style files, attached to this lecture,",
          "zh": "自己去寫樣式檔，我在這堂課的附件裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 262.32,
          "end": 267.32,
          "en": "you actually find those prepared Components style files,",
          "zh": "其實幫你準備好了這些元件的樣式檔，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 267.33,
          "end": 269.58,
          "en": "which you can use for your component",
          "zh": "你可以把它們用在你的元件上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 269.58,
          "end": 272.703,
          "en": "so that you don't have to write the CSS code on your own.",
          "zh": "這樣你就不必自己寫 CSS 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 273.57,
          "end": 276.096,
          "en": "Of course, you then also may wanna have a look",
          "zh": "當然，你可能也會想看一下"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 276.096,
          "end": 280.8,
          "en": "at this CSS code to see which classes and elements",
          "zh": "這些 CSS 程式碼，看看其中用了哪些類別和元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 280.8,
          "end": 282.81600000000003,
          "en": "are used there to structure",
          "zh": "那樣才能用這些來組織"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 282.81600000000003,
          "end": 285.39,
          "en": "your component markup accordingly.",
          "zh": "你的元件標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 285.39,
          "end": 287.828,
          "en": "Though ultimately, it's of course not too important",
          "zh": "不過說到底，樣式做對做錯當然沒那麼重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 287.828,
          "end": 291.09000000000003,
          "en": "that you get the styling right, you should just try",
          "zh": "你只要試著"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 291.09000000000003,
          "end": 295.38,
          "en": "to build some Investment Calculator application.",
          "zh": "打造出一個投資計算器應用程式就好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 295.38,
          "end": 297,
          "en": "So, that's the starting project.",
          "zh": "好，那就是起始專案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 297,
          "end": 300.54,
          "en": "In order to use it, you should run npm install",
          "zh": "要使用它的話，你要在下載後的那個附件資料夾裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 300.54,
          "end": 303.18,
          "en": "in that attached folder once you downloaded it",
          "zh": "執行 npm install，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 303.18,
          "end": 306.21,
          "en": "so that you install all dependencies.",
          "zh": "這樣才能安裝所有相依套件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 306.21,
          "end": 307.89,
          "en": "And then, with that out of the way,",
          "zh": "接著，這些處理好之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 307.89,
          "end": 310.98,
          "en": "npm start to start the development server.",
          "zh": "執行 npm start 來啟動開發伺服器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 310.98,
          "end": 313.98,
          "en": "Now, you can try building this application on your own",
          "zh": "現在，你可以試著自己打造這個應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 313.98,
          "end": 317.463,
          "en": "starting with the next lecture we'll build it together.",
          "zh": "從下一堂課開始，我們會一起打造它。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797828",
      "title": "Adding a Header Component With An Image",
      "lectureOrder": 77,
      "videoOrder": 71,
      "sourceHash": "5d28cb2a0fef22894f9259008bf9b898263452faca0a2bd46a0555182a87a012",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.5,
          "end": 4,
          "en": "So let's now build this application together",
          "zh": "那我們現在一起來打造這個應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4,
          "end": 6.766,
          "en": "and let's solve this exercise together.",
          "zh": "一起來完成這個練習。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.766,
          "end": 10.3,
          "en": "By the way, if you were not able to do this on your own,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，如果你無法自己完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.3,
          "end": 11.666,
          "en": "that's no problem.",
          "zh": "也完全沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.666,
          "end": 13.4,
          "en": "We're just getting started.",
          "zh": "我們才剛開始而已。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.4,
          "end": 15.766,
          "en": "It's the second application you're building.",
          "zh": "這只是你要做的第二個應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.766,
          "end": 17.533,
          "en": "It's totally normal if you're not able",
          "zh": "如果你還沒辦法"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.533,
          "end": 20.033,
          "en": "to complete it on your own yet.",
          "zh": "自己完成，那完全很正常。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.033,
          "end": 23.533,
          "en": "You'll get more practice throughout the rest of this course",
          "zh": "在這門課程剩下的內容中，你會獲得更多練習"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.533,
          "end": 24.9,
          "en": "and you'll get plenty",
          "zh": "而且你會從這個章節獲得"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.9,
          "end": 27.333,
          "en": "of useful knowledge out of this section.",
          "zh": "大量有用的知識。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.333,
          "end": 30.066,
          "en": "Let's simply build it together now.",
          "zh": "現在我們就一起來打造它吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.066,
          "end": 34.466,
          "en": "And I wanna start with that first task here.",
          "zh": "而我想從這裡的第一項任務開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.466,
          "end": 38.333,
          "en": "I wanna add that \"Header\" component to my application.",
          "zh": "我想把那個「Header」元件加到我的應用程式裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.366,
          "end": 41.533,
          "en": "And therefore in the app folder,",
          "zh": "所以在 app 資料夾裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.533,
          "end": 43.8,
          "en": "we can add a new header folder,",
          "zh": "我們可以新增一個 header 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.8,
          "end": 46.533,
          "en": "where we can add those component files.",
          "zh": "然後把那些元件檔案加進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.7,
          "end": 50.933,
          "en": "Or alternatively, we don't do that.",
          "zh": "或者，我們也可以不這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.933,
          "end": 53.366,
          "en": "And instead, in a new terminal window,",
          "zh": "而是開一個新的終端機視窗，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.366,
          "end": 57.966,
          "en": "we use the Angular CLI to add that header component.",
          "zh": "用 Angular CLI 來新增那個 header 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.966,
          "end": 61.433,
          "en": "With the ng, g, c command",
          "zh": "用 ng g c 這個指令"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.433,
          "end": 64.633,
          "en": "to generate a new component,",
          "zh": "產生一個新元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.633,
          "end": 66.4,
          "en": "and I'll name that component header",
          "zh": "而我會把那個元件命名為 header"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.4,
          "end": 70.666,
          "en": "and I'll add the dash, dash, skip dash, tests flag",
          "zh": "並加上 --skip-tests 這個旗標"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.666,
          "end": 74.066,
          "en": "so that this extra testing file isn't generated,",
          "zh": "這樣就不會產生多餘的測試檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.066,
          "end": 75.766,
          "en": "because I don't need that.",
          "zh": "因為我不需要那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.43299999999999,
          "end": 80.2,
          "en": "With that, I got my header folder here",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我這裡就有了 header 資料夾"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.2,
          "end": 82.26599999999999,
          "en": "with the header.component files,",
          "zh": "裡面有 header.component 這些檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.26599999999999,
          "end": 84.233,
          "en": "and it automatically created",
          "zh": "而且它自動幫我"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.233,
          "end": 86.333,
          "en": "a standalone component for me here.",
          "zh": "在這裡建立了一個 standalone 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.333,
          "end": 89.46600000000001,
          "en": "And I'll start by using standalone components,",
          "zh": "我會先用 standalone 元件開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.46600000000001,
          "end": 91.93299999999999,
          "en": "but later at the end of this section,",
          "zh": "但稍後在這個章節結尾時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.93299999999999,
          "end": 95.566,
          "en": "I'll migrated all to module based components",
          "zh": "我會把所有東西遷移到以模組為基礎的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.566,
          "end": 99.166,
          "en": "so that you also see how you could use modules instead",
          "zh": "這樣你也能看到可以用模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.166,
          "end": 101,
          "en": "of standalone components.",
          "zh": "來取代 standalone 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.066,
          "end": 104.6,
          "en": "Now I will actually not change anything",
          "zh": "現在我不打算改動"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.6,
          "end": 106.533,
          "en": "in that header ts file though,",
          "zh": "那個 header.ts 檔案裡的任何東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.533,
          "end": 110.066,
          "en": "instead, I'll jump to the header.component.html file,",
          "zh": "我要改跳到 header.component.html 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.066,
          "end": 111.26599999999999,
          "en": "because it's in there",
          "zh": "因為我要在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.26599999999999,
          "end": 116.26599999999999,
          "en": "where I now wanna add the header element like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣加上 header 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.666,
          "end": 120.166,
          "en": "And then in there, I wanna have an h1 element,",
          "zh": "然後在裡面，我要有一個 h1 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.166,
          "end": 124.533,
          "en": "where I say, Investment Calculator.",
          "zh": "裡面寫著「Investment Calculator」。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.533,
          "end": 127.733,
          "en": "And above that, I wanna have an image like this.",
          "zh": "在它上面，我要像這樣放一個圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.7,
          "end": 129.966,
          "en": "And here for this source,",
          "zh": "而這裡的這個 source，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.966,
          "end": 132.333,
          "en": "it's now important to recognize",
          "zh": "現在重要的是要認出"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.333,
          "end": 136.133,
          "en": "that the image is actually now in the public folder.",
          "zh": "這張圖片現在其實是在 public 資料夾裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.133,
          "end": 139.766,
          "en": "It's this investment-calculator-logo.png file,",
          "zh": "就是這個 investment-calculator-logo.png 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.766,
          "end": 141.766,
          "en": "and you can actually just add it like this",
          "zh": "你其實可以直接像這樣加上它"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.766,
          "end": 145.8,
          "en": "and add the extension without adding public slash",
          "zh": "並直接加上副檔名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.8,
          "end": 146.8,
          "en": "at the beginning.",
          "zh": "不用在開頭加上 public/。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.8,
          "end": 150,
          "en": "And also not by adding assets slash at the beginning,",
          "zh": "也不用在開頭加上 assets/，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150,
          "end": 152.1,
          "en": "because it isn't in an assets folder.",
          "zh": "因為它不在 assets 資料夾裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.1,
          "end": 154.666,
          "en": "And whilst it is in a public folder,",
          "zh": "雖然它在一個 public 資料夾裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.666,
          "end": 157.066,
          "en": "this folder and the files inside of it",
          "zh": "這個資料夾和裡面的檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.066,
          "end": 159.53300000000002,
          "en": "are actually loaded slightly differently",
          "zh": "實際上的載入方式有點不同，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.53300000000002,
          "end": 163.3,
          "en": "so that you can and should omit the public path here",
          "zh": "所以你在這裡可以而且應該省略 public 路徑，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.3,
          "end": 165.8,
          "en": "and just directly reference the files",
          "zh": "直接參照這些檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 165.8,
          "end": 168.666,
          "en": "and folders inside of the public folder.",
          "zh": "以及 public 資料夾裡的資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 168.666,
          "end": 169.766,
          "en": "So in this case,",
          "zh": "所以在這個情況下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.766,
          "end": 173.3,
          "en": "the image that's stored inside of the public folder.",
          "zh": "就是存放在 public 資料夾裡的那張圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.3,
          "end": 175.8,
          "en": "And then we should also add some alt text here,",
          "zh": "然後我們在這裡也該加上一些替代文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.8,
          "end": 176.633,
          "en": "like,",
          "zh": "例如，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 177.966,
          "end": 179.1,
          "en": "money bag,",
          "zh": "錢袋，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 179.1,
          "end": 182.133,
          "en": "because that's in the end what's visible on this image.",
          "zh": "因為那終究是這張圖片上可見的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 183.5,
          "end": 185.1,
          "en": "So that's the markup.",
          "zh": "所以那就是標記結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 185.1,
          "end": 187.2,
          "en": "We also need some styling,",
          "zh": "我們還需要一些樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 187.2,
          "end": 189.033,
          "en": "and that's why I attached",
          "zh": "所以我才在這個章節前面"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 189.033,
          "end": 192.633,
          "en": "some components style files earlier in this section.",
          "zh": "附上了一些元件的樣式檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 192.633,
          "end": 196.9,
          "en": "But attached U again finds the header.component.css file,",
          "zh": "但在附件裡你會再次找到 header.component.css 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 196.9,
          "end": 200.8,
          "en": "and you can simply replace your header.component.css file",
          "zh": "你可以直接用附件的那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 200.8,
          "end": 202.4,
          "en": "with the attached one.",
          "zh": "取代你的 header.component.css 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 204.633,
          "end": 205.833,
          "en": "Well, and with that,",
          "zh": "好，這樣一來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 205.833,
          "end": 206.766,
          "en": "we got the markup,",
          "zh": "我們有標記結構了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 206.766,
          "end": 207.933,
          "en": "we got the styles,",
          "zh": "有樣式了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 207.933,
          "end": 211.166,
          "en": "and we don't need any special TypeScript logic.",
          "zh": "而且不需要任何特殊的 TypeScript 邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 211.166,
          "end": 212.36599999999999,
          "en": "And we can, therefore,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 212.36599999999999,
          "end": 216.166,
          "en": "go back to the app.component.html file.",
          "zh": "回到 app.component.html 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 216.166,
          "end": 219.766,
          "en": "And in there, you can now replace this h1 element",
          "zh": "然後在那裡，你可以把這個 h1 元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 219.766,
          "end": 222.86599999999999,
          "en": "with app-header,",
          "zh": "換成 app-header，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 222.86599999999999,
          "end": 226.1,
          "en": "and you can add that as a self-closing tag like this,",
          "zh": "並且可以像這樣把它加成自我封閉的標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 227.133,
          "end": 228.36599999999999,
          "en": "though, as you see,",
          "zh": "不過，你也看到了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 228.36599999999999,
          "end": 229.633,
          "en": "this will give us an error",
          "zh": "這會讓我們出現一個錯誤"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 229.633,
          "end": 231.36599999999999,
          "en": "that it's not a known element.",
          "zh": "說它不是已知的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 231.36599999999999,
          "end": 233.666,
          "en": "Because by default, as you learned,",
          "zh": "因為如你所學到的，預設情況下"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 233.666,
          "end": 238.666,
          "en": "Angular doesn't scan your project for possible components.",
          "zh": "Angular 不會掃描你的專案來尋找可能的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 238.933,
          "end": 242.966,
          "en": "So in order to make Angular aware of a component here,",
          "zh": "所以要讓 Angular 知道這裡有個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 242.966,
          "end": 245.533,
          "en": "you have to add it to this imports array",
          "zh": "你必須把它加到這個 imports 陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 245.533,
          "end": 248.333,
          "en": "in the AppComponent TypeScript file.",
          "zh": "也就是 AppComponent 的 TypeScript 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 248.333,
          "end": 250.966,
          "en": "So here, I'll add this imports array",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡會加上這個 imports 陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 250.966,
          "end": 254.533,
          "en": "in my AppComponent component selector,",
          "zh": "到我的 AppComponent 元件選擇器裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 254.533,
          "end": 259.233,
          "en": "and I will import the HeaderComponent",
          "zh": "然後我會匯入 HeaderComponent"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 260.266,
          "end": 265.266,
          "en": "from ./header/header.component,",
          "zh": "從 ./header/header.component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 265.83299999999997,
          "end": 268.366,
          "en": "and then also add it here to imports.",
          "zh": "然後也把它加到這裡的 imports。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 269.766,
          "end": 272.56600000000003,
          "en": "Alternatively, if I remove that,",
          "zh": "或者，如果我把那個拿掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 272.56600000000003,
          "end": 276.6,
          "en": "we could, of course, also have used our IDE support",
          "zh": "當然也可以用我們 IDE 的支援功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 276.6,
          "end": 278.966,
          "en": "and we could have chosen that Quick Fix here,",
          "zh": "選擇這裡的 Quick Fix，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 278.966,
          "end": 281.666,
          "en": "which Visual Studio Code suggested to me.",
          "zh": "那是 Visual Studio Code 幫我建議的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 282.866,
          "end": 286,
          "en": "This also adds this import",
          "zh": "這同樣也會加上這個匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 286,
          "end": 288.633,
          "en": "and adds it here to this imports array.",
          "zh": "並把它加到這個 imports 陣列裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 290.033,
          "end": 293.766,
          "en": "And with that, if you go back to local host 4,200,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果你回到 localhost:4200，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 293.766,
          "end": 297.1,
          "en": "you should now see your header here on the screen,",
          "zh": "你現在應該會在畫面上看到你的 header，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 297.1,
          "end": 299.533,
          "en": "the title and the image.",
          "zh": "還有標題和圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 300.4,
          "end": 304.1,
          "en": "And that's the first step completed already,",
          "zh": "而第一個步驟就已經完成了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.1,
          "end": 306.2,
          "en": "though, of course, arguably,",
          "zh": "不過，或許可以說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 306.2,
          "end": 308.833,
          "en": "the remaining steps will take up more time.",
          "zh": "剩下的步驟會花更多時間。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797830",
      "title": "Adding a User Input Component",
      "lectureOrder": 78,
      "videoOrder": 72,
      "sourceHash": "c45322185cf99e8efb2782d6634ac172333bbbe74d90c34a64a054a268ea9557",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 3.24,
          "en": "So we added the header Component,",
          "zh": "所以我們加入了 header 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.24,
          "end": 6.45,
          "en": "and of course that was a relatively easy step,",
          "zh": "當然那只是相對簡單的一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.45,
          "end": 8.79,
          "en": "a relatively easy task.",
          "zh": "相對簡單的任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.79,
          "end": 11.34,
          "en": "But we're now going to dive a bit deeper",
          "zh": "但現在我們要再深入一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.34,
          "end": 14.61,
          "en": "and we're going to continue with that second step",
          "zh": "繼續進行第二步驟，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.61,
          "end": 18.06,
          "en": "where we'll add another new Component.",
          "zh": "我們要再加上一個新的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.06,
          "end": 21.06,
          "en": "But now a Component that will do a bit more",
          "zh": "但這次是一個多做一點事情的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.06,
          "end": 23.82,
          "en": "than just output some text.",
          "zh": "而不只是輸出一些文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.82,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "We'll add a user input Component,",
          "zh": "我們要加上 user-input 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 30.18,
          "en": "which job is to get the user input",
          "zh": "它的任務是取得使用者輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.18,
          "end": 32.55,
          "en": "with help of two-way binding.",
          "zh": "靠的是雙向繫結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.55,
          "end": 35.1,
          "en": "And for the moment, that's then it.",
          "zh": "目前就先這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.1,
          "end": 38.07,
          "en": "And, of course, we also want to make sure here",
          "zh": "當然，我們在這裡還要確認"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.07,
          "end": 40.47,
          "en": "that we can submit the form",
          "zh": "我們可以提交表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.47,
          "end": 42.69,
          "en": "that we'll need in this Component",
          "zh": "也就是我們在這個元件中所需要的表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.69,
          "end": 44.94,
          "en": "so that we have this button that allows us",
          "zh": "這樣才有那個按鈕讓我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.94,
          "end": 47.52,
          "en": "to produce these results in the end.",
          "zh": "最後能算出這些結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.52,
          "end": 48.39,
          "en": "Though for the moment,",
          "zh": "不過目前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.39,
          "end": 51.12,
          "en": "we'll not derive those results just yet.",
          "zh": "我們還不會馬上算出那些結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.12,
          "end": 54.54,
          "en": "Instead, right now, the idea is to collect that input",
          "zh": "相反地，現在的概念是先收集那個輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.54,
          "end": 57.36,
          "en": "and then maybe just output it in the console.",
          "zh": "然後也許先把它輸出到 console 看看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.36,
          "end": 61.35,
          "en": "So that's what I'll do here as a next step.",
          "zh": "所以我接下來會在這裡這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.35,
          "end": 65.04,
          "en": "So therefore, another new Component is needed,",
          "zh": "所以這裡需要另一個新的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 67.77,
          "en": "and I'll generate it with ng g c",
          "zh": "我會用 ng g c 來產生它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.77,
          "end": 69.93,
          "en": "and I'll name it user-input",
          "zh": "並且把它命名為 user-input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.93,
          "end": 73.8,
          "en": "and again, I'll skip the generation of these test files",
          "zh": "同樣地，我會跳過這些測試檔案的產生，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.8,
          "end": 76.923,
          "en": "with the --skip-tests command.",
          "zh": "用 --skip-tests 這個參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.72,
          "end": 81.75,
          "en": "With that, if I hit enter, this is created,",
          "zh": "這樣按下 Enter 之後，就會產生這些檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.75,
          "end": 83.78999999999999,
          "en": "this user input folder is added here",
          "zh": "這裡就會新增這個 user-input 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.78999999999999,
          "end": 86.07,
          "en": "next to the header folder.",
          "zh": "放在 header 資料夾旁邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.07,
          "end": 88.53,
          "en": "And as a first step, I'll start",
          "zh": "第一步，我會先"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.53,
          "end": 92.28,
          "en": "by bringing in those user-input Component styles,",
          "zh": "把之前那些 user-input 元件的樣式放進來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.28,
          "end": 95.7,
          "en": "which you found attached earlier in this section.",
          "zh": "也就是你之前在這個單元看到的附檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.7,
          "end": 99.03,
          "en": "I'll replace the user-input.component.css file with the one",
          "zh": "我要用那個檔案取代 user-input.component.css，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.03,
          "end": 100.65299999999999,
          "en": "that was attached earlier.",
          "zh": "也就是先前附上的那個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.39,
          "end": 106.74000000000001,
          "en": "And we can now work on the markup of this Component.",
          "zh": "接著我們就可以處理這個元件的標記了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.74000000000001,
          "end": 110.94,
          "en": "And here in this user-input.component.html file,",
          "zh": "在這個 user-input.component.html 檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.94,
          "end": 113.31,
          "en": "I in the end want to have a form,",
          "zh": "我最後想要有一個表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.31,
          "end": 116.64,
          "en": "a form that outputs all these different inputs",
          "zh": "這個表單會輸出各種不同的輸入欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.64,
          "end": 119.07,
          "en": "that allow us to collect the different pieces",
          "zh": "讓我們能收集這個應用程式所需的"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.07,
          "end": 121.593,
          "en": "of data we need for this application.",
          "zh": "各種不同資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.24,
          "end": 126.87,
          "en": "Now for styling purposes, I'll add a div in a form",
          "zh": "為了套用樣式，我會在表單中加一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.87,
          "end": 130.953,
          "en": "with a class of input-group.",
          "zh": "並給它 input-group 這個類別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.08,
          "end": 135.6,
          "en": "And in that div I want to have a paragraph",
          "zh": "而在那個 div 裡我想要有一個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.6,
          "end": 139.44,
          "en": "which then contains a label and an input element.",
          "zh": "裡面包含一個 label 和一個 input 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.44,
          "end": 141.72,
          "en": "That will be my first input here,",
          "zh": "這會是我在這裡的第一個輸入欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.72,
          "end": 144.36,
          "en": "this combination, which is about getting",
          "zh": "這個組合用來取得"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.36,
          "end": 148.593,
          "en": "that initial investment amount from the user.",
          "zh": "使用者的初始投資金額。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.67000000000002,
          "end": 151.59,
          "en": "So that's my label text.",
          "zh": "所以那就是我的 label 文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.59,
          "end": 154.62,
          "en": "And I'll then add the for attribute to that label",
          "zh": "接著我要在那個 label 上加上 for 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 154.62,
          "end": 157.02,
          "en": "for accessibility reasons",
          "zh": "為了無障礙的原因，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.02,
          "end": 158.67000000000002,
          "en": "and point at the element",
          "zh": "並指向那個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 158.67000000000002,
          "end": 162.12,
          "en": "with the id initial-investment.",
          "zh": "也就是 id 為 initial-investment 的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.12,
          "end": 165.54,
          "en": "Though of course, no element has that ID right now.",
          "zh": "當然，現在還沒有任何元素有這個 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.54,
          "end": 168.45,
          "en": "So I'll add the id attribute to the input element",
          "zh": "所以我要在 input 元素上加上 id 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.45,
          "end": 171.27,
          "en": "and assign that as an id,",
          "zh": "並指派這個 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.27,
          "end": 174.45,
          "en": "so that this label and input are connected",
          "zh": "這樣這個 label 與 input 就會"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.45,
          "end": 175.923,
          "en": "through that assignment.",
          "zh": "透過這個指派連結起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.81,
          "end": 179.55,
          "en": "Next, I'll add the type attribute",
          "zh": "接下來我要加上 type 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.55,
          "end": 181.32,
          "en": "and set that to number so",
          "zh": "並把它設為 number，這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 181.32,
          "end": 186.32,
          "en": "that this input focuses on getting numbers as input values,",
          "zh": "這個輸入欄位就會專注於輸入數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.02,
          "end": 189.51,
          "en": "though from a type perspective,",
          "zh": "不過從型別的角度來看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.51,
          "end": 191.49,
          "en": "we'll still get string inputs.",
          "zh": "我們拿到的仍然是字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 191.49,
          "end": 195.78,
          "en": "But the user will get better support with entering numbers,",
          "zh": "但使用者在輸入數字時會得到更好的支援，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.78,
          "end": 197.79,
          "en": "especially when visiting this page",
          "zh": "尤其是在行動裝置上"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 197.79,
          "end": 201.03,
          "en": "on mobile devices, for example.",
          "zh": "造訪這個頁面時，例如。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 201.03,
          "end": 203.973,
          "en": "So that's a setting I want to set here.",
          "zh": "所以這是我想設定的一項設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 205.35,
          "end": 209.79,
          "en": "Now, I'll copy that to add a second input below that input,",
          "zh": "接著我要複製它，在那個輸入欄位下方加上第二個輸入欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.79,
          "end": 214.79,
          "en": "or, thanks to this class here, visually next to that input.",
          "zh": "多虧這裡的這個類別，視覺上會接在那個輸入欄位旁邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.89,
          "end": 218.61,
          "en": "And here that will get a label",
          "zh": "而這裡它會有一個 label，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.61,
          "end": 220.683,
          "en": "of annual investment,",
          "zh": "也就是年度投資，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.55,
          "end": 224.16,
          "en": "because this input is about getting that value",
          "zh": "因為這個輸入欄位要取得"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 224.16,
          "end": 227.463,
          "en": "that the user plans to invest every year.",
          "zh": "使用者每年計畫投資的那個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 228.32999999999998,
          "end": 231.27,
          "en": "And hence, I'll also change the ID here",
          "zh": "所以我也要把這裡的 ID 改掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.27,
          "end": 233.31,
          "en": "to annual investment.",
          "zh": "改成 annual-investment。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.31,
          "end": 235.233,
          "en": "The type still is number.",
          "zh": "type 仍然是 number。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.59,
          "end": 241.05,
          "en": "Well, and now I'm going to copy",
          "zh": "好，現在我要複製"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 241.05,
          "end": 243.9,
          "en": "and duplicate this entire input group",
          "zh": "並複製整個 input 群組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 243.9,
          "end": 246.15,
          "en": "to add two more inputs,",
          "zh": "再加上兩個輸入欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 246.15,
          "end": 248.07,
          "en": "which also again will be positioned",
          "zh": "它們同樣也會被排在"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.07,
          "end": 250.53,
          "en": "next to each other visually.",
          "zh": "視覺上彼此相鄰。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 250.53,
          "end": 255.15,
          "en": "And here in the first input of these newly added inputs,",
          "zh": "而在這些新加入的輸入欄位中的第一個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 255.15,
          "end": 258.33,
          "en": "I want to get my expected return rate.",
          "zh": "我要取得我的預期報酬率。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 258.33,
          "end": 260.283,
          "en": "And that should also be of type number.",
          "zh": "而它的 type 也應該是 number。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 261.72,
          "end": 263.58,
          "en": "And I'll give this an id",
          "zh": "我要給它一個 id，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 263.58,
          "end": 267.933,
          "en": "of expected return, like this.",
          "zh": "也就是 expected-return，像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 271.41,
          "end": 274.32,
          "en": "And then here for the second input,",
          "zh": "接著這裡的第二個輸入欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 274.32,
          "end": 276.75,
          "en": "I want to get the duration,",
          "zh": "我要取得投資期間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 276.75,
          "end": 281.433,
          "en": "and hence I'll choose duration here as an id.",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡選擇 duration 作為 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 285,
          "end": 287.90999999999997,
          "en": "Now, last but not least,",
          "zh": "最後，當然也不能少了"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 287.90999999999997,
          "end": 289.53,
          "en": "at the bottom of this form,",
          "zh": "在這個表單的底部，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 289.53,
          "end": 293.07,
          "en": "I want to add a paragraph, which includes a button,",
          "zh": "我要加一個段落，裡面有一個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 293.07,
          "end": 295.173,
          "en": "which says Calculate.",
          "zh": "上面寫著 Calculate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 297.21,
          "end": 299.79,
          "en": "Well, with that, we should have the markup we need.",
          "zh": "好，這樣我們應該就有需要的標記了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 299.79,
          "end": 304.05,
          "en": "Now we can go to the user input Component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以到 user-input 元件的 TypeScript 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 304.05,
          "end": 306.39,
          "en": "and make sure that we link the template",
          "zh": "確認有把模板"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 306.39,
          "end": 307.62,
          "en": "and style file there,",
          "zh": "和樣式檔案連結在那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 307.62,
          "end": 310.29,
          "en": "which out of the box should be the case",
          "zh": "一般情況下應該本來就是如此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 310.29,
          "end": 313.14300000000003,
          "en": "if you generated this with help of the CLI.",
          "zh": "如果你用 CLI 產生這個元件的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 314.16,
          "end": 316.86,
          "en": "I'm also using a standalone Component here,",
          "zh": "我在這裡也用的是 standalone 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 316.86,
          "end": 320.22,
          "en": "but again, I'll show you module based Components later",
          "zh": "不過我之後還是會在這個單元"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 320.22,
          "end": 321.183,
          "en": "in this section.",
          "zh": "示範基於模組的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 322.62,
          "end": 325.83,
          "en": "And I now wanna output this user input Component.",
          "zh": "而現在我要把這個 user-input 元件輸出出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 325.83,
          "end": 329.4,
          "en": "Therefore I'll go to the app.component.html file,",
          "zh": "所以我要到 app.component.html 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 329.4,
          "end": 331.53,
          "en": "and there, below my app header,",
          "zh": "然後在我的 app-header 下方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 331.53,
          "end": 336.09000000000003,
          "en": "I'll output my app-user-input Component,",
          "zh": "輸出我的 app-user-input 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 336.09000000000003,
          "end": 339.63,
          "en": "or whatever you chose as a selector",
          "zh": "或是你自己選擇的 selector，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 339.63,
          "end": 343.02,
          "en": "in this user input Component TypeScript file.",
          "zh": "那是在這個 user-input 元件的 TypeScript 檔案中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 343.02,
          "end": 346.74,
          "en": "Here, that's the selector the CLI generated for me,",
          "zh": "這裡就是 CLI 為我產生的 selector，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 346.74,
          "end": 349.533,
          "en": "so that's the selector we have to use here.",
          "zh": "所以這裡必須使用這個 selector。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 351.09000000000003,
          "end": 354,
          "en": "Of course, again, this is not a known element just yet,",
          "zh": "當然，這個元素目前還不是已知元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 354,
          "end": 356.19,
          "en": "so I'll take that quick fix",
          "zh": "所以我要用那個快速修正，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 356.19,
          "end": 359.55,
          "en": "and make sure that this import is added",
          "zh": "並確認這個匯入有加到"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 359.55,
          "end": 362.07,
          "en": "to the app Component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": "app 元件的 TypeScript 檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 362.07,
          "end": 366.423,
          "en": "so that the UserInputComponent is registered there.",
          "zh": "讓 UserInputComponent 在那裡被註冊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 368.34,
          "end": 371.31,
          "en": "With that, if you save everything and reload,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果你存檔並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 371.31,
          "end": 376.31,
          "en": "you should see this user input area here below the header.",
          "zh": "你應該會在 header 下方看到這個輸入區域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 377.55,
          "end": 381.12,
          "en": "And you should be able to enter some values here.",
          "zh": "而且你應該可以在這裡輸入一些數值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 381.12,
          "end": 383.37,
          "en": "So that should work.",
          "zh": "所以應該可以運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 383.37,
          "end": 385.44,
          "en": "Of course, pressing the calculate button",
          "zh": "當然，現在按下 calculate 按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 385.44,
          "end": 388.08,
          "en": "right now won't do anything useful though.",
          "zh": "還不會做任何有用的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 388.08,
          "end": 390.69,
          "en": "Instead, it will trigger the browser default",
          "zh": "相反地，它會觸發瀏覽器的預設行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 390.69,
          "end": 395.07,
          "en": "and submit that form to the server that serves this website,",
          "zh": "把該表單提交給提供這個網站的伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 395.07,
          "end": 396.93,
          "en": "which is not what we want.",
          "zh": "而這不是我們想要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 396.93,
          "end": 400.473,
          "en": "So as a next step, I want to handle this form submission.",
          "zh": "所以接下來我要處理這個表單提交。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797832",
      "title": "Handling Form Submission",
      "lectureOrder": 79,
      "videoOrder": 73,
      "sourceHash": "c75584d20e7764a10b66f74f365d38e604a4f02cd3f0040000954c80a986036b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.19,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmüller] So let's now handle",
          "zh": "所以現在我們要來處理"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 4.56,
          "en": "the submission of this forum.",
          "zh": "這個表單的送出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.56,
          "end": 9.33,
          "en": "And for that I'll go to my user input component HTML file,",
          "zh": "為了做到這件事，我會打開我的 user input component HTML 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.33,
          "end": 11.16,
          "en": "and they are on the forum.",
          "zh": "並在表單上做相關設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.16,
          "end": 14.85,
          "en": "We can listen to an event about which you learned earlier",
          "zh": "我們可以監聽一個事件，你在前面"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.85,
          "end": 17.01,
          "en": "in the essentials section.",
          "zh": "核心觀念的章節中學過。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.01,
          "end": 20.043,
          "en": "We can listen to the ngSubmit event,",
          "zh": "我們可以監聽 ngSubmit 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.91,
          "end": 23.91,
          "en": "or at least we almost can.",
          "zh": "或者說幾乎可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.91,
          "end": 25.41,
          "en": "Right now I can't",
          "zh": "但我現在還不行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.41,
          "end": 29.25,
          "en": "because this is not a default browser event.",
          "zh": "因為這不是瀏覽器預設的事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.25,
          "end": 32.13,
          "en": "Instead, this is an event that's triggered",
          "zh": "相反地，這是一個由 Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.13,
          "end": 35.839,
          "en": "four form elements by Angular,",
          "zh": "在表單元素上觸發的事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.839,
          "end": 40.839,
          "en": "but only after we imported and unlocked, so to say,",
          "zh": "但前提是我們已經匯入並可以說是「解鎖」了"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.46,
          "end": 44.76,
          "en": "a certain Angular feature.",
          "zh": "某個 Angular 功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.76,
          "end": 49.05,
          "en": "To be precise in the component that wants to use ngSubmit,",
          "zh": "更精確地說，在想要使用 ngSubmit 的元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.05,
          "end": 54.05,
          "en": "we have to add the forms module to our imports array here,",
          "zh": "我們必須在這裡的 imports 陣列加上 FormsModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.99,
          "end": 57.18,
          "en": "and to make it available in this file,",
          "zh": "而為了讓它能在這個檔案中運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.18,
          "end": 59.34,
          "en": "we actually also have to add",
          "zh": "我們其實還得加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.34,
          "end": 63.873,
          "en": "the import at the top of the file from @Angular forms.",
          "zh": "檔案最上方從 @angular/forms 匯入的 import。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.1,
          "end": 69.09,
          "en": "This module includes a couple of important things.",
          "zh": "這個模組包含幾項重要的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.09,
          "end": 73.26,
          "en": "For example, an extension of the default form element,",
          "zh": "例如，它是對預設 form 元素的擴充，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.26,
          "end": 74.73,
          "en": "if you want to call it like this,",
          "zh": "如果你想這樣說的話，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.73,
          "end": 78.09,
          "en": "that unlocks this ngSubmit event.",
          "zh": "它會解鎖這個 ngSubmit 事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.09,
          "end": 79.56,
          "en": "So now we can listen to that",
          "zh": "所以現在我們可以在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.56,
          "end": 81.993,
          "en": "with that event binding syntax here.",
          "zh": "用事件繫結語法來監聽它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.13,
          "end": 86.49,
          "en": "Now I also of course, need to define what should happen",
          "zh": "當然，我還需要定義當那個事件發生時"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.49,
          "end": 88.23,
          "en": "when that event occurs,",
          "zh": "應該要做什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.23,
          "end": 91.62,
          "en": "and here I want to add a new method",
          "zh": "而在這裡我想新增一個方法"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.62,
          "end": 95.19,
          "en": "to that user input component class.",
          "zh": "到那個 user input component 類別中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.19,
          "end": 96.93,
          "en": "onSubmit could be the name,",
          "zh": "名稱可以叫做 onSubmit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.93,
          "end": 99.53999999999999,
          "en": "though, of course the name is up to you.",
          "zh": "當然，名字你自己決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.53999999999999,
          "end": 101.46000000000001,
          "en": "And with that method added",
          "zh": "而在加上那個方法之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.46000000000001,
          "end": 105.36,
          "en": "in the template of this component where we added the method,",
          "zh": "在這個元件我們加上該方法的模板中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.36,
          "end": 109.563,
          "en": "we can now call onSubmit when that event occurs.",
          "zh": "現在就能在事件發生時呼叫 onSubmit。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.91,
          "end": 112.443,
          "en": "So that's how we connect this.",
          "zh": "所以我們就是這樣把它連結起來的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.97,
          "end": 116.34,
          "en": "Now to see whether this works or not,",
          "zh": "現在要確認這是否有效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.34,
          "end": 120.3,
          "en": "Inside of onSubmit, we can console log,",
          "zh": "我們可以在 onSubmit 裡面用 console log，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.3,
          "end": 122.373,
          "en": "submit it, for example.",
          "zh": "例如把 submitted 印出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.17,
          "end": 127.83,
          "en": "With that added, if you open the developer tools",
          "zh": "加上之後，如果你打開開發者工具"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.83,
          "end": 130.41,
          "en": "and they are the JavaScript console,",
          "zh": "裡面的 JavaScript 主控台，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.41,
          "end": 134.913,
          "en": "if you click calculate, now you should see submitted here.",
          "zh": "當你按下 calculate，現在就應該會在這裡看到 submitted。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.68,
          "end": 139.65,
          "en": "So that's an important step in the right direction.",
          "zh": "所以這是朝正確方向邁進的重要一步。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.65,
          "end": 143.37,
          "en": "As a next step, I want to use two-way binding",
          "zh": "下一步，我想使用雙向繫結"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.37,
          "end": 145.47,
          "en": "to get hold of the values",
          "zh": "取得這些欄位中"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.47,
          "end": 148.083,
          "en": "that have been entered into these fields.",
          "zh": "所輸入的值。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797838",
      "title": "Extracting Values with Two-Way-Binding",
      "lectureOrder": 80,
      "videoOrder": 74,
      "sourceHash": "3cc3a976f127d2c22b31e2e05d49882f9644342e48e244b20af91e6f97d4f6fc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 2.49,
          "en": "So let's set up two-Way binding",
          "zh": "所以我們來為這些輸入"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.49,
          "end": 5.19,
          "en": "for these inputs here.",
          "zh": "設定雙向繫結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.19,
          "end": 7.44,
          "en": "As you learned earlier in the course,",
          "zh": "如同你在課程前面學過的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.44,
          "end": 10.98,
          "en": "this can be achieved by in the end, combining the property",
          "zh": "這最終可以透過結合屬性繫結"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.98,
          "end": 13.32,
          "en": "and event binding syntax",
          "zh": "和事件繫結的語法來達成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.32,
          "end": 17.97,
          "en": "since two-Way binding is about binding both directions.",
          "zh": "因為雙向繫結就是把兩個方向都繫結起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.97,
          "end": 21.51,
          "en": "We want to be able to send data into the element",
          "zh": "我們希望能將資料傳入我們正在繫結的那個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.51,
          "end": 24.66,
          "en": "that we're binding and we want to be able to get values",
          "zh": "也希望能從那個元素取得值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.66,
          "end": 27.813,
          "en": "out of that element when the values change.",
          "zh": "當值改變時把它取出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.86,
          "end": 31.83,
          "en": "Now, you also learned earlier in the course",
          "zh": "現在，你在課程前面也學過，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.83,
          "end": 35.37,
          "en": "that there is no built-in property",
          "zh": "標準的瀏覽器元素上"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.37,
          "end": 39.6,
          "en": "you could listen to on the standard browser elements",
          "zh": "並沒有內建的屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.6,
          "end": 42.03,
          "en": "that would support two-Way binding.",
          "zh": "可以支援雙向繫結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.03,
          "end": 45.69,
          "en": "Instead, you have to bring your own elements",
          "zh": "相反地，你必須自己帶入元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.69,
          "end": 48.69,
          "en": "and you will learn how to support two-Way binding",
          "zh": "而你會在課程後面學到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.69,
          "end": 51.54,
          "en": "on your own properties in your own components",
          "zh": "如何在自己元件的自訂屬性上"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.54,
          "end": 53.07,
          "en": "later in the course",
          "zh": "支援雙向繫結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.07,
          "end": 56.46,
          "en": "but to unlock it for certain built-in elements",
          "zh": "但若要為某些內建元素開啟這項功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.46,
          "end": 58.32,
          "en": "like for the input element,",
          "zh": "例如 input 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.32,
          "end": 61.65,
          "en": "you can use the NG model directive,",
          "zh": "你可以使用 NGModel 指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.65,
          "end": 64.14,
          "en": "which is provided by Angular,",
          "zh": "這是 Angular 提供的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.14,
          "end": 69.09,
          "en": "which does support two-way binding on input and text area",
          "zh": "它確實支援 input、textarea"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.09,
          "end": 71.013,
          "en": "and related elements.",
          "zh": "等相關元素的雙向繫結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.97,
          "end": 75,
          "en": "Now, this NG model directive is available",
          "zh": "現在，只要"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75,
          "end": 79.68,
          "en": "if you do import this forms module, which we do",
          "zh": "你匯入了這個 FormsModule（我們有匯入），"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.68,
          "end": 81.873,
          "en": "so we don't need to change anything here.",
          "zh": "這個 NGModel 指令就可以使用，所以在這裡不必做任何更動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.92,
          "end": 85.53,
          "en": "And now we can use that two-way binding syntax,",
          "zh": "而現在我們可以使用那個雙向繫結語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.53,
          "end": 88.5,
          "en": "which is square brackets around parentheses",
          "zh": "也就是在你要繫結的屬性外面"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.5,
          "end": 91.203,
          "en": "around the property that you want to bind.",
          "zh": "套上「方括號包住圓括號」。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.09,
          "end": 97.65,
          "en": "And that NG model thing when used with two-way binding,",
          "zh": "而這個 NGModel 搭配雙向繫結使用時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.65,
          "end": 101.46000000000001,
          "en": "we'll now listen to changes of the value of this input",
          "zh": "我們會監聽這個輸入元素值的變化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.46000000000001,
          "end": 104.25,
          "en": "and then update some property of our choice",
          "zh": "然後用改變後的值更新"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.25,
          "end": 108.45,
          "en": "with that changed value, or if we change that property",
          "zh": "某個我們選定的屬性；反過來，如果我們從"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.45,
          "end": 110.67,
          "en": "from some other place in our code,",
          "zh": "程式碼的其他地方改變那個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.67,
          "end": 114,
          "en": "it will send that data back into the input.",
          "zh": "它就會把那個資料送回輸入元素中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114,
          "end": 116.07300000000001,
          "en": "So we'll have that two-way binding.",
          "zh": "這樣就會有雙向繫結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.39,
          "end": 121.11,
          "en": "That of course also means that we now need a property",
          "zh": "這當然也意味著我們現在需要一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.11,
          "end": 123.93,
          "en": "to which we can two-way bind",
          "zh": "可以做雙向繫結的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.93,
          "end": 127.11,
          "en": "and therefore back in the user component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": "所以回到 User 元件的 TypeScript 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.11,
          "end": 129.75,
          "en": "I will now add a new property here",
          "zh": "我現在要在這裡加上一個新的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.75,
          "end": 132.75,
          "en": "inside of the user input component class,",
          "zh": "放在 UserInput 元件的類別裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.75,
          "end": 137.43,
          "en": "and I'll name it entered initial investment.",
          "zh": "我會把它命名為 enteredInitialInvestment。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.43,
          "end": 140.403,
          "en": "Though of course the property name is up to you,",
          "zh": "當然，屬性的名稱由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.99,
          "end": 145.11,
          "en": "and I'll set this to an initial value of a string",
          "zh": "我會把它設成一個字串的初始值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.11,
          "end": 147.183,
          "en": "that contains the number zero.",
          "zh": "其中包含數字零。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.07999999999998,
          "end": 150.6,
          "en": "So I'll not set it to the number zero,",
          "zh": "所以我不會把它設成數字 0，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.6,
          "end": 155.6,
          "en": "but to a string that contains the zero digit, so to say.",
          "zh": "而是設成一個包含 0 這個數位的字串，可以這麼說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.64,
          "end": 159.54,
          "en": "And I'm doing this because as I mentioned earlier,",
          "zh": "我這樣做是因為就像我稍早提到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 159.54,
          "end": 162.69,
          "en": "the value you'll get out of an input",
          "zh": "你從輸入元素取得的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 162.69,
          "end": 165.21,
          "en": "will always be a string,",
          "zh": "永遠都會是字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 165.21,
          "end": 166.8,
          "en": "even if the user entered a number,",
          "zh": "即使使用者輸入的是數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.8,
          "end": 168.24,
          "en": "it will be of type string.",
          "zh": "它的型別也會是 string。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 168.24,
          "end": 171.57,
          "en": "It will be a string that includes the number, so to say.",
          "zh": "它會是一個包含了該數字的字串，可以這麼說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.57,
          "end": 174.63,
          "en": "And that's why I'm also setting my initial value",
          "zh": "所以我也把初始值"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.63,
          "end": 178.2,
          "en": "to such a string that includes a number.",
          "zh": "設成這樣一個包含數字的字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 178.2,
          "end": 180.6,
          "en": "We'll convert it to an actual number,",
          "zh": "我們之後會把它轉換成真正的數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 180.6,
          "end": 183.723,
          "en": "which we need for our calculations later.",
          "zh": "後面的計算會需要它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.01,
          "end": 187.56,
          "en": "But that's the property to which I wanna bind",
          "zh": "但那就是我想繫結的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 187.56,
          "end": 192.56,
          "en": "and here I am setting up this property to not use signals.",
          "zh": "而我在這裡把這個屬性設成不使用 signals。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.5,
          "end": 195.57,
          "en": "You could also use signals here",
          "zh": "你也可以在這裡使用 signals，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.57,
          "end": 198.63,
          "en": "and I'll show you how to migrate the application",
          "zh": "我之後會向你展示如何把應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.63,
          "end": 200.31,
          "en": "to signals later.",
          "zh": "遷移到 signals。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.31,
          "end": 202.32,
          "en": "But for the moment, I'll use this approach",
          "zh": "但目前我會用這種做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 202.32,
          "end": 204.333,
          "en": "and not use a Signal here.",
          "zh": "在這裡不使用 Signal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 205.77,
          "end": 207,
          "en": "But with that now added,",
          "zh": "現在加上了這個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207,
          "end": 210.75,
          "en": "we can go back to the user input component, HTML file",
          "zh": "我們可以回到 UserInput 元件的 HTML 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.75,
          "end": 214.44,
          "en": "and use this entered initial investment property",
          "zh": "把這個 enteredInitialInvestment 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 214.44,
          "end": 216.96,
          "en": "as a value for the two-way binding here",
          "zh": "當成這裡雙向繫結的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.96,
          "end": 218.883,
          "en": "for this first input.",
          "zh": "用在第一個輸入元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 220.56,
          "end": 222.99,
          "en": "Now, I'll press this code format shortcut",
          "zh": "現在，我按下這個格式化程式碼的快捷鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.99,
          "end": 224.85,
          "en": "to make this a bit more readable",
          "zh": "讓這段程式碼好讀一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.85,
          "end": 227.613,
          "en": "and with that, my first input is done.",
          "zh": "這樣第一個輸入元素就完成了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.63,
          "end": 230.57999999999998,
          "en": "Now of course, all the inputs",
          "zh": "當然，所有的輸入元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 230.57999999999998,
          "end": 233.1,
          "en": "should be two-way bound though,",
          "zh": "都應該要做雙向繫結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.1,
          "end": 236.49,
          "en": "and therefore I'll repeat that process.",
          "zh": "所以我會重複那個步驟。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.49,
          "end": 238.77,
          "en": "And in the user input component file,",
          "zh": "而在 UserInput 元件的檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.77,
          "end": 243.77,
          "en": "I'll also add an entered annual investment property,",
          "zh": "我也會加上一個 enteredAnnualInvestment 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 244.62,
          "end": 248.643,
          "en": "which also contains zero as a starting value.",
          "zh": "它的起始值同樣是 0。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 250.2,
          "end": 254.13,
          "en": "I'll add an entered expected return property,",
          "zh": "我會加上一個 enteredExpectedReturn 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 254.13,
          "end": 259.13,
          "en": "which also has zero as a starting value, or maybe five.",
          "zh": "它的起始值也可以是 0，或是 5。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 259.38,
          "end": 263.5,
          "en": "Let's use 5% as a default expected return rate",
          "zh": "我們就用 5% 作為預設的預期報酬率，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 264.84,
          "end": 268.59,
          "en": "and a entered duration, which maybe has 10",
          "zh": "還有 enteredDuration，它的起始值"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 268.59,
          "end": 272.25,
          "en": "as a starting value though also as a string,",
          "zh": "也許是 10，但同樣也是字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 272.25,
          "end": 276.003,
          "en": "just as the expected return and the other properties.",
          "zh": "就像預期報酬率和其他屬性一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 278.7,
          "end": 281.58,
          "en": "Now with all these properties added here",
          "zh": "現在所有這些屬性都加在這裡了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 281.58,
          "end": 285.33,
          "en": "back in the user input component HTML file,",
          "zh": "回到 UserInput 元件的 HTML 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 285.33,
          "end": 288.3,
          "en": "we can copy this two-way binding code",
          "zh": "我們可以複製這段雙向繫結程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 288.3,
          "end": 291.65999999999997,
          "en": "and add it on all those inputs.",
          "zh": "並加到所有那些輸入元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 291.65999999999997,
          "end": 294.24,
          "en": "For example here, the annual investment input,",
          "zh": "例如這裡的年投資額輸入元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 294.24,
          "end": 296.73,
          "en": "though of course, I now don't wanna bind",
          "zh": "當然，我現在不想把它繫結到"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 296.73,
          "end": 300.06,
          "en": "to the entered initial investment property,",
          "zh": "enteredInitialInvestment 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 300.06,
          "end": 304.563,
          "en": "but to the entered annual investment property.",
          "zh": "而要繫結到 enteredAnnualInvestment 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 306.3,
          "end": 308.49,
          "en": "And then again, we can copy this",
          "zh": "接著一樣地，我們可以把這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 308.49,
          "end": 310.72,
          "en": "to the expected return input here",
          "zh": "複製到這裡的預期報酬輸入元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 313.26,
          "end": 318.26,
          "en": "and bind this to the entered expected return property",
          "zh": "並把它繫結到 enteredExpectedReturn 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 320.76,
          "end": 323.23,
          "en": "and copy it to the duration input",
          "zh": "再複製到期間的輸入元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 324.3,
          "end": 327.843,
          "en": "and bind it to entered duration like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣把它繫結到 enteredDuration。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 331.32,
          "end": 336.08299999999997,
          "en": "With that, I added two way binding to all these inputs",
          "zh": "完成這些，我就替所有這些輸入元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 337.11,
          "end": 340.8,
          "en": "and therefore back in the user input component file,",
          "zh": "都加上雙向繫結了，所以回到 UserInput 元件的檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 340.8,
          "end": 344.13,
          "en": "we can now also console log those values",
          "zh": "我們現在也可以用 console.log 輸出這些值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 344.13,
          "end": 347.943,
          "en": "to confirm that we really captured them.",
          "zh": "確認我們真的有取得它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 348.81,
          "end": 352.263,
          "en": "So I'll output the entered initial investment.",
          "zh": "所以我會輸出 enteredInitialInvestment。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 353.46,
          "end": 357.48,
          "en": "This entered initial investment,",
          "zh": "這個 enteredInitialInvestment，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 357.48,
          "end": 361.95,
          "en": "I'll output this entered annual investment,",
          "zh": "我會輸出這個 enteredAnnualInvestment，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 361.95,
          "end": 366.3,
          "en": "and of course also the expected return",
          "zh": "當然還有預期報酬率，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 366.3,
          "end": 368.403,
          "en": "and the entered duration.",
          "zh": "以及 enteredDuration。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 371.4,
          "end": 376.2,
          "en": "With that done, if you save this and you reload,",
          "zh": "完成這些後，如果你存檔並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 376.2,
          "end": 380.58,
          "en": "you'll be greeted by an error here in the console.",
          "zh": "就會在這裡的主控台看到一個錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 380.58,
          "end": 384.51,
          "en": "And the error message is that NG model",
          "zh": "錯誤訊息是說 NGModel"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 384.51,
          "end": 386.43,
          "en": "if used within a foreign tag,",
          "zh": "用在 foreign tag 裡面時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 386.43,
          "end": 388.71,
          "en": "in the end needs the name attribute",
          "zh": "最終需要 name 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 388.71,
          "end": 391.08299999999997,
          "en": "on the input element to which you set it.",
          "zh": "在你所設定的那個輸入元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 392.22,
          "end": 395.61,
          "en": "And that's not the case here in my template.",
          "zh": "而在我的模板中並不是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 395.61,
          "end": 399.93,
          "en": "All these inputs have an ID attribute but no name attribute,",
          "zh": "所有這些輸入元素都有 id 屬性，但沒有 name 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 399.93,
          "end": 404.223,
          "en": "but NG model requires it as this error message tells us.",
          "zh": "但如這個錯誤訊息所說，NGModel 需要它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 405.72,
          "end": 407.88,
          "en": "Well, that's not too difficult to do.",
          "zh": "嗯，這做起來並不困難。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 407.88,
          "end": 410.1,
          "en": "We can of course simply add the name here",
          "zh": "當然，我們只要在這裡加上 name 就行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 410.1,
          "end": 413.523,
          "en": "and set the name to the same value as the ID.",
          "zh": "並把 name 設成和 id 相同的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 414.78,
          "end": 417.48,
          "en": "So I did this here for the initial investment",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡為初始投資額這樣做了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 417.48,
          "end": 420.99,
          "en": "and all updated for all our inputs as well.",
          "zh": "也替我們所有的輸入元素都做了更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 420.99,
          "end": 424.59,
          "en": "So here, update the annual investment input",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，更新年投資額的輸入元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 424.59,
          "end": 425.943,
          "en": "to have the right name.",
          "zh": "讓它有正確的 name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 426.99,
          "end": 430.473,
          "en": "Then also here, the expected return input.",
          "zh": "然後這裡的預期報酬輸入元素也是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 431.67,
          "end": 436.343,
          "en": "And last but not least, also the duration input.",
          "zh": "最後當然也不能漏掉期間的輸入元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 439.92,
          "end": 442.98,
          "en": "And with those name attributes added here,",
          "zh": "在這裡加上這些 name 屬性之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 442.98,
          "end": 445.68,
          "en": "now you see if I reload, the error is gone.",
          "zh": "現在你會看到，我重新載入後錯誤消失了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 445.68,
          "end": 449.85,
          "en": "And if I now enter some values here",
          "zh": "而如果我現在在這裡輸入一些值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 449.85,
          "end": 452.52,
          "en": "and maybe keep the defaults for expected return",
          "zh": "也許讓預期報酬率"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 452.52,
          "end": 455.46,
          "en": "and duration, if I click calculate,",
          "zh": "和期間保持預設值，當我點下 calculate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 455.46,
          "end": 458.013,
          "en": "you see that data was received.",
          "zh": "你就會看到資料有被接收到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 459.48,
          "end": 462.39,
          "en": "And we also see the two-way binding in action",
          "zh": "我們也能看到雙向繫結實際運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 462.39,
          "end": 464.73,
          "en": "because our entered values",
          "zh": "因為我們輸入的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 464.73,
          "end": 468.84000000000003,
          "en": "like the initial investment are captured and output.",
          "zh": "像初始投資額，都被擷取並輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 468.84000000000003,
          "end": 473.34000000000003,
          "en": "But at the same time, these fields here were pre-populated",
          "zh": "但同時，這裡的這些欄位一開始就"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 473.34000000000003,
          "end": 476.90999999999997,
          "en": "with the default values five and 10,",
          "zh": "已經用 5 和 10 這些預設值填好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 476.90999999999997,
          "end": 478.98,
          "en": "which I did set up in my code,",
          "zh": "而這些是我在程式碼中設定的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 478.98,
          "end": 482.46,
          "en": "here in the user input component TypeScript file.",
          "zh": "在這裡的 UserInput 元件 TypeScript 檔案中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 482.46,
          "end": 486.15,
          "en": "So we were able to pass this data here into the inputs",
          "zh": "所以我們能把這裡的資料傳入這些輸入元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 486.15,
          "end": 488.403,
          "en": "and get the entered data out of them.",
          "zh": "也能從它們取出輸入的資料。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797842",
      "title": "Calculating the Annual Investment Data",
      "lectureOrder": 81,
      "videoOrder": 75,
      "sourceHash": "408884926d01d446a01ce4377b065aa3e713b91735f8179f957608c9c4488f69",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 3.42,
          "en": "So now that we are collecting",
          "zh": "所以現在我們已經在收集"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.42,
          "end": 5.82,
          "en": "that data entered by the user,",
          "zh": "使用者輸入的那些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.82,
          "end": 10.59,
          "en": "the next step is to derive those results.",
          "zh": "下一步就是去算出那些結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.59,
          "end": 11.91,
          "en": "And of course for that,",
          "zh": "而當然為了這件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.91,
          "end": 16.62,
          "en": "I provided you with this investment results TypeScript file,",
          "zh": "我提供了這個 investment results 的 TypeScript 檔案給你，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.62,
          "end": 18.51,
          "en": "which contains some code",
          "zh": "裡面包含一些程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.51,
          "end": 21.9,
          "en": "where you can use those captured input values",
          "zh": "你可以在其中用那些擷取到的輸入值"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.9,
          "end": 23.94,
          "en": "to derive the annual data,",
          "zh": "來算出年度資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.94,
          "end": 25.953,
          "en": "which should be output in the table.",
          "zh": "而這些資料應該要輸出在表格中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.18,
          "end": 30.81,
          "en": "Now the question is where we want to use that code though.",
          "zh": "現在的問題是我們要在哪裡使用那段程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.81,
          "end": 32.94,
          "en": "And here we got two main options",
          "zh": "在這裡有兩個主要選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.94,
          "end": 34.41,
          "en": "and I'll show you both,",
          "zh": "而我會把兩種都展示給你看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.41,
          "end": 37.47,
          "en": "because it's always good to know about alternatives",
          "zh": "因為知道其他替代做法總是好的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.47,
          "end": 40.44,
          "en": "and there is no clear right or wrong path,",
          "zh": "而且沒有明確的對或錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.44,
          "end": 43.89,
          "en": "though I will also tell you what my personal preferences.",
          "zh": "不過我也會告訴你我的個人偏好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.89,
          "end": 46.32,
          "en": "But the two options are essentially",
          "zh": "但這兩個選項基本上是"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.32,
          "end": 47.796,
          "en": "that we put this code",
          "zh": "把這段程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.796,
          "end": 52.796,
          "en": "into the to be added investment results component,",
          "zh": "放進即將要新增的 investment results 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.01,
          "end": 56.85,
          "en": "for example or into the app component for example",
          "zh": "例如，或是放進 app component 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.85,
          "end": 61.85,
          "en": "and that we make sure that we pass this gathered input data",
          "zh": "然後確保我們把這些收集到的輸入資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.04,
          "end": 65.46,
          "en": "to the component that performs these calculations",
          "zh": "傳給負責進行這些計算的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.46,
          "end": 68.95,
          "en": "and that we then pass the result of these calculations",
          "zh": "再把這些計算的結果"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.95,
          "end": 72.21000000000001,
          "en": "to the component that outputs them.",
          "zh": "傳給負責輸出的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.21000000000001,
          "end": 76.233,
          "en": "Or the alternative approach would be to use a service.",
          "zh": "另一種做法則是使用服務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.07,
          "end": 79.83,
          "en": "Now, using the service has certain advantages",
          "zh": "現在，使用服務有一些好處，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.83,
          "end": 81.63,
          "en": "and would be my preference",
          "zh": "而且這也是我的偏好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.63,
          "end": 84.3,
          "en": "and you'll see the advantages soon.",
          "zh": "你很快就會看到那些好處。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.3,
          "end": 87.87,
          "en": "But since you should know about both approaches",
          "zh": "但既然你應該要了解這兩種做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.87,
          "end": 90.42,
          "en": "and the different Angular features you'll need",
          "zh": "以及你會需要用到的不同 Angular 功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.42,
          "end": 93.72,
          "en": "to use to implement these two different approaches,",
          "zh": "來實作這兩種不同的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.72,
          "end": 96.47999999999999,
          "en": "I'll show you both approaches.",
          "zh": "我會把兩種做法都展示給你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.47999999999999,
          "end": 100.97999999999999,
          "en": "And I'll start with the in component calculation,",
          "zh": "而我會先從在元件內計算的做法開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.97999999999999,
          "end": 104.22,
          "en": "before we then thereafter implement the service.",
          "zh": "之後再來實作服務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.22,
          "end": 108.42,
          "en": "And here I want to derive my annual results,",
          "zh": "而我在這裡想算出我的年度結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.42,
          "end": 110.39099999999999,
          "en": "which should be output in that table,",
          "zh": "它們應該要輸出在那個表格中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.39099999999999,
          "end": 113.25,
          "en": "in this app component here.",
          "zh": "在這裡這個 app component 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.25,
          "end": 114.083,
          "en": "So in the end,",
          "zh": "所以最後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.083,
          "end": 116.703,
          "en": "I wanna put this code here into the app component,",
          "zh": "我想把這裡這段程式碼放進 app component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.9,
          "end": 122.07,
          "en": "so we can copy it as a method without the function keyword.",
          "zh": "所以我們可以把它複製成一個方法，並去掉 function 關鍵字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.07,
          "end": 123.153,
          "en": "for example.",
          "zh": "例如。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.5,
          "end": 127.71,
          "en": "Though, I also need to bring the return statement along,",
          "zh": "不過我也得把 return 敘述一起帶過去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.71,
          "end": 130.831,
          "en": "but we can copy this without the function keyword",
          "zh": "但我們可以複製過來並去掉 function 關鍵字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.831,
          "end": 133.623,
          "en": "into this app component TypeScript file.",
          "zh": "放到這個 app component 的 TypeScript 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.39,
          "end": 137.49,
          "en": "Now, we'll still get these errors here,",
          "zh": "現在，我們在這裡還是會看到這些錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.49,
          "end": 141.03,
          "en": "because these are all non-existent variables,",
          "zh": "因為這些全都不存在的變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.03,
          "end": 142.893,
          "en": "but we'll fix this soon.",
          "zh": "但我們很快就會修好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.18,
          "end": 147.725,
          "en": "Or actually we can fix this immediately",
          "zh": "或者其實我們可以立刻修好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.725,
          "end": 151.38,
          "en": "by simply accepting these missing variables",
          "zh": "只要把這些缺少的變數"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.38,
          "end": 152.7,
          "en": "as parameters here.",
          "zh": "當成這裡的參數就行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.7,
          "end": 155.55,
          "en": "That would be one way of solving this.",
          "zh": "那是解決這個問題的一種方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.55,
          "end": 158.13,
          "en": "So, we could expect this method",
          "zh": "所以我們可以讓這個方法"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.13,
          "end": 161.553,
          "en": "to receive the initial investment,",
          "zh": "接收初始投資金額，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.51,
          "end": 164.403,
          "en": "which should be a number,",
          "zh": "它應該是一個數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.9,
          "end": 168.15,
          "en": "the duration, which should be a number.",
          "zh": "還有投資期間，它也應該是一個數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.15,
          "end": 169.437,
          "en": "And I want numbers here,",
          "zh": "而我在這裡要的是數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.437,
          "end": 172.44,
          "en": "even though we get strings from the inputs,",
          "zh": "即使我們從輸入欄位拿到的是字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.44,
          "end": 175.41,
          "en": "but I expect the converted values here",
          "zh": "但我預期這裡拿到的是轉換後的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.41,
          "end": 176.57999999999998,
          "en": "and we'll have to make sure",
          "zh": "而我們必須確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 176.57999999999998,
          "end": 179.89,
          "en": "that we do convert them in some other place in our code",
          "zh": "在我們程式碼的其他地方有做轉換，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.65,
          "end": 186.65,
          "en": "and I also expect to get the expected return here,",
          "zh": "而且我也預期在這裡拿到預期的回傳值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.89,
          "end": 191.37,
          "en": "which should be a number and the annual investment,",
          "zh": "它應該是一個數字，也就是年度投資，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 191.37,
          "end": 192.84,
          "en": "which should be a number.",
          "zh": "也應該是一個數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.84,
          "end": 196.773,
          "en": "And of course, the order of these parameters is up to you,",
          "zh": "當然，這些參數的順序由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.15,
          "end": 200.55,
          "en": "but the order is also the problem here,",
          "zh": "但順序在這裡確實是個問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 200.55,
          "end": 202.56,
          "en": "since I have four parameters,",
          "zh": "因為我有四個參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.56,
          "end": 206.34,
          "en": "whenever we call this method, we have to remember the order.",
          "zh": "每次呼叫這個方法時，我們都得記住順序。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 206.34,
          "end": 208.74,
          "en": "So, we could simplify this",
          "zh": "所以我們可以簡化這件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 208.74,
          "end": 213.27,
          "en": "by actually wrapping those parameters between curly braces,",
          "zh": "把那些參數用大括號包起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.27,
          "end": 216.81,
          "en": "so that we actually expect to get one single parameter,",
          "zh": "這樣我們就只會收到一個參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 216.81,
          "end": 220.59300000000002,
          "en": "which should be an object with these properties.",
          "zh": "它應該是一個具有這些屬性的物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 221.94,
          "end": 223.56,
          "en": "Now we just have to be careful,",
          "zh": "現在我們只要小心一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 223.56,
          "end": 226.32,
          "en": "because this is now actually the type definition",
          "zh": "因為這其實是型別定義，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.32,
          "end": 228.81,
          "en": "that defines the shape of this object.",
          "zh": "用來定義這個物件的形狀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 228.81,
          "end": 232.62,
          "en": "We of course, also must give this object a name like data",
          "zh": "當然，我們也必須給這個物件一個像 data 這樣的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 232.62,
          "end": 234.84,
          "en": "and then add a colon to make it clear",
          "zh": "然後加上冒號，讓大家清楚"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 234.84,
          "end": 238.68,
          "en": "that this object type here describes the shape",
          "zh": "這裡這個物件型別描述的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.68,
          "end": 240.243,
          "en": "of this data parameter.",
          "zh": "這個 data 參數的形狀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 241.08,
          "end": 244.95,
          "en": "So, the data parameter should be an object with this shape.",
          "zh": "所以 data 參數應該是一個具有這個形狀的物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.95,
          "end": 248.65,
          "en": "So, with these properties of these types",
          "zh": "所以，帶著這些類型的這些屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 250.41,
          "end": 254.76,
          "en": "and now of course we need these properties here.",
          "zh": "而現在當然我們需要這裡的這些屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 254.76,
          "end": 256.23,
          "en": "So we could, for example,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以，舉例來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 256.23,
          "end": 257.64,
          "en": "destructure them here",
          "zh": "在這裡對它們進行解構，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 257.64,
          "end": 261.42,
          "en": "by using this JavaScript destructuring syntax",
          "zh": "使用這個 JavaScript 的解構語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 261.42,
          "end": 265.08,
          "en": "where we point at the object that should be structured",
          "zh": "指向那個要被解構的物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 265.08,
          "end": 267.75,
          "en": "and we then have curly braces on the left side",
          "zh": "然後在等號左邊加上大括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 267.75,
          "end": 272.31,
          "en": "of the equal sign to pull out those different properties",
          "zh": "把那些不同的屬性取出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 272.31,
          "end": 277.31,
          "en": "and to store them in separate constant like this.",
          "zh": "並像這樣存成個別的常數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 282.9,
          "end": 286.74,
          "en": "That would be one way of accepting this input value here",
          "zh": "那是接收這裡這個輸入值的一種方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 286.74,
          "end": 289.71,
          "en": "in this calculate investment results method",
          "zh": "在這個 calculateInvestmentResults 方法裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 289.71,
          "end": 291.723,
          "en": "in this app component.",
          "zh": "在這個 app component 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 293.97,
          "end": 297.09000000000003,
          "en": "Now, we're not done returning the annual data here,",
          "zh": "現在，我們還沒有在這裡回傳年度資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 297.09000000000003,
          "end": 298.35,
          "en": "won't do anything,",
          "zh": "什麼事都還沒做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 298.35,
          "end": 300.78,
          "en": "and the method is not getting called right now,",
          "zh": "而且這個方法目前也還沒有被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 300.78,
          "end": 303.033,
          "en": "but it's an important first step.",
          "zh": "但這是重要的第一步。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797844",
      "title": "Cross-Component Communication with Outputs",
      "lectureOrder": 82,
      "videoOrder": 76,
      "sourceHash": "151fb8227c51665c90f0e30823554c961df4b187c27c0e789c829806bf67ddbf",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 1.83,
          "en": "So we got this",
          "zh": "所以我們在 app 元件裡有這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.83,
          "end": 5.52,
          "en": "calculate investment results method in the app component.",
          "zh": "calculateInvestmentResults 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.52,
          "end": 8.82,
          "en": "And we're expecting a data object here,",
          "zh": "而我們預期這裡會有一個資料物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.82,
          "end": 10.17,
          "en": "which we then destructure",
          "zh": "接著我們再對它解構，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.17,
          "end": 13.53,
          "en": "to pull out the initial investment hands-on.",
          "zh": "把 initialInvestment 這個值取出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.53,
          "end": 15.84,
          "en": "As a next step, we therefore must make sure",
          "zh": "所以下一步，我們必須確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.84,
          "end": 18.09,
          "en": "that this gets invoked",
          "zh": "這個函式有被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.09,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "and it should get invoked when this button here is pressed,",
          "zh": "而且它應該在這裡這個按鈕被按下時被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 23.883,
          "en": "this calculate button.",
          "zh": "也就是這個 calculate 按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.78,
          "end": 27.51,
          "en": "The problem just is that this button, of course,",
          "zh": "問題就在於，這個按鈕當然是"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.51,
          "end": 29.19,
          "en": "is in a different component.",
          "zh": "放在另一個元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.19,
          "end": 32.613,
          "en": "It's in the user input component, not the app component.",
          "zh": "它在 user input 元件裡，而不是 app 元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.63,
          "end": 36.33,
          "en": "Now, we could of course, move this method",
          "zh": "當然，我們可以把這個函式移到"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.33,
          "end": 38.37,
          "en": "into the user input component,",
          "zh": "user input 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.37,
          "end": 41.58,
          "en": "but I actually want to keep it here in the app component",
          "zh": "但我其實想把它留在 app 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.58,
          "end": 45.09,
          "en": "because we'll soon add that results component",
          "zh": "因為我們很快就要加入那個 results 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.09,
          "end": 47.94,
          "en": "that should output the table with the results.",
          "zh": "它應該用表格輸出結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.94,
          "end": 51.15,
          "en": "And I plan on inserting that results component",
          "zh": "而我打算把那個 results 元件放進"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.15,
          "end": 53.31,
          "en": "in the app component template,",
          "zh": "app 元件的模板裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.31,
          "end": 55.35,
          "en": "which means we need to get access",
          "zh": "這表示我們必須取得"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.35,
          "end": 57.33,
          "en": "to the calculated results here",
          "zh": "這裡算出的結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.33,
          "end": 59.67,
          "en": "in order to pass them into that",
          "zh": "才能把它們傳給那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.67,
          "end": 62.55,
          "en": "to be added results component.",
          "zh": "即將加入的 results 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.55,
          "end": 64.53,
          "en": "So we'll need access to the results",
          "zh": "所以我們反正很快就需要在 app 元件裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.53,
          "end": 66.96,
          "en": "in the app component anyways soon,",
          "zh": "存取這些結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.96,
          "end": 69.873,
          "en": "hence it makes sense to calculate them there.",
          "zh": "因此在這裡計算它們是合理的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.01,
          "end": 72.72,
          "en": "So I want to keep that method here.",
          "zh": "所以我想把這個函式留在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.72,
          "end": 75.96000000000001,
          "en": "I don't wanna move it into the user input component,",
          "zh": "我不想把它移到 user input 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.96000000000001,
          "end": 77.91,
          "en": "and therefore we need to find another way",
          "zh": "所以我們必須找出另一種方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 77.91,
          "end": 80.78999999999999,
          "en": "of communicating from that user input component",
          "zh": "從那個 user input 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 80.78999999999999,
          "end": 82.83,
          "en": "to the app component.",
          "zh": "把訊息傳到 app 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.83,
          "end": 84.42,
          "en": "And you did learn",
          "zh": "而你確實學過了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.42,
          "end": 87.93,
          "en": "how you can communicate from a child component,",
          "zh": "要如何從子元件傳訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 87.93,
          "end": 92.22,
          "en": "which the user input component is to the app component,",
          "zh": "user input 元件對 app 元件來說就是子元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.22,
          "end": 95.43,
          "en": "to the parent component of that child component.",
          "zh": "也就是傳給該子元件的父元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.43,
          "end": 98.85,
          "en": "So from the user input component to the app component,",
          "zh": "所以在這個情況下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.85,
          "end": 99.813,
          "en": "in this case.",
          "zh": "就是從 user input 元件傳到 app 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.58,
          "end": 105.21000000000001,
          "en": "You can communicate by emitting a custom event.",
          "zh": "你可以藉由發出自訂事件來傳遞訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.21000000000001,
          "end": 107.46000000000001,
          "en": "And that's what we'll do here.",
          "zh": "而這就是我們在這裡要做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 107.46000000000001,
          "end": 111,
          "en": "So in the user input component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": "所以在使用者輸入元件的 TypeScript 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 111,
          "end": 112.65,
          "en": "we can add a new property,",
          "zh": "我們可以新增一個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.65,
          "end": 115.71000000000001,
          "en": "which we will turn into a custom event",
          "zh": "並把它變成一個自訂事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.71000000000001,
          "end": 117.93,
          "en": "by using any name of our choice",
          "zh": "名稱可以用任何我們想要的名字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 117.93,
          "end": 120.51,
          "en": "though it should be a fitting event name,",
          "zh": "不過它應該是個貼切的事件名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 120.51,
          "end": 123.093,
          "en": "like for example, calculate.",
          "zh": "例如 calculate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 124.17,
          "end": 126.81,
          "en": "And now you got two different ways",
          "zh": "而現在你有兩種不同的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 126.81,
          "end": 131.81,
          "en": "of making this a custom event, of making this an output,",
          "zh": "可以把它變成一個自訂事件、也就是一個輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 131.94,
          "end": 133.77,
          "en": "as it's called an Angular.",
          "zh": "在 Angular 裡它是這樣稱呼的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.77,
          "end": 136.923,
          "en": "You can either call the output function,",
          "zh": "你可以呼叫 output 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138,
          "end": 140.7,
          "en": "which must be imported from Angular core,",
          "zh": "它必須從 Angular core 匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 140.7,
          "end": 145.7,
          "en": "which can only be used if you're using Angular 17.3",
          "zh": "而且只有在使用 Angular 17.3"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 145.71,
          "end": 150.71,
          "en": "or higher, or you manually create an event emitter here,",
          "zh": "或更新版本時才能用；或者你也可以手動建立一個 event emitter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153.03,
          "end": 155.49,
          "en": "which also must be imported from Angular core,",
          "zh": "它同樣必須從 Angular core 匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 155.49,
          "end": 157.14,
          "en": "but which has been around forever",
          "zh": "但它一直都存在，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.14,
          "end": 160.05,
          "en": "and which is the approach you'll see",
          "zh": "也是你在更多 Angular 專案裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.05,
          "end": 162.21,
          "en": "in more Angular projects.",
          "zh": "會看到的那種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.21,
          "end": 163.743,
          "en": "Hence I'll use that here.",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡會用那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.76,
          "end": 168.99,
          "en": "And you then also need to decorate this property here",
          "zh": "然後你也必須用 @Output"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 168.99,
          "end": 171.69,
          "en": "with @output.",
          "zh": "來裝飾這裡的這個屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 171.69,
          "end": 174.753,
          "en": "So with this output decorator like this,",
          "zh": "所以用像這樣的 Output 裝飾器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 175.82999999999998,
          "end": 179.073,
          "en": "which also must be imported from Angular core,",
          "zh": "它同樣必須從 Angular core 匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 180.42,
          "end": 182.31,
          "en": "this decorator is only needed",
          "zh": "這個裝飾器只有在你"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.31,
          "end": 184.65,
          "en": "if you're using the event emitter here.",
          "zh": "使用 event emitter 時才需要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.65,
          "end": 187.08,
          "en": "If you're instead using the output function,",
          "zh": "如果你改用 output 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 187.08,
          "end": 189.12,
          "en": "you don't need the decorator",
          "zh": "就不需要這個裝飾器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 189.12,
          "end": 191.163,
          "en": "and you shouldn't be using it then.",
          "zh": "而且那時候也不該使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 193.65,
          "end": 196.11,
          "en": "Now it is considered a good practice to make it clear",
          "zh": "現在，把這裡會發出哪一種資料說清楚，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 196.11,
          "end": 198.87,
          "en": "which kind of data will be emitted here.",
          "zh": "是一件被認為是好習慣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 198.87,
          "end": 202.68,
          "en": "And you do that by adding angle brackets after event emitter",
          "zh": "你可以藉由在 event emitter 後面加上角括號來做到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.68,
          "end": 204.27,
          "en": "before the parentheses.",
          "zh": "放在括號之前。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.27,
          "end": 205.95,
          "en": "And then between those angle brackets,",
          "zh": "然後在那些角括號之間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 205.95,
          "end": 209.19,
          "en": "you put the type definition of the type of data",
          "zh": "你放入即將發出的那種資料的型別定義，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 209.19,
          "end": 210.333,
          "en": "that will be emitted.",
          "zh": "也就是那個資料的型別定義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 211.44,
          "end": 214.62,
          "en": "And here I actually wanna emit data",
          "zh": "而我在這裡實際想發出的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 214.62,
          "end": 217.41,
          "en": "that has this shape here.",
          "zh": "就是這個形狀的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 217.41,
          "end": 220.89,
          "en": "I wanna omit an object that has these properties,",
          "zh": "我想發出一個具有這些屬性的物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 220.89,
          "end": 222.303,
          "en": "which are all numbers.",
          "zh": "而它們全都是數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 223.68,
          "end": 226.56,
          "en": "So we can copy this type definition here",
          "zh": "所以我們可以把這裡的這個型別定義，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 226.56,
          "end": 229.41,
          "en": "from the app component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": "從 app 元件的 TypeScript 檔案複製過來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 229.41,
          "end": 232.083,
          "en": "and insert it here between the angle brackets.",
          "zh": "然後插到這裡的角括號之間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 233.49,
          "end": 238.17000000000002,
          "en": "Since this is a non-trivial type though,",
          "zh": "不過因為這是一個不簡單的型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 238.17000000000002,
          "end": 241.5,
          "en": "it's a bit longer, a bit more code,",
          "zh": "它比較長、比較多程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 241.5,
          "end": 243.81,
          "en": "we could also consider putting this",
          "zh": "所以我們也可以考慮把它放到"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 243.81,
          "end": 248.22,
          "en": "into a separate model though, a separate type definition,",
          "zh": "另一個獨立的 model、也就是另一個型別定義裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 248.22,
          "end": 250.53,
          "en": "which we could then reuse.",
          "zh": "之後就能重複使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 250.53,
          "end": 252.78,
          "en": "And I'll do that soon but for the moment,",
          "zh": "我很快就會那麼做，但目前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 252.78,
          "end": 254.13,
          "en": "I'll just copy and paste it",
          "zh": "我只是先複製貼上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 254.13,
          "end": 256.923,
          "en": "to focus on outputting the event for now.",
          "zh": "專注在輸出的事件上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 258.33,
          "end": 260.67,
          "en": "So we got that calculate output.",
          "zh": "所以我們就有這個 calculate 輸出了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 260.67,
          "end": 263.56,
          "en": "We can now use that here in on submit",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在 onSubmit 裡使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 264.45,
          "end": 267.84,
          "en": "to call, calculate, or this.calculate",
          "zh": "呼叫 calculate、也就是 this.calculate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 267.84,
          "end": 270.423,
          "en": "since it's a property of the class, of course.",
          "zh": "因為它當然是這個類別的一個屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 271.44,
          "end": 274.77,
          "en": "This.calculate.emit",
          "zh": "用 this.calculate.emit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 274.77,
          "end": 277.887,
          "en": "and you do that no matter if you manually create created",
          "zh": "而不管你是手動建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 277.887,
          "end": 281.883,
          "en": "the event emitter or if you used the output function.",
          "zh": "event emitter，還是使用 output 函式，都是這樣寫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 284.37,
          "end": 287.73,
          "en": "Well and then we have to emit an object of that shape.",
          "zh": "接著我們必須發出一個那個形狀的物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 287.73,
          "end": 291.42,
          "en": "So an object that has all these properties,",
          "zh": "也就是一個具有所有這些屬性的物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 291.42,
          "end": 295.35,
          "en": "initial investment, duration, expected return,",
          "zh": "包含 initialInvestment、duration、expectedReturn，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 295.35,
          "end": 300.15,
          "en": "and annual investment and the values now of course",
          "zh": "還有 annualInvestment，而這些值當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 300.15,
          "end": 302.88,
          "en": "should be the values entered by the user,",
          "zh": "應該是使用者輸入的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 302.88,
          "end": 306.57,
          "en": "but transformed to a number.",
          "zh": "但要轉換成數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 306.57,
          "end": 310.56,
          "en": "And you can easily and quickly transform a string value",
          "zh": "而在 Angular 裡，你可以很容易地把一個字串值"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 310.56,
          "end": 314.01,
          "en": "to a number in Angular by simply adding a plus",
          "zh": "轉換成數字，只要簡單地在它前面"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 314.01,
          "end": 315.63,
          "en": "in front of it.",
          "zh": "加上一個加號就行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 315.63,
          "end": 319.98,
          "en": "So plus this entered initial investment,",
          "zh": "所以像是這個輸入的 initialInvestment，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 319.98,
          "end": 323.103,
          "en": "for example, here, for the initial investment property.",
          "zh": "在這裡就是 initialInvestment 這個屬性，寫上加號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 325.53,
          "end": 330.53,
          "en": "For the duration, it's therefore plus this entered duration.",
          "zh": "至於 duration，就是加上這個輸入的 duration。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 331.86,
          "end": 333.12,
          "en": "For the expected return,",
          "zh": "對於 expectedReturn，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 333.12,
          "end": 338.12,
          "en": "it's plus this entered expected return",
          "zh": "是加上這個輸入的 expectedReturn，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 338.64,
          "end": 341.46,
          "en": "and for the annual investment, you guessed it,",
          "zh": "至於 annualInvestment，你猜對了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 341.46,
          "end": 345.543,
          "en": "it's plus this entered annual investment.",
          "zh": "也是加上這個輸入的 annualInvestment。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 346.38,
          "end": 350.4,
          "en": "And with that we'll emit this event, this output,",
          "zh": "接著我們就發出這個事件、這個輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 350.4,
          "end": 354.213,
          "en": "and send this data, this object along with it.",
          "zh": "並把這些資料、這個物件一起傳出去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 356.4,
          "end": 359.88,
          "en": "Now as a last step to finally trigger",
          "zh": "現在，作為最後一步，為了真正觸發"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 359.88,
          "end": 362.67,
          "en": "this calculate investment results function",
          "zh": "app 元件裡的這個 calculateInvestmentResults 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 362.67,
          "end": 366.06,
          "en": "in the app component, we just have to listen",
          "zh": "我們只要在 app 元件裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 366.06,
          "end": 367.743,
          "en": "to that emitted event.",
          "zh": "監聽那個被發出的事件就行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 368.73,
          "end": 372.12,
          "en": "We can do that in the app component template",
          "zh": "我們可以在 app 元件的模板裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 372.12,
          "end": 374.07,
          "en": "by using event binding",
          "zh": "用事件繫結來做到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 374.07,
          "end": 377.19,
          "en": "and then here I get this smart suggestion",
          "zh": "然後這裡就會出現這個智慧提示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 377.19,
          "end": 380.403,
          "en": "so by binding it to the calculate output event.",
          "zh": "我可以把它繫結到 calculate 這個輸出事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 381.66,
          "end": 384.63,
          "en": "Now we need to define which code should be executed",
          "zh": "現在我們必須定義當那個事件發生時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 384.63,
          "end": 386.04,
          "en": "when that event occurs.",
          "zh": "應該執行哪一段程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 386.04,
          "end": 387.264,
          "en": "And here I want to call",
          "zh": "而我在這裡想呼叫"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 387.264,
          "end": 391.11,
          "en": "this calculate investment results method,",
          "zh": "這個 calculateInvestmentResults 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 391.11,
          "end": 393.18,
          "en": "or actually to be in line",
          "zh": "不過為了符合我一向"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 393.18,
          "end": 397.71,
          "en": "with how I always name these event handling methods.",
          "zh": "對這些事件處理函式的命名方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 397.71,
          "end": 401.37,
          "en": "I'll name it on calculate investment results.",
          "zh": "我就把它命名為 onCalculateInvestmentResults。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 401.37,
          "end": 403.47,
          "en": "This is not technically required,",
          "zh": "這在技術上不是必要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 403.47,
          "end": 405.723,
          "en": "just a convention I adopted.",
          "zh": "只是我採用的一個慣例。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 407.79,
          "end": 410.49,
          "en": "So it's on calculate investment results,",
          "zh": "所以這裡就是 onCalculateInvestmentResults，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 410.49,
          "end": 412.263,
          "en": "which should be executed here.",
          "zh": "它應該在這裡被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 413.82,
          "end": 414.96,
          "en": "Now, I'm getting an error here",
          "zh": "現在我這裡出現一個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 414.96,
          "end": 417.93,
          "en": "because of course on calculate investment results",
          "zh": "因為 onCalculateInvestmentResults"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 417.93,
          "end": 421.383,
          "en": "expects one argument, but I'm not passing any data to it.",
          "zh": "預期要一個參數，但我沒有傳任何資料給它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 422.49,
          "end": 425.16,
          "en": "And of course, I wanna pass along that data,",
          "zh": "當然我想把那個資料一起傳過去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 425.16,
          "end": 426.75,
          "en": "which I emitted.",
          "zh": "也就是我剛才發出的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 426.75,
          "end": 429.3,
          "en": "You also learned how you can do that.",
          "zh": "你也學過要怎麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 429.3,
          "end": 432.96,
          "en": "You can use the special dollar sign event variable,",
          "zh": "你可以使用那個特殊的 dollar sign 事件變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 432.96,
          "end": 435.33,
          "en": "which is made available by Angular",
          "zh": "它是 Angular 提供的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 435.33,
          "end": 439.89,
          "en": "when using event binding to take that event data",
          "zh": "在使用事件繫結時，用它取得那個事件資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 439.89,
          "end": 444.89,
          "en": "that was attached to the emitted custom event to the output,",
          "zh": "也就是附加在那個發出的自訂事件上、傳給輸出的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 445.26,
          "end": 448.44,
          "en": "and then use it in any way you wanna use it.",
          "zh": "然後以任何你想用的方式使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 448.44,
          "end": 451.26,
          "en": "In this case, I'll send it as an argument",
          "zh": "在這個情況下，我會把它當成參數"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 451.26,
          "end": 453.873,
          "en": "to on calculate investment results.",
          "zh": "傳給 onCalculateInvestmentResults。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 455.49,
          "end": 459.36,
          "en": "And now as a last step to check whether this worked,",
          "zh": "現在作為最後一步，為了檢查這是否成功，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 459.36,
          "end": 462.51,
          "en": "I'll actually replace this return statement here.",
          "zh": "我會把這裡的這個 return 敘述換掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 462.51,
          "end": 464.22,
          "en": "Since currently there's no one",
          "zh": "因為目前沒有任何人"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 464.22,
          "end": 467.37,
          "en": "who would be interested in returned data,",
          "zh": "會對回傳的資料感興趣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 467.37,
          "end": 470.79,
          "en": "I'll replace it by console logging",
          "zh": "所以我把它改成用 console 記錄，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 470.79,
          "end": 473.04,
          "en": "this calculated annual data",
          "zh": "記錄這個算出來的年度資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 473.04,
          "end": 475.863,
          "en": "to see whether it looks all right or not.",
          "zh": "看看它看起來是否正確。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 479.04,
          "end": 482.04,
          "en": "So that was a lot of work but with that, if you save it all,",
          "zh": "所以這下子做了很多事，但這樣一來，如果你把一切都存檔，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 482.04,
          "end": 487.04,
          "en": "if you reload and you enter some data here, like this maybe,",
          "zh": "重新載入，然後在這裡輸入一些資料，像這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 489.75,
          "end": 491.46,
          "en": "and you click calculate,",
          "zh": "再點擊 calculate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 491.46,
          "end": 493.95,
          "en": "you should see some annual data here",
          "zh": "你應該會在這裡看到一些年度資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 493.95,
          "end": 496.98,
          "en": "and array with multiple rows,",
          "zh": "還有一個有多個列的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 496.98,
          "end": 499.62,
          "en": "multiple entries, one for every year.",
          "zh": "很多筆項目，每一年一筆。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 499.62,
          "end": 504,
          "en": "Since I have a duration of 10 years, I got 10 entries here.",
          "zh": "因為我設定的期間是 10 年，所以這裡有 10 筆項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 504,
          "end": 507.87,
          "en": "And then for every year, you see the annual investment,",
          "zh": "然後每一年，你會看到年度投資額、"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 507.87,
          "end": 511.38,
          "en": "the interest gained in that year, the total amount invested,",
          "zh": "那一年獲得的利息、累計投入的總金額，"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 511.38,
          "end": 513.21,
          "en": "which is the initial investment",
          "zh": "也就是初始投資，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 513.21,
          "end": 516.87,
          "en": "and the accumulated annual investments.",
          "zh": "以及累計的年度投資額。"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 516.87,
          "end": 519.51,
          "en": "The total interest gained up to this point.",
          "zh": "到目前為止獲得的利息總額。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 519.51,
          "end": 523.14,
          "en": "So the accumulated interest over all the years",
          "zh": "也就是所有年度累積的利息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 523.14,
          "end": 526.02,
          "en": "and the value of the investment at the end of the year,",
          "zh": "還有該年度結束時的投資價值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 526.02,
          "end": 528.963,
          "en": "which is the amount investment plus the interest.",
          "zh": "也就是投資金額加上利息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 530.04,
          "end": 534.09,
          "en": "And that, of course, should update in a correct way",
          "zh": "當然，這些都應該正確地更新，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 534.09,
          "end": 536.4,
          "en": "for every year.",
          "zh": "對每一年而言。"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 536.4,
          "end": 538.98,
          "en": "So that's looking good to me here,",
          "zh": "所以在我看來這裡沒問題了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 538.98,
          "end": 542.28,
          "en": "and therefore we got one way of calculating",
          "zh": "因此我們得到了計算那些年度資料的"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 542.28,
          "end": 543.51,
          "en": "that annual data.",
          "zh": "一種方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 543.51,
          "end": 547.44,
          "en": "The next step now, of course, is to output it on the screen",
          "zh": "接下來的下一步，當然，就是把它輸出到畫面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 547.44,
          "end": 550.41,
          "en": "before we then thereafter we'll explore",
          "zh": "然後之後我們會再探討"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 550.41,
          "end": 553.56,
          "en": "how we could use a service instead of doing it here",
          "zh": "如何改用服務，而不是在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 553.56,
          "end": 554.67,
          "en": "in the app component.",
          "zh": "在 app 元件裡做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 554.67,
          "end": 558.24,
          "en": "But first, let's make sure that we output this annual data,",
          "zh": "但首先，讓我們先確定把這個年度資料輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 558.24,
          "end": 561.36,
          "en": "not just in the console, but instead on the screen",
          "zh": "不只是在 console，而是輸出到畫面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 561.36,
          "end": 563.223,
          "en": "in a table below the input.",
          "zh": "放在輸入框下方的表格裡。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797848",
      "title": "Creating & Using a Data Model",
      "lectureOrder": 83,
      "videoOrder": 77,
      "sourceHash": "ae6df8908ac7361aee0350eb1eea92e7b6b52f5b6a8d4e97af5eb272cd0831cc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 1.59,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmüller] Now actually,",
          "zh": "那麼現在其實，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.59,
          "end": 4.74,
          "en": "before I'll output the annual data here",
          "zh": "在我要把年度資料輸出到這裡的"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.74,
          "end": 8.67,
          "en": "in a table on the screen, I'll do something else.",
          "zh": "表格之前，我先做別的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.67,
          "end": 13.11,
          "en": "I'll outsource this type definition here into a model,",
          "zh": "我要把這裡的這個型別定義抽出去放到一個 model 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.11,
          "end": 15,
          "en": "which is not something you have to do,",
          "zh": "這不是非做不可的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15,
          "end": 17.58,
          "en": "but something that can make your code a bit leaner",
          "zh": "但它可以讓你的程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.58,
          "end": 20.04,
          "en": "and easier to reuse.",
          "zh": "精簡一點，也更容易重用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.04,
          "end": 23.943,
          "en": "For that, I'll add a new file here in my app folder,",
          "zh": "為此，我要在我的 app 資料夾裡新增一個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.08,
          "end": 30.08,
          "en": "and I'll name it investment-input.model.ts.",
          "zh": "並命名為 investment-input.model.ts。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.27,
          "end": 31.8,
          "en": "The file name is up to you,",
          "zh": "檔名由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.8,
          "end": 34.29,
          "en": "but of course it should describe what's inside of it,",
          "zh": "但當然它應該描述裡面的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.29,
          "end": 36.45,
          "en": "and it should follow this convention",
          "zh": "而且它應該遵循這個慣例"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.45,
          "end": 38.28,
          "en": "of having this description",
          "zh": "也就是帶上這個描述"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.28,
          "end": 42.06,
          "en": "of which kind of thing you'll store in that file",
          "zh": "說明你會在那個檔案裡存放哪一類東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.06,
          "end": 44.46,
          "en": "if it's a component, a service,",
          "zh": "比方說是元件、服務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.46,
          "end": 46.443,
          "en": "or in this case a data model.",
          "zh": "或在這個情況下是資料模型。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48,
          "end": 50.19,
          "en": "Now model is a big word here though.",
          "zh": "不過在這裡，model 這個詞有點大。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.19,
          "end": 54.06,
          "en": "In the end in there, I want to create a custom object type",
          "zh": "最終我在那裡面想要建立一個自訂的物件型別"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.06,
          "end": 58.44,
          "en": "with help of this interface keyword provided by TypeScript,",
          "zh": "藉由 TypeScript 提供的這個 interface 關鍵字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.44,
          "end": 61.86,
          "en": "which I'll name investment input",
          "zh": "我會把它命名為 investment input"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.86,
          "end": 64.563,
          "en": "to be in line with my file name here,",
          "zh": "以配合我這裡的檔名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.15,
          "end": 68.97,
          "en": "and then I'll paste in that object type",
          "zh": "然後我會把那個物件型別"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.97,
          "end": 70.773,
          "en": "as we defined it earlier.",
          "zh": "貼進來，也就是我們之前定義的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.42,
          "end": 76.44,
          "en": "Alternatively, instead of using an interface,",
          "zh": "或者，你也可以不用 interface，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.44,
          "end": 79.23,
          "en": "you could have also used the type keyword",
          "zh": "而改用 type 這個關鍵字"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.23,
          "end": 82.743,
          "en": "to create this type, like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣來建立這個型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.91,
          "end": 86.16,
          "en": "It's up to you what you want to use.",
          "zh": "你想用哪一種由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.16,
          "end": 87.99,
          "en": "Here, I'll go for the interface",
          "zh": "這裡我會選擇 interface"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.99,
          "end": 90.69,
          "en": "since that's the approach you'll see a bit more often",
          "zh": "因為以我的經驗，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.69,
          "end": 93.243,
          "en": "in Angular projects in my experience.",
          "zh": "這種做法在 Angular 專案裡比較常見。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.7,
          "end": 98.19,
          "en": "Now we definitely need to export it.",
          "zh": "現在我們當然需要把它匯出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.19,
          "end": 101.1,
          "en": "We also would need to do that with the custom type",
          "zh": "如果是用自訂型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.1,
          "end": 103.71000000000001,
          "en": "to make it available outside of this file,",
          "zh": "同樣也需要這樣做，讓它能在這個檔案之外使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.71000000000001,
          "end": 108,
          "en": "because the idea now is to import this custom type",
          "zh": "因為現在的概念是要匯入這個自訂型別"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108,
          "end": 112.35300000000001,
          "en": "in all the places where such a object type is expected.",
          "zh": "到所有需要這種物件型別的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.55,
          "end": 115.68,
          "en": "So in the app component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": "所以在 app 元件的 TypeScript 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.68,
          "end": 119.78999999999999,
          "en": "I'll now replace this object type definition here",
          "zh": "我要把這裡的這個物件型別定義"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.78999999999999,
          "end": 123.75,
          "en": "by using my investment input type.",
          "zh": "換成我的 investment input 型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.75,
          "end": 126.57,
          "en": "And for that we must import it",
          "zh": "而為了做到這件事，我們必須匯入它"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.57,
          "end": 129.09,
          "en": "and we can add the type keyword in front of it",
          "zh": "我們可以在前面加上 type 關鍵字"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.09,
          "end": 132.57,
          "en": "to make it clear that this is just a type definition.",
          "zh": "讓人清楚這只是一個型別定義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.57,
          "end": 134.79,
          "en": "And we then assign it as a type here",
          "zh": "接著我們在這裡把它指定為型別"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.79,
          "end": 136.713,
          "en": "for this data parameter.",
          "zh": "給這個 data 參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.45,
          "end": 141.18,
          "en": "And it's now not just here where we can use it,",
          "zh": "而現在我們不只是在這裡能用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.18,
          "end": 145.41,
          "en": "but also in the user input component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": "在 user input 元件的 TypeScript 檔案裡也可以，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.41,
          "end": 147.66,
          "en": "there on this event emitter,",
          "zh": "在那個 event emitter 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.66,
          "end": 152.463,
          "en": "it's now also this investment input type that we can use.",
          "zh": "現在也可以使用這個 investment input 型別了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.63,
          "end": 157.77,
          "en": "And here we also must make sure that this import was added",
          "zh": "而在這裡，我們也必須確保這個匯入有被加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.77,
          "end": 161.643,
          "en": "and we can add this type addition here to the import.",
          "zh": "我們可以在這個匯入加上這個 type 的修飾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 163.53,
          "end": 168.483,
          "en": "With that, of course, the program will still work as before,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，當然，程式還是會像之前一樣運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.04,
          "end": 172.38,
          "en": "but we made our code a bit leaner.",
          "zh": "但我們的程式碼變精簡了一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.38,
          "end": 174.6,
          "en": "But now I wanna make sure that the data",
          "zh": "但現在我要確認資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 174.6,
          "end": 176.853,
          "en": "is actually also output on the screen.",
          "zh": "真的有被輸出到畫面上。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797850",
      "title": "Passing Data from Parent to Child with Inputs",
      "lectureOrder": 84,
      "videoOrder": 78,
      "sourceHash": "86014f90a2e6e24c19cf7c64f95d64781cf8561ce389f2426ce982c7036e149a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.33,
          "end": 3.24,
          "en": "Now in order to output this investment data",
          "zh": "現在為了把這份投資資料輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.24,
          "end": 4.073,
          "en": "on the screen,",
          "zh": "到畫面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.073,
          "end": 7.11,
          "en": "I want to add a new component that deals",
          "zh": "我要新增一個元件來處理"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.11,
          "end": 9.45,
          "en": "with displaying this table.",
          "zh": "顯示這張表格。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.45,
          "end": 14.22,
          "en": "So we can generate a new component with the NGC command.",
          "zh": "所以我們可以用 ng g c 這個 NGC 指令產生一個新元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.22,
          "end": 15.75,
          "en": "And of course the name is up to you.",
          "zh": "當然，名稱由你自己決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.75,
          "end": 18.9,
          "en": "Here, I'll name it investment dash results.",
          "zh": "在這裡我把它命名為 investment-dash-results。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.9,
          "end": 22.143,
          "en": "And I don't need the testing related files.",
          "zh": "而我不需要那些測試相關的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.52,
          "end": 27.18,
          "en": "With this command executed, we got this component here.",
          "zh": "執行這個指令後，我們就得到了這裡的這個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.18,
          "end": 30.57,
          "en": "And I'll again start by replacing the style file",
          "zh": "我一樣先從取代樣式檔案開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.57,
          "end": 33.33,
          "en": "with the one you found attached earlier at the beginning",
          "zh": "用你在這個單元開頭"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.33,
          "end": 37.263,
          "en": "of this section so that we got the proper table stylings.",
          "zh": "看到的附檔取代，這樣才有正確的表格樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.88,
          "end": 43.173,
          "en": "And as a next step, I wanna start working on that markup.",
          "zh": "接下來我要開始處理那個標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.46,
          "end": 49.02,
          "en": "And here I got actually a couple of requirements.",
          "zh": "在這裡我其實有幾項需求。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.02,
          "end": 52.26,
          "en": "For one, I want to show some fallback text,",
          "zh": "第一，我想顯示一些備援文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.26,
          "end": 55.5,
          "en": "like please enter some values",
          "zh": "例如「請輸入一些數值」"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.5,
          "end": 59.61,
          "en": "and press calculate if the user",
          "zh": "並按下 calculate，如果使用者"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.61,
          "end": 61.89,
          "en": "hasn't done that yet.",
          "zh": "還沒這麼做的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.89,
          "end": 64.353,
          "en": "So we'll need to show this conditionally.",
          "zh": "所以我們需要有條件地顯示這段文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.28,
          "end": 68.78999999999999,
          "en": "Otherwise, if the user did press the calculate button,",
          "zh": "否則，如果使用者確實按下了 calculate 按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.78999999999999,
          "end": 72.423,
          "en": "I wanna output a table with that investment data.",
          "zh": "我就要輸出含有那些投資資料的表格。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.53,
          "end": 76.24,
          "en": "For that, I'll give that table a head",
          "zh": "為了做到這件事，我要給那張表格一個表頭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.66,
          "end": 83.28,
          "en": "with my different column headings like year,",
          "zh": "包含我不同的欄位標題，例如年份，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.28,
          "end": 88.28,
          "en": "investment value, interest for the given year,",
          "zh": "投資金額、該年度的利息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 90.99,
          "end": 93.003,
          "en": "total interest,",
          "zh": "利息總額，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 93.96000000000001,
          "end": 96.63,
          "en": "and invested capital.",
          "zh": "以及投入的本金。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 96.63,
          "end": 99.843,
          "en": "These are the headings for my columns.",
          "zh": "這些就是我各欄位的標題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 102.15,
          "end": 105.47999999999999,
          "en": "And that of course is the data we are deriving here in",
          "zh": "當然，這些就是我們在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 105.47999999999999,
          "end": 106.71000000000001,
          "en": "that annual data.",
          "zh": "那份年度資料中所計算出來的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 106.71000000000001,
          "end": 109.053,
          "en": "So that's all that data we already got.",
          "zh": "所以那些資料我們都已經有了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 110.64,
          "end": 113.7,
          "en": "But then below the heading, I want to have the table body.",
          "zh": "然後在標題下方，我要加上表格主體。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 113.7,
          "end": 117.99000000000001,
          "en": "And here I now want to dynamically output as many table rows",
          "zh": "在這裡我要動態地輸出盡可能多的表格列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 117.99000000000001,
          "end": 121.14,
          "en": "as needed because of course, I don't know in advance",
          "zh": "依需求而定，因為我當然不可能預先知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 121.14,
          "end": 124.59,
          "en": "for how many years the user wants to calculate that.",
          "zh": "使用者要計算多少年。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 124.59,
          "end": 129.57,
          "en": "Maybe they just wanna calculate for one year, maybe for 100.",
          "zh": "也許對方只想算一年，也許要算 100 年。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 129.57,
          "end": 131.22,
          "en": "I don't know it in advance.",
          "zh": "我事先是不知道的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 131.22,
          "end": 135.99,
          "en": "So we need some dynamic code here to output those rows.",
          "zh": "所以我們需要一些動態程式碼來輸出那些列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 135.99,
          "end": 139.86,
          "en": "Now, before we can add that code though, we must make sure",
          "zh": "不過在加入那段程式碼之前，我們必須先確認"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 139.86,
          "end": 143.553,
          "en": "that we get those results into this component so",
          "zh": "能把那些結果傳進這個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 143.553,
          "end": 146.22,
          "en": "that we have them available here.",
          "zh": "讓我們在這裡就能使用它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 146.22,
          "end": 150.27,
          "en": "And we can achieve that by accepting an input,",
          "zh": "我們可以透過接受一個輸入來達成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 150.27,
          "end": 154.77,
          "en": "a bindable property that's exposed by this component",
          "zh": "也就是這個元件公開出來、可被繫結的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 154.77,
          "end": 156.72,
          "en": "to its parent component so",
          "zh": "給它的父元件，這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 156.72,
          "end": 161.7,
          "en": "that the parent component can pass data into this component.",
          "zh": "父元件就能把資料傳入這個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 161.7,
          "end": 164.64,
          "en": "And here for accepting such input data,",
          "zh": "而要接受這種輸入資料，這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 164.64,
          "end": 167.7,
          "en": "we again got two approaches.",
          "zh": "我們同樣有兩種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 167.7,
          "end": 170.34,
          "en": "Both start by adding a property",
          "zh": "兩種做法都要先加上一個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 170.34,
          "end": 172.803,
          "en": "that should be settable from outside.",
          "zh": "而且這個屬性要能從外部設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 173.88,
          "end": 176.04,
          "en": "And it could be named results here,",
          "zh": "在這裡它可以命名為 results，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 176.04,
          "end": 177.49,
          "en": "though the name is up to you.",
          "zh": "當然名稱由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 178.8,
          "end": 183.39,
          "en": "Then you could turn this into an input by assigning a value",
          "zh": "接著你可以指派一個值，把它變成一個輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 183.39,
          "end": 187.56,
          "en": "where the value is the result of calling the input function",
          "zh": "這個值是呼叫 input 函式的結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 187.56,
          "end": 191.313,
          "en": "with a lowercase I imported from Angular core.",
          "zh": "那個小寫開頭的 input 函式，從 @angular/core 匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 193.08,
          "end": 197.31,
          "en": "This registers this as an input to be precise",
          "zh": "更精確地說，這會把它註冊成一個輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 197.31,
          "end": 201.153,
          "en": "as a signal input, so using signals.",
          "zh": "一個 signal input，也就是使用 Signal 的輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 202.68,
          "end": 203.97,
          "en": "Now that would be one way.",
          "zh": "這會是一種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 203.97,
          "end": 206.13,
          "en": "The other way would be",
          "zh": "另一種做法則是"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 206.13,
          "end": 209.37,
          "en": "to not assign a value,",
          "zh": "不要指派值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 209.37,
          "end": 212.25,
          "en": "but instead to add a decorator in front of it,",
          "zh": "而是在前面加上一個裝飾器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 212.25,
          "end": 216.36,
          "en": "the input decorator with an uppercase eye,",
          "zh": "也就是大寫開頭的 Input 裝飾器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 216.36,
          "end": 219.303,
          "en": "which is also imported from Angular core.",
          "zh": "它同樣是從 @angular/core 匯入的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 221.85,
          "end": 226.44,
          "en": "Now, we also need to set the type of data we expect here,",
          "zh": "接著我們還要設定這裡預期接收的資料型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 226.44,
          "end": 228.72,
          "en": "and I'll do that in just a second.",
          "zh": "我等一下就會做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 228.72,
          "end": 232.2,
          "en": "We also would need to do that on the input function though",
          "zh": "不過在 input 函式上同樣也要設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 232.2,
          "end": 234.603,
          "en": "with help of angle brackets like this.",
          "zh": "用像這樣的角括號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 235.68,
          "end": 239.19,
          "en": "But what is the type of data we expect to get here?",
          "zh": "但我們預期在這裡接收的資料型別是什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 239.19,
          "end": 242.43,
          "en": "Well, it's in the end, the shape",
          "zh": "歸根究柢，它就是這些年度結果的"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 242.43,
          "end": 247.38,
          "en": "of these annual results here, the annual data here.",
          "zh": "結構，也就是這裡的年度資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 247.38,
          "end": 250.17,
          "en": "It will be an array full of objects",
          "zh": "它會是一個充滿物件的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 250.17,
          "end": 252.96,
          "en": "where every object has this shape.",
          "zh": "每個物件都是這個結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 252.96,
          "end": 256.35,
          "en": "So an object that has a year property, interest property,",
          "zh": "也就是一個有 year 屬性、interest 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 256.35,
          "end": 257.763,
          "en": "and so on.",
          "zh": "等等的物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 258.96,
          "end": 262.473,
          "en": "So what I'll do is I'll copy this code here, this object,",
          "zh": "所以我要把這裡的這段程式碼、這個物件複製下來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 263.67,
          "end": 267.24,
          "en": "and go back to my investment results",
          "zh": "然後回到我的 investment results 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 267.24,
          "end": 269.73,
          "en": "and use that here though, of course like this,",
          "zh": "在這裡使用它，當然像這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 269.73,
          "end": 273.33,
          "en": "it's not a type, I need to replace the part",
          "zh": "它不是型別，我必須把這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 273.33,
          "end": 276.21,
          "en": "after the colon here with valid types.",
          "zh": "冒號後面的部分換成有效的型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 276.21,
          "end": 279.12,
          "en": "So here, for example, should be a number.",
          "zh": "所以這裡，例如，應該是 number。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 279.12,
          "end": 281.04,
          "en": "The interest should be a number.",
          "zh": "interest 應該是 number。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 281.04,
          "end": 283.40999999999997,
          "en": "The value at the end of the year should be a number.",
          "zh": "該年底的金額應該是 number。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 283.40999999999997,
          "end": 285.21,
          "en": "The annual investment should be a number.",
          "zh": "年度投資額應該是 number。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 285.21,
          "end": 287.01,
          "en": "The total interest should be a number,",
          "zh": "利息總額應該是 number，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 287.01,
          "end": 289.26,
          "en": "and the total amount invested should be a number.",
          "zh": "而投入的總金額也應該是 number。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 289.26,
          "end": 290.913,
          "en": "So pretty straightforward.",
          "zh": "所以相當單純。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 293.64,
          "end": 296.61,
          "en": "And that's also the type you would use here",
          "zh": "順帶一提，這也是你在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 296.61,
          "end": 299.1,
          "en": "between those angle brackets by the way,",
          "zh": "那些角括號之間要用的型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 299.1,
          "end": 302.22,
          "en": "if you were using this input function instead",
          "zh": "如果你改用這個 input 函式的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 302.22,
          "end": 304.293,
          "en": "of this approach here.",
          "zh": "也就是取代這個做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 305.85,
          "end": 308.1,
          "en": "Now you'll see that I'll still get an error here",
          "zh": "現在你會看到我這裡還是有個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 308.1,
          "end": 312.633,
          "en": "because I have no initial value assigned to results.",
          "zh": "因為我沒有指派初始值給 results。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 314.01,
          "end": 315.21,
          "en": "So what we can do here",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡可以這樣做"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 315.21,
          "end": 319.26,
          "en": "to fix this problem is either add a question mark here",
          "zh": "來解決這個問題：可以在屬性名稱後面"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 319.26,
          "end": 321.93,
          "en": "after the property name to tell TypeScript",
          "zh": "加上一個問號，告訴 TypeScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 321.93,
          "end": 324.03,
          "en": "that this is an optional property,",
          "zh": "這是一個選用的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 324.03,
          "end": 326.49,
          "en": "which might have this value",
          "zh": "它可能有這個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 326.49,
          "end": 329.04,
          "en": "or a value of this type to be precise,",
          "zh": "更精確地說，可能是這種型別的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 329.04,
          "end": 331.323,
          "en": "but which might also be undefined.",
          "zh": "但也可能是 undefined。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 332.46,
          "end": 335.64,
          "en": "Or we add an exclamation mark to tell TypeScript",
          "zh": "或者加上一個驚嘆號，告訴 TypeScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 335.64,
          "end": 340.40999999999997,
          "en": "that this will always be a value of this shape here.",
          "zh": "這個值一定會是這個結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 340.40999999999997,
          "end": 343.47,
          "en": "Now here a question mark seems more appropriate",
          "zh": "而在這裡問號似乎比較合適，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 343.47,
          "end": 347.46,
          "en": "because of course if the user hasn't clicked calculate yet,",
          "zh": "因為如果使用者還沒點 calculate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 347.46,
          "end": 349.8,
          "en": "we won't have any results yet.",
          "zh": "我們還不會有任何結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 349.8,
          "end": 351.96,
          "en": "And therefore it makes sense",
          "zh": "所以這樣安排是合理的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 351.96,
          "end": 355.8,
          "en": "that this investment results component might be displayed",
          "zh": "也就是這個 investment results 元件可能被顯示出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 355.8,
          "end": 359.31,
          "en": "without any results being available.",
          "zh": "卻還沒有任何結果可用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 359.31,
          "end": 362.22,
          "en": "So that's how I'll set this up here.",
          "zh": "所以我會在這裡這樣設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 362.22,
          "end": 364.83,
          "en": "Now with the input added, we can go back",
          "zh": "現在加上了輸入，我們可以回到"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 364.83,
          "end": 369.48,
          "en": "to the app component, to the app component template,",
          "zh": "app 元件，也就是 app 元件的模板，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 369.48,
          "end": 374.48,
          "en": "and use our app investment results component here.",
          "zh": "在這裡使用我們的 app-investment-results 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 374.76,
          "end": 378.9,
          "en": "Of course, it's not available yet, so we need to import it",
          "zh": "當然，目前它還不能用，所以我們要匯入它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 378.9,
          "end": 382.23,
          "en": "and add it to this imports array on the app component.",
          "zh": "並把它加到 app 元件的 imports 陣列中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 382.23,
          "end": 383.67,
          "en": "But with it, it is available.",
          "zh": "但加上之後它就可用了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 383.67,
          "end": 388.67,
          "en": "And with that we can then also bind this results property.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就可以繫結這個 results 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 389.73,
          "end": 394.23,
          "en": "Though it's also fine if we would pass some undefined",
          "zh": "不過在這裡傳入某個 undefined"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 394.23,
          "end": 396.73,
          "en": "value as an initial value here",
          "zh": "作為初始值也沒問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 397.77,
          "end": 399.84000000000003,
          "en": "because thanks to this question mark,",
          "zh": "因為有了這個問號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 399.84000000000003,
          "end": 402.42,
          "en": "that is a value we anticipate here",
          "zh": "表示我們預期在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 402.42,
          "end": 404.493,
          "en": "in the investment results component.",
          "zh": "的 investment results 元件中會有這種值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 406.08,
          "end": 409.14,
          "en": "But either way, at the moment, I got nothing to pass",
          "zh": "但不管是哪一種，目前我沒有東西可以傳給"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 409.14,
          "end": 412.17,
          "en": "to the app investment results component",
          "zh": "這個 app-investment-results 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 412.17,
          "end": 414.27,
          "en": "from inside the app component",
          "zh": "從 app 元件裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 414.27,
          "end": 417.33,
          "en": "because in the app component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": "因為在 app 元件的 TypeScript 檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 417.33,
          "end": 419.49,
          "en": "I'm calculating the annual data,",
          "zh": "我雖然計算了年度資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 419.49,
          "end": 422.91,
          "en": "but I'm then just logging it to the console,",
          "zh": "但我接下來只是把它輸出到 console，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 422.91,
          "end": 425.85,
          "en": "which is not that helpful.",
          "zh": "這不太有用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 425.85,
          "end": 427.62,
          "en": "In order to make it available",
          "zh": "為了讓它可以使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 427.62,
          "end": 429.9,
          "en": "to the app component template so",
          "zh": "讓 app 元件的模板能夠"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 429.9,
          "end": 432.75,
          "en": "that we can then there use it as a value",
          "zh": "在那裡把它當作一個值來使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 432.75,
          "end": 434.52,
          "en": "for some property binding,",
          "zh": "例如用於某個屬性繫結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 434.52,
          "end": 439.52,
          "en": "for example, I have to store that annual data in a property",
          "zh": "我就必須把那份年度資料存到一個屬性中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 439.53,
          "end": 440.823,
          "en": "of the app component.",
          "zh": "也就是 app 元件上的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 442.23,
          "end": 445.89,
          "en": "So here I'll add a results data property.",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡加上一個 resultsData 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 445.89,
          "end": 448.38,
          "en": "The name of course is up to you.",
          "zh": "當然名稱由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 448.38,
          "end": 452.64,
          "en": "And this property should actually have the same data shape",
          "zh": "而這個屬性實際上應該有相同的資料結構，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 452.64,
          "end": 455.49,
          "en": "as we have in the investment results component",
          "zh": "也就是 investment results 元件中的結構，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 455.49,
          "end": 456.633,
          "en": "here for the input.",
          "zh": "這裡則是針對這個輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 458.07,
          "end": 460.26,
          "en": "And actually there I have a tiny error",
          "zh": "而且我現在重新看了一下，那裡有個小錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 460.26,
          "end": 462.39,
          "en": "now that I look at it again.",
          "zh": "是我再次檢查時發現的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 462.39,
          "end": 464.79,
          "en": "I'm expecting an object of this shape,",
          "zh": "我預期的是這個結構的物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 464.79,
          "end": 467.43,
          "en": "but of course this should actually be an array",
          "zh": "但當然這實際上應該是一個陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 467.43,
          "end": 468.54,
          "en": "of such objects.",
          "zh": "由這種物件組成的陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 468.54,
          "end": 471.03,
          "en": "And the valid TypeScript type definition for",
          "zh": "而有效的 TypeScript 型別定義，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 471.03,
          "end": 475.11,
          "en": "that would be this with those square brackets",
          "zh": "應該像這樣，在物件型別後面加上方括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 475.11,
          "end": 476.943,
          "en": "after the object type.",
          "zh": "也就是在那個物件型別之後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 477.9,
          "end": 480.24,
          "en": "This tells TypeScript that the type",
          "zh": "這會告訴 TypeScript，results 的型別"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 480.24,
          "end": 483.36,
          "en": "of results is actually an array full",
          "zh": "其實是一個滿載"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 483.36,
          "end": 485.55,
          "en": "of objects that have this shape.",
          "zh": "這種結構物件的陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 485.55,
          "end": 488.253,
          "en": "That would be the valid type here.",
          "zh": "這才是這裡有效的型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 490.11,
          "end": 492.9,
          "en": "But that's now also the type I want",
          "zh": "但這也是我現在想要的型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 492.9,
          "end": 497.343,
          "en": "to use in my app component for this results data property.",
          "zh": "用在 app 元件的這個 resultsData 屬性上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 499.29,
          "end": 503.16,
          "en": "And again, we could outsource this into a separate file,",
          "zh": "同樣地，我們也可以把這個型別抽到獨立的檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 503.16,
          "end": 506.01,
          "en": "but here to keep this a bit shorter, I'll not do that.",
          "zh": "但為了讓這裡簡短一點，我就不這麼做了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 506.01,
          "end": 508.263,
          "en": "You could definitely do it though.",
          "zh": "當然你完全可以這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 509.79,
          "end": 512.34,
          "en": "But with that, I have this results data property,",
          "zh": "但這樣我就有了這個 resultsData 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 512.34,
          "end": 513.75,
          "en": "which has this shape.",
          "zh": "它有這個結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 513.75,
          "end": 515.91,
          "en": "And initially this is undefined.",
          "zh": "而且它初始是 undefined。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 515.91,
          "end": 518.85,
          "en": "And to tell TypeScript that this is fine,",
          "zh": "為了告訴 TypeScript 這樣沒問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 518.85,
          "end": 521.07,
          "en": "I'll also add a question mark here,",
          "zh": "我在這裡也加上一個問號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 521.07,
          "end": 524.76,
          "en": "which means it may hold data of this shape,",
          "zh": "這表示它可以持有這種結構的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 524.76,
          "end": 526.77,
          "en": "but it may also be undefined",
          "zh": "但它也可能是 undefined，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 526.77,
          "end": 529.293,
          "en": "as it initially will be, for example.",
          "zh": "例如它初始就會是 undefined。"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 531.69,
          "end": 533.7,
          "en": "And now as a next step,",
          "zh": "接下來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 533.7,
          "end": 536.34,
          "en": "we can replace this console log statement",
          "zh": "我們可以把這段 console.log 敘述"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 536.34,
          "end": 539.58,
          "en": "with an assignment to results data.",
          "zh": "換成對 resultsData 的指派。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 539.58,
          "end": 542.82,
          "en": "And I wanna store my calculated annual data",
          "zh": "而我要把計算出來的年度資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 542.82,
          "end": 545.553,
          "en": "in that results data property.",
          "zh": "存進那個 resultsData 屬性裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 548.13,
          "end": 549.93,
          "en": "And now with that done,",
          "zh": "現在完成這些之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 549.93,
          "end": 552.78,
          "en": "finally in the app component template,",
          "zh": "最後在 app 元件的模板中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 552.78,
          "end": 556.89,
          "en": "we can pass this results data property as a value",
          "zh": "我們可以把這個 resultsData 屬性當作一個值"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 556.89,
          "end": 561.753,
          "en": "to the results input property on app investment results.",
          "zh": "傳給 app-investment-results 上的 results 輸入屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 564.06,
          "end": 566.76,
          "en": "And that's a common pattern you might see from time",
          "zh": "而這是 Angular 應用程式中"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 566.76,
          "end": 570.78,
          "en": "to time in Angular applications that you got one component",
          "zh": "你不時會看到的一種常見模式：有個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 570.78,
          "end": 574.32,
          "en": "that provides some data to the parent component,",
          "zh": "會把一些資料提供給父元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 574.32,
          "end": 577.26,
          "en": "to the app component in this case with help",
          "zh": "在這裡就是 app 元件，靠的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 577.26,
          "end": 581.46,
          "en": "of a custom output, a custom event.",
          "zh": "一個自訂的輸出，也就是自訂事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 581.46,
          "end": 585.03,
          "en": "And that the parent component, the app component here,",
          "zh": "而父元件，這裡的 app 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 585.03,
          "end": 587.91,
          "en": "then does something with that data",
          "zh": "接著對那些資料做一些處理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 587.91,
          "end": 592.26,
          "en": "and passes it down as an input to some other component.",
          "zh": "並把它當作輸入傳給另一個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 592.26,
          "end": 594.603,
          "en": "That is a fairly common pattern.",
          "zh": "這是相當常見的模式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 597.24,
          "end": 598.38,
          "en": "With that done,",
          "zh": "完成這些之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 598.38,
          "end": 600.84,
          "en": "this app investment results component",
          "zh": "這個 app-investment-results 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 600.84,
          "end": 605.07,
          "en": "should receive these results and we can now use them there.",
          "zh": "應該就會收到這些結果，我們現在可以在那裡使用它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 605.07,
          "end": 607.743,
          "en": "And that's now what I'll do as a next step.",
          "zh": "而這就是我接下來要做的事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797858",
      "title": "Outputting Data in a Table",
      "lectureOrder": 85,
      "videoOrder": 79,
      "sourceHash": "eea2a468fd901183985721bab3df0c396294ea325d311adbca136930368c85fd",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.57,
          "end": 3.93,
          "en": "So how can we now use the results here",
          "zh": "所以我們現在要怎麼使用這裡的結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.93,
          "end": 6.123,
          "en": "in the investment results component?",
          "zh": "放在 investment results component 中呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.96,
          "end": 8.97,
          "en": "Well, in two main ways.",
          "zh": "嗯，主要有兩種方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.97,
          "end": 10.38,
          "en": "For one, I want to check",
          "zh": "第一，我想檢查"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.38,
          "end": 13.05,
          "en": "whether we maybe don't have any results",
          "zh": "我們是否可能根本沒有任何結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.05,
          "end": 16.26,
          "en": "so that in that case we show this paragraph.",
          "zh": "如果是這種情況，就顯示這一段文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.26,
          "end": 18.45,
          "en": "Otherwise, if we do have results,",
          "zh": "否則，如果我們確實有結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.45,
          "end": 21.54,
          "en": "I want to output some rows in that table.",
          "zh": "我就要在那個表格中輸出幾列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.54,
          "end": 23.76,
          "en": "Now let's start with the if check",
          "zh": "現在先從 if 判斷開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.76,
          "end": 25.95,
          "en": "and if you're using modern Angular,",
          "zh": "如果你在使用現代的 Angular，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.95,
          "end": 29.13,
          "en": "you can output this content conditionally",
          "zh": "你可以用條件式的方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.13,
          "end": 31.24,
          "en": "by adding @if here",
          "zh": "在這裡加上 @if，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.13,
          "end": 34.62,
          "en": "and by then putting your condition",
          "zh": "然後把你的條件"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.62,
          "end": 36.51,
          "en": "between those parentheses.",
          "zh": "寫在那組括號之間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.51,
          "end": 41.49,
          "en": "And here my condition is that results is not truthy,",
          "zh": "而我這裡的條件是 results 不是真值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.49,
          "end": 43.503,
          "en": "so not results.",
          "zh": "也就是 not results。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.81,
          "end": 48.693,
          "en": "If that's the case, this paragraph should be displayed.",
          "zh": "如果是這樣，這段文字就應該顯示出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.89,
          "end": 53.67,
          "en": "Now this starting project, which I provided to you,",
          "zh": "我提供給你的這個起始專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.67,
          "end": 57.09,
          "en": "uses a Angular version that's recent enough",
          "zh": "使用的 Angular 版本夠新，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.09,
          "end": 60.93,
          "en": "to support this modern @if syntax.",
          "zh": "足以支援這個現代的 @if 語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.93,
          "end": 64.26,
          "en": "In older Angular projects, you would need",
          "zh": "在較舊的 Angular 專案中，你會需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.26,
          "end": 68.03999999999999,
          "en": "to use the ng if directive like this,",
          "zh": "像這樣使用 ngIf 指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.03999999999999,
          "end": 69.843,
          "en": "but here it's not required.",
          "zh": "但這裡不需要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.83,
          "end": 75.83,
          "en": "Now this if syntax here also supports an at else branch,",
          "zh": "現在這個 if 語法也支援 @else 分支，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.41,
          "end": 79.17,
          "en": "which will become active if this condition is not met.",
          "zh": "當這個條件不成立時就會啟用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.17,
          "end": 82.26,
          "en": "So if we do have results and therefore here,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們確實有結果，因此在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.26,
          "end": 85.41,
          "en": "I'll grab my table like this",
          "zh": "我會像這樣把表格拿進來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.41,
          "end": 88.413,
          "en": "and I'll put that here in that else branch.",
          "zh": "然後把它放在那個 else 分支裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.57,
          "end": 92.31,
          "en": "With that, if you save that,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果你儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.31,
          "end": 95.52000000000001,
          "en": "you should see this fallback text.",
          "zh": "你就會看到這段替代文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.52000000000001,
          "end": 97.74000000000001,
          "en": "And to improve the styling of that,",
          "zh": "而為了改善它的樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.74000000000001,
          "end": 101.92,
          "en": "I'll actually add the class center to it",
          "zh": "我會實際上為它加上 class center，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.43,
          "end": 105.90299999999999,
          "en": "so that it is centered.",
          "zh": "讓它置中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.86,
          "end": 108.12299999999999,
          "en": "So that looks better.",
          "zh": "這樣看起來好多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.38,
          "end": 112.62,
          "en": "Now of course, if we have results, I wanna output them here.",
          "zh": "當然，如果我們有結果，我就要在這裡把它們輸出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.62,
          "end": 115.14,
          "en": "And by the way, if I would click calculate,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，如果我按下 calculate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.14,
          "end": 116.58,
          "en": "this table would be rendered.",
          "zh": "這個表格就會被算繪出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.58,
          "end": 117.84,
          "en": "So the if check works,",
          "zh": "所以這個 if 判斷是有效的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.84,
          "end": 121.05,
          "en": "but of course we have no rows yet, so that's what we need",
          "zh": "但當然我們還沒有任何列，所以這就是我們需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.05,
          "end": 124.05,
          "en": "to change and therefore we should dynamically output",
          "zh": "修改的地方，因此我們應該動態地輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.05,
          "end": 126.66,
          "en": "some rows here in that table body.",
          "zh": "幾列到那個表格主體裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.66,
          "end": 129.87,
          "en": "And we can do this with @for.",
          "zh": "而我們可以用 @for 來做到這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.87,
          "end": 134.87,
          "en": "Another modern control flow statement supported by Angular.",
          "zh": "這是 Angular 支援的另一個現代控制流程語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.3,
          "end": 139.38,
          "en": "Now @for needs your looping code",
          "zh": "現在 @for 需要你的迴圈程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.38,
          "end": 143.7,
          "en": "or the code that defines through which data it should loop",
          "zh": "也就是定義它要針對哪些資料進行迴圈的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.7,
          "end": 146.73,
          "en": "and iterate between those parentheses",
          "zh": "並在那些括號之間進行迭代，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.73,
          "end": 151.35,
          "en": "and therefore here we can write result of results",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們可以寫 result of results，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.35,
          "end": 154.41,
          "en": "so that we loop through the results property,",
          "zh": "讓我們逐一走過 results 這個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.41,
          "end": 156.66,
          "en": "which will hold an array value.",
          "zh": "它會存放一個陣列值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.66,
          "end": 159.18,
          "en": "So we can loop through it",
          "zh": "所以我們可以對它進行迴圈，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.18,
          "end": 163.41,
          "en": "and we then extract every entry into such a result variable,",
          "zh": "然後把每一筆項目取出到 result 這個變數中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 165.66,
          "en": "which we can access between the curly braces",
          "zh": "我們可以在大括號之間"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.66,
          "end": 167.973,
          "en": "to output that data.",
          "zh": "存取它來輸出那些資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.71,
          "end": 173.28,
          "en": "Now we also need to add something here after a semicolon,",
          "zh": "現在我們還要在分號之後加點東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.28,
          "end": 176.79,
          "en": "and that is track and then define",
          "zh": "那就是 track，接著要定義"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.79,
          "end": 181.79,
          "en": "which criteria uniquely identifies every entry",
          "zh": "哪個準則能唯一辨識每一筆項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 182.04,
          "end": 182.88,
          "en": "in that array.",
          "zh": "在那個陣列之中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.88,
          "end": 185.52,
          "en": "And in that case, that would be the year property,",
          "zh": "在這個例子中，那就是 year 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.52,
          "end": 188.97,
          "en": "for example, because every element in this results array",
          "zh": "因為這個 results 陣列中的每一個元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.97,
          "end": 191.61,
          "en": "will have a unique year assigned to it,",
          "zh": "都會被指派一個唯一的 year，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 191.61,
          "end": 195.363,
          "en": "and that is required by Angular for performance reasons.",
          "zh": "而這是 Angular 基於效能考量所要求的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 196.92000000000002,
          "end": 197.753,
          "en": "With that though,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 197.753,
          "end": 200.92000000000002,
          "en": "we can then render one table row per element",
          "zh": "我們就能為每個元素算繪出一列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.84,
          "end": 205.32,
          "en": "and then have multiple columns in there where we,",
          "zh": "然後裡面有多個欄位，我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 205.32,
          "end": 210.32,
          "en": "for example, output the result year in the first column",
          "zh": "例如在第一欄輸出 result.year，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 210.45,
          "end": 213.45,
          "en": "using this string interpolation syntax",
          "zh": "使用這種字串插值語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 213.45,
          "end": 215.703,
          "en": "with the double curly braces.",
          "zh": "也就是雙大括號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 217.82999999999998,
          "end": 220.26,
          "en": "And I'm outputting the year in the first column",
          "zh": "而我在第一欄輸出 year，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 220.26,
          "end": 222.903,
          "en": "because that is my first column heading as well.",
          "zh": "因為那也是我的第一欄標題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 227.13,
          "end": 229.41,
          "en": "Now the second column",
          "zh": "現在第二欄"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 229.41,
          "end": 233.28,
          "en": "should then output the investment value,",
          "zh": "則應該輸出投資金額，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 233.28,
          "end": 236.133,
          "en": "which we can get from result.valueEndOfYear.",
          "zh": "我們可以從 result.valueEndOfYear 取得。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 240.54,
          "end": 243.483,
          "en": "So that's what our investment is currently worth.",
          "zh": "所以那就是我們目前的投資價值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 244.59,
          "end": 246.6,
          "en": "And then thereafter,",
          "zh": "接著之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 246.6,
          "end": 251.33,
          "en": "I output the interest gained in that year thereafter.",
          "zh": "我輸出該年度賺到的利息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 254.61,
          "end": 257.07,
          "en": "We have the total interest",
          "zh": "我們有總利息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 257.07,
          "end": 259.593,
          "en": "and thereafter the total amount invested.",
          "zh": "接著是投資的總金額。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 265.08,
          "end": 266.04,
          "en": "With that,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 266.04,
          "end": 269.76,
          "en": "if you save this, you should actually be able",
          "zh": "如果你儲存，你實際上應該能夠"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 269.76,
          "end": 272.61,
          "en": "to enter something here, enter some values,",
          "zh": "在這裡輸入一些東西，輸入幾個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 272.61,
          "end": 273.78,
          "en": "and click calculate.",
          "zh": "然後按下 calculate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 273.78,
          "end": 275.52,
          "en": "And you should see a table.",
          "zh": "你就會看到一個表格。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 275.52,
          "end": 279.09000000000003,
          "en": "Now the values will not look that great yet.",
          "zh": "現在這些值看起來還不會太漂亮。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 279.09000000000003,
          "end": 283.95,
          "en": "They're not formatted as currency, but will fix this soon.",
          "zh": "它們還沒有被格式化為貨幣格式，但我們很快就會修好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 283.95,
          "end": 285.75,
          "en": "You should see some rows here though,",
          "zh": "不過你應該會在這裡看到幾列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 285.75,
          "end": 289.56,
          "en": "and that therefore proves that calculating those values",
          "zh": "而這因此證明了計算那些值"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 289.56,
          "end": 291.63,
          "en": "and outputting them works.",
          "zh": "並把它們輸出來是可行的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 291.63,
          "end": 295.503,
          "en": "As a next step, let's fix the way they're displayed.",
          "zh": "下一步，讓我們修一下它們的顯示方式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797862",
      "title": "Formatting Output with a Pipe",
      "lectureOrder": 86,
      "videoOrder": 80,
      "sourceHash": "10664e3b8822a558781156a76b9d1a70bd93ac998a0e8889b1927b4f23ba3925",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.45,
          "end": 1.89,
          "en": "Now to fix the way",
          "zh": "現在為了修正"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.89,
          "end": 6.75,
          "en": "those values are displayed, we can use a pipe,",
          "zh": "這些值的顯示方式，我們可以使用 pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.75,
          "end": 8.91,
          "en": "which is a feature provided by Angular",
          "zh": "這是 Angular 提供的功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.91,
          "end": 13.32,
          "en": "about which you learned, which helps you format values.",
          "zh": "你已經學過，它能幫你格式化值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.32,
          "end": 15.6,
          "en": "And you apply a pipe to a value",
          "zh": "而你要把 pipe 套用到某個值上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.6,
          "end": 17.07,
          "en": "that's output in the template",
          "zh": "這個值是在模板中輸出的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.07,
          "end": 21.15,
          "en": "by adding the pipe symbol here, this vertical bar,",
          "zh": "方式就是在這裡加上 pipe 符號，就是那條直線，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.15,
          "end": 23.34,
          "en": "and then thereafter, the pipe name.",
          "zh": "然後接上 pipe 的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.34,
          "end": 26.88,
          "en": "And in this case, I'm using the built-in currency pipe",
          "zh": "在這個情況，我使用的是內建的 currency pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.88,
          "end": 29.103,
          "en": "that's provided by Angular.",
          "zh": "它由 Angular 提供。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.2,
          "end": 34.8,
          "en": "Now, in order to unlock this pipe in this component here,",
          "zh": "現在，為了要在這個元件中啟用這個 pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.8,
          "end": 39.45,
          "en": "I need to go to the component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": "我需要到元件的 TypeScript 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.45,
          "end": 41.58,
          "en": "and then there, we need to add the pipe",
          "zh": "然後在那裡把這個 pipe"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.58,
          "end": 45.03,
          "en": "to this imports array, the currency pipe,",
          "zh": "加到這個 imports 陣列中，也就是 currency pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.03,
          "end": 48.333,
          "en": "and we also need to import it from Angular common.",
          "zh": "而且我們還需要從 @angular/common 匯入它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.71,
          "end": 52.68,
          "en": "With it imported, it's available in the template,",
          "zh": "匯入之後，它就可以在模板中使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.68,
          "end": 55.65,
          "en": "and we can add it to all these values,",
          "zh": "我們可以把它加到所有這些值上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.65,
          "end": 58.833,
          "en": "except for the year, which of course is no currency.",
          "zh": "除了年份之外，當然年份不是貨幣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.14,
          "end": 65.583,
          "en": "If you then save that, and you again enter something here,",
          "zh": "接著如果你存檔，並在這裡再次輸入一些東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.7,
          "end": 72.213,
          "en": "you should see values that are formatted in a nicer way.",
          "zh": "你就會看到值被排版得更漂亮了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 73.38,
          "end": 76.62,
          "en": "By the way, you could also configure this currency pipe",
          "zh": "順帶一提，你也可以設定這個 currency pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 76.62,
          "end": 80.37,
          "en": "by adding a colon after it to pass parameters into it.",
          "zh": "在它後面加上一個冒號，就能傳入參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 80.37,
          "end": 82.35,
          "en": "For example, if you wanted to output",
          "zh": "例如，如果你想讓輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 82.35,
          "end": 85.14,
          "en": "the value as euros instead of dollars,",
          "zh": "的單位是歐元而不是美元，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.14,
          "end": 86.883,
          "en": "you could do it like this.",
          "zh": "你可以這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87.84,
          "end": 90.419,
          "en": "Of course, you can learn about all the configuration options",
          "zh": "當然，所有可用的設定選項"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.419,
          "end": 93.45,
          "en": "in the official documentation.",
          "zh": "你都可以在官方文件中找到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.45,
          "end": 95.64,
          "en": "Here, I'm actually happy with the defaults,",
          "zh": "在這裡，我其實對預設值還算滿意，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.64,
          "end": 97.38300000000001,
          "en": "so I'll just add it like this.",
          "zh": "所以我就這樣加上去。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797868",
      "title": "Using Signals & Resetting The Form After Submission",
      "lectureOrder": 87,
      "videoOrder": 81,
      "sourceHash": "43fb97dfe642822024a2c7652ee8c9d024c87da3c79ba6582f351f99f86d7756",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 2.61,
          "en": "So at this point",
          "zh": "所以到這個階段"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.61,
          "end": 5.61,
          "en": "we're actually done with this exercise.",
          "zh": "我們其實已經完成這個練習了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.61,
          "end": 7.62,
          "en": "We built everything we need,",
          "zh": "我們建好了所有需要的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.62,
          "end": 11.91,
          "en": "but of course I'll now also show you some variations.",
          "zh": "但我現在也會展示給你看一些變化。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.91,
          "end": 14.76,
          "en": "We'll use a service, we'll use signals,",
          "zh": "我們會使用服務，也會使用 signals，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.76,
          "end": 18.688,
          "en": "but this would all be valid solution",
          "zh": "但這些全都是有效的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.688,
          "end": 21.933,
          "en": "here that's really important to understand.",
          "zh": "這點真的很重要，一定要理解。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.92,
          "end": 25.8,
          "en": "But let's now take a look at some variations,",
          "zh": "不過現在讓我們看看一些變化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.8,
          "end": 30,
          "en": "some other ways of solving this and building this.",
          "zh": "也就是其他解決與建構這件事的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30,
          "end": 34.11,
          "en": "And I wanna start by using some signals,",
          "zh": "而我想先用一些 signals，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.11,
          "end": 36.21,
          "en": "most importantly in the app component",
          "zh": "最重要的是在 app component 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.21,
          "end": 39.24,
          "en": "because this is a component where I have a property",
          "zh": "因為這是一個我有某個屬性的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.24,
          "end": 43.92,
          "en": "that changes when the user enters some data in the end.",
          "zh": "它會在使用者最後輸入資料時改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.92,
          "end": 47.73,
          "en": "So after on calculate investment results executed,",
          "zh": "所以在 onCalculateInvestmentResults 執行之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.73,
          "end": 50.28,
          "en": "this results data property is changed.",
          "zh": "這個 resultsData 屬性就改變了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.28,
          "end": 54.15,
          "en": "And this method here will be triggered when the user clicks",
          "zh": "而這裡這個方法會在使用者點擊"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.15,
          "end": 56.1,
          "en": "to calculate button.",
          "zh": "calculate 按鈕時被觸發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.1,
          "end": 58.47,
          "en": "So put number words, this here.",
          "zh": "換句話說，這裡這個就是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.47,
          "end": 61.35,
          "en": "Results data is some stateful data,",
          "zh": "resultsData 是某種有狀態的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.35,
          "end": 65.76,
          "en": "some data which when changed will have an impact on the UI.",
          "zh": "也就是一旦改變，就會對 UI 造成影響的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.76,
          "end": 69.06,
          "en": "And that's some data we could manage with a Signal",
          "zh": "而這正是我們可以用 Signal 管理的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.06,
          "end": 71.103,
          "en": "instead of using it like this.",
          "zh": "而不是像這樣使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.3,
          "end": 73.44,
          "en": "How would we do that?",
          "zh": "那我們要怎麼做呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.44,
          "end": 77.16,
          "en": "Well, as a first step, I'll get rid of that type annotation",
          "zh": "首先，我要把那個型別註記"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.16,
          "end": 79.08,
          "en": "and that question mark.",
          "zh": "還有那個問號拿掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.08,
          "end": 83.46000000000001,
          "en": "And I'll instead initialize results data as a Signal",
          "zh": "然後改成把 resultsData 初始化成一個 Signal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.46000000000001,
          "end": 87.82,
          "en": "by assigning a Signal value by executing the signal function",
          "zh": "也就是執行 signal 函式來指派一個 Signal 值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.74,
          "end": 92.88300000000001,
          "en": "and the Signal function is imported from Angular core.",
          "zh": "而這個 Signal 函式是從 @angular/core 匯入的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.31,
          "end": 99.27000000000001,
          "en": "Now this Signal then also needs an initial value,",
          "zh": "現在這個 Signal 也需要一個初始值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.27000000000001,
          "end": 102.12,
          "en": "and that initial value could be undefined,",
          "zh": "而那個初始值可以是 undefined，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.12,
          "end": 103.74000000000001,
          "en": "that would be fine,",
          "zh": "那樣也沒問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.74000000000001,
          "end": 108.53999999999999,
          "en": "but eventually I wanna store a different value in there.",
          "zh": "但最終我想放進去的是另一種值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.53999999999999,
          "end": 112.74000000000001,
          "en": "So I'll add angle brackets to add this type annotation",
          "zh": "所以我會加上角括號來加上這個型別註記，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.74000000000001,
          "end": 117.74000000000001,
          "en": "to tell Signal which kind of value it will eventually store.",
          "zh": "告訴 Signal 它最終會存放哪一種值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 118.71000000000001,
          "end": 123.36,
          "en": "And I'll then grab this results type definition again,",
          "zh": "然後我再把這個 results 型別定義拿過來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 123.36,
          "end": 127.48,
          "en": "this array full of object types that have this shape",
          "zh": "這個由具有這種形狀的物件型別組成的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 130.29,
          "end": 134.01,
          "en": "and add that here between the angle brackets.",
          "zh": "把它加在這裡的角括號中間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 134.01,
          "end": 138.45,
          "en": "Now undefined is now actually not a valid value",
          "zh": "現在 undefined 其實不是有效的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 138.45,
          "end": 142.75,
          "en": "if we tell Angular that this is the expected type",
          "zh": "如果我們告訴 Angular 這就是預期的型別的話，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 143.7,
          "end": 147.69,
          "en": "and therefore we need to clarify this type definition",
          "zh": "所以我們必須把這個型別定義說清楚，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 147.69,
          "end": 150.48,
          "en": "here by adding the pipe symbol",
          "zh": "在這裡加上 pipe 符號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 150.48,
          "end": 152.55,
          "en": "and then adding undefined thereafter.",
          "zh": "接著再加上 undefined。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 152.55,
          "end": 156.99,
          "en": "This is TypeScript way of defining two possible types",
          "zh": "這就是 TypeScript 定義兩種可能型別的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 156.99,
          "end": 158.913,
          "en": "for a given value.",
          "zh": "給一個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 160.5,
          "end": 162.66,
          "en": "So with that, we're telling Angular",
          "zh": "所以這樣我們就是告訴 Angular，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 162.66,
          "end": 166.89,
          "en": "that this Signal will hold either an array full of objects",
          "zh": "這個 Signal 要嘛持有的是一個充滿物件的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 166.89,
          "end": 170.94299999999998,
          "en": "that have this shape or an undefined value.",
          "zh": "這些物件具有這種形狀，要嘛就是 undefined 值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 173.91,
          "end": 176.91,
          "en": "So that would be one way of working with signals here",
          "zh": "所以那會是在這裡使用 signals 的一種方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 176.91,
          "end": 178.173,
          "en": "and of setting this up.",
          "zh": "也是設定這個功能的一種方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 179.46,
          "end": 181.53,
          "en": "Now we also need to change the code",
          "zh": "現在我們還需要修改程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 181.53,
          "end": 183.96,
          "en": "where we update the results data though,",
          "zh": "也就是更新 resultsData 的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 183.96,
          "end": 186.6,
          "en": "because this line of code won't work anymore.",
          "zh": "因為這一行程式碼已經不能運作了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 186.6,
          "end": 190.14,
          "en": "Instead, since results data now is a Signal, we need",
          "zh": "相反地，既然 resultsData 現在是 Signal，我們需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 190.14,
          "end": 191.88,
          "en": "to call this set method",
          "zh": "呼叫這個 set 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 191.88,
          "end": 195.183,
          "en": "and set it to this annual data as a new value.",
          "zh": "並把這個 annualData 設為新的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 197.04,
          "end": 198.57,
          "en": "But that's then it.",
          "zh": "但這樣就夠了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 198.57,
          "end": 202.803,
          "en": "That's how we migrate this code here to use signals.",
          "zh": "這就是我們把這裡的程式碼改用 signals 的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 204.21,
          "end": 205.8,
          "en": "It's not all we have to do though.",
          "zh": "不過我們還沒做完所有事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 205.8,
          "end": 209.43,
          "en": "We also need to work on the app component template",
          "zh": "我們還需要處理 app component 的模板，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 209.43,
          "end": 212.01,
          "en": "because there I'm passing my results data",
          "zh": "因為在那裡我把我的 resultsData"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 212.01,
          "end": 214.71,
          "en": "to the results property of the app",
          "zh": "傳給 app"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 214.71,
          "end": 216.93,
          "en": "investment results component,",
          "zh": "investment results 元件的 results 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 216.93,
          "end": 220.38,
          "en": "and results of course doesn't want a Signal,",
          "zh": "而 results 當然不想要一個 Signal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 220.38,
          "end": 223.173,
          "en": "it wants the data inside the Signal.",
          "zh": "它想要的是 Signal 裡面的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 224.19,
          "end": 226.59,
          "en": "So we need to read the Signal data",
          "zh": "所以我們必須讀取 Signal 的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 226.59,
          "end": 230.49,
          "en": "and let Angular set up a subscription behind the scenes",
          "zh": "並讓 Angular 在幕後設定好訂閱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 230.49,
          "end": 232.023,
          "en": "by adding brackets here.",
          "zh": "方法就是在這裡加上括號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 234.69,
          "end": 237.87,
          "en": "That's all though with that if you save this",
          "zh": "不過就這些，如果你儲存這個檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 237.87,
          "end": 241.44,
          "en": "and you enter some valid data,",
          "zh": "並輸入一些有效的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 241.44,
          "end": 243.45,
          "en": "this should work as before.",
          "zh": "就應該會像之前一樣運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 243.45,
          "end": 245.313,
          "en": "But now using a Signal,",
          "zh": "但現在使用 Signal 之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 247.2,
          "end": 250.53,
          "en": "it's not the only place where we can use a Signal though.",
          "zh": "這並不是唯一可以使用 Signal 的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 250.53,
          "end": 252.81,
          "en": "Instead, the user input component",
          "zh": "相反地，user input 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 252.81,
          "end": 256.17,
          "en": "actually also has some properties that change",
          "zh": "其實也有一些會改變的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 256.17,
          "end": 258.87,
          "en": "as the user enters some new values",
          "zh": "在使用者輸入新值的時候，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 258.87,
          "end": 261.09,
          "en": "with help of two-way binding.",
          "zh": "透過雙向繫結來完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 261.09,
          "end": 264.39,
          "en": "And we can also use signals here.",
          "zh": "而我們在這裡也可以使用 signals。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 264.39,
          "end": 268.59,
          "en": "So we can turn all these properties into signals by calling",
          "zh": "所以我們可以透過呼叫"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 268.59,
          "end": 270.12,
          "en": "that Signal function",
          "zh": "那個 Signal 函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 270.12,
          "end": 272.64300000000003,
          "en": "after importing it from Angular of course,",
          "zh": "當然，先從 Angular 匯入它之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 274.11,
          "end": 277.383,
          "en": "and we can then pass our initial values into Signal.",
          "zh": "然後把初始值傳入 Signal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 278.61,
          "end": 281.79,
          "en": "And here we don't even need to set a type",
          "zh": "而這裡我們甚至不需要用"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 281.79,
          "end": 284.79,
          "en": "with the angle brackets then because TypeScript",
          "zh": "角括號來設定型別，因為 TypeScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 284.79,
          "end": 287.28,
          "en": "will infer the type of the Signal",
          "zh": "會推斷出這個 Signal 的型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 287.28,
          "end": 289.17,
          "en": "from that initial value.",
          "zh": "從那個初始值推斷出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 289.17,
          "end": 291.54,
          "en": "And we only had to overwrite",
          "zh": "而我們只有需要覆寫"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 291.54,
          "end": 295.26,
          "en": "or extend that inferred type in the app component",
          "zh": "或延伸 app component 中那個推斷出來的型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 295.26,
          "end": 298.71,
          "en": "because their TypeScript would've inferred undefined",
          "zh": "因為它們的 TypeScript 會把 undefined 推斷為"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 298.71,
          "end": 300.15,
          "en": "as a Signal value.",
          "zh": "Signal 的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 300.15,
          "end": 304.229,
          "en": "And that of course, wasn't all we wanted to accept there.",
          "zh": "而那當然不是我們在那裡想接受的全部。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 304.229,
          "end": 307.26,
          "en": "Instead there we also wanted to accept an array",
          "zh": "相反地，我們在那裡還想接受一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 307.26,
          "end": 309.03,
          "en": "of such objects.",
          "zh": "由這類物件組成的陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 309.03,
          "end": 311.97,
          "en": "That's why we needed to be more specific",
          "zh": "所以我們才需要更明確，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 311.97,
          "end": 314.97,
          "en": "and explicitly assign a type here.",
          "zh": "在這裡明確指定一個型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 314.97,
          "end": 316.89,
          "en": "In the user input component,",
          "zh": "在 user input 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 316.89,
          "end": 319.8,
          "en": "I am fine with TypeScript inferring",
          "zh": "我完全滿意讓 TypeScript 去推斷，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 319.8,
          "end": 322.17,
          "en": "that this Signal will hold a string.",
          "zh": "這個 Signal 會持有字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 322.17,
          "end": 325.23,
          "en": "It can infer that from the initial value, and that's fine",
          "zh": "它可以從初始值推斷出來，這樣沒問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 325.23,
          "end": 329.283,
          "en": "because that is indeed all this Signal will ever hold.",
          "zh": "因為那確實是這個 Signal 唯一會持有的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 330.87,
          "end": 335.74,
          "en": "So we can do that here for all these properties",
          "zh": "所以我們可以像這樣對所有這些屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 341.7,
          "end": 342.533,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": "都這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 344.13,
          "end": 347.73,
          "en": "Now with that done in the user input template,",
          "zh": "現在在 user input 模板裡做完這些之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 347.73,
          "end": 351.06,
          "en": "we actually don't need to call these signals",
          "zh": "我們其實不需要呼叫這些 signals，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 351.06,
          "end": 353.97,
          "en": "and you shouldn't call them because NG model",
          "zh": "而且也不應該呼叫，因為 ngModel"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 353.97,
          "end": 356.31,
          "en": "actually already is built such",
          "zh": "本身已經是這樣設計的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 356.31,
          "end": 361.05,
          "en": "that internally it does accept signals as inputs as well,",
          "zh": "它內部也接受 signals 作為輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 361.05,
          "end": 363,
          "en": "and it will automatically read them",
          "zh": "而且會自動讀取它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 363,
          "end": 365.34,
          "en": "and set up a subscription then.",
          "zh": "然後設定好訂閱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 365.34,
          "end": 366.51,
          "en": "So we don't need,",
          "zh": "所以我們不需要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 366.51,
          "end": 367.897,
          "en": "and we shouldn't change anything",
          "zh": "也不應該改動任何東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 367.897,
          "end": 371.91,
          "en": "in the user input component, HTML file.",
          "zh": "在 user input 元件的 HTML 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 371.91,
          "end": 374.91,
          "en": "Instead, this is all we need to do to migrate",
          "zh": "相反地，要改用 signals 遷移這段程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 374.91,
          "end": 376.653,
          "en": "this code to signals.",
          "zh": "我們只需要做這些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 377.58,
          "end": 380.94,
          "en": "However, we should change the code here in on submit,",
          "zh": "不過，我們應該修改 onSubmit 裡的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 380.94,
          "end": 383.25,
          "en": "because when I emit my data,",
          "zh": "因為當我 emit 我的資料時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 383.25,
          "end": 387.39,
          "en": "I actually wanna emit the data stored in the Signal,",
          "zh": "我其實想 emit 的是存放在 Signal 裡的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 387.39,
          "end": 390.03,
          "en": "not the Signal itself.",
          "zh": "而不是 Signal 本身。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 390.03,
          "end": 393.21,
          "en": "So we should read all these signals",
          "zh": "所以我們應該讀取所有這些 signals，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 393.21,
          "end": 395.22,
          "en": "here by adding parentheses",
          "zh": "在這裡加上括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 395.22,
          "end": 398.73,
          "en": "when that on submit method is triggered.",
          "zh": "當那個 onSubmit 方法被觸發時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 398.73,
          "end": 401.73,
          "en": "So with that done, if you now save this",
          "zh": "所以做完這些，如果你現在儲存這個檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 401.73,
          "end": 404.703,
          "en": "and you again enter some data here,",
          "zh": "並在這裡再次輸入一些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 405.75,
          "end": 409.05,
          "en": "that should again work as before.",
          "zh": "那就應該會再次像之前一樣運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 409.05,
          "end": 410.85,
          "en": "Now with the help of signals",
          "zh": "現在有了 signals 的協助，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 410.85,
          "end": 414,
          "en": "here in the user input component as well.",
          "zh": "在 user input 元件裡也是一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 414,
          "end": 417.78,
          "en": "Well, and now we could actually also migrate this code here,",
          "zh": "那麼，現在我們其實也可以把這裡的程式碼改寫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 417.78,
          "end": 419.64,
          "en": "as I already mentioned before,",
          "zh": "就像我之前提過的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 419.64,
          "end": 422.25,
          "en": "and not use the output decorator,",
          "zh": "不要使用 output 裝飾器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 422.25,
          "end": 426.933,
          "en": "but instead use the output function provided by Angular.",
          "zh": "而是改用 Angular 提供的 output 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 428.76,
          "end": 432.45,
          "en": "However, I still wanna add this type annotation",
          "zh": "不過，我還是想加上這個型別註記，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 432.45,
          "end": 435.483,
          "en": "here to make it clear which kind of data will be emitted.",
          "zh": "在這裡讓大家清楚會 emit 哪一種資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 437.7,
          "end": 439.17,
          "en": "But with that change made,",
          "zh": "但做完這個改動之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 439.17,
          "end": 441.51,
          "en": "we can now also remove the event emitter",
          "zh": "我們現在也可以把 EventEmitter"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 441.51,
          "end": 443.883,
          "en": "and output decorator imports.",
          "zh": "和 output 裝飾器的匯入都移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 445.92,
          "end": 450.36,
          "en": "Similarly, in the investment results component,",
          "zh": "同樣地，在 investment results 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 450.36,
          "end": 454.2,
          "en": "we can also migrate this results property",
          "zh": "我們也可以把這個 results 屬性改寫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 454.2,
          "end": 458.913,
          "en": "to use this input function here like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣使用這裡的 input 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 460.02,
          "end": 464.15999999999997,
          "en": "Then we'll actually also get a input Signal here.",
          "zh": "那樣我們在這裡也會得到一個 input Signal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 464.15999999999997,
          "end": 466.38,
          "en": "So this will also be a Signal,",
          "zh": "所以這也會是一個 Signal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 466.38,
          "end": 469.35,
          "en": "which doesn't really change anything in our application",
          "zh": "它其實不會真的改變我們應用程式裡的什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 469.35,
          "end": 472.95,
          "en": "here, but which could theoretically allow Angular",
          "zh": "但理論上可以讓 Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 472.95,
          "end": 476.82,
          "en": "to update this component more efficiently.",
          "zh": "更有效率地更新這個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 476.82,
          "end": 478.47,
          "en": "Now, with that change made,",
          "zh": "現在，做完這個改動之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 478.47,
          "end": 481.68,
          "en": "we should also remove this input decorator import",
          "zh": "我們也應該把這個 input 裝飾器的匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 481.68,
          "end": 483.52,
          "en": "here in this component",
          "zh": "從這個元件裡移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 484.89,
          "end": 487.08,
          "en": "and in the template of this component.",
          "zh": "以及從這個元件的模板中移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 487.08,
          "end": 489.75,
          "en": "Since results is now a Signal,",
          "zh": "既然 results 現在是一個 Signal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 489.75,
          "end": 493.44,
          "en": "we have to execute it to read the Signal value",
          "zh": "我們必須執行它才能讀取 Signal 的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 493.44,
          "end": 496.863,
          "en": "and again, let Angular set up that subscription.",
          "zh": "並同樣讓 Angular 設定好那個訂閱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 498.24,
          "end": 500.943,
          "en": "We also have to do that here in our if check.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡的 if 判斷中也必須那樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 503.22,
          "end": 505.8,
          "en": "So again, with that, if we save this,",
          "zh": "所以同樣地，做完這些，如果我們儲存這個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 505.8,
          "end": 509.19,
          "en": "this should work the same as before.",
          "zh": "它應該會和之前一樣運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 509.19,
          "end": 513.03,
          "en": "Yeah, looks good to me here.",
          "zh": "嗯，看起來沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 513.03,
          "end": 516.18,
          "en": "We could of course also make sure that the form is reset",
          "zh": "當然我們也可以確保表單會被重設，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 516.18,
          "end": 517.98,
          "en": "whenever we submit that,",
          "zh": "在每次送出表單時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 517.98,
          "end": 520.32,
          "en": "and we could have done that before as well,",
          "zh": "而我們之前也可以這樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 520.32,
          "end": 522.06,
          "en": "even without using signals.",
          "zh": "就算沒有使用 signals 也一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 522.06,
          "end": 523.86,
          "en": "But now that we are using signals,",
          "zh": "但現在我們在使用 signals 了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 523.86,
          "end": 526.26,
          "en": "we can do it here in the on submit method,",
          "zh": "我們可以在 onSubmit 方法裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 526.26,
          "end": 528.45,
          "en": "in the user input component,",
          "zh": "在 user input 元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 528.45,
          "end": 531.3,
          "en": "we can reach out to all our signals here,",
          "zh": "對這裡的每一個 signals 進行處理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 531.3,
          "end": 533.55,
          "en": "like the entered initial investment amount",
          "zh": "例如輸入的初始投資金額，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 533.55,
          "end": 536.94,
          "en": "and set it back to that value, which is a string",
          "zh": "把它設回那個值，也就是字串"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 536.94,
          "end": 539.133,
          "en": "with the number zero, for example.",
          "zh": "例如數字 0。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 541.767,
          "end": 543.42,
          "en": "And we can of course now repeat",
          "zh": "而我們當然也可以對"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 543.42,
          "end": 547.17,
          "en": "that for all the other signals here as well",
          "zh": "這裡其他所有的 signals 這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 547.17,
          "end": 550.14,
          "en": "and reset them to their initial values.",
          "zh": "把它們重設回各自的初始值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 550.14,
          "end": 552.99,
          "en": "Again, that is something we could have done before as well.",
          "zh": "同樣地，這也是我們之前就可以做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 552.99,
          "end": 556.02,
          "en": "It's not something that's unlocked by using signals.",
          "zh": "這不是使用 signals 才解鎖的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 556.02,
          "end": 560.223,
          "en": "This is just the Signal way of resetting those values.",
          "zh": "這只是用 Signal 重設那些值的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 561.3,
          "end": 564.45,
          "en": "So with that, if I enter something here",
          "zh": "所以做完這些，如果我在這裡輸入東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 564.45,
          "end": 568.023,
          "en": "and I click calculate, you see the form is reset thereafter.",
          "zh": "然後點擊 calculate，你就會看到表單隨後被重設。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 569.07,
          "end": 572.28,
          "en": "So that's how we can use signals",
          "zh": "所以這就是我們可以在"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 572.28,
          "end": 574.56,
          "en": "in those different components,",
          "zh": "這些不同的元件裡使用 signals 的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 574.56,
          "end": 578.28,
          "en": "and that is something you could consider doing therefore,",
          "zh": "因此，你可以考慮這樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 578.28,
          "end": 581.88,
          "en": "before, I'll show you how you could use modules",
          "zh": "接著，我會展示你可以如何使用模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 581.88,
          "end": 583.89,
          "en": "instead of standalone components.",
          "zh": "來取代 standalone 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 583.89,
          "end": 587.19,
          "en": "I first wanna show you how you could integrate",
          "zh": "我想先展示你可以如何整合"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 587.19,
          "end": 589.65,
          "en": "a service into this application",
          "zh": "一個服務到這個應用程式裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 589.65,
          "end": 591.63,
          "en": "because that is something",
          "zh": "因為那是一件"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 591.63,
          "end": 594.003,
          "en": "you might wanna consider doing here.",
          "zh": "你可能會想考慮在這裡做的事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797874",
      "title": "Using a Service for Cross-Component Communication",
      "lectureOrder": 88,
      "videoOrder": 82,
      "sourceHash": "3b05b9d431c16ad6e34b7998d60f0cfe54c7c6634f35ffcfed15367e5708fc70",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 3.42,
          "en": "So how could we use a service",
          "zh": "那我們要怎麼在這個應用程式裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.42,
          "end": 5.493,
          "en": "in this application to improve it?",
          "zh": "使用服務來改善它呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.54,
          "end": 9.54,
          "en": "Well, at the moment we are using this AppComponent",
          "zh": "嗯，目前我們是用這個 AppComponent"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.54,
          "end": 11.43,
          "en": "to derive the investment results,",
          "zh": "來推導投資結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.43,
          "end": 12.72,
          "en": "and that, of course, means",
          "zh": "而這當然意味著"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.72,
          "end": 17.04,
          "en": "that data must be passed up from the UserInputComponent",
          "zh": "資料必須從 UserInputComponent 往上傳，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.04,
          "end": 19.44,
          "en": "through a custom event,",
          "zh": "透過一個自訂事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.44,
          "end": 22.555,
          "en": "through an output to the AppComponent.",
          "zh": "透過一個輸出傳到 AppComponent。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.555,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "And it then must be passed down to the InvestmentResults",
          "zh": "接著又必須往下傳給 InvestmentResults，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 29.28,
          "en": "through an input from that component,",
          "zh": "從那個元件透過一個輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.28,
          "end": 31.447,
          "en": "so from that AppComponent.",
          "zh": "也就是從那個 AppComponent 傳過去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.43,
          "end": 34.8,
          "en": "There's nothing wrong with this approach,",
          "zh": "這種做法沒有錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.8,
          "end": 37.47,
          "en": "but it's some extra code we have to write.",
          "zh": "但我們得額外寫一些程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.47,
          "end": 40.53,
          "en": "Both the output as well as the input",
          "zh": "不論是輸出還是輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.53,
          "end": 43.44,
          "en": "could actually be avoided if we used a service.",
          "zh": "如果我們用服務，其實都可以省掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.44,
          "end": 45.6,
          "en": "And that's, therefore, what I'll do now.",
          "zh": "所以我現在就會這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.6,
          "end": 48.24,
          "en": "So what I'll do here is I'll add a service",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡要做的是新增一個服務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.24,
          "end": 50.01,
          "en": "maybe next to the AppComponent.",
          "zh": "也許放在 AppComponent 旁邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.01,
          "end": 52.95,
          "en": "The exact position is not too important here,",
          "zh": "確切的位置在這裡不太重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.95,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "and I'll name it investment service.",
          "zh": "而我會把它命名為 investment service。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.04,
          "end": 59.733,
          "en": "So the file is named investment.service.ts.",
          "zh": "所以檔案名稱是 investment.service.ts。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.99,
          "end": 63.06,
          "en": "And in there as you learned it,",
          "zh": "而在裡面，如你所學的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.06,
          "end": 67.233,
          "en": "we can and should export a class called InvestmentService,",
          "zh": "我們可以也應該匯出一個叫 InvestmentService 的類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.1,
          "end": 70.28999999999999,
          "en": "which should be decorated",
          "zh": "它應該用"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.28999999999999,
          "end": 73.14,
          "en": "with the @Injectable decorator,",
          "zh": "@Injectable 這個裝飾器來裝飾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.14,
          "end": 75.903,
          "en": "which is imported from @angular/core.",
          "zh": "而它是從 @angular/core 匯入的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78,
          "end": 81.63,
          "en": "And to that decorator, you pass a configuration object",
          "zh": "而你會傳給這個裝飾器一個設定物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.63,
          "end": 85.053,
          "en": "where you should set providedIn to root.",
          "zh": "在裡面把 providedIn 設為 root。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.64,
          "end": 89.19,
          "en": "This will make sure that Angular is able",
          "zh": "這樣可以確保 Angular 能夠"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.19,
          "end": 91.38,
          "en": "to inject that service,",
          "zh": "注入那個服務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.38,
          "end": 96.38,
          "en": "and that components can request that service to be injected.",
          "zh": "也能讓元件要求注入那個服務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.75,
          "end": 99.09,
          "en": "Now inside of this service,",
          "zh": "現在在這個服務裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.09,
          "end": 103.02000000000001,
          "en": "I now wanna gather the data entered by the user",
          "zh": "我想把使用者輸入的資料收集起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.02000000000001,
          "end": 105.96000000000001,
          "en": "and derive those results.",
          "zh": "並推導出那些結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.96000000000001,
          "end": 110.1,
          "en": "So what we could do here in this service is",
          "zh": "所以我們在這個服務裡可以做的是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.1,
          "end": 113.37299999999999,
          "en": "take that code from our AppComponent,",
          "zh": "把我們 AppComponent 裡的那段程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.37299999999999,
          "end": 117.453,
          "en": "this onCalculateInvestmentResults method here,",
          "zh": "也就是這裡的 onCalculateInvestmentResults 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.68,
          "end": 121.473,
          "en": "cut it and remove it from the AppComponent,",
          "zh": "剪下來並從 AppComponent 移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.67,
          "end": 126.12,
          "en": "and add it to the InvestmentService.",
          "zh": "然後加到 InvestmentService 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.12,
          "end": 128.67,
          "en": "Though I'll rename it to calculateInvestmentResults",
          "zh": "不過我會把它重新命名為 calculateInvestmentResults，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.75,
          "end": 134.75,
          "en": "since it will no longer be directly bound to a custom event.",
          "zh": "因為它不再直接繫結到一個自訂事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.94,
          "end": 136.653,
          "en": "But that's just a naming thing.",
          "zh": "但那只是命名上的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138,
          "end": 139.44,
          "en": "Now I wanna still use",
          "zh": "現在我還是想使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.44,
          "end": 143.04,
          "en": "that custom InvestmentInput data type,",
          "zh": "那個自訂的 InvestmentInput 資料型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 143.04,
          "end": 147.513,
          "en": "which is imported from that model file like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣從那個 model 檔案匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.61,
          "end": 151.47,
          "en": "And of course we must make sure",
          "zh": "當然我們必須確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.47,
          "end": 155.49,
          "en": "that we still store the results data either with a signal",
          "zh": "我們仍然用 signal 來儲存結果資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.49,
          "end": 157.53,
          "en": "or with a regular property.",
          "zh": "或是一般的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.53,
          "end": 159.84,
          "en": "And again, I'll show you both.",
          "zh": "同樣地，兩種方式我都會給你看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.84,
          "end": 162.21,
          "en": "Now let's start by not using a signal,",
          "zh": "現在我們先從不使用 signal 開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 162.21,
          "end": 164.823,
          "en": "but instead by using a regular property.",
          "zh": "而是使用一般的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.87,
          "end": 170.04,
          "en": "For that, we can add a property to that InvestmentService",
          "zh": "為此，我們可以在那個 InvestmentService 裡加一個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.04,
          "end": 173.553,
          "en": "and we could name it resultData just as before.",
          "zh": "而我們可以像之前一樣把它命名為 resultData。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 174.93,
          "end": 177.27,
          "en": "So of course then, we should also go back",
          "zh": "所以當然，我們也應該回到"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 177.27,
          "end": 180.753,
          "en": "to the AppComponent and grab this data type here.",
          "zh": "AppComponent，把這裡的這個資料型別抓過去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 182.19,
          "end": 184.89,
          "en": "And now we can and should also get rid of this signal here,",
          "zh": "而現在我們可以也應該把這裡的這個 signal 拿掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.89,
          "end": 186.72,
          "en": "of this resultsData signal,",
          "zh": "也就是這個 resultsData signal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 186.72,
          "end": 190.8,
          "en": "and get rid of all these imports which we no longer need,",
          "zh": "並移除所有我們已經不再需要的匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.8,
          "end": 192.27,
          "en": "so that the app.component",
          "zh": "這樣一來，app.component"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 192.27,
          "end": 195.213,
          "en": "or this entire file is now much leaner again.",
          "zh": "或整個檔案就又精簡多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 196.95,
          "end": 198.63,
          "en": "In the InvestmentService,",
          "zh": "在 InvestmentService 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.63,
          "end": 201.42000000000002,
          "en": "we should set the type of resultData",
          "zh": "我們應該把 resultData 的型別"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.42000000000002,
          "end": 205.35,
          "en": "to this type here, though it can initially be undefined.",
          "zh": "設成這裡的這個型別，雖然它一開始可以是 undefined。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 205.35,
          "end": 206.973,
          "en": "Hence, this question mark.",
          "zh": "所以才有這個問號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 208.26,
          "end": 211.32,
          "en": "And now of course, in this method,",
          "zh": "當然，現在在這個方法裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 211.32,
          "end": 213.87,
          "en": "in this calculateInvestmentResults method,",
          "zh": "也就是在這個 calculateInvestmentResults 方法裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 213.87,
          "end": 215.88,
          "en": "we should set this resultData",
          "zh": "我們應該把這個 resultData"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 215.88,
          "end": 218.613,
          "en": "to this annualData that is derived here.",
          "zh": "設成這裡推導出來的這個 annualData。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 220.29,
          "end": 223.11,
          "en": "So with that, we now got this method in this service",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們現在就在這個服務裡有了這個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 223.11,
          "end": 227.4,
          "en": "and we got a property which will eventually hold the result",
          "zh": "也有一個屬性，它最終會持有"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 227.4,
          "end": 230.553,
          "en": "of this method here, of this calculation.",
          "zh": "這個方法、這個計算的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 232.07999999999998,
          "end": 235.44,
          "en": "Now we can and should use this InvestmentService",
          "zh": "現在我們可以也應該使用這個 InvestmentService"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 235.44,
          "end": 238.86,
          "en": "in the files that need to interact with it,",
          "zh": "在需要與它互動的那些檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 238.86,
          "end": 242.853,
          "en": "for example, in the user-input.component TypeScript file.",
          "zh": "例如在 user-input.component 的 TypeScript 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 243.99,
          "end": 247.32,
          "en": "There, instead of setting up this output,",
          "zh": "在那裡，與其設定這個輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 247.32,
          "end": 250.59,
          "en": "which should be removed therefore, and hence, you can",
          "zh": "它應該被移除，所以你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 250.59,
          "end": 253.593,
          "en": "and should also remove this output function import,",
          "zh": "也應該移除這個 output 函式的匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 254.52,
          "end": 257.553,
          "en": "and this unneeded import.",
          "zh": "以及這個不需要的匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 258.39,
          "end": 261.03,
          "en": "Instead of using that output, we can",
          "zh": "與其使用那個輸出，我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 261.03,
          "end": 265.563,
          "en": "and should now reach out to that service here in onSubmit.",
          "zh": "也應該在這裡的 onSubmit 中去呼叫那個服務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 267.20799999999997,
          "end": 270.18,
          "en": "Therefore, of course, we must make that service available.",
          "zh": "所以當然，我們必須讓那個服務可以用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 270.18,
          "end": 272.37,
          "en": "And one way of doing that is with help",
          "zh": "而其中一種做法是藉由"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 272.37,
          "end": 275.04,
          "en": "of this constructor function,",
          "zh": "這個建構子函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 275.04,
          "end": 279.33,
          "en": "where you can inject that service with help of Angular",
          "zh": "你可以藉由 Angular 的協助注入那個服務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 279.33,
          "end": 283.05,
          "en": "by adding a parameter with any name of your choice,",
          "zh": "只要加上一個名稱隨你選的參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 283.05,
          "end": 285.927,
          "en": "for example, investmentService,",
          "zh": "例如 investmentService，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 287.58,
          "end": 291.33,
          "en": "and by setting the type two InvestmentService.",
          "zh": "並把型別設成 InvestmentService。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 291.33,
          "end": 293.793,
          "en": "So to your service class name.",
          "zh": "也就是你的服務類別名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 294.99,
          "end": 298.65,
          "en": "And for that of course, you must import this service class",
          "zh": "而當然，為此你必須匯入這個服務類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 298.65,
          "end": 301.803,
          "en": "from this investment.service TypeScript file.",
          "zh": "從這個 investment.service 的 TypeScript 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 304.59,
          "end": 308.003,
          "en": "This syntax here, this code, will tell Angular",
          "zh": "這裡的這個語法、這段程式碼，會告訴 Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 308.003,
          "end": 312.48,
          "en": "that it should inject an instance of this InvestmentService",
          "zh": "它應該注入這個 InvestmentService 的一個實例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 312.48,
          "end": 315.63,
          "en": "as a value for this InvestmentService parameter",
          "zh": "作為這個 InvestmentService 參數的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 315.63,
          "end": 318,
          "en": "into this constructor function.",
          "zh": "傳入這個建構子函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 318,
          "end": 320.94,
          "en": "And since I need access to that injected service here",
          "zh": "而因為我在這裡需要存取那個注入的服務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 320.94,
          "end": 322.74,
          "en": "in this onSubmit method,",
          "zh": "在這個 onSubmit 方法裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 322.74,
          "end": 325.2,
          "en": "we then need to store this parameter",
          "zh": "所以我們還需要把這個參數"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 325.2,
          "end": 327.87,
          "en": "in a property of this class.",
          "zh": "存成這個類別的一個屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 327.87,
          "end": 330.72,
          "en": "And you can easily do this by using a shortcut",
          "zh": "而你可以用一個簡單的捷徑輕鬆做到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 330.72,
          "end": 332.52,
          "en": "that's provided by TypeScript.",
          "zh": "這是 TypeScript 提供的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 332.52,
          "end": 335.58,
          "en": "By simply adding the public or private keyword",
          "zh": "只要在這個參數前面"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 335.58,
          "end": 337.53,
          "en": "in front of this parameter,",
          "zh": "加上 public 或 private 關鍵字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 337.53,
          "end": 341.28,
          "en": "a new property with that name will be created",
          "zh": "就會以那個名稱建立一個新的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 341.28,
          "end": 342.573,
          "en": "in this component.",
          "zh": "在這個元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 343.98,
          "end": 345.54,
          "en": "And here we can use private,",
          "zh": "而在這裡我們可以用 private，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 345.54,
          "end": 348.87,
          "en": "because I don't need to use this service anywhere else.",
          "zh": "因為我不需要在其他任何地方用到這個服務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 348.87,
          "end": 351.57,
          "en": "I don't need to access it in the template",
          "zh": "我不需要在模板中存取它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 351.57,
          "end": 352.83299999999997,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": "或類似的事情。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 354.27,
          "end": 358.08,
          "en": "So with that, a property of this name here will be created",
          "zh": "所以這樣一來，就會在這裡建立一個這個名稱的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 358.08,
          "end": 359.64,
          "en": "and added to the class",
          "zh": "並加入這個類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 359.64,
          "end": 362.103,
          "en": "and it will hold such a service instance.",
          "zh": "而它會持有那樣的一個服務實例。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 363.21,
          "end": 365.49,
          "en": "Therefore, here in onSubmit, we can",
          "zh": "所以在這裡的 onSubmit 裡，我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 365.49,
          "end": 368.97,
          "en": "and should now use this investmentService property",
          "zh": "也應該使用這個 investmentService 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 368.97,
          "end": 372.18,
          "en": "and then reach out to that service class instance",
          "zh": "然後去呼叫那個服務類別的實例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 372.18,
          "end": 373.98,
          "en": "and call calculateInvestmentResults.",
          "zh": "呼叫 calculateInvestmentResults。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 376.53,
          "end": 377.94,
          "en": "Well and now we can",
          "zh": "好，現在我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 377.94,
          "end": 380.46,
          "en": "and should pass this data object here",
          "zh": "也應該把這裡的這個資料物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 380.46,
          "end": 381.96,
          "en": "to calculateInvestmentResults.",
          "zh": "傳給 calculateInvestmentResults。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 384,
          "end": 385.65,
          "en": "And we can and should get rid",
          "zh": "而我們可以也應該移除"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 385.65,
          "end": 388.413,
          "en": "of this calculate.emit call here.",
          "zh": "這裡的這個 calculate.emit 呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 389.61,
          "end": 392.61,
          "en": "So that's how we now trigger this service method",
          "zh": "所以現在我們就是這樣觸發這個服務方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 392.61,
          "end": 394.14,
          "en": "when the form is submitted",
          "zh": "在表單被送出時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 394.14,
          "end": 396.837,
          "en": "from inside this UserInputComponent.",
          "zh": "從這個 UserInputComponent 內部觸發它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 398.7,
          "end": 402.39,
          "en": "Now we're interested in our calculation result,",
          "zh": "現在我們有興趣的是我們的計算結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 402.39,
          "end": 404.73,
          "en": "so in that resultData here",
          "zh": "也就是這裡的那個 resultData，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 404.73,
          "end": 407.67,
          "en": "in the investment-results.component.",
          "zh": "在 investment-results.component 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 407.67,
          "end": 412.353,
          "en": "So in this file we should now actually remove this input,",
          "zh": "所以在這個檔案裡，我們現在其實應該把這個輸入移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 413.22,
          "end": 416.043,
          "en": "and remove this input import,",
          "zh": "並移除這個 Input 的匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 417.33,
          "end": 420.9,
          "en": "and also inject that service here, so that we get access",
          "zh": "同時也在這裡注入那個服務，讓我們能存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 420.9,
          "end": 424.35,
          "en": "to the same service class instance that we used",
          "zh": "和我們在這個元件裡用來"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 424.35,
          "end": 427.86,
          "en": "for calculating the results here in this component",
          "zh": "計算結果的那個服務類別實例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 427.86,
          "end": 429.543,
          "en": "to get the results.",
          "zh": "以取得結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 431.19,
          "end": 433.92,
          "en": "Now we can again inject this service instance",
          "zh": "現在我們可以再次注入這個服務實例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 433.92,
          "end": 435.48,
          "en": "with help of the constructor",
          "zh": "藉由建構子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 435.48,
          "end": 438.42,
          "en": "or by using this other approach I showed you",
          "zh": "或是用我展示過的那個另一種做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 438.42,
          "end": 442.71,
          "en": "where you can add a property with any name of your choice.",
          "zh": "你可以加上一個名稱隨你選的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 442.71,
          "end": 446.01,
          "en": "And the value of that property is the result",
          "zh": "而那個屬性的值就是呼叫"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 446.01,
          "end": 450.63,
          "en": "of calling the inject function that's provided by Angular.",
          "zh": "Angular 提供的 inject 函式的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 450.63,
          "end": 455.63,
          "en": "And to inject, you pass your service class name like this.",
          "zh": "而要注入的話，就像這樣傳入你的服務類別名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 458.19,
          "end": 461.01,
          "en": "For that to work, you must import both inject",
          "zh": "要這樣運作，你必須同時匯入 inject"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 461.01,
          "end": 462.993,
          "en": "as well as your service clause.",
          "zh": "以及你的服務類別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 466.35,
          "end": 468.93,
          "en": "Now with that, we got the service available here.",
          "zh": "現在這樣一來，服務在這裡就可以用了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 468.93,
          "end": 471.57,
          "en": "Now to expose it to the template,",
          "zh": "現在要把它暴露給模板，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 471.57,
          "end": 474.63,
          "en": "or to expose the results to the template,",
          "zh": "或是把結果暴露給模板，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 474.63,
          "end": 477.663,
          "en": "we could add a getter called results.",
          "zh": "我們可以加一個叫 results 的 getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 479.46,
          "end": 480.293,
          "en": "And then here,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 480.293,
          "end": 485.09,
          "en": "simply return this InvestmentService.resultData",
          "zh": "直接回傳 this.investmentService.resultData，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 487.08,
          "end": 489.78,
          "en": "to expose that resultData from that service",
          "zh": "把那個服務的 resultData 暴露出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 489.78,
          "end": 493.14300000000003,
          "en": "through that getter to the template of this component.",
          "zh": "透過那個 getter 給這個元件的模板。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 495.51,
          "end": 498.87,
          "en": "Now in the investment-results.component.html file,",
          "zh": "現在在 investment-results.component.html 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 498.87,
          "end": 501.33,
          "en": "results is no longer a signal.",
          "zh": "results 已經不再是 signal 了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 501.33,
          "end": 504.45,
          "en": "So we need to remove those parentheses,",
          "zh": "所以我們需要移除那些括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 504.45,
          "end": 507.33299999999997,
          "en": "but other than that, it should work just as before.",
          "zh": "除此之外，其他部分應該都跟之前一樣運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 508.2,
          "end": 509.76,
          "en": "And that is indeed all.",
          "zh": "而那確實就是全部了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 509.76,
          "end": 512.55,
          "en": "That is how you could use a service",
          "zh": "這就是你如何使用服務"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 512.55,
          "end": 514.953,
          "en": "to communicate between those components.",
          "zh": "在這些元件之間傳遞訊息的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 515.79,
          "end": 518.55,
          "en": "With those changes made, you should now also go",
          "zh": "做完這些修改之後，你現在還要"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 518.55,
          "end": 520.5,
          "en": "to the AppComponent template",
          "zh": "到 AppComponent 的模板，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 520.5,
          "end": 524.163,
          "en": "and of course, get rid of this event binding here.",
          "zh": "當然把這裡的這個事件繫結移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 525.18,
          "end": 527.97,
          "en": "Since app-user-input does no longer",
          "zh": "因為 app-user-input 已經不再"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 527.97,
          "end": 532.97,
          "en": "emit this calculate event, it no longer has this output.",
          "zh": "發出這個 calculate 事件，所以它不再有這個輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 533.25,
          "end": 535.8,
          "en": "And you must get rid of this results binding,",
          "zh": "而你必須移除這個 results 繫結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 535.8,
          "end": 539.13,
          "en": "since app-investment-results, this component here,",
          "zh": "因為 app-investment-results，也就是這個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 539.13,
          "end": 541.593,
          "en": "no longer wants this input.",
          "zh": "不再需要這個輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 543.63,
          "end": 545.58,
          "en": "With that, if you save that,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果你存檔了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 545.58,
          "end": 547.95,
          "en": "and you reload the application,",
          "zh": "並重新載入應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 547.95,
          "end": 551.94,
          "en": "if you enter some input here like this",
          "zh": "如果你在這裡輸入一些資料，像這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 551.94,
          "end": 556.05,
          "en": "and you click CALCULATE, you should again see the same kind",
          "zh": "再點擊 CALCULATE，你應該又會看到同樣的"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 556.05,
          "end": 559.77,
          "en": "of results as before, but now they're generated",
          "zh": "結果，但現在它們是由"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 559.77,
          "end": 562.8,
          "en": "and sent between those components, so to say,",
          "zh": "這些元件之間產生並傳遞的，可以這麼說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 562.8,
          "end": 564.24,
          "en": "with help of a service.",
          "zh": "藉由一個服務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 564.24,
          "end": 567.96,
          "en": "And as you can tell, that led to a leaner app component",
          "zh": "而如你所見，這讓 app 元件更精簡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 567.96,
          "end": 571.08,
          "en": "and to less code in both the user-input",
          "zh": "也讓 user input"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 571.08,
          "end": 573.573,
          "en": "and the investment-results components.",
          "zh": "和 investment-results 這兩個元件的程式碼更少。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797880",
      "title": "Using Signals in Services",
      "lectureOrder": 89,
      "videoOrder": 83,
      "sourceHash": "a4cc02bcbec4bcbd89c8076b9ad40a85c7729ebb3836ceb09f739eb99a3643f4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.45,
          "end": 3.96,
          "en": "Now of course, we can also build this service",
          "zh": "當然，我們也可以改造這個服務"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.96,
          "end": 7.41,
          "en": "by using a signal in there for managing that data",
          "zh": "在其中用一個訊號（signal）來管理那份資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.41,
          "end": 9.333,
          "en": "instead of using a property.",
          "zh": "來取代使用屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.5,
          "end": 15.5,
          "en": "And you would do that by assigning a value to resultData,",
          "zh": "你會把一個值指派給 resultData，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.77,
          "end": 20.643,
          "en": "a value that will be the result of calling signal.",
          "zh": "這個值會是呼叫 signal 的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.78,
          "end": 24.03,
          "en": "And for that, of course, you must import",
          "zh": "當然，為此你必須匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.03,
          "end": 27.34,
          "en": "this signal function from Angular Core",
          "zh": "這個 signal 函式，它來自 Angular Core"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 29.28,
          "end": 31.29,
          "en": "and you must remove this question mark",
          "zh": "而且你必須把這個問號"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.29,
          "end": 33.39,
          "en": "and this type annotation here",
          "zh": "和這裡的這個型別註記"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.39,
          "end": 38.07,
          "en": "since resultData will now always hold such a signal,",
          "zh": "拿掉，因為 resultData 現在一定會持有這樣一個訊號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.07,
          "end": 40.26,
          "en": "but it will be a signal",
          "zh": "但它會是一個訊號"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.26,
          "end": 43.92,
          "en": "that holds an undefined value at the beginning",
          "zh": "在開頭時持有 undefined 值"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.92,
          "end": 46.443,
          "en": "and eventually will hold the resultData.",
          "zh": "之後才會持有該 resultData。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.88,
          "end": 50.4,
          "en": "Now, you saw before how you can set",
          "zh": "現在，你之前看過可以如何設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.4,
          "end": 55.02,
          "en": "that data appropriately here, you can add angle brackets",
          "zh": "那個資料，在這裡你可以加上角括號"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.02,
          "end": 58.89,
          "en": "and then add the type of data that will eventually be stored",
          "zh": "然後加上訊號最終會存放的資料型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 58.89,
          "end": 63.84,
          "en": "by that signal, but also optionally accept undefined",
          "zh": "也可以選擇性地接受 undefined"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 63.84,
          "end": 67.71,
          "en": "as a value since that is our starting value here.",
          "zh": "作為值，因為那是我們這裡的起始值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 67.71,
          "end": 70.56,
          "en": "So that's how we can use a signal here.",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡就可以這樣使用訊號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 70.56,
          "end": 75.56,
          "en": "With that signal added, we can go to the bottom of this",
          "zh": "加上這個訊號後，我們可以到這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 75.78,
          "end": 78.61,
          "en": "calculateInvestmentResults function here",
          "zh": "calculateInvestmentResults 函式的底部"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 79.47,
          "end": 82.86,
          "en": "and update it by calling set,",
          "zh": "並透過呼叫 set 來更新它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 82.86,
          "end": 86.463,
          "en": "though the name of the property is now resultData.",
          "zh": "不過屬性的名稱現在是 resultData。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 88.95,
          "end": 92.97,
          "en": "Now, that's all you need to do here in this service.",
          "zh": "現在，你在這個服務裡需要做的就這些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 92.97,
          "end": 94.62,
          "en": "We don't need to change anything",
          "zh": "我們不需要改動任何東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 94.62,
          "end": 96.36,
          "en": "in the user input component,",
          "zh": "在 user input 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 96.36,
          "end": 98.28,
          "en": "but we do need to change something",
          "zh": "但我們確實需要改動"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 98.28,
          "end": 101.67,
          "en": "in the investment-results component now",
          "zh": "現在的 investment-results 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 101.67,
          "end": 104.85,
          "en": "because resultData is now a signal,",
          "zh": "因為 resultData 現在是一個訊號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 104.85,
          "end": 108.21000000000001,
          "en": "so our getter here now returns a signal.",
          "zh": "所以我們的 getter 現在回傳的是一個訊號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 108.21000000000001,
          "end": 112.14,
          "en": "So in the template, we again need to execute this function",
          "zh": "所以在模板裡，我們同樣需要執行這個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 112.14,
          "end": 115.713,
          "en": "to read the signal value and set up this subscription.",
          "zh": "來讀取訊號的值並建立這個訂閱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 118.05,
          "end": 120.24,
          "en": "In addition, you could consider",
          "zh": "此外，你也可以考慮"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 120.24,
          "end": 122.34,
          "en": "changing the code here a little bit,",
          "zh": "稍微改動一下這裡的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 122.34,
          "end": 124.83,
          "en": "and instead of setting up a getter like this,",
          "zh": "不要像這樣設定 getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 124.83,
          "end": 126.72,
          "en": "which would work,",
          "zh": "雖然那樣是可行的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 126.72,
          "end": 131.55,
          "en": "you could also instead create a computed value",
          "zh": "你也可以改成建立一個 computed 值"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 131.55,
          "end": 133.95,
          "en": "by calling the computed function",
          "zh": "透過呼叫 computed 函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 133.95,
          "end": 136.263,
          "en": "that's provided by Angular Core.",
          "zh": "它是由 Angular Core 提供的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 138.48,
          "end": 140.34,
          "en": "And then to this function,",
          "zh": "然後你傳給這個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 140.34,
          "end": 144.03,
          "en": "you pass a function that returns the computed value.",
          "zh": "一個會回傳 computed 值的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 144.03,
          "end": 145.65,
          "en": "And here I wanna reach out",
          "zh": "而在這裡我要存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 145.65,
          "end": 149.55,
          "en": "to this.investmentService.resultData",
          "zh": "this.investmentService.resultData"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 149.55,
          "end": 152.463,
          "en": "and execute that since this is a signal.",
          "zh": "並執行它，因為這是一個訊號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 153.99,
          "end": 156.72,
          "en": "With that, results still returns a signal",
          "zh": "這樣一來，results 仍然回傳一個訊號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 156.72,
          "end": 158.55,
          "en": "just as it did before,",
          "zh": "就像之前一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.55,
          "end": 162.21,
          "en": "but it no longer directly returns the writeable signal",
          "zh": "但它不再直接回傳服務內部"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 162.21,
          "end": 163.95,
          "en": "from inside the service.",
          "zh": "那個可寫入的訊號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.95,
          "end": 167.49,
          "en": "But instead, a computed read-only signal.",
          "zh": "而是回傳一個 computed 的唯讀訊號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.49,
          "end": 170.43,
          "en": "And with this pattern, you therefore make sure",
          "zh": "而用這種寫法，你就能確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.43,
          "end": 173.34,
          "en": "that you don't accidentally change the data",
          "zh": "不會不小心改動"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 173.34,
          "end": 177.03,
          "en": "managed by the service from outside the service,",
          "zh": "服務內部管理的資料，從服務外部去改，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 177.03,
          "end": 179.76,
          "en": "which you could do if you were directly interacting",
          "zh": "而如果你直接操作"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.76,
          "end": 181.86,
          "en": "with the resultData.",
          "zh": "resultData，就可能發生這種事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.86,
          "end": 183.66,
          "en": "As an alternative,",
          "zh": "作為另一種選擇，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.66,
          "end": 187.89,
          "en": "you could also omit this computed function",
          "zh": "你也可以省略這個 computed 函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 187.89,
          "end": 190.05,
          "en": "and not call it,",
          "zh": "不去呼叫它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.05,
          "end": 193.2,
          "en": "and instead, you can directly store the signal",
          "zh": "而是可以直接把這個訊號"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 193.2,
          "end": 196.68,
          "en": "provided by the service in this results property,",
          "zh": "存進這個 results 屬性裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 196.68,
          "end": 199.62,
          "en": "though there's a little twist.",
          "zh": "不過有個小地方要注意。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.62,
          "end": 203.853,
          "en": "You should call asReadonly on that signal.",
          "zh": "你應該在那個訊號上呼叫 asReadonly。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 204.84,
          "end": 208.89,
          "en": "asReadonly is a method provided by Angular,",
          "zh": "asReadonly 是 Angular 提供的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 208.89,
          "end": 211.8,
          "en": "which you can call on signals",
          "zh": "你可以在訊號上呼叫它"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 211.8,
          "end": 214.86,
          "en": "to get a read-only version of those signals,",
          "zh": "以取得這些訊號的唯讀版本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 214.86,
          "end": 216.663,
          "en": "which can't be manipulated.",
          "zh": "這個版本無法被修改。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 217.71,
          "end": 220.53,
          "en": "So this is therefore simply an alternative",
          "zh": "所以這其實只是另一種"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 220.53,
          "end": 223.5,
          "en": "to using the computed function we used before.",
          "zh": "取代我們先前用的 computed 函式的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 223.5,
          "end": 226.56,
          "en": "It's up to you which approach you prefer.",
          "zh": "你偏好哪種做法由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 226.56,
          "end": 228.81,
          "en": "Here, I'll go back to computed",
          "zh": "這裡我會改回 computed"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 228.81,
          "end": 232.2,
          "en": "so that we see that function in action again as well,",
          "zh": "這樣我們也能再次看到那個函式運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 232.2,
          "end": 234.84,
          "en": "but you could also use the more concise",
          "zh": "但你也可以用我剛才提到的"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 234.84,
          "end": 237.42000000000002,
          "en": "asReadonly method I just showed you.",
          "zh": "更簡潔的 asReadonly 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 237.42000000000002,
          "end": 240.033,
          "en": "With that, if you save that and reload again,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果你儲存並再次重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 240.93,
          "end": 243.45,
          "en": "if you again enter some data,",
          "zh": "如果你再次輸入一些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 243.45,
          "end": 246.36,
          "en": "this is still calculated just as before,",
          "zh": "計算結果還是跟之前一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 246.36,
          "end": 249.513,
          "en": "but now with help of a signal in this service.",
          "zh": "但現在是靠這個服務裡的一個訊號。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797882",
      "title": "Migrating to Angular Modules",
      "lectureOrder": 90,
      "videoOrder": 84,
      "sourceHash": "079e75be7425491c038cd899730e5fd8d53c8c8668bd15ddada832939e4c6cf1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 2.73,
          "en": "Now, last but not least,",
          "zh": "最後，當然也不能少了"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.73,
          "end": 6.69,
          "en": "to conclude this section and this project,",
          "zh": "為了收尾這個單元與這個專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.69,
          "end": 8.97,
          "en": "I wanna migrate all these components",
          "zh": "我想把這些元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.97,
          "end": 11.1,
          "en": "to not be standalone components,",
          "zh": "都遷移成非 standalone 的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.1,
          "end": 15.48,
          "en": "which would be the more modern and recommended approach,",
          "zh": "雖然那才是比較現代也比較推薦的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.48,
          "end": 17.58,
          "en": "but instead, I wanna use modules",
          "zh": "但我要改用模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.58,
          "end": 21.36,
          "en": "since this is still a pattern and an approach you'll see",
          "zh": "因為這仍然是外面許多專案"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.36,
          "end": 24.093,
          "en": "in many Angular projects out there,",
          "zh": "都會看到的模式與做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.14,
          "end": 28.71,
          "en": "and converting this application to use modules",
          "zh": "而要把這個應用程式改成使用模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.71,
          "end": 32.61,
          "en": "for combining components and pipes and so on,",
          "zh": "來組合元件和 pipe 等等，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.61,
          "end": 34.59,
          "en": "instead of standalone components,",
          "zh": "而不是用 standalone 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.59,
          "end": 37.83,
          "en": "is really easy and straightforward.",
          "zh": "其實非常簡單直接。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.83,
          "end": 40.89,
          "en": "It all starts here, next to the app.component,",
          "zh": "一切都從這裡開始，也就是 app.component 旁邊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.89,
          "end": 45.63,
          "en": "where you should add a app.module.ts file.",
          "zh": "你應該在那裡新增一個 app.module.ts 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.63,
          "end": 50,
          "en": "In that file, you then should create a class, AppModule,",
          "zh": "在那個檔案中，你要建立一個 AppModule 類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.12,
          "end": 55.29,
          "en": "and decorate that class with the NgModule decorator,",
          "zh": "並用 NgModule 裝飾器裝飾那個類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.29,
          "end": 58.053,
          "en": "which is imported from @angular/core.",
          "zh": "它是從 @angular/core 匯入的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.04,
          "end": 62.07,
          "en": "This decorator then takes a configuration object,",
          "zh": "這個裝飾器會接收一個設定物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.07,
          "end": 65.58,
          "en": "where you, for example, should add a declarations array,",
          "zh": "例如你應該在裡面加上一個 declarations 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.58,
          "end": 68.64,
          "en": "where you will declare all the components",
          "zh": "在其中宣告所有元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.64,
          "end": 72.15,
          "en": "and other features that need to work together here.",
          "zh": "以及其他需要在這裡一起運作的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.15,
          "end": 74.98,
          "en": "For example, here you should add the AppComponent",
          "zh": "例如在這裡你要加上 AppComponent"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.9,
          "end": 78.303,
          "en": "and also add the import here,",
          "zh": "並在這裡加上匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.74,
          "end": 82.263,
          "en": "but also the HeaderComponent,",
          "zh": "還有 HeaderComponent，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.61,
          "end": 86.78999999999999,
          "en": "the UserInputComponent,",
          "zh": "UserInputComponent，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.78999999999999,
          "end": 88.53999999999999,
          "en": "and the InvestmentResultsComponent.",
          "zh": "以及 InvestmentResultsComponent。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.08,
          "end": 93.84,
          "en": "Now, of course, right now, I'm getting a bunch of errors",
          "zh": "當然，現在我這邊出現了一堆錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.84,
          "end": 96.33,
          "en": "because these are all standalone components",
          "zh": "因為這些全都是 standalone 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 96.33,
          "end": 99.6,
          "en": "and therefore can't be added to NgModules,",
          "zh": "所以不能被加到 NgModule 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.6,
          "end": 102.42,
          "en": "but I'll change this now, and I'll start",
          "zh": "但我現在要來改掉，先從"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.42,
          "end": 106.083,
          "en": "with the app.component and remove standalone: true here.",
          "zh": "app.component 開始，把這裡的 standalone: true 移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.00999999999999,
          "end": 109.8,
          "en": "You then also need to remove this imports array,",
          "zh": "接著你還需要把這個 imports 陣列移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.8,
          "end": 112.71000000000001,
          "en": "which is what I'll do here, which also means",
          "zh": "我在這裡就是這麼做，這也表示"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.71000000000001,
          "end": 115.32,
          "en": "that you can and should remove all these imports",
          "zh": "你可以也應該把這裡上方"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.32,
          "end": 116.82,
          "en": "at the top here.",
          "zh": "所有這些匯入都移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.82,
          "end": 120.21,
          "en": "Next up, we can continue to the header.component",
          "zh": "接著我們可以繼續處理 header.component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.21,
          "end": 124.41,
          "en": "and also remove standalone and the imports array here.",
          "zh": "同樣把這裡的 standalone 和 imports 陣列移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.41,
          "end": 127.05,
          "en": "We can then move on to the user-input.component",
          "zh": "接著可以移到 user-input.component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.05,
          "end": 131.13,
          "en": "and do the same, remove standalone, remove this import,",
          "zh": "做同樣的事，移除 standalone，移除這個匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.13,
          "end": 134.1,
          "en": "but, since I'm importing the FormsModule here,",
          "zh": "不過因為我在這裡匯入了 FormsModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.1,
          "end": 137.583,
          "en": "we'll need to make sure that we add this to our NgModule.",
          "zh": "我們必須確認要把它加到 NgModule 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.35,
          "end": 142.8,
          "en": "So back in the app.module, which we just added,",
          "zh": "所以回到剛剛新增的 app.module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 142.8,
          "end": 145.62,
          "en": "we should add an imports array here",
          "zh": "我們應該在這裡加上一個 imports 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 145.62,
          "end": 148.423,
          "en": "and import that FormsModule,",
          "zh": "並匯入那個 FormsModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 149.73,
          "end": 152.853,
          "en": "which is imported from angular/forms.",
          "zh": "它是從 @angular/forms 匯入的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.29,
          "end": 158.1,
          "en": "We must add it here so that these components have access",
          "zh": "我們必須在這裡加上它，這樣這些元件才能存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.1,
          "end": 160.82999999999998,
          "en": "to the features provided by that FormsModule,",
          "zh": "FormsModule 所提供的功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.82999999999998,
          "end": 164.553,
          "en": "like the ngModel directive or this ngSubmit event.",
          "zh": "例如 ngModel 指令或這個 ngSubmit 事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 165.72,
          "end": 167.76,
          "en": "Now, with that, we can proceed",
          "zh": "接著這樣我們就可以進行"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.76,
          "end": 171.94,
          "en": "to the investment-results.component file",
          "zh": "到 investment-results.component 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 173.25,
          "end": 175.71,
          "en": "and also remove standalone: true here,",
          "zh": "同樣把這裡的 standalone: true 移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.71,
          "end": 178.2,
          "en": "and also remove the imports array here,",
          "zh": "並把這裡的 imports 陣列也移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 178.2,
          "end": 181.89,
          "en": "though, again, here I'm importing the CurrencyPipe,",
          "zh": "不過同樣地，我在這裡匯入了 CurrencyPipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 181.89,
          "end": 186.42,
          "en": "so we must make that available through the AppModule now.",
          "zh": "所以現在必須透過 AppModule 讓它可用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 186.42,
          "end": 188.58,
          "en": "But first, let's remove it here.",
          "zh": "但首先，讓我們在這裡把它移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 188.58,
          "end": 193.58,
          "en": "Let's also remove this import, and in the AppModule,",
          "zh": "我們也把這個匯入移除，然後在 AppModule 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 194.61,
          "end": 197.61,
          "en": "we now don't add the CurrencyPipe here,",
          "zh": "現在不在這裡加入 CurrencyPipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 197.61,
          "end": 199.503,
          "en": "but instead, the BrowserModule.",
          "zh": "而是加入 BrowserModule。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 201.42000000000002,
          "end": 205.29,
          "en": "This module will actually include the CurrencyPipe.",
          "zh": "這個模組其實會包含 CurrencyPipe。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 205.29,
          "end": 207.27,
          "en": "The exact position, by the way, doesn't matter,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，確切的位置並不重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 207.27,
          "end": 210,
          "en": "but I'll still add it in front of the FormsModule",
          "zh": "但我還是會把它加在 FormsModule 前面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 210,
          "end": 211.71,
          "en": "since you'll often see it there,",
          "zh": "因為你經常會在那裡看到它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 211.71,
          "end": 215.76,
          "en": "because this is a special module that exposes some features",
          "zh": "因為這是一個特殊的模組，它公開了一些功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 215.76,
          "end": 218.76,
          "en": "that are oft needed, like all those pipes,",
          "zh": "而這些功能經常會用到，例如所有的那些 pipe，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 218.76,
          "end": 223.56,
          "en": "but also the NgIf and NgFor directives, for example.",
          "zh": "還有像 NgIf 和 NgFor 這些指令。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 223.56,
          "end": 226.65,
          "en": "And in general, you must import this module",
          "zh": "一般而言，你必須匯入這個模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 226.65,
          "end": 230.52,
          "en": "and make it available when declaring your root module,",
          "zh": "並在宣告根模組時讓它可用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.52,
          "end": 231.993,
          "en": "like we're doing it here.",
          "zh": "就像我們在這裡做的一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 233.46,
          "end": 235.86,
          "en": "So that is also something that must be imported",
          "zh": "所以那也是必須匯入的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.86,
          "end": 239.673,
          "en": "into this file and then be added to this imports array.",
          "zh": "匯入到這個檔案，然後加到這個 imports 陣列中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 241.83,
          "end": 244.14,
          "en": "With that, we're almost done,",
          "zh": "做到這裡，我們幾乎完成了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 244.14,
          "end": 248.4,
          "en": "but since this is the root module of this application,",
          "zh": "但因為這是這個應用程式的根模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 248.4,
          "end": 252.15,
          "en": "we also must add the bootstrap property here",
          "zh": "我們還必須在這裡加上 bootstrap 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 252.15,
          "end": 254.37,
          "en": "to this configuration object,",
          "zh": "也就是加到這個設定物件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 254.37,
          "end": 258.66,
          "en": "and then define all the root components of this application.",
          "zh": "然後定義這個應用程式所有的根元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 258.66,
          "end": 261.72,
          "en": "And in this case, like in most applications,",
          "zh": "而在這個例子中，就像在多數應用程式裡一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 261.72,
          "end": 265.637,
          "en": "we only have one, which is our AppComponent,",
          "zh": "我們只有一個，也就是我們的 AppComponent，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 265.637,
          "end": 267.93,
          "en": "but this is an important step.",
          "zh": "但這是很重要的一步。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 267.93,
          "end": 271.05,
          "en": "Now, with that done, as a last step,",
          "zh": "現在完成這些，作為最後一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 271.05,
          "end": 275.13,
          "en": "we also need to go to the main.ts file and change this code",
          "zh": "我們還要去 main.ts 檔案修改這段程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 275.13,
          "end": 278.253,
          "en": "that starts the application, so to say.",
          "zh": "也就是啟動應用程式的那段。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 279.24,
          "end": 283.40999999999997,
          "en": "Instead of bootstrapping a specific component,",
          "zh": "不再是啟動某個特定的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 283.40999999999997,
          "end": 288.153,
          "en": "we now need to call the platformBrowserDynamic function,",
          "zh": "現在我們需要呼叫 platformBrowserDynamic 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 289.05,
          "end": 294.05,
          "en": "which is imported from @angular/platform-browser-dynamic,",
          "zh": "它是從 @angular/platform-browser-dynamic 匯入的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 295.53,
          "end": 298.56,
          "en": "and get rid of that bootstrapApplication import.",
          "zh": "並移除那個 bootstrapApplication 的匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 298.56,
          "end": 300.9,
          "en": "And that function then returns an object,",
          "zh": "而那個函式會回傳一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 300.9,
          "end": 304.35,
          "en": "which has a bootstrapModule method, which you must execute",
          "zh": "上面有一個 bootstrapModule 方法，你必須執行它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 304.35,
          "end": 306.96,
          "en": "and pass the AppModule identifier,",
          "zh": "並傳入 AppModule 這個識別名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 306.96,
          "end": 308.52,
          "en": "so the name of that module,",
          "zh": "也就是那個模組的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 308.52,
          "end": 312.153,
          "en": "which you must import to bootstrapModule.",
          "zh": "你必須把它匯入才能傳給 bootstrapModule。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 313.35,
          "end": 315.93,
          "en": "That's how you start an Angular application",
          "zh": "這就是在 Angular 應用程式中"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 315.93,
          "end": 319.443,
          "en": "that uses modules instead of standalone components.",
          "zh": "使用模組而非 standalone 元件時啟動應用的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 321.03,
          "end": 323.49,
          "en": "And with that, we added to this root module,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就把這些加到了這個根模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 323.49,
          "end": 326.88,
          "en": "which registers all those components.",
          "zh": "由它註冊所有那些元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 326.88,
          "end": 328.35,
          "en": "Now, as you learned,",
          "zh": "現在，如你所學到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 328.35,
          "end": 332.34000000000003,
          "en": "you could actually also register multiple modules",
          "zh": "你其實也可以註冊多個模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 332.34000000000003,
          "end": 336.153,
          "en": "and split up your application into multiple modules.",
          "zh": "並把你的應用程式拆成多個模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 336.99,
          "end": 340.40999999999997,
          "en": "For example, just to show you again how that would work,",
          "zh": "例如為了再次說明這要怎麼運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 340.40999999999997,
          "end": 342.69,
          "en": "we could create a separate module",
          "zh": "我們可以為 UserInputComponent 另建一個模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 342.69,
          "end": 344.4,
          "en": "for the UserInputComponent,",
          "zh": "也就是為它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 344.4,
          "end": 347.67,
          "en": "even though here it doesn't make too much sense,",
          "zh": "雖然在這個例子中這樣做沒太大意義，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 347.67,
          "end": 351.36,
          "en": "but we could add a user-input.module.ts file",
          "zh": "但我們可以在 user-input 資料夾中"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 351.36,
          "end": 354.33,
          "en": "in the user-input folder, and then in there,",
          "zh": "新增一個 user-input.module.ts 檔案，然後在裡面"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 354.33,
          "end": 358.74,
          "en": "export our UserInputModule class,",
          "zh": "匯出我們的 UserInputModule 類別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 358.74,
          "end": 363.153,
          "en": "which must be decorated with NgModule, of course.",
          "zh": "當然它必須用 NgModule 裝飾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 364.89,
          "end": 369.447,
          "en": "And now here, we declare just this UserInputComponent,",
          "zh": "而現在在這裡，我們只宣告這個 UserInputComponent，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 370.394,
          "end": 372.15,
          "en": "because that's the only component we need here",
          "zh": "因為這裡唯一需要的元件就是它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 372.15,
          "end": 374.883,
          "en": "for this module and for this component to work.",
          "zh": "讓這個模組與這個元件能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 375.84,
          "end": 377.61,
          "en": "And we add the imports array",
          "zh": "然後我們加上 imports 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 377.61,
          "end": 379.693,
          "en": "where we import the FormsModule.",
          "zh": "在其中匯入 FormsModule。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 380.85,
          "end": 382.98,
          "en": "Now, back in the AppModule,",
          "zh": "接著回到 AppModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 382.98,
          "end": 387.31,
          "en": "you would remove the UserInputComponent from declarations",
          "zh": "你要把 UserInputComponent 從 declarations 中移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 388.26,
          "end": 391.803,
          "en": "and also remove its import here at the top.",
          "zh": "並把上方這裡的匯入也移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 393.12,
          "end": 395.49,
          "en": "And since it was the only component",
          "zh": "而既然它是唯一一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 395.49,
          "end": 399.42,
          "en": "that needed the FormsModule, that would be removed as well,",
          "zh": "需要 FormsModule 的元件，那 FormsModule 也要一起移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 399.42,
          "end": 402.18,
          "en": "but on the other hand, you would now add",
          "zh": "但另一方面，你現在要加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 402.18,
          "end": 407.18,
          "en": "this UserInputModule here, so that the things declared",
          "zh": "這個 UserInputModule，讓該模組所宣告的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 407.58,
          "end": 411.87,
          "en": "by that module, like the UserInputComponent, are available",
          "zh": "例如 UserInputComponent，可以再次"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 411.87,
          "end": 414.423,
          "en": "to the AppComponent again, for example.",
          "zh": "被 AppComponent 使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 415.92,
          "end": 418.35,
          "en": "That now allows us to get rid of the FormsModule,",
          "zh": "這樣我們就能把 FormsModule 拿掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 418.35,
          "end": 420.96,
          "en": "and that is how you could split your application",
          "zh": "而這就是你把應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 420.96,
          "end": 424.68,
          "en": "across multiple modules and organize your components",
          "zh": "拆成多個模組，並組織你的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 424.68,
          "end": 428.313,
          "en": "and their dependencies across multiple modules.",
          "zh": "以及把它們的相依項目分散到多個模組中的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 429.75,
          "end": 432.57,
          "en": "Now, if you were to leave it like this,",
          "zh": "現在，如果你就這樣放著，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 432.57,
          "end": 436.86,
          "en": "you should be greeted by an error in your terminal, though,",
          "zh": "你的終端機上應該會出現一個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 436.86,
          "end": 441.27,
          "en": "where you ran npm start, that the app-user-input component",
          "zh": "也就是你執行 npm start 的那個地方，說 app-user-input 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 441.27,
          "end": 443.103,
          "en": "is actually not recognized,",
          "zh": "其實並不被辨識，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 444.33,
          "end": 446.82,
          "en": "because if you are splitting your application",
          "zh": "因為如果你把應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 446.82,
          "end": 451.44,
          "en": "across multiple modules, then the nested modules,",
          "zh": "拆成多個模組，那麼這些巢狀的模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 451.44,
          "end": 454.26,
          "en": "so to say, like this UserInputModule here,",
          "zh": "可以說像這裡的 UserInputModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 454.26,
          "end": 457.68,
          "en": "actually also need to export anything",
          "zh": "其實也必須匯出"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 457.68,
          "end": 462.68,
          "en": "that should be available in modules that import this module.",
          "zh": "那些應該在匯入這個模組的模組中可用的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 463.26,
          "end": 465.82,
          "en": "So here, we need to export this UserInputComponent",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我們必須匯出這個 UserInputComponent，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 466.98,
          "end": 469.62,
          "en": "to make it available to the AppModule,",
          "zh": "讓它對 AppModule 可用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 469.62,
          "end": 473.13,
          "en": "and therefore, to all the components that are registered",
          "zh": "因此對所有由"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 473.13,
          "end": 474.483,
          "en": "by the AppModule.",
          "zh": "AppModule 註冊的元件也都可用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 475.53,
          "end": 478.98,
          "en": "With this added here, if you save this,",
          "zh": "在這裡加上這些之後，如果你存檔，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 478.98,
          "end": 480.6,
          "en": "the error should go away,",
          "zh": "那個錯誤應該就會消失，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 480.6,
          "end": 483.42,
          "en": "and the application should again work in the same way",
          "zh": "而應用程式應該又會像之前一樣運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 483.42,
          "end": 486.273,
          "en": "as before, but now using modules.",
          "zh": "但現在是使用模組。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43797884",
      "title": "Module Summary",
      "lectureOrder": 91,
      "videoOrder": 85,
      "sourceHash": "4b0c0ce6b072bfa4ae68791dd401d0c55bcf802cc54b7c86ef6a9b88444901f0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.6,
          "end": 4.92,
          "en": "And that's now it for this application.",
          "zh": "這個應用程式就做到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.92,
          "end": 6.84,
          "en": "In this section",
          "zh": "在這個章節中"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.84,
          "end": 11.31,
          "en": "and this demo application, which we built here, we used many",
          "zh": "以及我們在這裡建立的這個示範應用程式，我們用到了許多"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.31,
          "end": 15.18,
          "en": "of these crucial essential Angular features you learned",
          "zh": "你之前在這門課中學到的"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.18,
          "end": 18.33,
          "en": "about earlier in this course.",
          "zh": "這些重要的核心 Angular 功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.33,
          "end": 21.84,
          "en": "And of course, we'll use all these essentials again",
          "zh": "當然，我們會在接下來的課程中"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.84,
          "end": 24.09,
          "en": "and again throughout the rest of this course.",
          "zh": "一次又一次地用到這些核心觀念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.09,
          "end": 27.84,
          "en": "So if something's not 100% clear yet,",
          "zh": "所以如果有些地方你還不是 100% 清楚，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.84,
          "end": 29.64,
          "en": "that's no problem at all.",
          "zh": "完全沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.64,
          "end": 33.18,
          "en": "You'll get plenty of additional opportunities to practice",
          "zh": "你會有很多額外的機會去練習"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.18,
          "end": 35.853,
          "en": "what you learned throughout the rest of this course.",
          "zh": "你在接下來課程中學到的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.75,
          "end": 39.84,
          "en": "Still, these are some important essentials and",
          "zh": "不過，這些畢竟還是重要的核心，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.84,
          "end": 42.93,
          "en": "therefore, if something's not 100% clear,",
          "zh": "所以如果有哪裡不是 100% 清楚，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.93,
          "end": 46.32,
          "en": "you also might want to consider revisiting the lectures",
          "zh": "你也可以考慮回頭複習那些講解的章節，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.32,
          "end": 50.58,
          "en": "where those concepts were introduced in the earlier sections",
          "zh": "也就是前面章節中介紹這些觀念的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.58,
          "end": 54.69,
          "en": "so that you are well prepared to dive deeper into Angular,",
          "zh": "這樣你就能做好準備，更深入探索 Angular，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.69,
          "end": 56.61,
          "en": "because that is what we'll do next.",
          "zh": "因為那就是我們接下來要做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.61,
          "end": 60.3,
          "en": "We'll dive deeper into Angular, into more advanced concepts,",
          "zh": "我們會更深入探索 Angular，探索更進階的觀念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.3,
          "end": 62.61,
          "en": "and therefore you'll get more opportunities",
          "zh": "所以你也會有更多機會"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.61,
          "end": 64.35,
          "en": "to practice what you learned.",
          "zh": "去練習你學到的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.35,
          "end": 66.87,
          "en": "But if something's totally unclear,",
          "zh": "但如果某個地方完全搞不懂，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.87,
          "end": 70.05,
          "en": "you should definitely revisit that concept first",
          "zh": "你絕對應該先把那個觀念重新看一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.05,
          "end": 71.253,
          "en": "before you continue.",
          "zh": "再繼續往下。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43798068",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "lectureOrder": 92,
      "videoOrder": 86,
      "sourceHash": "a6663c13f65a8cd40b94b929c7d64d0bf60eaf849874856bc81ab2f1c9cafc3b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.69,
          "end": 3,
          "en": "As you are working with Angular,",
          "zh": "當你在使用 Angular 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3,
          "end": 4.38,
          "en": "you will, of course,",
          "zh": "你當然會"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.38,
          "end": 7.89,
          "en": "also from time to time encounter errors",
          "zh": "不時遇到錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.89,
          "end": 10.62,
          "en": "and therefore you need to know how to debug",
          "zh": "所以你需要知道如何除錯"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.62,
          "end": 12.42,
          "en": "your Angular applications",
          "zh": "你的 Angular 應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.42,
          "end": 14.64,
          "en": "and how to fix those errors.",
          "zh": "以及如何修正那些錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.64,
          "end": 17.76,
          "en": "And that's exactly what we'll take a look at in this section",
          "zh": "而這正是我們在這個章節要看的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.76,
          "end": 19.5,
          "en": "because we'll explore",
          "zh": "我們會探索"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.5,
          "end": 23.1,
          "en": "how you can make sense of error messages,",
          "zh": "如何理解錯誤訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.1,
          "end": 24.87,
          "en": "Angular might throw at you,",
          "zh": "也就是 Angular 丟給你的那些訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.87,
          "end": 27.78,
          "en": "and how you can fix the underlying errors",
          "zh": "以及如何借助這些訊息"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.78,
          "end": 30.87,
          "en": "with help of those messages.",
          "zh": "修正背後真正的錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.87,
          "end": 35.1,
          "en": "You will also learn how you can debug logical errors,",
          "zh": "你也會學到如何對邏輯錯誤進行除錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.1,
          "end": 38.16,
          "en": "so errors in your code, bugs in your code",
          "zh": "也就是你程式碼中的錯誤、程式碼中的 bug，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.16,
          "end": 41.19,
          "en": "that might not actually cause an error message,",
          "zh": "它們可能不會真的產生錯誤訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.19,
          "end": 44.19,
          "en": "but that still produce wrong results.",
          "zh": "但仍會導致錯誤的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.19,
          "end": 47.73,
          "en": "And we'll take a look at the Angular developer tools,",
          "zh": "我們也會看一下 Angular 的開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.73,
          "end": 48.66,
          "en": "what that is,",
          "zh": "那是什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.66,
          "end": 52.62,
          "en": "and why that might be a useful addition to your tool belt.",
          "zh": "以及為什麼它可能是你工具箱中很有用的一項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.62,
          "end": 54.72,
          "en": "Now for this section,",
          "zh": "現在，為了這個章節，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.72,
          "end": 57.96,
          "en": "I prepared a brand new starting project",
          "zh": "我準備了一個全新的起始專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.96,
          "end": 59.76,
          "en": "and it's essentially,",
          "zh": "它基本上就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.76,
          "end": 63.12,
          "en": "the finished project from the previous section,",
          "zh": "上一個章節完成的那個專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.12,
          "end": 68.12,
          "en": "but I added some minor errors to it.",
          "zh": "但我在裡面加了一些小錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.16,
          "end": 71.4,
          "en": "So you should use the attached starting project.",
          "zh": "所以你應該使用附上的起始專案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.4,
          "end": 72.93,
          "en": "Then once you downloaded it,",
          "zh": "下載之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.93,
          "end": 74.88,
          "en": "run npm install once",
          "zh": "執行一次 npm install，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.88,
          "end": 77.85,
          "en": "so that you have all those dependencies installed",
          "zh": "讓所有相依套件都安裝好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 77.85,
          "end": 81.633,
          "en": "and then npm start to bring up that development server,",
          "zh": "然後執行 npm start 啟動開發伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.77,
          "end": 84.42,
          "en": "or at least you can try",
          "zh": "或者至少你可以試試看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.42,
          "end": 87.57,
          "en": "because you will be greeted by an error message",
          "zh": "因為你會看到一個錯誤訊息"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.57,
          "end": 88.92,
          "en": "when you try to do that,",
          "zh": "在你嘗試這麼做的時候，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.92,
          "end": 91.65,
          "en": "and that's then what we'll start with.",
          "zh": "而那就是我們的起點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 91.65,
          "end": 93.6,
          "en": "We'll take a look at that error message,",
          "zh": "我們會看一下那個錯誤訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.6,
          "end": 95.19,
          "en": "we'll try to understand it,",
          "zh": "試著理解它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.19,
          "end": 97.35,
          "en": "and we'll, most importantly,",
          "zh": "最重要的是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.35,
          "end": 100.173,
          "en": "try to fix the underlying error.",
          "zh": "我們會試著修正背後真正的錯誤。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43798070",
      "title": "Understanding Error Messages & Fixing Errors",
      "lectureOrder": 93,
      "videoOrder": 87,
      "sourceHash": "f891501725ec5fd6853fd7d1118ec35eb6354173f00a9d63b3686b8d2d422a84",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 3.27,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmuller] So we got an error message here",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡看到一則錯誤訊息"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.27,
          "end": 6.933,
          "en": "in the terminal when we try to start this project.",
          "zh": "在我們嘗試啟動這個專案的終端機裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.77,
          "end": 11.16,
          "en": "And most Angular error messages",
          "zh": "而大多數 Angular 的錯誤訊息"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.16,
          "end": 16.16,
          "en": "are thankfully pretty helpful and often easy to understand.",
          "zh": "幸運的是都相當有幫助，也通常容易理解。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.34,
          "end": 21.87,
          "en": "For example here, the error message is that this type here,",
          "zh": "例如在這裡，錯誤訊息是這個型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.87,
          "end": 26.87,
          "en": "this object type is not assignable to type string.",
          "zh": "這個物件型別無法指派給 string 型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 27.21,
          "end": 31.14,
          "en": "So I'm trying to use a value that has this shape,",
          "zh": "所以我是在一個需要字串值的地方"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 31.14,
          "end": 36.14,
          "en": "this type in a place where a string value is expected.",
          "zh": "使用了具有這種形狀的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 36.27,
          "end": 39.213,
          "en": "That's the error message here in this case,",
          "zh": "這就是這裡的錯誤訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 40.05,
          "end": 42.27,
          "en": "but it actually doesn't stop there.",
          "zh": "但它其實不只這些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 42.27,
          "end": 45.78,
          "en": "Pretty much all Angular error messages",
          "zh": "幾乎所有 Angular 的錯誤訊息"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 45.78,
          "end": 49.47,
          "en": "then also try to show you the code",
          "zh": "都會試著向你顯示"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 49.47,
          "end": 51.54,
          "en": "that's causing the problem.",
          "zh": "造成問題的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 51.54,
          "end": 54.48,
          "en": "So here we learn that the problem stems",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們得知問題源自"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 54.48,
          "end": 59.053,
          "en": "from the app component, HTML file, and there line 13,",
          "zh": "app component 的 HTML 檔案，第 13 行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 60.81,
          "end": 63.63,
          "en": "this part here is the column, you can ignore that,",
          "zh": "這裡這部分是欄位，你可以忽略，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 63.63,
          "end": 65.98,
          "en": "but the line number is often helpful",
          "zh": "但行號通常很有幫助，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 67.32,
          "end": 71.07,
          "en": "and it even shows us the problematic line of code",
          "zh": "它甚至會向我們顯示有問題的那一行程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 71.07,
          "end": 75.99,
          "en": "and highlights the part that's causing this error.",
          "zh": "並強調造成這個錯誤的部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 75.99,
          "end": 79.38,
          "en": "So it looks like it's this property assignment,",
          "zh": "所以看起來是這個屬性賦值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 79.38,
          "end": 81.3,
          "en": "this input assignment here",
          "zh": "也就是這裡這個 input 賦值"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 81.3,
          "end": 84.39,
          "en": "that's causing this error message.",
          "zh": "造成了這個錯誤訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 84.39,
          "end": 88.14,
          "en": "And that's therefore always how you should analyze",
          "zh": "所以你都應該用這種方式來分析"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 88.14,
          "end": 89.55,
          "en": "those error messages.",
          "zh": "這些錯誤訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 89.55,
          "end": 91.77,
          "en": "Don't panic if you get one.",
          "zh": "如果看到錯誤訊息，不要慌張。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 91.77,
          "end": 95.25,
          "en": "Don't stop developing and ask for help,",
          "zh": "不要停下開發去求助，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 95.25,
          "end": 99.63,
          "en": "instead take a look at the error message because chances are",
          "zh": "而是去看一下錯誤訊息，因為很有可能"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 99.63,
          "end": 102.63,
          "en": "that it will actually explain pretty well",
          "zh": "它其實會解釋得相當清楚"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 102.63,
          "end": 105.42,
          "en": "what the problem is and you can therefore",
          "zh": "問題是什麼，因此你就能"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 105.42,
          "end": 109.59,
          "en": "also often easily find a fix for the problem.",
          "zh": "也常常能輕易找到解決問題的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 109.59,
          "end": 114.45,
          "en": "So here the fix is to make sure that we pass a string value",
          "zh": "所以在這裡的修正方式就是確保我們傳入字串值"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 114.45,
          "end": 116.61,
          "en": "to that user ID property",
          "zh": "給那個 userId 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 116.61,
          "end": 119.88,
          "en": "instead of the entire selected user object",
          "zh": "而不是整個被選取的使用者物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 119.88,
          "end": 122.43,
          "en": "because it needs a string value here",
          "zh": "因為它在這裡需要的是字串值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 122.43,
          "end": 124.53,
          "en": "and we are passing an object right now",
          "zh": "而我們現在傳入的是一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 124.53,
          "end": 126.6,
          "en": "and clearly that's not right.",
          "zh": "顯然那是不對的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 126.6,
          "end": 128.19,
          "en": "So to fix this error,",
          "zh": "所以要修正這個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.19,
          "end": 131.73,
          "en": "we can go to this app component HTML file.",
          "zh": "我們可以到這個 app component 的 HTML 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 131.73,
          "end": 134.8,
          "en": "And then there I actually also get a hint in my IDE",
          "zh": "然後在那裡我的 IDE 其實也會給我提示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.99,
          "end": 139.65,
          "en": "because that's also pretty good about Angular",
          "zh": "因為多數 IDE 對 Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 139.65,
          "end": 143.61,
          "en": "and the IDE support offered for Angular",
          "zh": "以及 Angular 所提供的 IDE 支援"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 143.61,
          "end": 144.663,
          "en": "by most IDEs.",
          "zh": "也做得相當不錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 145.71,
          "end": 147.69,
          "en": "For example, Visual Studio code",
          "zh": "例如 Visual Studio Code，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.69,
          "end": 151.32,
          "en": "with the Angular language server extension installed",
          "zh": "安裝了 Angular language server 擴充套件之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.32,
          "end": 156.32,
          "en": "will catch and highlight many errors right here in your code",
          "zh": "就能在你的程式碼裡直接"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 156.32999999999998,
          "end": 158.94,
          "en": "before you even try to run it.",
          "zh": "在你執行之前就先偵測並標示出許多錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.94,
          "end": 162,
          "en": "So here we could have identified this problem",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們其實可以先辨認出這個問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 162,
          "end": 164.04,
          "en": "even without running the code",
          "zh": "甚至不必執行程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 164.04,
          "end": 166.62,
          "en": "just by going through our code files",
          "zh": "只要走過我們的程式碼檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.62,
          "end": 169.41,
          "en": "or at the point of time where we write this code,",
          "zh": "或是在撰寫這段程式碼的當下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.41,
          "end": 172.07999999999998,
          "en": "we could have seen immediately that something's wrong",
          "zh": "我們就能立刻看出有地方不對，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.07999999999998,
          "end": 174.753,
          "en": "because we got these red squiggly lines here.",
          "zh": "因為這裡有這些紅色波浪線。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175.89,
          "end": 178.23,
          "en": "And you can then also always hover over",
          "zh": "而且你隨時都可以把滑鼠停在"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.23,
          "end": 181.17,
          "en": "those red squiggly lines in your IDE",
          "zh": "IDE 中的那些紅色波浪線上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.17,
          "end": 183.6,
          "en": "to get an error message here as well.",
          "zh": "在這裡也會看到錯誤訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.6,
          "end": 187.23,
          "en": "And it's of course the same error message in the end here",
          "zh": "當然這裡最後看到的還是同一個錯誤訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 187.23,
          "end": 189.69,
          "en": "that we're passing a value of this shape",
          "zh": "也就是我們把具有這種形狀的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 189.69,
          "end": 192.693,
          "en": "in a place where a string value is expected.",
          "zh": "傳到需要字串值的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 193.89,
          "end": 195.63,
          "en": "And of course here the fix then is",
          "zh": "當然這裡的修正方式就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 195.63,
          "end": 200.4,
          "en": "to actually access the ID property on selected user,",
          "zh": "實際上去存取 selectedUser 的 id 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.4,
          "end": 203.04,
          "en": "which then gives us a string value",
          "zh": "那樣就會給我們一個字串值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 203.04,
          "end": 207.18,
          "en": "because it is that ID, that string ID that should be passed",
          "zh": "因為那個 ID，也就是那個字串 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 207.18,
          "end": 210.78300000000002,
          "en": "as a value for this user ID property here.",
          "zh": "才應該作為這裡這個 userId 屬性的值傳入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 211.65,
          "end": 213.42000000000002,
          "en": "And that's how we can fix this error.",
          "zh": "這就是我們修正這個錯誤的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 213.42000000000002,
          "end": 215.13,
          "en": "But even more importantly,",
          "zh": "但更重要的是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 215.13,
          "end": 218.31,
          "en": "that's how you can analyze those error messages",
          "zh": "這就是你分析那些錯誤訊息的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 218.31,
          "end": 221.25,
          "en": "and how you can see them either in the terminal",
          "zh": "以及你可以選擇在終端機"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 221.25,
          "end": 225.003,
          "en": "or in the IDE and both of course can be helpful.",
          "zh": "或 IDE 中看到它們，兩者當然都有幫助。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43798078",
      "title": "Debugging Logical Errors with the Browser DevTools & Breakpoints",
      "lectureOrder": 94,
      "videoOrder": 88,
      "sourceHash": "89093545c055fe40754ec4aecb0d8a97a9f1235cf7195beb547d59adaa74ca1b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.84,
          "end": 3.99,
          "en": "So now that we fixed this error,",
          "zh": "好，現在我們修好了這個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.99,
          "end": 7.77,
          "en": "there still is an error left in this program",
          "zh": "這個程式裡還是留下一個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.77,
          "end": 9.75,
          "en": "even though you now shouldn't get",
          "zh": "雖然你現在不應該再看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.75,
          "end": 11.82,
          "en": "any error messages anymore.",
          "zh": "任何錯誤訊息了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.82,
          "end": 14.88,
          "en": "The app should load without errors now.",
          "zh": "應用程式現在應該能無錯誤地載入了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.88,
          "end": 17.91,
          "en": "But as mentioned, there still is a problem",
          "zh": "但如先前提到的，這個程式還是有問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.91,
          "end": 20.58,
          "en": "with this program here.",
          "zh": "就是這裡的這個程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.58,
          "end": 25.58,
          "en": "If we try to add a new task, doesn't matter what you enter.",
          "zh": "如果我們試著新增一個任務，不管你輸入什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.95,
          "end": 27.54,
          "en": "So if you enter some data here",
          "zh": "所以如果你在這裡輸入一些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.54,
          "end": 31.26,
          "en": "and you click Create, that all works",
          "zh": "再點擊 Create，這些都運作正常，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.26,
          "end": 33.483,
          "en": "but the task is not showing up here,",
          "zh": "但任務卻沒有出現在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.35,
          "end": 39.09,
          "en": "so it's somehow not stored for this user.",
          "zh": "所以它不知怎麼地沒有被儲存到這個使用者身上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.09,
          "end": 41.43,
          "en": "And of course, a problem like that",
          "zh": "而當然，像這樣的問題"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.43,
          "end": 44.82,
          "en": "could have multiple possible sources.",
          "zh": "可能有很多種來源。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.82,
          "end": 49.82,
          "en": "Maybe the input we enter here wasn't read correctly.",
          "zh": "也許我們在這裡輸入的內容沒有被正確讀取。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.19,
          "end": 52.59,
          "en": "Maybe the task wasn't added,",
          "zh": "也許任務沒有被新增，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.59,
          "end": 55.8,
          "en": "maybe it was added, but to the wrong user,",
          "zh": "也許有新增，但加到了錯誤的使用者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.8,
          "end": 58.563,
          "en": "there are different potential sources.",
          "zh": "有各種不同的可能來源。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.741,
          "end": 60.9,
          "en": "Sources in situations like this,",
          "zh": "在這種情況下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.9,
          "end": 65.13,
          "en": "it of course makes sense to go to the place in your code",
          "zh": "當然，前往你程式碼中的那個位置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.13,
          "end": 70.13,
          "en": "where you are dealing with that task that just failed.",
          "zh": "也就是你處理剛才那個失敗任務的地方，是合理的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.47,
          "end": 73.62,
          "en": "So in this case, we could go to the new-task component",
          "zh": "所以在這個情況下，我們可以前往 new-task 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.62,
          "end": 75.39,
          "en": "where we render this form",
          "zh": "我們在那裡渲染這個表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.39,
          "end": 78.57,
          "en": "and we could then try to analyze the code here",
          "zh": "然後試著分析這裡的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.57,
          "end": 82.32,
          "en": "to see whether the entered data is extracted correctly",
          "zh": "看看輸入的資料有沒有被正確取出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.32,
          "end": 84.81,
          "en": "and if it's sent to the service correctly",
          "zh": "以及有沒有正確地傳給服務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.81,
          "end": 88.053,
          "en": "and that is definitely something you might wanna do.",
          "zh": "而這當然是你可能會想做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.19,
          "end": 93.3,
          "en": "But you can actually also try a different approach.",
          "zh": "但你其實也可以試另一種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.3,
          "end": 95.97,
          "en": "You can open your browser Developer tools,",
          "zh": "你可以打開瀏覽器的開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.97,
          "end": 97.41,
          "en": "and here I'm using Chrome,",
          "zh": "我這裡用的是 Chrome，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.41,
          "end": 99.84,
          "en": "and that's then how those tools look like.",
          "zh": "這些工具看起來就像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.84,
          "end": 102.723,
          "en": "And you should have a Sources tab here.",
          "zh": "你這裡應該會有一個 Sources 分頁。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.95,
          "end": 106.89,
          "en": "And this Sources tab allows you",
          "zh": "而這個 Sources 分頁可以讓你"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.89,
          "end": 110.52000000000001,
          "en": "to analyze your Angular code,",
          "zh": "分析你的 Angular 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.52000000000001,
          "end": 113.43,
          "en": "your TypeScript code at runtime.",
          "zh": "也就是執行時的 TypeScript 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.43,
          "end": 115.59,
          "en": "And you can place break points here.",
          "zh": "而且你可以在這裡設中斷點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.59,
          "end": 118.32,
          "en": "And you can do that even though it's technically",
          "zh": "而且你即使嚴格來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.32,
          "end": 123.06,
          "en": "not your TypeScript code that's running in the browser here.",
          "zh": "這裡在瀏覽器跑的並不是你的 TypeScript 程式碼，還是能這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.06,
          "end": 125.52,
          "en": "As you learned earlier in the course,",
          "zh": "如你在這門課一開始學過的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.52,
          "end": 128.16,
          "en": "the Angular code you write",
          "zh": "你寫的 Angular 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.16,
          "end": 130.65,
          "en": "wouldn't work like that in the browser.",
          "zh": "在瀏覽器裡是無法直接運作的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 130.65,
          "end": 135.39,
          "en": "Therefore it's compiled by the Angular CLI behind the scenes",
          "zh": "所以它會在幕後由 Angular CLI 編譯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.39,
          "end": 137.88,
          "en": "and it's actually that compiled code",
          "zh": "而實際在瀏覽器裡跑的"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.88,
          "end": 139.503,
          "en": "that runs in the browser.",
          "zh": "就是編譯後的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.43,
          "end": 143.7,
          "en": "But thanks to a feature called Source Maps,",
          "zh": "但多虧了一個叫做 Source Maps 的功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.7,
          "end": 147.03,
          "en": "which are also produced by that CLI behind the scenes,",
          "zh": "它同樣也是那個 CLI 在幕後產生的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.03,
          "end": 149.7,
          "en": "the browser is able to map the code",
          "zh": "瀏覽器才能把實際執行的程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.7,
          "end": 154.47,
          "en": "that's actually executing to the original code you wrote.",
          "zh": "對應回你原本寫的那份程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.47,
          "end": 156.09,
          "en": "And here in the Sources tab,",
          "zh": "而在這裡的 Sources 分頁中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.09,
          "end": 160.05,
          "en": "you should then be able to see that code you wrote.",
          "zh": "你應該就能看到你寫的那份程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.05,
          "end": 162.27,
          "en": "You should for example, be able to dive",
          "zh": "例如，你應該能夠進入"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.27,
          "end": 165.27,
          "en": "into the src folder into the app folder,",
          "zh": "src 資料夾、app 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.27,
          "end": 167.01,
          "en": "and then the tasks folder",
          "zh": "然後是 tasks 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.01,
          "end": 170.65,
          "en": "and explore the different task component code files",
          "zh": "瀏覽各種 task 元件的程式碼檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.65,
          "end": 172.62,
          "en": "in the TypeScript version.",
          "zh": "而且是 TypeScript 版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.62,
          "end": 174.723,
          "en": "So in the version you wrote them.",
          "zh": "也就是你撰寫時的那個版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 175.62,
          "end": 179.25,
          "en": "And what you can then do, for example, is you can go",
          "zh": "接著你可以做的，例如是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.25,
          "end": 182.19,
          "en": "to your code and then here in onSubmit,",
          "zh": "前往你的程式碼，然後在這裡的 onSubmit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.19,
          "end": 184.29,
          "en": "you can place a break point",
          "zh": "你可以點擊這裡的行號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.29,
          "end": 186.783,
          "en": "by clicking here on the line number.",
          "zh": "在這裡設下一個中斷點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.31,
          "end": 193.31,
          "en": "And now if you enter some data here like this,",
          "zh": "而現在如果你在這裡輸入一些資料，像這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.41,
          "end": 196.41,
          "en": "you will see that as I click Create,",
          "zh": "你會看到當我點擊 Create 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.41,
          "end": 200.28,
          "en": "the execution of the website pauses,",
          "zh": "網站的執行會暫停下來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 200.28,
          "end": 203.04,
          "en": "the browser is pausing it here,",
          "zh": "瀏覽器會在這裡把它停住，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.04,
          "end": 207.003,
          "en": "and this line here gets highlighted on the right.",
          "zh": "而這裡這一行會在右邊被高亮顯示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.07999999999998,
          "end": 211.07999999999998,
          "en": "And you can now also hover over things there",
          "zh": "而你現在也可以在那裡把游標移到東西上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.07999999999998,
          "end": 214.59300000000002,
          "en": "to see the actual values you are currently working with.",
          "zh": "查看你目前實際操作的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 216.12,
          "end": 219.18,
          "en": "For example, I can hover over this entered title",
          "zh": "例如，我可以在這個輸入的標題上移動游標，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 219.18,
          "end": 222.99,
          "en": "and I see the data that has been extracted,",
          "zh": "然後看到被取出來的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 222.99,
          "end": 225.15,
          "en": "and that is a good first check",
          "zh": "而這是一個很好的第一個檢查，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 225.15,
          "end": 226.56,
          "en": "because that tells me",
          "zh": "因為它告訴我，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 226.56,
          "end": 229.89,
          "en": "that the data was extracted successfully.",
          "zh": "資料被成功取出來了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 229.89,
          "end": 232.41,
          "en": "I don't have to analyze all the code to find out.",
          "zh": "我不必分析所有程式碼才知道這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.41,
          "end": 234.36,
          "en": "I can simply hover over it here",
          "zh": "我只要在這裡把游標移過去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.36,
          "end": 236.403,
          "en": "whilst it's executing to tell.",
          "zh": "在它執行時就能知道。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 237.3,
          "end": 239.64,
          "en": "So this is not the problem.",
          "zh": "所以問題不在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 239.64,
          "end": 244.47,
          "en": "The values are extracted and we're calling at task here.",
          "zh": "值有被取出來，而我們在這裡呼叫了 addTask。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 244.47,
          "end": 247.41,
          "en": "Now you can navigate through your code here",
          "zh": "現在你可以藉由這些控制項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 247.41,
          "end": 250.953,
          "en": "as it's executing with help of these controls.",
          "zh": "在程式碼執行的過程中逐步瀏覽。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 252.48,
          "end": 257.373,
          "en": "You can resume execution to unpause the program.",
          "zh": "你可以繼續執行來讓程式恢復執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 258.39,
          "end": 261.96,
          "en": "You can move on to the next code block,",
          "zh": "你可以前往下一個程式碼區塊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 261.96,
          "end": 263.07,
          "en": "but you can, for example,",
          "zh": "但例如你也可以，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 263.07,
          "end": 265.8,
          "en": "also dive into the functional method",
          "zh": "進一步進入正在執行的"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 265.8,
          "end": 267.66,
          "en": "that's being executed here.",
          "zh": "那個函式方法裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 267.66,
          "end": 269.34,
          "en": "So here, for example,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，例如，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 269.34,
          "end": 273.03,
          "en": "I can press this dive into button here",
          "zh": "我可以按這裡的 dive into 按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 273.03,
          "end": 276.65999999999997,
          "en": "to dive into this addTask method",
          "zh": "進入這個 addTask 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 276.65999999999997,
          "end": 280.83,
          "en": "and to now step through the code execution here step by step",
          "zh": "然後在這裡逐步執行這些程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 280.83,
          "end": 284.31,
          "en": "to find out whether something's wrong here.",
          "zh": "看看這裡是否有什麼問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 284.31,
          "end": 287.4,
          "en": "And here I now see something",
          "zh": "而我在這裡現在看到一個東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 287.4,
          "end": 289.773,
          "en": "that seems to be causing this issue.",
          "zh": "它似乎是造成這個問題的原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 290.64,
          "end": 293.79,
          "en": "The userId here is set to an empty string",
          "zh": "這裡的 userId 被設成一個空字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 293.79,
          "end": 297.18,
          "en": "instead of the actual userId of the user",
          "zh": "而不是那個真正使用者的 userId，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 297.18,
          "end": 299.763,
          "en": "for whom we're trying to add the task.",
          "zh": "而我們正要幫他新增任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 301.14,
          "end": 303.54,
          "en": "Now it turns out that we do get",
          "zh": "現在我發現，其實我們確實有拿到"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 303.54,
          "end": 306.66,
          "en": "that userId as an argument here,",
          "zh": "那個 userId 作為這裡的參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 306.66,
          "end": 309.69,
          "en": "I am just not using it here in the code.",
          "zh": "我只是在程式碼裡沒有用到它而已。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 309.69,
          "end": 311.34,
          "en": "That's one of the changes I made",
          "zh": "這是我對起始專案所做的修改之一，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 311.34,
          "end": 314.943,
          "en": "to the starting project in order to simulate this problem.",
          "zh": "目的是要模擬這個問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 315.9,
          "end": 318.15,
          "en": "So it looks like that's the problem.",
          "zh": "所以看起來問題就在那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 318.15,
          "end": 321.15,
          "en": "Back in our code, we can now go to that place",
          "zh": "回到我們的程式碼，現在我們可以前往那個位置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 321.15,
          "end": 322.47,
          "en": "and update the code",
          "zh": "然後更新程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 322.47,
          "end": 324.58,
          "en": "and use the userId again",
          "zh": "再次使用 userId，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 325.86,
          "end": 328.71,
          "en": "so that we do assign the newly added task",
          "zh": "讓我們確實把新增加的任務"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 328.71,
          "end": 330.363,
          "en": "to the right user again,",
          "zh": "指派給正確的使用者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 331.29,
          "end": 333.42,
          "en": "we can then test our change again.",
          "zh": "接著就可以再次測試我們的修改。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 333.42,
          "end": 336.123,
          "en": "Now, first of all, I wanna remove my break point.",
          "zh": "現在，首先我想移除我的中斷點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 340.17,
          "end": 342.27,
          "en": "So in that new-task component file,",
          "zh": "所以在那個 new-task 元件檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 342.27,
          "end": 345.51,
          "en": "I'll click on that break point again to remove it",
          "zh": "我再點一次那個中斷點把它移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 345.51,
          "end": 348.063,
          "en": "so that I don't pause execution again.",
          "zh": "這樣就不會再暫停執行了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 349.56,
          "end": 353.967,
          "en": "And then if I try to add a new task here again like this,",
          "zh": "然後如果我像這樣在這裡再次新增一個任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 357.33,
          "end": 359.4,
          "en": "now it's added to the right user again,",
          "zh": "現在它又被加到正確的使用者身上了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 359.4,
          "end": 362.88,
          "en": "I can see it here and that's working the way it should.",
          "zh": "我在這裡看得到它，而且運作方式完全正確。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 362.88,
          "end": 365.49,
          "en": "And that's how you can debug logical errors",
          "zh": "這就是你如何偵錯邏輯錯誤的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 365.49,
          "end": 369.54,
          "en": "like the one we had here before with help of Source Maps",
          "zh": "像我們剛才那個，靠 Source Maps 的協助，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 369.54,
          "end": 372.18,
          "en": "and the built in browser Developer tools",
          "zh": "以及內建的瀏覽器開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 372.18,
          "end": 373.83,
          "en": "by placing breakpoints",
          "zh": "藉由設定中斷點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 373.83,
          "end": 377.373,
          "en": "and by step by step, walking through your code.",
          "zh": "以及一步一步走過你的程式碼。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43798084",
      "title": "Exploring the Angular DevTools",
      "lectureOrder": 95,
      "videoOrder": 89,
      "sourceHash": "4c198d0d9ae7964c096a8ed453440476d91798cdb3b26a524ec2d97fb2507a3b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 1.56,
          "en": "Now with that,",
          "zh": "現在這樣一來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.56,
          "end": 4.02,
          "en": "we're almost done for this section,",
          "zh": "這個章節我們快要完成了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.02,
          "end": 7.68,
          "en": "but there's one last very useful tool you should know",
          "zh": "但還有一個你該知道、非常好用的工具"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.68,
          "end": 9.78,
          "en": "as an Angular developer,",
          "zh": "身為 Angular 開發者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.78,
          "end": 12.42,
          "en": "and that would be the Angular DevTools,",
          "zh": "那就是 Angular DevTools，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.42,
          "end": 15.3,
          "en": "the Angular developer tools.",
          "zh": "也就是 Angular 的開發者工具。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.3,
          "end": 16.77,
          "en": "Now, you can learn more about them",
          "zh": "關於它們，你可以再深入了解，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.77,
          "end": 18.42,
          "en": "in the official documentation,",
          "zh": "官方文件裡就有相關說明，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.42,
          "end": 20.61,
          "en": "but here I'm interested in installing them.",
          "zh": "但這裡我想談的是安裝它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.61,
          "end": 24,
          "en": "Because the Angular DevTools are an extension,",
          "zh": "因為 Angular DevTools 是一個擴充功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24,
          "end": 25.56,
          "en": "a browser extension,",
          "zh": "一個瀏覽器擴充功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.56,
          "end": 28.17,
          "en": "you can, for example, install in Chrome.",
          "zh": "你可以在 Chrome 中安裝。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.17,
          "end": 31.23,
          "en": "Here on the Angular DevTools extension page,",
          "zh": "在這個 Angular DevTools 擴充功能頁面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.23,
          "end": 33.24,
          "en": "you can learn more about it",
          "zh": "你可以再多了解一些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 33.24,
          "end": 36.12,
          "en": "and you can then click Add to Chrome",
          "zh": "然後按一下 Add to Chrome"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 36.12,
          "end": 37.68,
          "en": "to install that extension.",
          "zh": "來安裝那個擴充功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.68,
          "end": 39.51,
          "en": "And once you did that,",
          "zh": "而一旦你安裝好之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 39.51,
          "end": 43.5,
          "en": "if you're on a page that uses Angular like this one here,",
          "zh": "如果你在一個像這樣使用 Angular 的頁面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 43.5,
          "end": 46.68,
          "en": "you can open your browser developer tools again,",
          "zh": "你可以再次開啟瀏覽器的開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 46.68,
          "end": 48.27,
          "en": "and here I'm getting some error,",
          "zh": "而我在這裡看到一個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.27,
          "end": 50.58,
          "en": "which seems to be a bug with that extension,",
          "zh": "那看起來是那個擴充功能的 bug，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 50.58,
          "end": 51.51,
          "en": "you can ignore it",
          "zh": "你可以忽略它"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 51.51,
          "end": 54.09,
          "en": "because we're now not working in the console here",
          "zh": "因為我們現在不是在這裡的 console 中操作"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 54.09,
          "end": 55.71,
          "en": "or the sources tab.",
          "zh": "也不是在 sources 分頁。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 55.71,
          "end": 57.9,
          "en": "Instead, with that extension installed,",
          "zh": "相反地，裝了那個擴充功能之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 57.9,
          "end": 60.333,
          "en": "there should be a new Angular tab,",
          "zh": "那裡應該會多出一個 Angular 分頁，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 62.1,
          "end": 66.6,
          "en": "and you can select that tab to load the Angular DevTools.",
          "zh": "你可以選取那個分頁來載入 Angular DevTools。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 66.6,
          "end": 71.6,
          "en": "Now, once they loaded, you will have multiple tabs here,",
          "zh": "載入之後，你在這裡會看到多個分頁，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.09,
          "end": 77.09,
          "en": "a Components tab, a Profiler tab, and an Injector Tree tab",
          "zh": "一個 Components 分頁、一個 Profiler 分頁，以及一個 Injector Tree 分頁"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 77.22,
          "end": 79.863,
          "en": "at the point of time where I'm recording that.",
          "zh": "至少在我錄製的這個時間點是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 80.94,
          "end": 82.32,
          "en": "I'll also zoom out a bit",
          "zh": "我也會把畫面縮小一點"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.32,
          "end": 84.393,
          "en": "so that we can see that a bit better.",
          "zh": "讓我們看得清楚一些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.23,
          "end": 88.02,
          "en": "Now let's start with the Components tab.",
          "zh": "現在我們先從 Components 分頁開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.02,
          "end": 92.82,
          "en": "The idea here is that you see your component tree,",
          "zh": "這裡的概念是，你會看到你的元件樹，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.82,
          "end": 95.34,
          "en": "and as you hover over Components here,",
          "zh": "當你在這裡把游標移到元件上方時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.34,
          "end": 97.68299999999999,
          "en": "they are highlighted on the left.",
          "zh": "左邊就會把它們高亮顯示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.64,
          "end": 101.55,
          "en": "Of course, you cannot just hover over them though.",
          "zh": "當然，你不能只是把滑鼠停留在那裡而已。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.55,
          "end": 103.83,
          "en": "You can also click on a component",
          "zh": "你也可以點擊一個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.83,
          "end": 106.89,
          "en": "to see more details about it here.",
          "zh": "在這裡看到它的更多細節。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.89,
          "end": 109.56,
          "en": "For example, you see its inputs",
          "zh": "例如，你會看到它的輸入"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.56,
          "end": 112.02000000000001,
          "en": "and you can also change those inputs",
          "zh": "而且你也可以修改這些輸入"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.02000000000001,
          "end": 114.69,
          "en": "by double clicking on them and tweaking them.",
          "zh": "只要雙擊它們並微調即可。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 114.69,
          "end": 117.72,
          "en": "For example, here I can set selected to true,",
          "zh": "例如，在這裡我可以把 selected 設為 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 117.72,
          "end": 120.33,
          "en": "and as you see, the UI updates accordingly,",
          "zh": "而如你所見，UI 也會跟著更新，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 120.33,
          "end": 122.82,
          "en": "at least the highlighted part here does.",
          "zh": "至少這裡被高亮的部分有更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 122.82,
          "end": 125.19,
          "en": "I don't see the details for that user",
          "zh": "我看不到那位使用者的細節"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 125.19,
          "end": 127.26,
          "en": "because that would require updating",
          "zh": "因為那需要連帶更新"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 127.26,
          "end": 130.05,
          "en": "other parts of the state as well.",
          "zh": "其他部分的狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 130.05,
          "end": 132.363,
          "en": "I still have to click the user to see that,",
          "zh": "我還是要點擊那位使用者才看得到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 133.35,
          "end": 135.36,
          "en": "but you can see the inputs and outputs",
          "zh": "但你可以看到輸入與輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 135.36,
          "end": 137.91,
          "en": "and you can explore them in greater detail",
          "zh": "而且可以更仔細地探索它們"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 137.91,
          "end": 141.93,
          "en": "and tweak them to try different scenarios",
          "zh": "微調它們來嘗試不同的情境"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 141.93,
          "end": 145.68,
          "en": "and simply perform simple tests on your application.",
          "zh": "並簡單地對你的應用程式做測試。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 145.68,
          "end": 147.6,
          "en": "This view can also be helpful",
          "zh": "這個檢視也可以幫助你"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 147.6,
          "end": 150.57,
          "en": "to understand your component hierarchy.",
          "zh": "了解你的元件階層結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 150.57,
          "end": 152.64,
          "en": "You can also click this icon here,",
          "zh": "你也可以點擊這裡的這個圖示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 152.64,
          "end": 154.74,
          "en": "this Inspect Element icon,",
          "zh": "也就是這個 Inspect Element 圖示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 154.74,
          "end": 157.5,
          "en": "to select an element here on the left,",
          "zh": "來選取左邊的某個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 157.5,
          "end": 160.68,
          "en": "and then the component that's related to it",
          "zh": "然後相關的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 160.68,
          "end": 163.113,
          "en": "will be selected here in the component tree.",
          "zh": "就會在這裡的元件樹中被選取。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 164.1,
          "end": 165.78300000000002,
          "en": "So that's this Components tab.",
          "zh": "所以這就是 Components 分頁。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 166.95,
          "end": 170.13,
          "en": "The Profiler tab allows you to analyze",
          "zh": "Profiler 分頁能讓你分析"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 170.13,
          "end": 172.82999999999998,
          "en": "the performance of your Angular application,",
          "zh": "你的 Angular 應用程式的效能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 172.82999999999998,
          "end": 175.29,
          "en": "and it's not something we'll explore here.",
          "zh": "不過這不是我們要在這裡探討的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 175.29,
          "end": 179.16,
          "en": "You can basically start recordings, then perform tasks,",
          "zh": "你基本上可以開始錄製，然後執行一些操作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 179.16,
          "end": 183.9,
          "en": "and stop recordings to see how often the page was updated",
          "zh": "再停止錄製，以看出頁面更新了多少次"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 183.9,
          "end": 185.79,
          "en": "and which components performed,",
          "zh": "以及是哪些元件執行了"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 185.79,
          "end": 188.52,
          "en": "how much work and what they did.",
          "zh": "多少工作、做了什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 188.52,
          "end": 189.99,
          "en": "So that can be useful",
          "zh": "所以這對"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 189.99,
          "end": 193.77,
          "en": "for analyzing performance bottlenecks in your application,",
          "zh": "分析應用程式中的效能瓶頸很有用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 193.77,
          "end": 196.803,
          "en": "but it's not a problem we have to deal with just yet.",
          "zh": "但這還不是我們現在必須處理的問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 198.18,
          "end": 200.43,
          "en": "And the Injector Tree can be helpful",
          "zh": "而 Injector Tree 可以幫助你"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 200.43,
          "end": 203.7,
          "en": "for understanding dependency injection",
          "zh": "理解相依性注入"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 203.7,
          "end": 206.22,
          "en": "in your Angular application.",
          "zh": "在你的 Angular 應用程式裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 206.22,
          "end": 208.29,
          "en": "It's also a more advanced topic,",
          "zh": "這也是比較進階的主題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 208.29,
          "end": 210.06,
          "en": "which we don't need to explore right now",
          "zh": "我們現在不需要去探討"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 210.06,
          "end": 212.22,
          "en": "because right now it's this components tree",
          "zh": "因為現在最有用的"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 212.22,
          "end": 214.62,
          "en": "that's probably most useful.",
          "zh": "還是這個元件樹。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 214.62,
          "end": 215.76,
          "en": "But as mentioned,",
          "zh": "不過如前面提到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 215.76,
          "end": 218.76,
          "en": "you also might wanna explore the official documentation",
          "zh": "你也可以去查閱官方文件"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 218.76,
          "end": 221.94,
          "en": "to learn all about the Angular DevTools",
          "zh": "深入了解 Angular DevTools"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 221.94,
          "end": 223.53,
          "en": "and what you can do with them,",
          "zh": "以及能用它們做什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 223.53,
          "end": 225.06,
          "en": "and in which situation,",
          "zh": "以及在什麼情況下"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 225.06,
          "end": 228.273,
          "en": "which feature of that extension might come in handy.",
          "zh": "那個擴充功能的哪個功能會派上用場。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "44115516",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "lectureOrder": 96,
      "videoOrder": 90,
      "sourceHash": "175f457c141815faea7c40265f0c05c2a6e5c967f36414fd78d78fbc42802f2e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.12,
          "end": 2.28,
          "en": "In this section,",
          "zh": "在這個單元中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.28,
          "end": 6.24,
          "en": "we'll work on yet another demo project,",
          "zh": "我們會再做一個練習專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.24,
          "end": 8.73,
          "en": "and it will be a demo project",
          "zh": "這會是一個練習專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.73,
          "end": 13.73,
          "en": "that will allow us to dive a bit deeper into components,",
          "zh": "讓我們能更深入地研究元件、"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.85,
          "end": 18.21,
          "en": "their templates, managing data and components,",
          "zh": "元件的模板，以及資料與元件的管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.21,
          "end": 21.75,
          "en": "and all those other related concepts.",
          "zh": "還有其他所有相關的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.75,
          "end": 23.31,
          "en": "Because in this section,",
          "zh": "因為在這個單元中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.31,
          "end": 26.25,
          "en": "we'll build up on the foundation we got",
          "zh": "我們會建立在先前幾個單元"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.25,
          "end": 29.19,
          "en": "over the previous sections,",
          "zh": "所打下的基礎之上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.19,
          "end": 30.33,
          "en": "and we'll dive into",
          "zh": "並深入探討"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.33,
          "end": 34.53,
          "en": "more advanced component features and concepts.",
          "zh": "更進階的元件功能與概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.53,
          "end": 36.3,
          "en": "Therefore, by the way,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 40.98,
          "en": "we will not focus on building this demo application",
          "zh": "我們不會把重點放在盡快"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.98,
          "end": 43.2,
          "en": "as quickly as possible.",
          "zh": "把這個練習應用程式建構完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.2,
          "end": 46.68,
          "en": "Instead, we'll just use it as a dummy application",
          "zh": "相反地，我們只會把它當成一個暫用的應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.68,
          "end": 49.29,
          "en": "to dive into all those advanced concepts",
          "zh": "來深入研究所有那些進階概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.29,
          "end": 54.29,
          "en": "and to explore some advanced concepts in an actual project.",
          "zh": "並在實際的專案中探索一些進階概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.48,
          "end": 58.23,
          "en": "Specifically, we'll, for example, have a look at",
          "zh": "具體來說，例如我們會看看"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.23,
          "end": 61.5,
          "en": "how we can work with a Components host element,",
          "zh": "要如何處理元件的宿主元素（host element），"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.5,
          "end": 63.54,
          "en": "what that actually is,",
          "zh": "它實際上到底是什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.54,
          "end": 67.98,
          "en": "and why it can sometimes be interesting to work with that.",
          "zh": "以及為什麼有時候處理它會很有意思。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.98,
          "end": 71.76,
          "en": "We'll revisit the idea of inputs and outputs",
          "zh": "我們會重新回顧輸入與輸出的概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.76,
          "end": 73.26,
          "en": "and two-way binding,",
          "zh": "以及雙向繫結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.26,
          "end": 76.8,
          "en": "and we'll explore advanced configuration options",
          "zh": "並探索進階的設定選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.8,
          "end": 81.18,
          "en": "and also how you can set up custom two-way binding",
          "zh": "以及如何在你自己的元件上"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.18,
          "end": 83.03999999999999,
          "en": "on your own Components",
          "zh": "設定自訂的雙向繫結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.03999999999999,
          "end": 86.25,
          "en": "so that certain properties on your own Components",
          "zh": "讓你自己元件上的某些屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.25,
          "end": 89.64,
          "en": "can be two-way bound if needed.",
          "zh": "在需要時可以進行雙向繫結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.64,
          "end": 91.92,
          "en": "We'll explore how you can interact",
          "zh": "我們會探討你要如何與元件的"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.92,
          "end": 95.1,
          "en": "with a Components view and content",
          "zh": "檢視和內容互動，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.1,
          "end": 97.38,
          "en": "and why you might want to do that",
          "zh": "以及你為什麼可能想這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.38,
          "end": 101.97,
          "en": "and what exactly I mean with interaction here.",
          "zh": "還有我這裡所說的互動究竟是指什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.97,
          "end": 105.78,
          "en": "We'll explore the lifecycle of a Component",
          "zh": "我們會探索元件的生命週期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.78,
          "end": 110.37,
          "en": "and how you can hook into certain lifecycle stages",
          "zh": "以及你要如何掛接到某些生命週期階段，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.37,
          "end": 112.28999999999999,
          "en": "and much more.",
          "zh": "還有更多內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.28999999999999,
          "end": 114.36,
          "en": "And therefore, let's dive right in,",
          "zh": "所以，讓我們直接開始吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.36,
          "end": 118.173,
          "en": "and let's get started with these more advanced concepts now.",
          "zh": "現在就從這些更進階的概念開始。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "44115524",
      "title": "Starting Project & An Opportunity For Smaller Components?",
      "lectureOrder": 97,
      "videoOrder": 91,
      "sourceHash": "9f7b2559433331b9b9f9b5a872edda89f5ae11df23b95ba4d5bd0a3b293a00b3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 2.58,
          "en": "Now for this section,",
          "zh": "在這個章節，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.58,
          "end": 6.24,
          "en": "I prepared another starting project,",
          "zh": "我準備了另一個起始專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.24,
          "end": 8.31,
          "en": "which you find attached.",
          "zh": "你可以在附件中找到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.31,
          "end": 13.31,
          "en": "And this project actually already comes with some code.",
          "zh": "而這個專案其實已經附帶一些程式碼了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.56,
          "end": 15.72,
          "en": "It comes with an app.component",
          "zh": "它有一個 app.component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.72,
          "end": 17.542,
          "en": "that already contains some data",
          "zh": "裡面已經包含一些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.542,
          "end": 22.17,
          "en": "and that has a template where some data is output.",
          "zh": "而且它有一個模板，會輸出一些資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.17,
          "end": 25.92,
          "en": "Now, in order to work on that demo project",
          "zh": "現在，為了處理那個示範專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.92,
          "end": 30.42,
          "en": "after downloading it, you should run npm install",
          "zh": "下載之後，你應該執行 npm install，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.42,
          "end": 35.04,
          "en": "in that extracted project folder to install the dependencies",
          "zh": "在那個解壓出來的專案資料夾中，安裝所需的相依套件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.04,
          "end": 38.04,
          "en": "that are needed to run this project.",
          "zh": "也就是執行這個專案所需要的那些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.04,
          "end": 40.5,
          "en": "As you learned, this command only needs",
          "zh": "如你所學，這個指令只需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.5,
          "end": 43.233,
          "en": "to be executed once initially.",
          "zh": "在最初執行一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.25,
          "end": 46.65,
          "en": "And thereafter, you should run npm start",
          "zh": "之後你就應該執行 npm start，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.65,
          "end": 49.89,
          "en": "to start that development server.",
          "zh": "來啟動那個開發伺服器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.89,
          "end": 53.107,
          "en": "And if you then visit localhost:4200",
          "zh": "然後如果你造訪 localhost:4200，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.65,
          "end": 58.047,
          "en": "or whichever address is showing up for you",
          "zh": "或是執行 npm start 時"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.047,
          "end": 61.23,
          "en": "when you ran npm start,",
          "zh": "顯示給你的那個位址，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.23,
          "end": 65.76,
          "en": "you should see this dummy application on the screen.",
          "zh": "你就會在畫面上看到這個 dummy 應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.76,
          "end": 68.22,
          "en": "And that's not the finished application.",
          "zh": "而那不是完成的應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.22,
          "end": 70.89,
          "en": "We'll work on it throughout this section.",
          "zh": "我們會在這個章節中持續處理它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.89,
          "end": 74.283,
          "en": "But it's a starting state on which we'll build up on.",
          "zh": "但它是一個我們會在上面繼續建構的起始狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.75,
          "end": 77.28,
          "en": "Now, I'll also say right away",
          "zh": "現在，我也要先說明，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.28,
          "end": 79.65,
          "en": "that there is a lot of dummy content in here,",
          "zh": "這裡面有很多 dummy 內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.65,
          "end": 81.66,
          "en": "like this navigation here.",
          "zh": "像這裡這個導覽。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.66,
          "end": 84.9,
          "en": "We'll not yet add multiple pages here.",
          "zh": "我們目前還不會在這裡加入多個頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.9,
          "end": 88.74,
          "en": "That's something we'll do in a later course section.",
          "zh": "那是我們會在後面的章節做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.74,
          "end": 91.59,
          "en": "Instead in this section, as mentioned,",
          "zh": "相反地，在這個章節中，如先前所提，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.59,
          "end": 93.69,
          "en": "we'll focus on diving a bit deeper",
          "zh": "我們會專注於更深入一點地"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.69,
          "end": 98.16,
          "en": "into Components and Component-related features.",
          "zh": "探索元件以及與元件相關的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.16,
          "end": 100.283,
          "en": "And indeed in this starting project,",
          "zh": "而且事實上在這個我為你準備的"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.283,
          "end": 102.81,
          "en": "which I prepared for you,",
          "zh": "起始專案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.81,
          "end": 106.462,
          "en": "there already is one component related question",
          "zh": "已經有一個與元件相關的問題"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.462,
          "end": 109.2,
          "en": "I wanna answer together with you.",
          "zh": "我想跟你一起回答。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.2,
          "end": 112.59,
          "en": "Because if you take a look at this app.component.html file,",
          "zh": "因為如果你看一下這個 app.component.html 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.59,
          "end": 116.4,
          "en": "you see that it contains quite a bit of markup.",
          "zh": "你會看到它含相當多的標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.4,
          "end": 117.947,
          "en": "Definitely not horrible,",
          "zh": "當然不算糟糕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.947,
          "end": 121.74,
          "en": "but it has a lot of content in there.",
          "zh": "但裡面確實有很多內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.74,
          "end": 125.64,
          "en": "And the first question I wanna answer together with you",
          "zh": "而我想跟你一起回答的第一個問題是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.64,
          "end": 128.648,
          "en": "is when exactly you should split up",
          "zh": "究竟什麼時候你應該把"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.648,
          "end": 132.27,
          "en": "a component into multiple components.",
          "zh": "一個元件拆成多個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.27,
          "end": 134.16,
          "en": "So, how do you decide",
          "zh": "那麼，你要怎麼決定"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.16,
          "end": 137.43,
          "en": "what should go into a separate component?",
          "zh": "什麼東西應該放進一個獨立的元件？"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.43,
          "end": 138.87,
          "en": "Because after all,",
          "zh": "因為說到底，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.87,
          "end": 142.53,
          "en": "you could theoretically put all your markup",
          "zh": "理論上你可以把所有標記"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.53,
          "end": 147.39,
          "en": "and all your logic into one single component",
          "zh": "和所有邏輯都放進單一個元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.39,
          "end": 149.76,
          "en": "as it's currently the case here.",
          "zh": "就像這裡目前的情況一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.76,
          "end": 152.673,
          "en": "But the question is whether that's a good idea.",
          "zh": "但問題是那是不是一個好主意。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "44115544",
      "title": "When & How To Split Up Components",
      "lectureOrder": 98,
      "videoOrder": 92,
      "sourceHash": "c069c27c5b2dc78d1d7124c9534ca5cd3758df26ddb5ed2de746fc1b7c1df3a2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 4.44,
          "en": "So, when should you split up a component?",
          "zh": "那麼，你該在什麼時候拆分元件呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.44,
          "end": 9.44,
          "en": "How do you decide what should go into a separate component?",
          "zh": "你如何決定什麼東西應該獨立成一個元件？"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.99,
          "end": 14.97,
          "en": "And the simple answer is that it's of course up to you.",
          "zh": "而簡單的答案當然是：這由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.97,
          "end": 18.15,
          "en": "But one of the main ideas",
          "zh": "但 Angular 中這個元件概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.15,
          "end": 22.44,
          "en": "behind this component concept in Angular",
          "zh": "背後的一個主要想法"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.44,
          "end": 26.88,
          "en": "but also in other libraries and frameworks like React,",
          "zh": "在 React 等其他函式庫與框架中也一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 26.88,
          "end": 30.51,
          "en": "is that you can separate concerns,",
          "zh": "就是你可以分離關注點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 30.51,
          "end": 33.93,
          "en": "which means that every component, typically,",
          "zh": "這意味著每個元件通常"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.93,
          "end": 37.68,
          "en": "should only do one thing.",
          "zh": "應該只做一件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 37.68,
          "end": 42.68,
          "en": "Now, of course, you can define one thing",
          "zh": "當然，對「一件事」的定義"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 42.9,
          "end": 45.39,
          "en": "in pretty different ways.",
          "zh": "可以相當不同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 45.39,
          "end": 48.21,
          "en": "You could argue that this app component here",
          "zh": "你可以說，這個 app component"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 48.21,
          "end": 50.88,
          "en": "does only one thing",
          "zh": "只做了一件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 50.88,
          "end": 53.61,
          "en": "because it renders this one page",
          "zh": "因為它只渲染這一頁，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 53.61,
          "end": 58.02,
          "en": "which outputs this fictional server data.",
          "zh": "而這一頁輸出了這些虛構的伺服器資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 58.02,
          "end": 60.78,
          "en": "But, of course, you could also argue",
          "zh": "但當然，你也可以說"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 60.78,
          "end": 63.51,
          "en": "that it's doing multiple things.",
          "zh": "它做了不只一件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 63.51,
          "end": 66.48,
          "en": "It's outputting this header here",
          "zh": "它輸出了這裡的 header，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 66.48,
          "end": 70.53,
          "en": "and then it's outputting three dashboard items,",
          "zh": "接著又輸出三個 dashboard 項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 70.53,
          "end": 73.863,
          "en": "which are about different things.",
          "zh": "而它們各自是關於不同的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 75.21000000000001,
          "end": 77.91,
          "en": "This first dashboard item here",
          "zh": "這裡的第一個 dashboard 項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.91,
          "end": 80.733,
          "en": "outputs some server status.",
          "zh": "輸出了一些伺服器狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 81.81,
          "end": 85.98,
          "en": "This second item shows us some made up traffic",
          "zh": "第二個項目向我們顯示一些虛構的流量"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 85.98,
          "end": 87.963,
          "en": "over the last couple of days.",
          "zh": "（最近幾天的）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 89.1,
          "end": 92.03999999999999,
          "en": "And this item, which is not complete yet,",
          "zh": "而這個項目還沒完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 92.03999999999999,
          "end": 95.943,
          "en": "will allow us to open and manage support tickets.",
          "zh": "它會讓我們可以開啟並管理支援案件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 97.05,
          "end": 99.06,
          "en": "So if you look at it like this,",
          "zh": "所以如果你這樣來看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 99.06,
          "end": 104.06,
          "en": "this component is not doing one thing but four things.",
          "zh": "這個元件做的不是一件事，而是四件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 105.06,
          "end": 107.4,
          "en": "So, therefore, it might make sense",
          "zh": "因此，或許把它"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 107.4,
          "end": 112.083,
          "en": "to split up this one component into four components.",
          "zh": "拆成四個元件會是合理的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 113.19,
          "end": 117,
          "en": "Now, of course, depending on the complexity of your website,",
          "zh": "當然，取決於你網站的複雜度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 117,
          "end": 119.88,
          "en": "and this here for example is, of course,",
          "zh": "例如這裡這個，當然，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 119.88,
          "end": 123.39,
          "en": "a pretty simple dummy web application,",
          "zh": "只是一個相當簡單的假網頁應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 123.39,
          "end": 128.16,
          "en": "you might prefer to not create a bunch of component files",
          "zh": "你可能會選擇不去建立一堆元件檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 128.16,
          "end": 132.84,
          "en": "even though you are technically doing different things.",
          "zh": "即使你在技術上做了不同的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 132.84,
          "end": 136.86,
          "en": "But if you then have four super simple components,",
          "zh": "但如果你因此有了四個超簡單的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 136.86,
          "end": 139.29,
          "en": "which barely contain any code,",
          "zh": "它們幾乎不含任何程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 139.29,
          "end": 144.29,
          "en": "it might've been better to leave them all in one component.",
          "zh": "那把它們全部留在同一個元件裡可能還更好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 144.51,
          "end": 147.78,
          "en": "So, in the end, it's also a trade-off",
          "zh": "所以歸根究柢，這也是一個取捨，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 147.78,
          "end": 151.23,
          "en": "and comes down to your personal preferences.",
          "zh": "取決於你個人的偏好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 151.23,
          "end": 154.62,
          "en": "You have this separation of concerns principle,",
          "zh": "你有分離關注點這個原則，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 154.62,
          "end": 157.14,
          "en": "and therefore you might want to create",
          "zh": "所以你可能會想建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 157.14,
          "end": 159.87,
          "en": "very granular small components",
          "zh": "非常細碎的小元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 159.87,
          "end": 162.51,
          "en": "and work with many components.",
          "zh": "並使用很多元件來工作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 162.51,
          "end": 163.95,
          "en": "But at the same time,",
          "zh": "但同時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 163.95,
          "end": 167.94,
          "en": "you sometimes might end up with a simpler application",
          "zh": "如果你把程式碼放在同一處，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 167.94,
          "end": 172.86,
          "en": "and more simplicity if you co-locate your code.",
          "zh": "有時反而會得到更簡單的應用程式，整體也更簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 172.86,
          "end": 176.7,
          "en": "So, ultimately there is no clear right or wrong,",
          "zh": "所以，最終沒有絕對的對與錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 176.7,
          "end": 179.85,
          "en": "and it will always depend on your preferences",
          "zh": "而這總是取決於你的偏好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 179.85,
          "end": 181.38,
          "en": "on the preferences",
          "zh": "也就是偏好"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 181.38,
          "end": 184.59,
          "en": "or guidelines of the team you are working in",
          "zh": "或你所屬團隊的指引，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 184.59,
          "end": 188.73,
          "en": "and on the complexity of the application you're working on.",
          "zh": "以及你正在處理的應用程式的複雜度。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 188.73,
          "end": 191.31,
          "en": "Because, of course, theoretically,",
          "zh": "因為當然，理論上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 191.31,
          "end": 195.3,
          "en": "you could make every paragraph its own component,",
          "zh": "你可以讓每一個段落都是一個獨立元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 195.3,
          "end": 197.76,
          "en": "but that wouldn't make a lot of sense.",
          "zh": "但那樣並沒有多大意義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 197.76,
          "end": 200.57999999999998,
          "en": "You don't wanna be that granular.",
          "zh": "你不會想做到那樣細碎。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 200.57999999999998,
          "end": 201.69,
          "en": "At the same time,",
          "zh": "另一方面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 201.69,
          "end": 204.75,
          "en": "working with just one or two components",
          "zh": "只使用一個或兩個元件來工作"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 204.75,
          "end": 207.15,
          "en": "is typically also not a good idea,",
          "zh": "通常也不是個好主意，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 207.15,
          "end": 211.23,
          "en": "especially as your application becomes more complex.",
          "zh": "尤其是在應用程式變得更複雜的時候。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 211.23,
          "end": 215.79,
          "en": "Therefore, my suggestion is that you try to identify",
          "zh": "所以我的建議是，你試著去辨識出"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 215.79,
          "end": 220.32,
          "en": "the main thing component does",
          "zh": "一個元件主要做的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 220.32,
          "end": 223.56,
          "en": "or the main things that are currently happening",
          "zh": "或當下正在發生的主要幾件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 223.56,
          "end": 224.94,
          "en": "in one of your components,",
          "zh": "在你的某個元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 224.94,
          "end": 228.36,
          "en": "and you then split those main things",
          "zh": "然後把那些主要的事情"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 228.36,
          "end": 230.7,
          "en": "into separate components.",
          "zh": "拆成獨立的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 230.7,
          "end": 234.27,
          "en": "And that's what I'll do now in this application.",
          "zh": "而那就是我現在要在這個應用程式中做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 234.27,
          "end": 237.72,
          "en": "I'll put this header into a separate component",
          "zh": "我會把這個 header 放進一個獨立元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 237.72,
          "end": 240.9,
          "en": "and then I'll put all those dashboard items",
          "zh": "然後把所有那些 dashboard 項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 240.9,
          "end": 242.673,
          "en": "into separate components.",
          "zh": "放進獨立的元件中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 243.6,
          "end": 247.38,
          "en": "And, of course, as an exercise, you can do that.",
          "zh": "當然，這部分可以當成練習由你自己做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 247.38,
          "end": 249.12,
          "en": "You can try that on your own.",
          "zh": "你可以自己試試看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 249.12,
          "end": 253.11,
          "en": "Try creating those four components I outlined before",
          "zh": "試著建立我剛才提到的"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 253.11,
          "end": 256.17,
          "en": "and try migrating the HTML code",
          "zh": "那四個元件，並試著把"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 256.17,
          "end": 258.66,
          "en": "that belongs to these different components",
          "zh": "屬於這些不同元件的 HTML 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 258.66,
          "end": 260.67,
          "en": "into these new components.",
          "zh": "遷移到這些新的元件中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 260.67,
          "end": 263.193,
          "en": "In the next lecture, we'll do it together.",
          "zh": "在下一堂課中，我們會一起做。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "44115546",
      "title": "Splitting A Component Into Multiple Components",
      "lectureOrder": 99,
      "videoOrder": 93,
      "sourceHash": "1d2de448dfd10199b895dcabfd8098fde7ff6df46b42ac5ad6c0afb39b66170a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 3.18,
          "en": "So let's create some new Components",
          "zh": "所以讓我們建立一些新的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.18,
          "end": 7.38,
          "en": "and break up this one relatively big app component",
          "zh": "把這個相對較大的 app 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.38,
          "end": 10.08,
          "en": "into smaller Components.",
          "zh": "拆分成比較小的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.08,
          "end": 12.12,
          "en": "Therefore, as a first step, we need",
          "zh": "所以，第一步我們需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.12,
          "end": 14.49,
          "en": "to create some new Components",
          "zh": "建立一些新的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.49,
          "end": 17.64,
          "en": "and that's why I opened up my terminal here",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡打開了我的終端機，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.64,
          "end": 20.73,
          "en": "and I'll create those new Components with help",
          "zh": "我要借助"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.73,
          "end": 23.16,
          "en": "of the Angular CLI.",
          "zh": "Angular CLI 來建立那些新元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.16,
          "end": 28.16,
          "en": "So by running the NGGC command to create new Components.",
          "zh": "也就是執行 ng generate component 這個指令來建立新元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.29,
          "end": 29.73,
          "en": "Of course, alternatively,",
          "zh": "當然，你也可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.73,
          "end": 32.703,
          "en": "you could also create all those files manually.",
          "zh": "手動建立所有那些檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.08,
          "end": 37.32,
          "en": "Now, which Components do we need here?",
          "zh": "現在，我們在這裡需要哪些元件呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.32,
          "end": 42.18,
          "en": "Well, as mentioned before, we need a header component",
          "zh": "就像之前提到的，我們需要一個 header 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.18,
          "end": 45.15,
          "en": "and I'll add skip-tests to make sure",
          "zh": "而我會加上 --skip-tests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.15,
          "end": 48.003,
          "en": "that those test files aren't created.",
          "zh": "以確保不會產生那些測試檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.05,
          "end": 53.013,
          "en": "So that's the first component I want to create.",
          "zh": "所以那是我想建立的第一個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.15,
          "end": 56.13,
          "en": "In addition, I now want",
          "zh": "此外，我現在還想"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.13,
          "end": 59.97,
          "en": "to create my dashboard item Components.",
          "zh": "建立我的 dashboard item 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.97,
          "end": 62.07,
          "en": "So I'll repeat this command",
          "zh": "所以我會重複這個指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.07,
          "end": 63.87,
          "en": "and I now don't want",
          "zh": "而現在我不想"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.87,
          "end": 67.89,
          "en": "to create a dashboard dash item component,",
          "zh": "建立 dashboard dash item 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.89,
          "end": 72.21000000000001,
          "en": "though we will create such a component a little bit later.",
          "zh": "雖然我們稍後會建立這樣一個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.21000000000001,
          "end": 74.01,
          "en": "But for the moment, I instead want",
          "zh": "但目前我想改為"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.01,
          "end": 77.37,
          "en": "to create those specific dashboard item",
          "zh": "建立這裡所需要的那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.37,
          "end": 78.75,
          "en": "Components I need here.",
          "zh": "特定 dashboard item 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.75,
          "end": 81.99,
          "en": "So one for the server status, one for the traffic,",
          "zh": "所以一個給 server-status、一個給 traffic，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.99,
          "end": 83.583,
          "en": "and one for the tickets.",
          "zh": "還有一個給 tickets。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.96000000000001,
          "end": 86.43,
          "en": "Therefore, I'll start",
          "zh": "所以我會先"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.43,
          "end": 89.78999999999999,
          "en": "by creating a server-status component,",
          "zh": "建立一個 server-status 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.78999999999999,
          "end": 94.65,
          "en": "though I wanna store that in a dashboard sub folder so",
          "zh": "但我想把它放在 dashboard 的子資料夾裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.65,
          "end": 97.83,
          "en": "that those dashboard specific Components",
          "zh": "讓那些 dashboard 專屬的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.83,
          "end": 100.38,
          "en": "are all in the same folder.",
          "zh": "都在同一個資料夾中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.38,
          "end": 102.66,
          "en": "That of course is not needed technically,",
          "zh": "當然技術上這不是必要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.66,
          "end": 104.85,
          "en": "but organizing your Components",
          "zh": "但像這樣組織你的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.85,
          "end": 107.94,
          "en": "and your code like this can make it a bit easier",
          "zh": "和程式碼，可以讓事情稍微容易一些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.94,
          "end": 111.53999999999999,
          "en": "to work on this application as it's getting more complex",
          "zh": "當這個應用程式越來越複雜時更好操作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.53999999999999,
          "end": 115.08,
          "en": "and as more and more Components might be added.",
          "zh": "當越來越多元件被加入時也是如此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.08,
          "end": 119.64,
          "en": "So I'll prefix my component here with dashboard slash,",
          "zh": "所以我會在這裡的元件名稱前面加上 dashboard/，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.64,
          "end": 121.23,
          "en": "which will tell Angular",
          "zh": "這會告訴 Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.23,
          "end": 123.63,
          "en": "that it should put this new component",
          "zh": "它應該把這個新元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.63,
          "end": 125.793,
          "en": "into the dashboard folder.",
          "zh": "放進 dashboard 資料夾裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.47,
          "end": 130.74,
          "en": "So by running this command, I get this dashboard folder,",
          "zh": "所以執行這個指令後，我就會得到這個 dashboard 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.74,
          "end": 132.39,
          "en": "and in that dashboard folder",
          "zh": "而在那個 dashboard 資料夾裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.39,
          "end": 134.34,
          "en": "I have the server status folder,",
          "zh": "會有 server-status 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.34,
          "end": 137.673,
          "en": "which contains this server status component files.",
          "zh": "裡面包含這個 server-status 元件的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.32,
          "end": 141.36,
          "en": "Now that's of course not the only dashboard",
          "zh": "當然那不是唯一與 dashboard"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.36,
          "end": 142.71,
          "en": "related component.",
          "zh": "相關的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.71,
          "end": 144.84,
          "en": "Instead, as a next step, I also want",
          "zh": "相反地，下一步我還想"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.84,
          "end": 148.14,
          "en": "to add my traffic component,",
          "zh": "加上我的 traffic 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.14,
          "end": 152.28,
          "en": "also in that dashboard folder by running disc command.",
          "zh": "同樣放在那個 dashboard 資料夾裡，透過執行 ng generate 指令。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.28,
          "end": 156.6,
          "en": "So now this dashboard folder has two sub folders.",
          "zh": "所以現在這個 dashboard 資料夾有兩個子資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.6,
          "end": 159.72,
          "en": "And now last but not least, I also want to create",
          "zh": "最後但同樣重要的是，我還想建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.72,
          "end": 161.793,
          "en": "that tickets component.",
          "zh": "那個 tickets 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.73,
          "end": 168.81,
          "en": "So these are my four new Components.",
          "zh": "所以這些就是我的四個新元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.81,
          "end": 171.87,
          "en": "And now we can grab the code from the app component",
          "zh": "現在我們可以把 app component 的程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.87,
          "end": 172.95,
          "en": "HTML file",
          "zh": "HTML 檔案裡的"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.95,
          "end": 177.57,
          "en": "and migrated into those component template files.",
          "zh": "內容搬到那些元件的模板檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.57,
          "end": 180.36,
          "en": "And I'll start with the header.",
          "zh": "而我會先從 header 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.36,
          "end": 183.93,
          "en": "We can simply grab this header markup",
          "zh": "我們可以直接把這段 header 的標記"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.93,
          "end": 187.98,
          "en": "and cut it from the app component HTML file",
          "zh": "從 app component 的 HTML 檔案剪下來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.98,
          "end": 190.74,
          "en": "and go to the header component HTML file",
          "zh": "然後到 header component 的 HTML 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.74,
          "end": 192.513,
          "en": "and put our code here.",
          "zh": "並把程式碼放在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.31,
          "end": 197.01,
          "en": "In the header component TypeScript file",
          "zh": "在 header component 的 TypeScript 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.01,
          "end": 199.44,
          "en": "we don't need to change anything at the moment.",
          "zh": "我們目前不需要做任何改動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.44,
          "end": 201.183,
          "en": "We can leave that as it is,",
          "zh": "我們可以先保持原樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.11,
          "end": 205.41,
          "en": "but back in the app component HTML file, we can",
          "zh": "但回到 app component 的 HTML 檔案，我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.41,
          "end": 209.43,
          "en": "and should now bring in our newly created header component",
          "zh": "而且現在也應該把我們新建立的 header component 帶進來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.43,
          "end": 211.82999999999998,
          "en": "by using the component tag.",
          "zh": "方法就是使用元件標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 211.82999999999998,
          "end": 215.52,
          "en": "So app-header like this,",
          "zh": "也就是像這樣的 app-header，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.52,
          "end": 217.74,
          "en": "written as a self-closing tag here,",
          "zh": "在這裡寫成自閉合標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 217.74,
          "end": 219.39,
          "en": "since we don't have any content",
          "zh": "因為開頭與結尾標籤之間"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 219.39,
          "end": 221.643,
          "en": "between the opening and closing tags.",
          "zh": "沒有任何內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.87,
          "end": 225.96,
          "en": "And of course the tag we use here is the tag",
          "zh": "當然，我們在這裡使用的標籤是"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 225.96,
          "end": 228.423,
          "en": "that's specified here in the selector.",
          "zh": "這裡在 selector 中所指定的標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 230.01,
          "end": 232.5,
          "en": "So that's the first component migrated.",
          "zh": "所以那是第一個搬移好的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 232.5,
          "end": 236.04,
          "en": "Of course, at the moment, app-header is not known",
          "zh": "當然，目前 app-header 對 app 元件來說還是未知的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 236.04,
          "end": 239.97,
          "en": "to the app component though, so to make it available here,",
          "zh": "所以要讓它在這裡可用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 239.97,
          "end": 243.03,
          "en": "we should go to the app component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": "我們應該到 app component 的 TypeScript 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 243.03,
          "end": 246.03,
          "en": "and there at this imports array",
          "zh": "然後在那裡的 imports 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 246.03,
          "end": 250.443,
          "en": "where we then import the header component.",
          "zh": "我們就把 header component 匯入進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 251.67,
          "end": 255.18,
          "en": "And for that you then also must add this import path at",
          "zh": "而為此你還必須在"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 255.18,
          "end": 256.353,
          "en": "the top of the file.",
          "zh": "檔案頂端加上這個匯入路徑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 258.48,
          "end": 260.46,
          "en": "With that, if you save everything",
          "zh": "做完這些，如果你把一切都儲存"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.46,
          "end": 263.25,
          "en": "and you reload, this application should work",
          "zh": "並重新載入，這個應用程式應該會運作"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 263.25,
          "end": 264.87,
          "en": "just as it did before,",
          "zh": "就像之前一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 264.87,
          "end": 266.97,
          "en": "but now the header was migrated",
          "zh": "但現在 header 已經被搬移"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 266.97,
          "end": 268.683,
          "en": "into a separate component.",
          "zh": "到一個獨立的元件裡了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 270.51,
          "end": 272.43,
          "en": "Now of course, that wasn't all though.",
          "zh": "當然，這還不是全部。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 272.43,
          "end": 274.65,
          "en": "In the app component HTML file,",
          "zh": "在 app component 的 HTML 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 274.65,
          "end": 278.1,
          "en": "I now also wanna migrate my dashboard items",
          "zh": "我現在也想搬移我的 dashboard item，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 278.1,
          "end": 280.86,
          "en": "and therefore I'll grab this first article,",
          "zh": "所以我會先抓取第一個 article，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 280.86,
          "end": 283.02,
          "en": "which is about the server status.",
          "zh": "它是有關 server status 的那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 283.02,
          "end": 286.72,
          "en": "This made up server status, and I'll cut that",
          "zh": "這個虛構的 server status，我就把它"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 287.76,
          "end": 292.14,
          "en": "and then bring that over into this server-status",
          "zh": "然後搬到這個 server-status"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 292.14,
          "end": 294.303,
          "en": "component HTML file.",
          "zh": "的元件 HTML 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 296.34000000000003,
          "end": 299.82,
          "en": "Now this HTML file does actually refer",
          "zh": "現在這個 HTML 檔案確實有參照到"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 299.82,
          "end": 303.33,
          "en": "to some property that was set up in",
          "zh": "某個設定在"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 303.33,
          "end": 306.15,
          "en": "the app component TypeScript file.",
          "zh": "app component TypeScript 檔案裡的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 306.15,
          "end": 308.34,
          "en": "This current status property,",
          "zh": "也就是 currentStatus 這個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 308.34,
          "end": 312.15,
          "en": "which later at some point will also be dynamic",
          "zh": "它之後在某個時間點也會變成動態的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 312.15,
          "end": 313.473,
          "en": "and will change.",
          "zh": "並且會改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 315.03,
          "end": 318.84,
          "en": "So in order to make this server status component work,",
          "zh": "所以為了讓這個 server-status 元件能運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 318.84,
          "end": 321.81,
          "en": "we should also cut this current status property",
          "zh": "我們也應該把這個 currentStatus 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 321.81,
          "end": 324.27,
          "en": "from the app component TypeScript file",
          "zh": "從 app component 的 TypeScript 檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 324.27,
          "end": 327.69,
          "en": "and bring it over into the server status component.",
          "zh": "搬到 server-status 元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 327.69,
          "end": 329.223,
          "en": "So into this class here.",
          "zh": "也就是搬到這裡這個類別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 331.05,
          "end": 333.75,
          "en": "By doing that, this component can again use",
          "zh": "這樣一來，這個元件就能再次使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 333.75,
          "end": 335.58299999999997,
          "en": "this current status property.",
          "zh": "這個 currentStatus 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 338.15999999999997,
          "end": 341.67,
          "en": "Now as a next step in the app component HTML file,",
          "zh": "接著在 app component 的 HTML 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 341.67,
          "end": 346.67,
          "en": "we should use this app-server-status component",
          "zh": "我們應該使用這個 app-server-status 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 347.15999999999997,
          "end": 351.273,
          "en": "we just migrated between those dashboard item diffs.",
          "zh": "也就是我們剛剛搬移的那個 dashboard item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 352.29,
          "end": 354.33,
          "en": "And of course, just as before,",
          "zh": "當然，就像之前一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 354.33,
          "end": 355.53,
          "en": "you must make sure",
          "zh": "你必須確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 355.53,
          "end": 357.96,
          "en": "that in the app component TypeScript file",
          "zh": "在 app component 的 TypeScript 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 357.96,
          "end": 360.96,
          "en": "and there in the component decorator, you make",
          "zh": "並在那裡的 Component 裝飾器中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 360.96,
          "end": 365.1,
          "en": "that server status component available by adding it",
          "zh": "把它加進去以讓那個 server-status 元件可用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 365.1,
          "end": 366.33,
          "en": "to this imports array",
          "zh": "加到這個 imports 陣列裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 366.33,
          "end": 369.633,
          "en": "and by adding this import path at the top of the file.",
          "zh": "並在檔案頂端加上這個匯入路徑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 373.11,
          "end": 378.11,
          "en": "Next we can migrate this traffic dashboard item.",
          "zh": "接著我們可以搬移這個 traffic dashboard item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 378.81,
          "end": 382.473,
          "en": "So I'll grab this article, cut it,",
          "zh": "所以我會抓取這個 article 並剪下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 383.67,
          "end": 388.653,
          "en": "and bring that over into my traffic component HTML file.",
          "zh": "然後搬到我的 traffic 元件 HTML 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 390.87,
          "end": 393.96,
          "en": "Now here I'm also referencing some data",
          "zh": "現在這裡我也參照到一些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 393.96,
          "end": 397.5,
          "en": "that was previously stored in the app component class.",
          "zh": "那些資料先前存放在 app component 類別裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 397.5,
          "end": 400.44,
          "en": "So we should grab that dummy traffic data",
          "zh": "所以我們應該把那份 dummy 的 traffic 資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 400.44,
          "end": 403.35,
          "en": "and this max traffic property",
          "zh": "還有這個 maxTraffic 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 403.35,
          "end": 405.96,
          "en": "and cut it from the app component",
          "zh": "從 app component 剪下來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 405.96,
          "end": 410.373,
          "en": "and instead migrated into the traffic component class,",
          "zh": "改成搬到 traffic 元件的類別裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 411.72,
          "end": 412.593,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 416.82,
          "end": 420.36,
          "en": "Of course now back in the app component HTML file,",
          "zh": "當然，現在回到 app component 的 HTML 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 420.36,
          "end": 424.053,
          "en": "we have to use this app-traffic component.",
          "zh": "我們必須使用這個 app-traffic 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 424.95,
          "end": 427.59,
          "en": "And of course also like before",
          "zh": "當然，也像之前一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 427.59,
          "end": 430.2,
          "en": "in the app component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": "在 app component 的 TypeScript 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 430.2,
          "end": 433.35,
          "en": "this traffic component must be added here",
          "zh": "必須把這個 traffic 元件加到這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 433.35,
          "end": 434.973,
          "en": "to this imports array.",
          "zh": "也就是這個 imports 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 437.73,
          "end": 439.5,
          "en": "With that, we're almost done.",
          "zh": "做到這裡，我們快完成了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 439.5,
          "end": 441.69,
          "en": "In the app component HTML file,",
          "zh": "在 app component 的 HTML 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 441.69,
          "end": 443.61,
          "en": "now as a last step,",
          "zh": "現在作為最後一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 443.61,
          "end": 448.437,
          "en": "I wanna migrate this unfinished tickets component.",
          "zh": "我想搬移這個還沒完成的 tickets 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 449.73,
          "end": 452.1,
          "en": "So grab that markup",
          "zh": "所以把那段標記"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 452.1,
          "end": 456.78,
          "en": "and migrate that into the tickets component HTML file.",
          "zh": "搬到 tickets 元件的 HTML 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 456.78,
          "end": 457.613,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 459.63,
          "end": 461.34000000000003,
          "en": "Here, I'm not using any data,",
          "zh": "這裡我沒有使用任何資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 461.34000000000003,
          "end": 464.67,
          "en": "so nothing else needs to be migrated.",
          "zh": "所以沒有其他東西需要搬移。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 464.67,
          "end": 467.55,
          "en": "But of course back in the app component,",
          "zh": "但當然回到 app component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 467.55,
          "end": 471.42,
          "en": "we should now use app-tickets here,",
          "zh": "我們現在應該在這裡使用 app-tickets，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 471.42,
          "end": 475.83,
          "en": "and then also go to the app component decorator",
          "zh": "然後也要到 app component 的裝飾器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 475.83,
          "end": 479.34000000000003,
          "en": "and just as before with all the other Components,",
          "zh": "並像之前處理其他所有元件一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 479.34000000000003,
          "end": 482.58,
          "en": "make the tickets component available in here.",
          "zh": "讓 tickets 元件在這裡可用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 482.58,
          "end": 484.563,
          "en": "Also by adding this import.",
          "zh": "同樣要加上這個匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 487.47,
          "end": 490.86,
          "en": "Great, with that everything has been migrated.",
          "zh": "很好，做到這裡所有東西都搬移完成了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 490.86,
          "end": 492.96,
          "en": "Now if you go back to your application",
          "zh": "現在如果你回到你的應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 492.96,
          "end": 497.19,
          "en": "and you reload it, it should still work as it did before.",
          "zh": "並重新載入，它應該還是一樣運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 497.19,
          "end": 500.37,
          "en": "You should still see the same content as before.",
          "zh": "你應該還是會看到和之前相同的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 500.37,
          "end": 501.57,
          "en": "But now we split up",
          "zh": "但現在我們把"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 501.57,
          "end": 505.35,
          "en": "that app component into four separate Components,",
          "zh": "那個 app component 拆成了四個獨立的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 505.35,
          "end": 506.7,
          "en": "and therefore we now have",
          "zh": "所以現在我們有"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 506.7,
          "end": 509.46,
          "en": "a much leaner app component template,",
          "zh": "一個精簡許多的 app component 模板，"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 509.46,
          "end": 512.04,
          "en": "and we therefore overall improved",
          "zh": "所以我們整體上改善了"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 512.04,
          "end": 514.44,
          "en": "this application's structure",
          "zh": "這個應用程式的結構，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 514.44,
          "end": 518.19,
          "en": "and possibly made it a bit easier to work on that,",
          "zh": "也可能讓它更容易處理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 518.19,
          "end": 521.67,
          "en": "especially as that application might grow",
          "zh": "尤其是當那個應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 521.67,
          "end": 523.623,
          "en": "in complexity in the future.",
          "zh": "未來在複雜度上持續成長時。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "44115548",
      "title": "Creating Reusable Components",
      "lectureOrder": 100,
      "videoOrder": 94,
      "sourceHash": "f6ef2d17b2f61f8dca08bf71f4e6ca84743cbc159be80b9b2a74640b3e414455",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 1.98,
          "en": "So we did now",
          "zh": "所以我們現在確實"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.98,
          "end": 4.245,
          "en": "break up this app Component here",
          "zh": "把這裡的這個 app 元件拆解開來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.245,
          "end": 8.28,
          "en": "into multiple smaller Components,",
          "zh": "拆成多個比較小的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.28,
          "end": 10.83,
          "en": "but we can break it up even more,",
          "zh": "但我們還能拆得更細，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.83,
          "end": 14.4,
          "en": "or we can use even more Components here.",
          "zh": "或者在這裡使用更多的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.4,
          "end": 17.16,
          "en": "Because the idea behind Components",
          "zh": "因為元件背後的概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.16,
          "end": 21.63,
          "en": "is not just that you can break up complex markup",
          "zh": "不只是你可以把複雜的標記拆開，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.63,
          "end": 25.38,
          "en": "into simpler markup building blocks,",
          "zh": "拆成更簡單的標記積木，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.38,
          "end": 28.08,
          "en": "but the idea behind Components is also",
          "zh": "元件背後的概念還包括，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.08,
          "end": 31.89,
          "en": "that you can build reusable building blocks.",
          "zh": "你可以打造可重複使用的積木。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.89,
          "end": 35.64,
          "en": "And whenever you have some kind of code duplication,",
          "zh": "而每當你出現某種程式碼重複時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.64,
          "end": 40.64,
          "en": "either logic duplication in the Component TypeScript files",
          "zh": "不論是元件 TypeScript 檔案裡的邏輯重複，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.71,
          "end": 45.15,
          "en": "or markup duplication, there is an opportunity",
          "zh": "還是標記重複，就有機會"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.15,
          "end": 48.81,
          "en": "to create another shared Component.",
          "zh": "再建立一個共用的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.81,
          "end": 52.02,
          "en": "You of course, don't have to use that opportunity,",
          "zh": "當然，你不必使用這個機會，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.02,
          "end": 53.883,
          "en": "but you should at least consider it.",
          "zh": "但你至少應該考慮一下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.96,
          "end": 59.49,
          "en": "And here for the Components we just created, we can see",
          "zh": "而在這裡，就我們剛建立的元件而言，我們可以看到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.49,
          "end": 62.52,
          "en": "that we, for example, get this div here",
          "zh": "例如，我們有這個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.52,
          "end": 65.58,
          "en": "with the class dashboard-item",
          "zh": "它的 class 是 dashboard-item，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.58,
          "end": 69.093,
          "en": "that is repeated for all those Components.",
          "zh": "而它在所有那些元件裡都重複出現。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.2,
          "end": 73.5,
          "en": "In addition, inside of those Components we created,",
          "zh": "除此之外，在我們建立的這些元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.5,
          "end": 76.28999999999999,
          "en": "we also have a similar pattern.",
          "zh": "還有一個類似的模式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.28999999999999,
          "end": 79.05,
          "en": "We always have an article with a header",
          "zh": "我們總是有一個帶有 header 的 article，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.05,
          "end": 83.34,
          "en": "where the header always has an image and an H2 tag.",
          "zh": "而那個 header 總是有圖片和一個 H2 標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.34,
          "end": 85.818,
          "en": "And then we have the actual Component content",
          "zh": "然後在 header 下方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.818,
          "end": 90.818,
          "en": "that differs from Component to Component below that header.",
          "zh": "有每個元件各自不同的真正內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.47,
          "end": 94.83,
          "en": "I mean the content in the header also differs.",
          "zh": "我是說 header 裡的內容也不一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 94.83,
          "end": 98.16,
          "en": "We have different titles and different images after all,",
          "zh": "畢竟我們有不同的標題和不同的圖片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 98.16,
          "end": 101.82300000000001,
          "en": "but the general shape is always the same.",
          "zh": "但整體的形狀總是相同的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 103.08,
          "end": 106.71000000000001,
          "en": "And this therefore gives us another opportunity",
          "zh": "所以這又給了我們另一個機會，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 106.71000000000001,
          "end": 109.68,
          "en": "to create a shared reused Component,",
          "zh": "去建立一個共用、重複使用的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 109.68,
          "end": 112.47,
          "en": "and I'll grab that opportunity.",
          "zh": "而我會抓住這個機會。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 112.47,
          "end": 114.45,
          "en": "Therefore, what I'll do here",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡要做的是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 114.45,
          "end": 117.6,
          "en": "is I'll generate another Component,",
          "zh": "我要再產生一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117.6,
          "end": 121.44,
          "en": "and I wanna generate it inside of that dashboard folder here",
          "zh": "而且我想在這裡的 dashboard 資料夾裡產生它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 121.44,
          "end": 126.27,
          "en": "since it belongs to that dashboard area of this application.",
          "zh": "因為它屬於這個應用程式的 dashboard 區域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 126.27,
          "end": 129.45,
          "en": "And I'll name it dashboard-item,",
          "zh": "我會把它命名為 dashboard-item，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 129.45,
          "end": 133.35,
          "en": "because I plan on creating a wrapper Component",
          "zh": "因為我打算建立一個包裝用的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 133.35,
          "end": 137.85,
          "en": "that will wrap those specific dashboard item Components",
          "zh": "把那些特定的 dashboard item 元件包起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 137.85,
          "end": 140.973,
          "en": "so that we can reuse that shared structure.",
          "zh": "讓我們能重複使用那個共用結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 142.14,
          "end": 145.287,
          "en": "Therefore all create this new Component,",
          "zh": "所以現在來建立這個新元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 145.287,
          "end": 147.303,
          "en": "the dashboard item Component.",
          "zh": "也就是 dashboard-item 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 148.92000000000002,
          "end": 152.49,
          "en": "And with it created inside of that Component,",
          "zh": "在它建立好之後，在那個元件裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 152.49,
          "end": 156.32999999999998,
          "en": "I want to share this article header markup here,",
          "zh": "我想把這裡的這個 article header 標記共用起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 156.32999999999998,
          "end": 159.3,
          "en": "and I also want to share this div",
          "zh": "我還想把這個 div 也共用起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 159.3,
          "end": 161.19299999999998,
          "en": "with the class dashboard item.",
          "zh": "它的 class 是 dashboard-item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 162.3,
          "end": 163.89,
          "en": "So I'll actually start with that.",
          "zh": "所以我就從那個開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 163.89,
          "end": 165.12,
          "en": "I'll copy that",
          "zh": "我會把它複製起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 165.12,
          "end": 168.54,
          "en": "and go to the dashboard item Component HTML file",
          "zh": "然後前往 dashboard-item 元件的 HTML 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.54,
          "end": 173.28300000000002,
          "en": "and paste in that div that has that dashboard item class.",
          "zh": "貼上那個帶有 dashboard-item class 的 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 175.17000000000002,
          "end": 177.21,
          "en": "And then inside of that div,",
          "zh": "然後在那個 div 裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 177.21,
          "end": 180.36,
          "en": "I wanna copy that structure,",
          "zh": "我想複製那個結構，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 180.36,
          "end": 182.19,
          "en": "though we'll of course adjust it.",
          "zh": "當然我們之後會做調整。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 182.19,
          "end": 184.62,
          "en": "So I'll copy such an article, for example,",
          "zh": "所以例如我會複製一個那樣的 article，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.62,
          "end": 187.53,
          "en": "from the server status Component HTML file.",
          "zh": "從 server status 元件的 HTML 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 187.53,
          "end": 190.781,
          "en": "I'll copy all the markup from there and paste it here",
          "zh": "我把那邊所有的標記複製過來，貼在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 190.781,
          "end": 194.55,
          "en": "into the dashboard item Component HTML file.",
          "zh": "也就是 dashboard-item 元件的 HTML 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 194.55,
          "end": 197.76,
          "en": "But I will remove that div here",
          "zh": "但我會把這裡的那個 div 移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 197.76,
          "end": 201.63,
          "en": "that contains the actual Component-specific content,",
          "zh": "它包含的是各元件特有的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 201.63,
          "end": 202.463,
          "en": "so the content",
          "zh": "也就是說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 202.463,
          "end": 205.413,
          "en": "that is specific to the server status, for example,",
          "zh": "像 server status 這種特有的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 206.49,
          "end": 211.05,
          "en": "so that just this shared markup is kept here.",
          "zh": "這樣這裡就只保留共用的標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 211.05,
          "end": 213.45,
          "en": "Now with that, we of course also",
          "zh": "現在這樣一來，當然我們還得"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
